window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2001,"title":"Chapter 2001 Killing Li Weiyuan, the End of the Battle","paragraphs":["2001 Killing Li Weiyuan, the End of the Battle","In the intense battle, Chu Yunfan had broken through to the third level of the Creation Stage. When his cultivation broke through to the third level, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength suddenly soared to the seventh level. Coupled with the enhancement of the medicinal pill, his combat strength doubled.","This was only a recent breakthrough. As time passed, his combat strength was still increasing. Originally, his combat strength was not much different from Li Weiyuan’s. However, after his breakthrough, his combat strength had doubled, forming a terrifying suppression on Li Weiyuan. With a thought, he stopped Li Weiyuan, who was trying to escape.","At this moment, Li Weiyuan felt terrible. It was not that he could not see the increase in Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, but he could see that there was no way to solve it. Chu Yunfan broke through just like that. He broke through again and again!","Li Weiyuan was not stupid. Of course, he knew that Chu Yunfan had suddenly given up on other attacks and changed them all to mere punches. Chu Yunfan wanted to use him to temper himself and force him into a desperate situation. Chu Yunfan wanted to unleash all his potential and achieve a breakthrough.","Li Weiyuan had been a prodigy on the previous Prodigy List, but now he had become Chu Yunfan’s whetstone. Whether he was willing to admit it or not, this was the reality.","Thinking of this, Li Weiyuan’s expression froze, and then he revealed a ferocious expression. He felt a huge threat from Chu Yunfan. This was completely different from the situation just now. He was confident that he could escape from Chu Yunfan as long as he wanted to, but now he didn’t even have the confidence to escape.","“You dare to use me as a whetstone?!” Li Weiyuan was a little angry.","“So what?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Otherwise, do you think you could have survived until now?”","Chu Yunfan had only remembered this matter halfway through the fight. According to normal speed, even with the help of the Wood Spirit Essence, it would probably take him more than one to two months to break through to the third level of the Creation Stage. However, with the help of Li Weiyuan’s strength, he could force out all his potential and complete the breakthrough in battle. He did not need to wait that long.","Now that he had completed his breakthrough, he could feel that his strength was rising at an astonishing speed. He would be fearless even if faced with a peak Creator. He would be able to protect himself and even resist! As for the seventh-level Creator who was originally a threat to him, he was no longer his match. This was Li Weiyuan’s greatest use.","Hearing Chu Yunfan admit this, Li Weiyuan felt even worse. Fortunately, he remembered that this was not the time to fight Chu Yunfan head-on.","“You can’t kill me! Otherwise, the Li clan will not let you go!”","Li Weiyuan finally remembered the identity of the Li clan. The Li clan was a military aristocratic family in Grand Xia, and their background was extremely deep.","“So what if I kill you? Li Weiyuan, although you are a descendant of the Li clan, you colluded with evil sects and attacked the External General of the Imperial Court. You deserve to be killed. What can you do if I kill you?” Chu Yunfan grinned coldly.","Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t have the protection of this official rank, he wouldn’t let Li Weiyuan off just because he was surrounded. The Li clan was nothing. Although the Li clan was strong, the Flying Celestials behind Chu Yunfan were not to be trifled with. Even without the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan had nothing to fear at his level of cultivation. With his current cultivation, there were probably only a few people in the Li clan who could pose a threat to him. The rest were like fish on the chopping board for him to slaughter.","“Cut the crap and die!” Chu Yunfan shouted and clenched his fist.","The fist force turned into a gale and condensed into eight dragons in the air. The eight figures suppressed everything. In an instant, they bombarded Li Weiyuan.","“Spirit Dragon Halberd!”","Li Weiyuan didn’t dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan. He immediately unleashed his most terrifying attack, the Spirit Dragon Halberd, and slashed toward Chu Yunfan’s eight dragons.","Boom!","The Spirit Dragon Halberd transformed into a huge spirit dragon, but in the next moment, it was torn apart by the eight dragons formed by the fist force. From afar, everyone seemed to see the terrifying scene of mythical creatures fighting in ancient times. These martial arts and divine arts were created by imitating such battles.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan shattered the spirit dragon with a punch, and then the fist force directly blasted into Li Weiyuan’s body. The layers of barriers in front of Li Weiyuan were shattered layer by layer like paper, and they collapsed in an instant.","Spurt!","Li Weiyuan spat out a mouthful of blood. He felt as if his chest was about to be punched through by Chu Yunfan. His entire body was like a shooting star as he fell toward the sea.","Boom!","A huge hole appeared on the surface of the sea, causing huge waves.","‘He’s so strong after breaking through!’ Li Weiyuan’s eyes flashed with disbelief.","Chu Yunfan was originally on par with him, but now, after only a short time, he had just broken through and was blown up by a punch. Li Weiyuan’s current combat strength far exceeded that of an ordinary peak Creator. An ordinary peak Creator might not even be able to withstand ten moves from him. One could imagine how shocking Chu Yunfan was at this moment.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s incomparably cold voice came from the sky. He stomped out, turning into a terrifying foot that spread out countless amounts of netherworld water and trampled on Li Weiyuan’s body.","At this moment, Li Weiyuan, who had been severely injured, could not block it anymore. He was stepped on in an instant.","Bam!","Li Weiyuan’s body finally could not hold on any longer and shattered into pieces in the air. When many people saw this scene, they gasped. Chu Yunfan, who had broken through, only used two moves to kill Li Weiyuan.","Chu Yunfan then made a huge energy hand and put Li Weiyuan’s corpse into the Mountain River Diagram. He heaved a sigh of relief. The aura wrapped around his body was also dissipating at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was breaking through bit by bit, falling back to a level comparable to the seventh level of the Creation Stage. The battle between these major forces and Chu Yunfan had finally come to an end.","Even though the Eastern Sea cultivators who were watching from afar knew that Chu Yunfan’s medicinal effects had worn off and he could no longer unleash such terrifying combat strength, none of them dared to step forward.","This person’s might had shaken the world!"]},{"number":2002,"title":"Chapter 2002 I Won’t Let This Go So Easily","paragraphs":["2002 I Won’t Let This Go So Easily","When the Flying Celestials’ rescue team arrived at the Eastern Sea battlefield, they realized that the battle had already ended.","Yes, it was over.","The big shots of the Flying Celestials had mixed feelings. They had rushed to the Eastern Sea through the teleportation portal to save Chu Yunfan. Who knew that the news they received was that the battle had ended? This had completely exceeded everyone’s expectations.","They had hoped that Chu Yunfan could hold out for a while longer and give them enough time to rescue him. If it weren’t for the fact that the Flying Celestials didn’t have a teleportation portal that led directly to Serene Immortal Mountain, they would have used that.","Although the Elder Princess was born in the imperial family of Grand Xia, she wasn’t on good terms with the imperial family. Serene Immortal Mountain had already become a private plot of land for the Elder Princess. All the teleportation portals were closed off from this place. If anyone wanted to come over, they would have to fly over by themselves.","The supreme grand elders of the Flying Celestials were all at least at the Creation stage. When they rushed at full speed, the effect was naturally very shocking. But even so, they still couldn’t make it in time for this battle. Before they could feel dejected, they realized that the winner of the battle was actually Chu Yunfan, and not the various forces as they had thought.","After Situ Xuan understood the entire battle, he didn’t know what to say. Chu Yunfan’s entire battle process had been smooth sailing. The experts of the various major forces had set up a circle to deal with Chu Yunfan, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would set them up instead?","If Chu Yunfan had shown his strength from the beginning, those people would have been scared away. No matter how powerful Chu Yunfan was, he couldn’t keep everyone here. However, he pretended to be weak, making everyone think that they could kill him if they worked harder. In the end, they were killed by Chu Yunfan one by one.","This kind of incisive operation made many people feel amazed when they recalled it. Chu Yunfan’s series of operations could be considered very skilled. It shouldn’t be the first time he used this method to trick people.","Situ Xuan thought differently from the others. He didn’t know what kind of experience Chu Yunfan had before. It was obvious that it wasn’t the first or second time Chu Yunfan had been surrounded and attacked. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been so calm.","The other prodigies, even Li Qianyuan, who had experienced many battles, were shielded by protectors. They would not be surrounded by so many masters. This was the limitation.","These prodigies had already gone through enough training. Even Situ Xuan had gone through the same thing back then. At first, he didn’t think there was anything wrong with it. However, compared to Chu Yunfan’s stunning performance, it was clear that the difference between them was obvious.","The Flying Celestials had investigated Chu Yunfan’s identity and background before. He was just a branch descendant of a noble family in the Great Wei of the Violet Thunder Prefecture. With such an identity, of course, he would not receive much protection. It was not difficult to find out Chu Yunfan’s achievements along the way, but no one knew what kind of inheritance he had obtained.","The various martial arts that Chu Yunfan used were not inherited from the Flying Celestials, and they were not martial arts from the various sects in the Great Wei Kingdom or the Violet Thunder Prefecture. Only the Seven Violet Thunder Swords could be confirmed to be the martial arts of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect of the past. The origins of the rest were unknown, but in terms of power, they were not inferior to the Seven Violet Thunder Swords. In fact, they were even above that.","Although every prodigy who could stand out had many secrets that no one knew about, Chu Yunfan had many inheritances that did not belong to the Flying Celestials. Even the source of the Flying Celestials’ inheritance came from inheritances that many seniors found outside. Later, for various reasons, it became the Flying Celestials’ inheritance. Compared to the others, Chu Yunfan obviously had more secrets.","But no matter what, Chu Yunfan was still a disciple of the Flying Celestials. After this incident, he made up his mind. When he saw the rescue team of the Flying Celestials, although he had already guessed that the Flying Celestials would send a large number of experts to rescue him, when he saw that even the sect leader had personally come out, Chu Yunfan was touched. No matter what the reason was, there was no doubt that the Flying Celestials valued him.","Although he had never expected the Flying Celestials to rescue him, he knew that he had such a trump card, but others did not. Therefore, when the experts of the Flying Celestials rushed over to support him, he was touched.","Previously, Hu Dingtian was willing to die brazenly for him. Not everyone was unafraid of death, but to them, their sacrifice was for the future of the Flying Celestials. These people enjoyed the best resources in the Flying Celestials, and their power was built on the strength of the Flying Celestials. If the Flying Celestials was destroyed, everything they had would be like a castle built on sand, and it would collapse easily.","“Thank you, sir, and all the elders for coming to my aid.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","“We’re relieved to see that you’re okay. You gave us a big surprise.” Situ Xuan quickly regained his composure and smiled. “You’ve given the whole world a big surprise.”","Behind Situ Xuan, many of the grand elders were observing Chu Yunfan intently, especially those who had never heard of him before. These grand elders would enter seclusion for ten years or even longer in order to break through. This was a very normal thing. Who knew that after coming out of seclusion this time, such a peerless genius would appear in the sect. Many of them had even yet to figure out what had happened before they were called to save Chu Yunfan.","This was the first time they were seeing Chu Yunfan in person. Although Chu Yunfan had already restrained his aura, because he had just broken through, there was still some aura leaking out from time to time. However, just the aura that leaked out made their hearts palpitate. Everyone knew that this person before them was the biggest guarantee for the Flying Celestials to become even stronger in the future.","“This isn’t the place to talk. Let’s head back first.” Situ Xuan swept his gaze around. “I won’t let those who besiege my disciple go so easily. You’d better watch your backs.”"]},{"number":2003,"title":"Chapter 2003 A Great Loss","paragraphs":["2003 A Great Loss","The Eastern Sea itinerant cultivators and the scouts from the various major powers couldn’t help but feel a chill run down their spines. When Situ Xuan’s gaze landed on them, they felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","Everyone knew that Situ Xuan was warning those forces that were ready to make a move, especially those forces that had besieged Chu Yunfan. The Flying Celestials would definitely not let this matter rest so easily.","Everyone understood that if the Flying Celestials didn’t make such a gesture, they wouldn’t be able to teach these forces a lesson, and in the future, no one would take the Flying Celestials seriously. The Flying Celestials was one of the ten great sects of Grand Xia. If they couldn’t even protect their most valued disciple, then who would take the Flying Celestials seriously in the future?","What made the remaining forces of the major forces so depressed that they wanted to vomit blood was that this time, they had organized a large number of experts to surround and attack Chu Yunfan. In the end, they were killed by Chu Yunfan and their entire team was wiped out. Such a loss could be said to be a serious injury.","The Flying Celestials would definitely not let this matter rest. In other words, they would have to face the Flying Celestials’ revenge. What did he mean by stealing a chicken but not succeeding and losing the rice? This was stealing a chicken but not succeeding and losing the rice. It was a double loss. Not only did they fail to kill Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan had actually broken through during the battle.","There was simply no justice!","The fact that so many high-stage Creators had failed to take down a single person made everyone understand that after this battle, Chu Yunfan would become famous all over the world. Those of his generation could not be compared to him.","They were all on the Prodigy List, but there was already a valley between them. If it were the other prodigies on the Prodigy List, not to mention facing so many experts at the same time, even any one of them would have the strength to kill these prodigies. These prodigies would be considered lucky to be able to escape.","If they originally had other thoughts, then with Situ Xuan’s arrival, these other thoughts disappeared without a trace. Although they had never seen Situ Xuan fight before, he was still one of the top experts in the world. At this moment, even if those forces sent out all their experts, they would not be able to do anything to Chu Yunfan. Situ Xuan was here, and he was the one who could stabilize the sea.","“Yes, let’s go. It’s not convenient here.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “We’ll talk when we get back.”","Everyone from the Flying Celestials quickly left and disappeared without a trace. The great battle on the Eastern Sea came to an end. The experts of the Eastern Sea who were watching the battle also left. The battle had ended, and even the corpses had been taken away by Chu Yunfan. It was impossible for them to fish in troubled waters.","Outside Serene Immortal Mountain, Princess Yun Yang looked a little stunned. She looked like like she had seen a ghost. She had never thought that there would be someone among her peers who was so powerful that he could easily slaughter those upper stage Creators who even she was no match for.","Princess Yun Yang knew very well that it was becoming more and more difficult to rope Chu Yunfan in. Fortunately, it was just as difficult for others to rope Chu Yunfan in, or even more difficult than her because she had helped Chu Yunfan once. Though Chu Yunfan had returned the favor, they had a friendship. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan, so he surely had become enemies with the Crown Prince. For her, this was the biggest benefit.","In the depths of Serene Immortal Mountain, on a throne shrouded in mist, the Elder Princess was taking in everything within a radius of hundreds of miles. Beside her was her maidservant Ruoxi.","“Your Highness, I didn’t expect Chu Yunfan would succeed in counterattacking. This is really too unexpected. I didn’t expect that he would actually have the ability to make pills. I think that Princess Yun Yang’s large-scale purchase of medicinal herbs must have been given to him,” Ruoxi said, looking amazed.","Her cultivation was also profound, and she was not afraid even when facing the prodigies on the Prodigy List. However, it was because of this that she understood how terrifying these experts who surrounded Chu Yunfan were. She could only run away from any one of them. However, Chu Yunfan was able to successfully counterattack. No matter what method Chu Yunfan used, a victory was a victory, and a defeat was a defeat. There were no excuses or reasons.","“Princess Gushe didn’t misjudge him,” Ruoxi said “She has been very confident in Chu Yunfan. It seems that she is the one who truly understands Chu Yunfan. It’s not in vain that Princess Gushe gave him the Wood Spirit Essence.”","The Elder Princess nodded noncommittally. “Siyu didn’t misjudge him,” she said. After a pause, she continued, “Go to the storeroom and find another Wood Spirit Essence for Siyu. Her cultivation has reached a critical point. She can’t be delayed by this kind of thing.”","Ruoxi smiled and said, “You are too good to Princess Gushe, ma’am. I have never seen anyone else receive such treatment. Fortunately, she did not disappoint you. With her cultivation, she’s one of the best in the world, second only to Chu Yunfan.”","A cold smile appeared on the Elder Princess’ beautiful face. “I want her to be the strongest one, not just second to him. Although Chu Yunfan is her future husband, who says that women are inferior to men? Who says that she can’t surpass Chu Yunfan?","“This Chu Yunfan is quite interesting. He has many secrets, but so what? As long as Siyu follows my plan and cultivates step by step, she will surpass him sooner or later.”","Ruoxi’s words had aroused the Elder Princess’ competitiveness. It was not difficult to see from her words that the Elder Princess had high hopes for Tang Siyu. Even if that person was Chu Yunfan, the Elder Princess would never allow Tang Siyu to lose.","“I hope Princess Gushe can understand your painstaking efforts,” Ruoxi said with a smile.","“She just needs to focus on her cultivation. That thing is about to open. If her cultivation can’t keep up, she’ll miss this opportunity. One step is a step away. Siyu should understand this. There’s no need to say anything more.” The Elder Princess then thought of something. “Oh right, I’m going out to Heaven’s Beyond to look for some divine materials. Before I come back, all the teleportation portals in Serene Immortal Mountain must be shut down and all the defensive barriers must be activated. No one is allowed to enter until I’m back.”","“Yes, ma’am.” Ruoxi nodded.","She understood that Serene Immortal Mountain was different from other forces. Serene Immortal Mountain was quite famous, but it only relied on the Elder Princess’ reputation. Without the Elder Princess, they would not have been able to defend Serene Immortal Mountain."]},{"number":2004,"title":"Chapter 2004 Number One on the Prodigy List — Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["2004 Number One on the Prodigy List — Chu Yunfan","The battle in the Eastern Sea had come to an end. This battle had attracted the attention of countless people in the entire Eastern Sea. Especially since the news spread so quickly in the Eastern Sea, it didn’t take long for all kinds of news to spread. It spread out in all directions at lightning speed.","Including the Li clan, there were five major forces involved. Even if each force was not in the Eastern Sea, they had a considerable reputation. Even for a military family like the Li clan, because of the previous war with the marine folks, everyone had seen the Li clan’s foundation. Although the final result was that the Li clan was defeated and their overseas strongholds and forces were uprooted, it was an inevitable outcome. In the Eastern Sea, there was no power that was a match for the marine folks. Even the powerful Grand Xia Empire could only maintain its rule in the coastal areas and could not extend its tentacles deep into the Eastern Sea.","These five factions, along with a large number of fifth, sixth, and seventh-level Creators at the peak of the Creation Stage, had collectively died. How shocking was this? Such a lineup was enough to sweep away a first-rate force in the Eastern Sea and uproot it.","However, they had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands so easily. Even Li Weiyuan, the previous prodigy of the Li clan, who was a peak Creator, had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This battle was earth-shattering. It shook the entire Eastern Sea. Many people watched from afar and saw everything. After they left, word of mouth spread. Chu Yunfan’s fame spread overnight in the Eastern Sea. Practically everyone knew that in Grand Xia, there was a legendary character.","Even in a colossus like Grand Xia, the probability of a legendary figure appearing was not high. The so-called top-notch figures were those who completely crushed their peers, not just like Li Qianyuan who was only ahead of his peers. Li Qianyuan could only be regarded as the leader of his peers, but Chu Yunfan was different. He crushed his peers and was invincible. There was no opponent.","“To think that such a person would appear in Grand Xia, and he’s from Grand Xia’s military. He’s clearly a time bomb. If such a person grows up, it will be a disaster for us!”","“The tallest tree in the forest is bound to be destroyed by the wind. His performance is too dazzling. I’m afraid there will be more than one or two people who can’t stand it. When that time comes, his days will be miserable.”","“That’s right. Geniuses who can’t grow up are nothing. There have been too many such people since ancient times.”","Chu Yunfan became famous in one battle. Countless people were dumbfounded, but there were still some people who had doubts. To them, whether Chu Yunfan could grow into a top figure in the world was still unknown. Compared to the major forces in the Eastern Sea who were the first to receive the news, the sensation caused by Chu Yunfan’s battle had actually begun three days ago.","Three days ago, Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan. The names on the Prodigy List had changed. If it was just an ordinary prodigy dying, it would not have caused such a huge commotion. However, this person was Li Qianyuan, who had been ranked first.","Since ancient times, everyone’s attention was often placed on the first place. From the second place to the 100th place, everyone’s attention might not be comparable to Li Qianyuan. Although he had encountered many dangers since his debut, no one had ever been able to kill him.","Now that the first name on the Prodigy List had suddenly disappeared, it immediately caused a huge uproar. This was especially true for the prodigies who were either in seclusion or traveling. They instantly felt the sorrow of the fox when the rabbit died. After all, although Li Qianyuan was their competitor and the target to catch up with, they were still very clear that Li Qianyuan was their benchmark. Now, even Li Qianyuan, who was ranked first, had died tragically. In other words, they were also in great danger.","For a moment, everyone felt threatened. They didn’t believe that someone of the same generation could kill Li Qianyuan. There was only one possibility. Some or some old monster had attacked without any regard, just like the supreme existence of the demons had crossed the border to attack Chu Yunfan without any regard.","What a shocking thing!","First Chu Yunfan, then Li Qianyuan, it was hard to say whether they would be the next. For a moment, everyone was panicking. Many people had a question lingering in their minds.","“Where’s Li Qianyuan’s protector? Where did they go? Why did they just watch Li Qianyuan die?”","For a time, all the factions with prodigies in the world began to take action. Many people wanted to know which faction had made a move. This kind of shameless attack not only offended the Li clan, but also the Crown Prince of Grand Xia who was behind the Li clan. The Li clan might not be enough to make many people fear them, but if they included the Crown Prince of Grand Xia behind them, they would be a colossus.","Th Crown Prince was someone who had a very high chance of ascending the throne and becoming a supreme existence that controlled the massive Grand Xia Empire. It was even said that the Crown Prince had issued an angry order from the Eastern Palace to find the murderer at all costs.","In the past three days, the storm had already started. Even the Grand Commandant’s Office was paying attention to it. After all, Li Qianyuan was a marquis and noble of Grand Xia. However, after three days of sensational discussion, a name appeared on the Prodigy List.","It was Chu Yunfan!","For a moment, looking at the name on the Prodigy List, everyone couldn’t help but rub their eyes. They felt that there must be something wrong with their eyes. The first place on the Prodigy List was actually Chu Yunfan, who had been confirmed to have died more than half a year ago?","“What is it? The first place was actually Chu Yunfan? Isn’t he already dead? Or is it someone with the same name?”","Everyone believed that Chu Yunfan was dead. The biggest evidence was that his name was no longer on the Prodigy List. They did not believe that anyone could hide from the divination of the Mysteries Pavilion. But now, reality had given them a hard slap.","“How can there be so many coincidences? Instead of me believing that another prodigy with the same name has appeared, I might as well believe that Chu Yunfan has come back from the dead!” someone said confidently.","The probability of that was even smaller than the probability of Chu Yunfan coming back from the dead. It was even more unbelievable.","“Could it really be him? That’s impossible. Didn’t he die a long time ago? Could Li Qianyuan’s death have something to do with him?” someone guessed."]},{"number":2005,"title":"Chapter 2005 The World Is Shocked","paragraphs":["2005 The World Is Shocked","Originally, no one would have thought so, but with Li Qianyuan’s death three days ago, and now Chu Yunfan just happened to be the first on the Prodigy List, all of this seemed too coincidental. Especially with the divination ability of the Mysteries Pavilion, they did not doubt that Chu Yunfan had such strength.","Some people could rely on luck to squeeze into the Prodigy List, but it was impossible for someone to rely on luck to become number one on the Prodigy List. Could it be that the other geniuses were all dead?","Originally, everyone thought that Li Qianyuan had died at the hands of some shameless old monster, but with Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance as the first on the Prodigy List, they found that there might be other possibilities. If Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan, then everything would have been taken for granted. The things that everyone couldn’t figure out at first were now understood.","In particular, the feud between Li Qianyuan and Chu Yunfan could be said to be known by quite a few people. Both sides wanted to kill each other, and there was a reasonable explanation for why Li Qianyuan’s protector couldn’t protect him and couldn’t play a sufficient role. Not many people knew that the Elder Princess had sent out invitations to choose a husband for her disciple. However, Chu Yunfan was Tang Siyu’s fiance, and Li Qianyuan had long expressed his intention to marry Tang Siyu. The collision between the two sides was almost inevitable.","If Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan in the arena, then everything would have a reasonable explanation. In Serene Immortal Mountain, no one would dare to go against the Elder Princess’ wishes.","If this was originally just a guess, then the news from the Eastern Sea soon confirmed this guess. The first news was naturally that Chu Yunfan, who was blocked by several major forces, killed Li Qianyuan. Many people who didn’t know what was going on suddenly realized that this was the only way for Chu Yunfan to kill Li Qianyuan.","However, many people were shocked. In the situation where everyone had already confirmed that he was dead, Chu Yunfan was still able to counterattack and kill Li Qianyuan, landing first on the Prodigy List. What kind of cultivation had he gone through during this period?","The other prodigies were even more dumbfounded. Li Qianyuan alone had already suppressed them to the point that they could not breathe. There was no one who could even stand shoulder-to-shoulder with Li Qianyuan.","Everyone was defeated by Li Qianyuan. It was just a question of how long they could hold out. However, Chu Yunfan managed to defeat and even kill Li Qianyuan. This was enough to make everyone incredulous.","As more and more details were revealed, everyone knew that Li Qianyuan had never gained the upper hand from the beginning to the end. He had completely fallen into Chu Yunfan’s control. In the end, Chu Yunfan easily forced him to use all his trump cards and killed him. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had the strength to completely crush Li Qianyuan. But soon, everyone realized that compared to the shocking battle that followed, Chu Yunfan’s killing of Li Qianyuan was nothing.","In the face of the revenge of the various large factions, Chu Yunfan had single-handedly brought down these factions and killed dozens of fifth-level and higher Creators. The previous generation of the Li clan, Li Weiyuan, died tragically. It could be said that the Li clan had lost the hope of a generation. There was no one in the clan who could take up the responsibility.","Such a valiant battle record made everyone dumbfounded as if they were looking at a monster.","“A legendary figure has appeared in our generation!”","After some of the elites learned of this news, they were stunned for a full fifteen minutes. They simply couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan had managed to surpass them completely when they were also improving at an astonishing speed. It wasn’t even a level higher, but a complete suppression of all of them.","Judging from the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, even without the pill that he had consumed, he would have enough strength to easily crush them. Even if the prodigies on the Prodigy List joined forces, they would not be able to defeat Chu Yunfan.","Many people were dumbfounded. How could they play this game? They were on completely different levels. Different from Li Qianyuan, although Li Qianyuan was strong, everyone still had hope to catch up. However, Chu Yunfan was so strong that they could no longer hope to catch up.","A whole generation had been suppressed!","After the news spread, many people paid attention to the reactions of these prodigies. Some sat in a daze, speechless, as if they had lost their fighting spirit, while others fell silent for a moment before entering seclusion again. Some of them laughed loudly, half crying and half laughing. It was difficult to tell. Every prodigy was different. Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan’s matter had really agitated them.","Overnight, Chu Yunfan’s name spread throughout the world. At this moment, no one dared to look down on Chu Yunfan, and no one dared to say that Chu Yunfan had not grown up. Chu Yunfan, who had yet to fully mature to the peak, already possessed peerless ferocity. He had slaughtered so many experts in succession. Once he fully matured, he would probably steal the glory of his peers.","“Being in the same era as him is truly the tragedy of all the current prodigies. He’s the blazing sun in the sky, while the others are probably not even considered as the glimmering flames.”","Some of the older generations could not help but sigh. They seemed to have thought of the scene of a peerless genius suppressing his peers.","“However, this matter will definitely not slide just like that. Chu Yunfan has slaughtered so many experts. How can those forces be willing to let it go?”","“That’s right. The top geniuses of the Flying Celestials are being besieged. The Flying Celestials is not to be trifled with. I’m afraid this will cause a sensation in the world.”","For a time, everyone was discussing animatedly. Everyone was watching the reactions of the various major factions, especially the Flying Celestials. It was the most important place for countless spies to gather information.","While everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan, the person they were talking about, had quietly returned to Baotai. Under the towering city walls of Baotai stood a huge military camp. A figure dressed in a moon-white robe traveled on light and quietly arrived here. It was a young man with delicate features. He stood with his hands behind his back, and his expression had a hint of dignity and bearing.","“I’m finally back,” the young man said softly."]},{"number":2006,"title":"Chapter 2006 The Li Clan Is the Sky, the Earth, and the Law!","paragraphs":["2006 The Li Clan Is the Sky, the Earth, and the Law!","Looking at the mess in the military camp, Chu Yunfan frowned because there was something wrong. There were piles of junk everywhere, and it was dirty and messy. There was even blood seeping into the ground. It looked like a garbage dump, not a military camp.","Even the original camp of the Baotai garrison had not been like this, let alone the camp of the External Army that he had trained and tidied up. However, this place did not seem to have been attacked. Suddenly, the sound of a whip came from afar.","“You lowly animals! Why aren’t you leaving? Do you want me to throw you out?”","Chu Yunfan looked up and saw a group of soldiers in ragged clothes walking in a line. They were staggering out of the camp, and behind them, a man in a luxurious robe was beating them with a long whip.","“When the general returns, he won’t let you go!” a soldier who had been whipped roared.","However, he was met with a few more lashes. The man laughed and said, “Your general? He’s long dead. Now, my Li clan has the final say here. You rebel soldiers. If you have the ability, then resist. I’ll beat you all to death!”","The man had an unbridled look on his face as if he didn’t see this place as a military camp. “The Li clan is the sky, the earth, and the law!”","“What big words.”","Suddenly, a cold voice was heard. Everyone looked up, and the man was a little puzzled. Where did this young man come from? However, after a brief moment of shock, the soldiers became excited.","“You are...” Before the man could speak, the soldiers cleared his doubts.","“General! You’re back!”","“This is great! I knew you wouldn’t have died so easily!”","Everyone was overjoyed, especially many of the strong-willed men who had tears in their eyes. It was obvious that they were very excited to see Chu Yunfan.","“Who do you think you are? How dare you barge into a military camp without permission?” Chu Yunfan sneered and instantly appeared in front of this person.","The man suddenly panicked, but he quickly recovered. His eyes showed a bit of ruthlessness. “So what if you are Chu Yunfan? This camp has already been placed under the command of Young Master Qianyuan of the Li clan by the Ministry of War. You have no right to interfere anymore.”","“Li Qianyuan?” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly, and his eyes revealed a bit of anger.","Chu Yunfan’s divine will instantly spread out, and the situation of the entire military camp was included in his divine will. He was instantly furious. This kind of abuse toward the soldiers of the External Army was not only happening in front of him but everywhere throughout the camp. Those private servants of the Li clan dealt with these soldiers of the External Army unscrupulously. Countless soldiers were tortured to death, and their corpses were thrown to the side. No one cared about them. Naturally, these things could not escape Chu Yunfan’s vision.","“The Li clan is really bold.” Chu Yunfan suppressed his voice, but the anger contained in it was about to explode in the next moment.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and lightning chains were released from his body. They spread throughout the entire military camp. In the next moment, hundreds of figures were grabbed out of the camp. These people were all wearing Li clan uniforms. Now, they were all grabbed out and kept screaming.","Many soldiers in the military camp did not understand what had happened. Their eyes were filled with confusion. In the next moment, these people were caught by lightning chains and hung on the flagpole above the military camp.","“Ahhhh!”","All kinds of screams were heard continuously. The lightning chains released by Chu Yunfan controlled the power of lightning and did not electrocute them to death. Otherwise, even though these were the elites of the Li clan and their cultivation was very strong, they were all Abstracts. Chu Yunfan even saw some Cosmics, but how could they be a match for Chu Yunfan’s attack?","However, the constant flow of electric currents in their bodies caused them unforgettable pain. Their divine power was scattered in an instant. Even if they were not scattered, they could not resist.","Chu Yunfan flew into the sky, his voice spreading throughout the entire military camp.","“I, Chu Yunfan, the Great General of the External Army, have returned. From now on, the External Army will be under my command. The entire army is dismissed to rest. All officers above the captain rank will come to my tent for a meeting.”","“The general is back!”","“Our suffering is over!”","“Why is the general only back now?”","When the soldiers heard this, they were stunned for a moment. Then, they were all in an uproar. During this time, they had suffered too much torture. After Chu Yunfan’s death, they had turned from proud soldiers to wanderers. Anyone could come up and bully them, especially the Li clan, who was Chu Yunfan’s enemy.","Ever since Li Qianyuan took over the External Army, the entire camp had been tortured. The entire army was about to collapse from the torture. However, the harsh military discipline of Grand Xia made it impossible for them to escape. Grand Xia had a special hunting team to deal with deserters. There was no way for them to escape. Moreover, they were just small characters. Even if they escaped, they would become cannon fodder and might even implicate their families. This left them with no other choice but to submit.","Now that Chu Yunfan had returned, it was like the sound of nature to them.","“Who is it? How dare you be so impudent!”","Suddenly, an angry roar came from the town of Baotai in the distance. In the next moment, an old man with white hair and a youthful face appeared above the camp of the External Army.","“A Li clan Grand Elder?” Chu Yunfan looked at the white-haired old man and instantly determined the latter’s identity. The mana fluctuations he emitted were easy to identify and could not be faked.","“That’s right. I’m Li Huan. Are you Chu Yunfan?” When the old man saw Chu Yunfan, his eyes revealed a hint of horror.","Li Huan had been stationed in Baotai for some time. Previously, he had only received news that the original commander of the External Army, General Chu Yunfan, had fallen. The Li clan had sent him to take over, but who knew that he would meet Chu Yunfan?"]},{"number":2007,"title":"Chapter 2007 Killing a Creator in One Hit, Shocking the City","paragraphs":["2007 Killing a Creator in One Hit, Shocking the City","Li Huan’s pupils contracted instinctively because he had received orders from the Li clan to come and cripple the army. Of course, because the External Army was an army of Grand Xia, they couldn’t use violent methods to slaughter them as they did to their enemies. Therefore, they could only use all kinds of methods to torture them.","In just a short time, one-third of the soldiers of the External Army had died from torture. If this continued, the remaining two-thirds would be tortured to death in the next six months. At that time, the Ministry of War would send new recruits to replace them. Everything was done perfectly. No one would care about an army that no longer had a leader. The Li clan took this opportunity to take control of another army. It could be said that everyone was happy.","At the same time, it was a warning to everyone that if they offended the Li clan, even if they died like Chu Yunfan, they would bring disaster to their families. Everyone related to Chu Yunfan would be punished.","However, Li Huan had not expected to meet Chu Yunfan here. As he recalled Chu Yunfan’s reputation within the Li clan, he instantly wanted to escape. Chu Yunfan had managed to escape from the demons and Demon God Sect that had joined forces, coupled with the Li clan’s secret support. He had killed many experts of the demons and the Demon God Sect. If not for the supreme figure of the demons, Chu Yunfan might have really escaped.","As the Grand Elder of the Li clan, Li Huan knew some inside information. Because of this, the moment he saw Chu Yunfan, his reaction was to escape. He was just an ordinary elder, and his cultivation had only just entered the Creation Stage. How could he face Chu Yunfan, who could easily slaughter the experts of the demons and the Demon God Sect?","“Chu Yunfan, it’s useless even if you’re back. According to the Ministry of War’s transfer order, the External Army has already been placed under the command of Marquis Huntian. You no longer have the right to command this place. You’re acting recklessly. I will report you to the Ministry of War and strip you of all your positions,” the Li clan’s Grand Elder said boldly.","“The External Army is under Li Qianyuan’s command?” Chu Yunfan sneered, but the killing intent in his eyes became colder. “Who do you think you are? How dare you harm a meritorious minister of the Imperial Court? One-third of the entire External Army has been killed or injured!”","Chu Yunfan scanned the ground with his divine will. The corpses on the ground were shocking to him.","“They are all soldiers who have made great contributions to the Imperial Court. They didn’t die in the hands of the foreign tribes, but they died in the hands of you despicable people. How dare you mention Li Qianyuan to me? I guess you haven’t heard the news yet. Li Qianyuan is dead, and he died by me hands!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Today, I will enforce justice on behalf of the heavens. None of you will escape!”","Li Huan’s first reaction was that it was impossible. Although Li Qianyuan was not invincible, he couldn’t have been defeated by his peers. This had never happened before. Li Qianyuan spent decades to establish his invincible prestige.","But at this moment, Li Huan felt an extreme sense of danger from Chu Yunfan. This feeling made him turn around and flee immediately. Regardless of whether Li Qianyuan had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands or not, since Chu Yunfan had returned with ill intentions, he did not dare to stay and confront Chu Yunfan head-on.","“Chu Yunfan, I will report this to the Ministry of War. Don’t even think about running away!” Li Huan roared, and then he swept out of the city. In an instant, he had already fled hundreds of kilometers.","“You’re not getting away.” Chu Yunfan sneered, not worried about Li Huan getting away.","Chu Yunfan waved, and a lightning whip appeared out of thin air. Then, it chased after Li Huan like a swimming dragon.","Stab!","Li Huan didn’t even have time to escape. His brain was pierced by the lightning whip, and it proceeded to sweep his entire body into the Mountain River Diagram. All of this happened too quickly. In a flash, the Grand Elder of the Li clan, who had dominated Baotai for more than half a year, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","All these changes made the experts of the various forces in Baotai feel that it was difficult to breathe. Seeing Chu Yunfan display his might as soon as he returned, these forces could not help but feel extremely wary.","Originally, Baotai had become Chu Yunfan’s private territory, and the forces related to Chu Yunfan had been supported. However, after more than half a year of action, it was not only the soldiers in the army who were persecuted by the Li clan. Even the forces that Chu Yunfan had supported had been ostracized, and it was difficult for them to survive. Now, the dominant forces in the city were either the Li clan’s forces or those related to the Li clan. Otherwise, it would be impossible to establish a foothold in Baotai.","But now, after seeing Chu Yunfan kill Li Huan with lightning speed, everyone was dumbfounded. That was a Creator Grand Elder. Such a figure would be a big shot in any direction. If he appeared on the human-demon battlefield, he would be a terrifying existence that could change the situation.","Ever since Li Huan had taken over Baotai, no one had been able to shake his position. However, such a terrifying existence had been killed in one strike. Although many people had heard of Chu Yunfan’s name, this was the first time they had seen him in person. At this moment, their expressions changed drastically.","“Is this Chu Yunfan? Why is he ten times more terrifying than the rumors?”","“He just said that Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian, is dead. Is this news true?”","“I think this news should be true. After all, this news is not difficult to verify. Marquis Huntian is the darling of the Li clan. Even if there is a slight movement, it should be easily detected by others. If what he said is wrong, he will only become a laughing stock.”","“That’s right. I think so too. I’m afraid Marquis Huntian is truly doomed.”","“Then what should we do? Chu Yunfan is so vicious. He definitely won’t let us off. What should we do?”","“We need to get out of here, and fast!”"]},{"number":2008,"title":"Chapter 2008 The Li Clan Is Just the Crown Prince’s Lapdog","paragraphs":["2008 The Li Clan Is Just the Crown Prince’s Lapdog","Some people were happy, while others were worried. In Baotai, all the forces related to the Li clan were in a panic. On the contrary, the local forces that were originally supported by Chu Yunfan were extremely excited.","The forces in Baotai had already been sorted out by Chu Yunfan. The local tyrants who opposed him naturally could not continue to exist. They had long been uprooted.","The remaining forces were either close to Chu Yunfan or had a relationship with him. However, after the news of Chu Yunfan’s death spread, they became frightened. Before they could find another backer, the Li clan’s forces had already landed, not giving them any time to react.","In this half a year, they were pushed aside to the point where they could only drag out their days. With the support of the Li clan, these forces that had various relationships with the Li clan continued to nibble away at the various interests of Baotai.","After two years of development on Chu Yunfan’s part, the nearby bandits and foreign forces that had broken into this area had been uprooted. It could be said that these foreign forces had been wiped out.","After all, with the existence of Zhenyao City, even if the foreign races broke in, they could only be small-scale troops. Ordinary local forces could not do anything about it, and the border areas often faced attacks from various foreign races. However, all of this was useless against the local garrison troops, which were more elite than the regular army.","After two years, Baotai had become the most prosperous city among the many border cities nearby. The benefits involved were also incomparably huge. The Li clan’s quick response to taking over Baotai and the External Army was definitely not only because of their grudge against Chu Yunfan. And now, they finally had a day to stand out.","For a moment, Baotai was in chaos. The civilians who did not know what was going on watched as the originally high and mighty Li clan members fled like hamsters. They hurriedly fled out of the city. Some people even tried to fly out of the city impatiently. However, just as they were about to fly out, the barrier in the city was activated. It was like a spider web, trapping all these people.","The elite troops that had not been in the city for a long time marched into the city in an orderly manner and quickly took over the city’s defenses. Although the armor on these soldiers was not complete, and many of them wore it, it seemed that in one night, their spirit and energy were found again.","A massacre was inevitable. The anger that these soldiers had suppressed for more than half a year was completely released. These forces were usually good at bullying the people, but they were no match for the External Army, which had regained its spirit. In just a short day, they were slaughtered.","The Li clan’s subsidiary forces were trying to resist and clamoring.","“Chu Yunfan, you will die a horrible death!”","“The Li clan will avenge us!”","“Marquis Huntian will not let you off!”","However, no matter how fiercely they shouted, it could not change the fact that they were constantly being slaughtered. After a whole day, the rising and falling resistance in the city finally came to an end. The forces that the Li clan had spent a lot of money to plant were cleaned up inside and out.","Stepping on a pool of blood, a young man stepped into Baotai like a king.","In the depths of the Flying Celestials, there was a place with green mountains and clear waters that were surrounded by immortal energy. It was like a paradise on earth.","Two figures were confronting each other. The chessboard was like a battlefield, with black and white chess pieces flying up and down. The two of them were killing happily.","One of them was Situ Xuan, the sect leader of the Flying Celestials. The other was dressed in a moon-white robe. He had white hair and a youthful face. He looked like an immortal from heaven.","If there were people who were familiar with the Flying Celestials, they would probably be shocked to see this person. This person was none other than the Flying Celestials’ chief grand elder, Zhangsun Yuan, who had not appeared for a long time.","Zhangsun Yuan was the head of the Grand Elders, and his position in the sect was only second to Situ Xuan. In fact, he was even above the vice sect leaders.","“Chu Yunfan has uprooted the Li clan in Baotai!” Zhangsun Yuan said as he casually placed a black piece down.","“That must be the case. Although this child has the heart of a Buddha, he also has lightning-fast methods.” Situ Xuan thought about it for a while and placed the white piece. He didn’t seem to be surprised by this news.","The Flying Celestials had always been collecting information on Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan was a disciple of the Flying Celestials, the more they valued him, the more information they had to collect. With the Flying Celestials’ mature system, it was naturally impossible for them to hand over their huge foundation to someone of unknown origin.","“Besides, he has been suppressing his anger for so long and needs to vent it. The Li clan’s interference this time has gone too far,” Situ Xuan continued.","Chu Yunfan cleaned up the Li clan’s forces tied up the Li clan’s spies in the External Army, and hung them on the flagpole. As soon as this matter came out, it caused a sensation. However, when they thought about how Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan, they were shocked but not surprised. These people added together were not as important as Li Qianyuan’s finger.","Situ Xuan said, “The Li clan sent people to question me, but I have already chased them away. I still need them to explain why Li Weiyuan appeared in the ranks of those who besieged Chu Yunfan. Hmph, the Li clan has been relying on the protection of the Crown Prince and the peerless genius Li Qianyuan. They think that it will not be a problem for them to rise in the future. They have caused big trouble several times. Do they really think that the Flying Celestials can’t deal with their clan?”","Situ Xuan’s eyes were filled with disdain. Although the Li clan was a colossus in the eyes of others, to the Flying Celestials, it was nothing more than something that could be slapped to death.","The Flying Celestials had stood tall in Grand Xia for countless years, and they had known countless powers like the Li clan. They watched as these people built skyscrapers and then watched them crumble. It was the attitude of the Flying Celestials that no matter how the world changed, the ten great sects would always stand tall and remain at the top of Grand Xia.","In his eyes, the Li clan was nothing more than a lapdog of the Crown Prince. If they dared to make a ruckus in front of him, he would kill them with a slap. It was only because the Crown Prince was very likely to become the next king that he had some scruples. Otherwise, no prince would dare to clamor in front of him. Even the king would not dare to target the Flying Celestials so brazenly.","“We will make the Li clan pay the price. This is also a warning to everyone who thinks of provoking the Flying Celestials,” Situ Xuan said coldly."]},{"number":2009,"title":"Chapter 2009 Placing High Hopes on Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["2009 Placing High Hopes on Chu Yunfan","“That being said,” Zhangsun Yuan said, “I’m afraid Chu Yunfan will blame us for not taking care of the External Army and letting it fall into Li Qianyuan’s hands. Aren’t you afraid that he will resent us?”","Situ Xuan laughed. “What’s there to be afraid of? If he’s really like this, then I’ve misjudged him. However, I’ve never misjudged him in my life.”","Zhangsun Yuan smiled and didn’t refute. Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan’s actions this time were so intense because he was expressing his dissatisfaction. However, he didn’t choose to express his dissatisfaction at the Flying Celestials. Instead, he announced his return by uprooting the Li clan.","After all, every injustice had its perpetrator, and the Flying Celestials weren’t the ones who attacked the External Army. In fact, if it weren’t for the Flying Celestials, the Li clan could easily wipe out the entire army by sending them to the most dangerous battlefield. The Li clan wouldn’t have needed to do it themselves.","“After this incident, he will understand that if he wants to protect the people he cares about, he can only rely on himself. He can’t rely on anyone else,” Situ Xuan said, “If he dies, he won’t have any value, right?”","Situ Xuan’s voice was calm. To him, although Chu Yunfan was dissatisfied with the Flying Celestials’ policy of letting the External Army roam freely, he would eventually understand that this was a matter of course.","This was reality and the iron rule of the world!","Only by living and showing enough value would one be able to make the Flying Celestials view them in a different light. Once they died, they would be like an extinguished lamp. They would be nothing.","This iron rule was not only targeted at Chu Yunfan but also at him. Although he was now the supreme sect leader of the Flying Celestials and one of the few big figures in Grand Xia, once he died, he would at most be the same as the past sect leaders who had passed away. He would only be a legendary figure in history. Soon, his influence would dissipate. When a person died, it was like a lamp being extinguished. When the tree falls, the monkeys scatter. This was the principle.","“So, he’s just throwing a tantrum, that’s all,” Situ Xuan said indifferently, “If he can’t even understand this, then my efforts to nurture him will be in vain.”","“What do you want to do, sir? To promote him as the chief disciple?” Zhangsun Yuan said.","“No, I want him to be a vice sect leader.” Situ Xuan frowned.","“Vice sect leader? Isn’t that a position that only the chief disciple can sit in?” Zhangsun Yuan was shocked by Situ Xuan’s thoughts.","Generally speaking, only after the older generation successively retired from the management level and the new generation became the pillar of support would the best of them have the possibility of becoming the vice sect leader. However, there was an exception. After a certain degree of experience, the chief disciple of a sect could become a vice sect leader. Once they were appointed as a vice sect leader, it was almost confirmed that he was the future successor of the sect leader.","In Zhangsun Yuan’s original opinion, Yang Dengxian would become the next vice sect leader, but that would only happen decades later when Yang Dengxian’s cultivation base had further developed. After that, Situ Xuan entrusted all the matters in the sect to Yang Dengxian, and he himself would gradually withdraw from the management level. He would focus on cultivating and breaking through to reach the supreme stage. However, Situ Xuan’s actions were clearly beyond his expectations.","“That’s right. Originally, I was more satisfied with Yang Dengxian becoming my successor. He was the most suitable candidate, but now, I think Chu Yunfan is more suitable.” Situ Xuan’s eyes were ablaze.","Zhangsun Yuan naturally understood why Situ Xuan suddenly changed his mind. Although Chu Yunfan’s performance was extremely amazing, he was not much better than Yang Dengxian. Compared to Yang Dengxian’s years of management, the position of the chief disciple was deeply rooted. Chu Yunfan could not shake Yang Dengxian’s position in a short period.","However, the situation had changed drastically. Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan and displayed his extraordinary strength. Even the previous number-one prodigy, Li Weiyuan, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Compared to Yang Dengxian, Chu Yunfan’s talent was obviously stronger, and his strength had already surpassed Yang Dengxian by several levels. In the future, when Chu Yunfan grew up, his future was limitless, and he even had the chance to become one of the strongest in the world. It had been many years since the Flying Celestials had produced such a character.","“But in comparison, Chu Yunfan doesn’t seem to have much sense of belonging to the Flying Celestials, and he doesn’t want to get involved in the competition for the position of chief disciple,” Zhangsun Yuan furrowed his brows as he recalled the analysis of the information he had read.","Ever since Chu Yunfan entered the Flying Celestials, he had been wandering outside of the system. It was obvious that there was a huge gap between him and Yang Dengxian, who was one of his own.","“A sense of belonging can be slowly cultivated. Is he going to return to the Violet Thunder Prefecture to become the head of the Chu clan?” Situ Xuan smiled faintly. “Moreover, there are many times when he doesn’t even need to manage worldly affairs. His existence is the greatest deterrence.”","“As for Yang Dengxian, I want to train him to be a vice sect leader as well. He will be in charge of all the matters in the sect and assist Chu Yunfan in bringing the Flying Celestials to a higher level,” Situ Xuan said.","Zhangsun Yuan immediately understood that Situ Xuan was using Chu Yunfan as a deterrent. If a genius like Chu Yunfan was nurtured into an existence like an ordinary sect leader, it would be a waste of heaven’s gift. Letting Chu Yunfan and Yang Dengxian cooperate was the most suitable path.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to participate in the management of the sect affairs. As long as he continued to cultivate, the Flying Celestials would become stronger because of his strength. It was not uncommon for a person to prosper in a sect in Grand Xia.","“However, this is still a long-term plan. I’ll pass down the order to appoint him as a vice sect leader first. As for the matters after that, we’ll have to think about it later,” Situ Xuan said, “Moreover, the Grand Commandant’s Office should be rewarding him soon. Even if someone tries to stop him, I don’t think the Elder Princess will let him do as he wishes. After all, our Chu Yunfan is the fiance of her last disciple, Princess Gushe. If Chu Yunfan doesn’t get a marquis title, wouldn’t that be a huge joke?”","“Hahaha, not bad. Then he’s the true number one of the younger generation!” Zhangsun Yuan thought for a moment and couldn’t help but clap his hands and laugh.","Now that Li Qianyuan was dead, wasn’t Chu Yunfan the only marquis of the younger generation?","Just as the Flying Celestials’ sect leader and the chief grand elder were discussing Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan was sitting high up in the commander’s office in Baotai."]},{"number":2010,"title":"Chapter 2010 So What if I Killed the Li Clan Members?","paragraphs":["2010 So What if I Killed the Li Clan Members?","In front of Chu Yunfan, You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai were sitting cross-legged in the air, their bodies faintly emitting layers of divine power fluctuations. The injuries on their bodies that were visible to the naked eye were recovering at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan’s body continuously emitted an endless stream of life force. In just a moment, the two people’s injuries were healed.","“Thank you, Senior Chu.”","You Chuyun’s cultivation became even more spirited. He was the first to complete the breakthrough. His face revealed a somewhat surprised and happy expression. Chu Yunfan had only given him a little bit of life force, but it had healed his injuries. His cultivation had even improved, and he had directly broken through to the Cosmos Stage.","Although the Cosmos Stage was nothing to Chu Yunfan at the moment, becoming a true disciple of the Flying Celestials and breaking through to the Cosmos Stage was still the biggest dream of an ordinary person. This was because 99% of people would never be able to break through to the Cosmos Stage in their lifetime.","You Chuyun originally estimated that he would only have a chance to break through to the Cosmos Stage within a few decades. At that time, he would no longer be young and would be close to middle-aged. There was basically no possibility of him advancing further. Chu Yunfan had helped him realize his dream of winning. With so much more time, he would have the opportunity to break through to a higher stage. Perhaps, in this life, he would be able to break through to the Creation Stage.","“You’re welcome.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","You Chuyun was able to break through because of his help, but You Chuyun’s own accumulation and foundation were also quite deep, which was why he was able to break through so quickly. Then, his gaze turned to Chu Hongcai. Compared to You Chuyun, Chu Hongcai’s injuries were more serious. However, it didn’t take long for him to recover.","Their injuries were from the human-demon battlefield. Although the Li clan did not dare to attack You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai openly, they could easily mobilize them to participate in the human-demon war with military orders.","Without Chu Yunfan, the commander, the External Army suffered heavy losses because they did not have any experts to hold the fort. The role of an expert on the battlefield was unquestionable. They could easily tear apart a battle formation and change the outcome of a battle.","Without Chu Yunfan, the army suffered heavy losses after several battles. They didn’t even have any reinforcements. At this rate, it wouldn’t be long before the name of the army was removed from Grand Xia’s list.","You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai were heavily injured in the battle and almost lost their lives. Without Chu Yunfan as a backer, the status of the two in the External Army could be imagined.","When Chu Hongcai opened his eyes, he realized that not only had his injuries healed, but his cultivation base had also soared by a large margin. He had stepped into the Abstract Interpretation Stage, saving him at least ten years of bitter cultivation. However, he was very indifferent. He had long since planted the belief that Chu Yunfan was omnipotent in his heart. This was only a matter of course.","“Do not go out for a while. Go into seclusion and digest your current strength. Otherwise, it will become a matter of pulling the seedlings to help them grow. That wouldn’t be a good thing,” Chu Yunfan instructed.","Chu Yunfan had shared a small portion of the Wood Spirit Essence in his body with the two of them. Their cultivation was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, so they naturally achieved breakthroughs easily, especially Chu Hongcai. Under normal cultivation, he wouldn’t even be able to touch the threshold of the Abstract Interpretation Stage without ten years. However, with the Wood Spirit Essence, he had broken through swiftly. It would be easy for him to enter the Cosmos Stage within a few years.","“In the following period, I will train the External Army. I want to restore the combat strength of the army. What’s the situation now?” Chu Yunfan inquired.","“I’m afraid the Li clan won’t let this go, Senior Chu.” You Chuyun looked at Chu Yunfan with some worry.","Unlike Chu Hongcai, who was an outsider, he was a native of Grand Xia and understood how terrifying the Li clan was. The words “military aristocratic family” already explained everything. It was not something that ordinary forces could use.","Although the Li clan was nothing compared to the Flying Celestials, it was still a colossus to them. Now, Chu Yunfan had used the lightning whip to hang these Li clan members to death and even killed a Creator of the Li clan. This enmity was huge.","“The Li clan is nothing. I even killed Li Qianyuan, so what’s a mere Creator elder?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai froze. They had heard something that shocked them. Li Qianyuan was so famous among his peers that even an outsider like Chu Hongcai had heard of him. One could imagine what kind of level he had reached.","It could be said that the biggest shadow in the hearts of Chu Yunfan’s followers had always been the resentment between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan, which could be said to be known by the whole world.","The two sides were bound to be in a life-and-death relationship. In this case, one day they were suddenly told that Li Qianyuan had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. One could imagine how much of a sensation it would cause.","However, You Chuyun immediately reacted. Unlike Chu Hongcai, who firmly believed that Chu Yunfan was omnipotent, You Chuyun immediately realized why Chu Yunfan did not put the Li clan in his eyes. He even looked down on them.","Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan. Although this matter had caused a stir and the whole world knew about it, he, who was bound in the military camp, didn’t know. However, he knew the attitude of the Flying Celestials toward the prodigies. Chu Yunfan could kill Li Qianyuan, which meant that he had replaced Li Qianyuan and become the number one prodigy in the world. The Flying Celestials would definitely protect Chu Yunfan. Not to mention the Li clan, even the other ten great sects would not be able to make the Flying Celestials retreat on the issue of Chu Yunfan.","As Chu Yunfan said, even Li Qianyuan was killed. What was a mere Li clan elder?","Thinking of this, You Chuyun felt like his heart was about to jump out of his chest. He knew that from today onward, Chu Yunfan would definitely soar to the sky and would no longer be a dispensable existence. The Flying Celestials would do their best to help him rise for the sake of the sect’s future. As long as Chu Yunfan didn’t die, he would definitely become one of the top experts in the world. The sect would be able to rise to the Heavens. This was the best outcome they could plan.","“You can rest assured and reorganize the army. As for the pressure on the Li clan, I will deal with it,” Chu Yunfan said calmly."]},{"number":2011,"title":"Chapter 2011 Promotion, Marquis Zhenyuan","paragraphs":["2011 Promotion, Marquis Zhenyuan","Chu Yunfan was naturally dissatisfied when he saw the miserable state of the army. However, he knew that the Flying Celestials would not fight with the Li clan over a dead person. If that happened, the Flying Celestials would be enemies with the entire world.","But now that he was still alive, the situation was completely different. The Flying Celestials naturally could not just watch as the Li clan targeted him and did nothing.","“It’s time for you to move!”","Countless thoughts flashed through Chu Yunfan’s mind. Just as Chu Yunfan returned to Baotai and cleaned up the various forces of the Li clan in the city, everyone was waiting to see if Grand Xia would punish Chu Yunfan for doing such a thing. However, to everyone’s surprise, Grand Xia turned a blind eye to this scene. Many sharp people sensed the inner workings hidden behind this.","On the third day, the notice from Grand Xia finally arrived. To everyone’s surprise, this was an imperial edict from the king of Grand Xia. Not only was Chu Yunfan fine, but on the contrary, because he had killed many foreign races and demonic cultivators, he had been promoted to Marquis Zhenyuan.","Chu Yunfan was to become the only marquis of the younger generation!","Originally, Li Qianyuan was the one-word marquis of the younger generation, but he had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Therefore, Chu Yunfan, who was conferred the title of Marquis Zhenyuan, became the only marquis of the younger generation and was above everyone.","For a while, this caused a huge commotion in Grand Xia. It was said that the Li clan had sent people to the palace to meet the king, hoping that he would retract the decree. However, it was obvious that the Li clan could not shake the will of the king, and the decree to confer Chu Yunfan the title of Marquis Zhenyuan was still issued.","For a moment, Chu Yunfan was in the limelight and became the only marquis among the younger generation. It was not difficult for the geniuses of the younger generation to become marquises. As long as these geniuses on the Prodigy List did not die, becoming marquises was almost certain. This was how a military family like the Li clan was formed. Generations of descendants were constantly conferred marquis titles, and the power they slowly accumulated was shocking.","However, just like when Li Qianyuan was the only one who had been conferred the title of marquis, it was already a very remarkable thing to be the first to do it. After all, to become a marquis wasn’t just about having enough contributions. The power behind it also needed to be constantly working. When Li Qianyuan was granted the title of Marquis Huntian, it was a shock. The Crown Prince’s forces were constantly working behind him, which led to Li Qianyuan’s title.","Now that Chu Yunfan had become a marquis, the power behind him was unquestionable. Everyone knew that it was the Flying Celestials. With the strength of the Flying Celestials, it was not difficult for them to make a person a marquis. Many of the Grand Elders in the Flying Celestials also had titles of nobility.","Not to mention, Chu Yunfan’s military exploits were real. He had killed many high-stage Creators. Killing a few of them was enough for an ordinary person to be awarded the title of marquis. Chu Yunfan had killed hundreds of high-stage Creators along with the demons and the Demon God Sect in one breath. This credit was simply earth-shattering. Not to mention being invincible among the younger generation, even among the older generation of experts, this glory was very rare.","These high-stage Creators were usually the tycoons of a region. They controlled countless forces and would not easily gather together. Only by targeting Chu Yunfan could these top experts who were usually far apart gather together. This was a prerequisite that ordinary people would not dare to imagine, let alone being surrounded by so many experts. It was simply a dead end. It was already very difficult to escape with one life, let alone kill them. It was simply impossible to kill all these experts. If Chu Yunfan had a protector by his side, even the protector would have fallen. There were too many conditions required. In other words, these were things that only Chu Yunfan could do. No one else could do it. They didn’t even dare to think about it.","Even the number of Creators that many of the Flying Celestials’ senior elders had killed in their entire lives was not even half of the number that Chu Yunfan had killed in these two battles. With so many heads as a contribution, Chu Yunfan’s promotion was naturally a matter of course.","There was even news that Chu Yunfan wasn’t just going to be conferred the title of Marquis Zhenyuan, but also the title of one-word marquis. However, the Crown Prince’s faction fought to the death to stop this.","This news was enough to shock everyone.","one-word marquises were different from two-word marquises like Marquis Zhenyuan. The number of outstanding nobles who were conferred the title of one-word marquis was only one-tenth of the number of two-word marquises. Generally speaking, only those who had made great contributions could be conferred the title of one-word marquis.","Most of the existing one-word marquises were conferred during the founding of the country. They were not comparable to two-word marquises. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t get the title in the end, just being nominated was already amazing.","Chu Yunfan was so young. Although he was currently a two-word marquis, he had a great chance of becoming a one-word marquis in the future. Thinking of this, many people looked at Chu Yunfan in a completely different way. Chu Yunfan could not even be considered a potential stock at this time because he had completely displayed his talent.","Chu Yunfan’s fief was in Baotai. It could be said that Baotai had been completely granted to Chu Yunfan. From then on, Chu Yunfan could have half of all the profits of Baotai. This was an astronomical amount of wealth that could be used as a family heirloom.","Baotai was in a state of jubilation, especially the External Army. Chu Yunfan had returned and avenged them in one fell swoop. Not only was he not blamed by the Imperial Court, but he was even conferred the title of Marquis Zhenyuan, becoming a noble.","However, along with the imperial edict, other than the seal and robe of the Marquis Zhenyuan, there was also an imperial edict for Chu Yunfan to report to the capital. This was different from when he was promoted to External General. This time, after he was made a marquis, Chu Yunfan would go to the Imperial Capital to meet the current king and report his work to him.","When Chu Yunfan thought of meeting one of the top masters in the world, the king, even though Chu Yunfan’s heart had long been calm, he could not help but feel a little excited. After receiving the imperial edict, Chu Yunfan did not delay and immediately used a teleportation portal to head to the Imperial Capital."]},{"number":2012,"title":"Chapter 2012 Chu Yunfan Becomes a Marquis? Everyone Is Convinced!","paragraphs":["2012 Chu Yunfan Becomes a Marquis? Everyone Is Convinced!","It was different from the last time he came to the capital to report on his work. The last time Chu Yunfan came to the Imperial Capital, there was no commotion. At that time, he was just an ordinary young prodigy. He wasn’t even ranked on the Prodigy List. Except for certain circles, most people were not interested in Chu Yunfan.","However, this time, when Chu Yunfan entered the capital to report on his work, the news of his arrival spread throughout the Imperial Capital. Especially these few days, he was in the limelight. After the Prodigy List was updated, Chu Yunfan became number one on the Prodigy List. Just as everyone was still wondering how Chu Yunfan could become the number one on the Prodigy List, a piece of news came.","Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan, the original number one on the Prodigy List!","For a time, the world was in an uproar. Even a place like the Imperial Capital, which everyone was proud of, was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing battle results. And as time passed, more news came. Chu Yunfan had done far more than just killing Li Qianyuan. He successfully killed all the major forces in the encirclement. Even the previous prodigy of the Li clan died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","As the saying went, no one heard of studying hard, but the world knew of one’s brilliant feat! This was especially true when Chu Yunfan was conferred the title of Marquis Zhenyuan. According to the usual practice of Grand Xia, such a major event as the title of Marquis had to be announced publicly. How much merit did this person have to make before he could be conferred the title of Marquis?","This was the ironclad rule left behind by the Grand Xia’s ancestor. No marquis could be conferred without meritorious service. Even those who came from great clans or sects had to have real contributions if they wanted to be conferred the title of Marquis.","Chu Yunfan’s qualifications were exposed, and for a time, countless people were blinded. The experts he killed and captured were related to the demons, the marine folks, the demonic path, and other mortal enemies of Grand Xia. There were so many names that they couldn’t be written on a single piece of paper. Every single name on it was once famous throughout the world. To the citizens of Grand Xia, it could be said that Chu Yunfan had a huge debt of blood on his hands. It was unknown how much blood he had on his hands.","When Li Qianyuan was conferred the title of marquis, he relied on his elite troops and the help of his family’s protectors to kill a few Creators. He was conferred the title of Marquis Huntian because of his meritorious service. Although the contribution was enough, it was only barely enough to reach the standard. It was enough for ordinary people to become marquis. However, Li Qianyuan was the number one person on the Prodigy List. Such contributions could only be said to be barely qualified.","However, under the protection of the Li clan and the Crown Prince, no one dared to jump out and say that it was wrong. After all, Li Qianyuan had reached the minimum standard of being a marquis. After all, everyone knew that it was the will of the Crown Prince. The Crown Prince himself could not show up, but he needed Li Qianyuan to recruit talents and win over the hearts of the people.","Chu Yunfan was different. He was the only two-word marquis after Li Qianyuan. Although he had the help of the Flying Celestials, the names on his kill list were real. This was especially true as many of them were at the seventh level of the Creation Stage and peak Creation Stage. Any one of these experts appearing on the battlefield could cause a huge change in the situation. Any one of them appearing on the mainland of Grand Xia could affect the Imperial Court.","After this series of names were announced, no one doubted Chu Yunfan’s qualifications. After all, this kind of battle merit could be said to have exceeded 90% of the veteran officials. If no one had seen Chu Yunfan’s first battle with the demons and Demon God Sect, then in the battle on the Eastern Sea, Chu Yunfan had single-handedly massacred all the experts from the various forces who had surrounded him. Just the gains from that battle alone were enough to make Chu Yunfan a marquis.","Among these voices, there were naturally some who doubted Chu Yunfan. The Godly Sabers also belonged to Grand Xia, not to mention Li Qianyuan and Li Weiyuan, who were the best of the younger generation. Now, they were all killed by Chu Yunfan. This made many people doubt that Chu Yunfan, who had attacked his own people, did not have the right to be conferred the title of marquis. It was already good enough that he was not punished.","However, this statement was not valid. After all, not everyone was a fool. Everyone understood that Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan on stage openly, which was allowed by the rules. After that, Li Weiyuan joined forces with the demonic cults and outsiders to attack Chu Yunfan. It was fine if Li Weiyuan was dead now, but if he was still alive, many officials would probably make trouble. This had crossed the bottom line in many people’s hearts.","Even Chu Yunfan did not expect that his matter had long been known in the Imperial Capital. The moment he arrived at the Imperial Capital through the teleportation portal, he could feel that the Luck Dragon entrenched above the Imperial Capital was even larger and more terrifying.","It was not that the Luck Dragon had become stronger in such a short time, but that his cultivation had improved by leaps and bounds. In the Imperial Capital, the higher one’s cultivation was, the more one would be suppressed by this Luck Dragon. If demonic experts dared to come to the Imperial Capital, they would probably be defeated by the Luck Dragon and have a decline in their cultivation. On the other hand, ordinary people would be fine. They could not even sense the existence of the Luck Dragon.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level had improved, so he could naturally sense the existence of the Luck Dragon. That huge Luck Dragon was entrenched above the Imperial Capital, and its four sharp claws were grabbing at the four corners of the Imperial Capital. The huge dragon head was patrolling in all directions as if it was resisting some extraordinary existence.","Chu Yunfan had the seal of Marquis Zhenyuan issued by Grand Xia. In the next moment, the seal emitted a faint golden light, and the pressure of the Luck Dragon that was originally crushing down disappeared without a trace. Chu Yunfan then discovered that the seal issued by Grand Xia had such a function. However, as a noble in Grand Xia’s system, Chu Yunfan and Grand Xia naturally shared glory and humiliation. It was normal for the Luck Dragon to treat him as one of its own.","Under the guidance of the officials who had come to receive him, Chu Yunfan arrived at the Imperial Palace of Grand Xia for the first time. At a glance, the walls of the Imperial Palace were hundreds of feet high, reaching straight into the clouds. There were carved dragons and painted pillars, and it was dazzling. It gave off a terrifying aura.","With just a slight sense, Chu Yunfan could sense that there were terrifying auras like coiling dragons entrenched in the Imperial Palace. He did not know how many experts there were. There were countless of them. This was the place with the densest number of experts in the world."]},{"number":2013,"title":"Chapter 2013 Meeting the King","paragraphs":["2013 Meeting the King","No one knew exactly how many experts were hidden in the Imperial Capital, or even how many armies were lurking there. Chu Yunfan could feel that there were countless layers of secondary spaces in the palace. Who knew how many experts were hiding in these sub-spaces? Just the experts on the surface were already shocking. Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be surprised if hundreds of experts or hundreds of thousands of elite troops suddenly appeared from these sub-spaces.","After verifying his identity, Chu Yunfan was led into the Imperial Capital by a small yellow door. Only a small part of the Imperial Capital was the Imperial Palace, and the rest were the offices of the various officials of the Imperial Court.","“You must be the newly promoted Marquis Zhenyuan, Lord Chu Yunfan!”","Not long after entering the Imperial Capital, a flash of light appeared in the distance. Chu Yunfan saw that it was a middle-aged man dressed in a eunuch’s robe. This man had a fair face and no beard. He looked dignified. Although he was a eunuch, he did not have a trace of maliciousness.","“Eunuch Wei!” The man who was leading Chu Yunfan quickly bowed and greeted.","Chu Yunfan immediately knew the identity of the person who had come. He should be the head eunuch of the current Grand Xia king, Wei Yin. It was said that Wei Yin had been by the side of the current king when the latter was still a prince. Later on, he became one of the most powerful figures in the entire palace after the king ascended the throne. He was even known as the Inner Minister.","Although Wei Yin accompanied the king all year round and did not appear often, there was no doubt that he was one of the few powerful figures in the world today. However, what Chu Yunfan cared about was not Wei Yin’s power, but the faint mana fluctuations that he could vaguely feel from Wei Yin. Although it was well hidden, Chu Yunfan still noticed it. This trace of mana fluctuation gave Chu Yunfan a feeling that Wei Yin was unfathomable.","Wei Yin seemed to have noticed Chu Yunfan’s gaze. He raised his eyebrows slightly and a faint smile appeared on his face.","“Greetings, Eunuch Wei.” Chu Yunfan bowed.","“You are too polite, Lord Chu. I’ve long heard of your name. Seeing you today, it’s indeed better to meet you in person than to hear about you,” Wei Yin said, “I have received the king’s orders to welcome you to his quarters.”","“Thank you, Eunuch Wei.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Please follow me, Lord Chu.” Wei Yin turned around and headed deeper into the palace.","Under his lead, Chu Yunfan entered the depths of the palace without any obstructions. Chu Yunfan followed Wei Yin into the Diligent Government Hall. There was a figure in a dragon robe with his back facing the two of them.","“Marquis Zhenyuan? This is the first time we’re meeting, but I sense you are indeed a talented person.”","The man turned around, and Chu Yunfan saw that it was a middle-aged man who looked to be about 30 years old. He had thick brows and twinkling eyes. He had a handsome face and looked dignified.","Chu Yunfan immediately knew the identity of this middle-aged man. He was the master of countless forces in Grand Xia, the current king.","“Your humble subject, Chu Yunfan, is here to meet you, Your Majesty.” Chu Yunfan placed a fist in front of his chest and saluted.","Unlike Wei Yin, who had a faint aura, the king looked like an ordinary middle-aged man. Although he had an aura, it did not seem like he was very strong in cultivation. Of course, Chu Yunfan was not stupid enough to think that the king really had no cultivation. The king’s cultivation was very profound, so profound that even Chu Yunfan could not sense it. The difference in their levels was too great. They were not on the same level.","Different from the Elder Princess he had met, the Elder Princess’ aura was as deep as the ocean. One look and one could tell that she was a top master, a figure that could be counted among the few in the world. However, the king, who was rumored to have unfathomable cultivation, was like a handsome uncle next door. This was the most unbelievable.","“No need for formalities. Please, sit!” The king nodded.","“Thank you, Your Majesty,” Chu Yunfan said as he sat down on a chair.","The king nodded with a smile and said, “You don’t have to think too much about it. There’s no need to be nervous. Today is just a formality. All your information and achievements have been verified by the Grand Commandant’s Office. Although I have heard of your name long ago, this is the first time I’m seeing you in the flesh. It’s not much different from what I imagined. What a young general. It would be great if everyone in Grand Xia is as dedicated as you.”","Chu Yunfan was confused. He didn’t know what the king’s true purpose was. He could only smile and say, “Thank you for your praise, Your Majesty. I don’t deserve it.”","“You don’t deserve it?” The king suddenly looked at Chu Yunfan and smiled. “As far as I know, you are extremely daring, Lord Chu. There’s nothing you don’t dare to do. How dare you kill Marquis Huntian just like that.”","Chu Yunfan’s heart suddenly tightened. He knew that this was the real reason he was summoned here. Although he had killed Li Qianyuan in the arena, if he thought that he could explain everything away just like this, he would be very wrong.","However, he still opened his mouth and said in neither servile nor overbearing manner, “Your Majesty, although I killed Marquis Huntian, that was in the arena. As the saying goes, fists and feet have no eyes. There will inevitably be casualties. If I don’t fight with all my strength, I’m afraid I would be the one who’s dead.”","The king looked at Chu Yunfan indifferently and said, “I know that with your strength, you could have spared his life. However, you killed him because you were afraid of endless trouble. Do you think you can hide this from me?”","The king spoke slowly. His power was constantly increasing, and it brought great pressure to Chu Yunfan.","“But since he’s in the arena, I’m sure he has nothing to say even if he dies. Originally, with your contributions, it would be more than enough to confer you the title of one-word marquis. However, you can only be conferred the title of two-word marquis now. This can be considered as a small punishment for you,” the king said lightly.","He clearly had no intention of seeking justice for Li Qianyuan. What kind of person was he? He controlled the entire Grand Xia Empire. Why would he care about the battle between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan?","“I understand.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands. However, he was not interested in the difference between the One or two-word marquises. In the depths of his heart, supreme martial arts was his lifelong pursuit.","“Recently, there have been people constantly nagging in front of me. Some people want to kill you, some want to protect you. They even try to involve the officials. You have quite some way around here,” the king commented, “However, whether you are killed or protected is none of my concern, I don’t care. I only care about how many contributions you have made to the empire. Do you understand what I mean?”"]},{"number":2014,"title":"Chapter 2014 Reporting Completed, the King’s Evaluation","paragraphs":["2014 Reporting Completed, the King’s Evaluation","Chu Yunfan immediately understood the king’s meaning. As a king, many people’s life and death struggles were not important to him.","For the Li clan, losing Li Qianyuan was equivalent to cutting off the hope of rising in the future. Even Li Weiyuan was killed by Chu Yunfan. Not only was the hope of rising in the future destroyed. Even if the Li clan produced another prodigy who could make it onto the Prodigy List in the future, it would take decades to nurture them.","In addition, the deaths of Li Weiyuan and Li Qianyuan brought about a huge problem. In other words, the Li clan would lack a leader in the next hundred years and would not be able to compete with other forces for the right to speak. This was naturally heartbreaking for the Li clan.","However, to the kings and Grand Xia, these people were nothing. They were just one of the shining stars in the history of Grand Xia. There were undercurrents in the Imperial Court. Some wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, while others wanted to protect him. The two sides were fighting fiercely, but the level was too high, so Chu Yunfan did not feel the struggle.","However, judging from the king’s intention, it was obvious that the king wanted to let bygones be bygones. After all, Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan in the arena. Everyone knew that fists and feet had no eyes in the arena. For the king, as long as Chu Yunfan continued to make enough contributions to the empire, this little mistake was not worth mentioning.","Chu Yunfan understood that if he died at the hands of Li Qianyuan, it would probably be the same result. Could it be that the king would punish Li Qianyuan for a small general? That was impossible. Although this was cruel, it was reality. This stimulated Chu Yunfan’s fighting spirit. He had to rise up and truly stand among the top experts in the world so that no one could control his life and death.","“I understand.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","The king nodded in satisfaction. “Very good, Lord Chu. I look forward to seeing you make great contributions to the empire in the future. You are only a two-word marquis now. In the future, you will be a one-word marquis. You can even be a duke or a king as long as you have the ability.”","Chu Yunfan could see the king had strong confidence. Although he didn’t show his strength, he was the ruler of this huge empire. Only when he had absolute confidence in himself would he not worry about his subordinates overshadowing him and hope that his subordinates would make more contributions.","“All right, you may go now. I took the time to meet you today because I wanted to see the younger generation of the empire. You didn’t disappoint me,” the king said.","Wei Yin, who had been invisible before, suddenly appeared in front of Chu Yunfan and made an inviting gesture. Chu Yunfan followed him out of the hall. He couldn’t help but feel a little absent-minded. However, he immediately smiled. He was just going through the motions.","In today’s world, civil and military officials are divided and ruled separately. The sage emperor governs the country by bowing his head. The civil minister is the head of all officials, and the military minister is the marshal. He was at the top of the group of generals.","Basically, all the major events in the world could be divided into civil and military affairs. Chu Yunfan had been promoted to Marquis Zhenyuan because of his military achievements. The Grand Commandant’s Office should have conducted all kinds of inspections and evaluations long ago, and he had already obtained the recognition of all parties in the court. The meeting with the king today was just a formality.","“This is where I shall see you off. I wish you a bright future, Lord Chu.”","After Wei Yin sent Chu Yunfan out of the Diligent Government Hall, he cupped his hands and turned around to reenter the hall. Soon, his figure disappeared into the shadows.","Chu Yunfan did not stay any longer. Under the guidance of the palace staff waiting outside, Chu Yunfan immediately left the Imperial Capital. In the Diligent Government Hall, Wei Yin, who had returned, stood at the king’s side.","“Tell me, what kind of person is he?” The king glanced at Wei Yin.","“Your Majesty, I’m an internal official. I don’t talk about external matters. This is the rule,” Wei Yin said.","“It’s okay. I asked you to tell me.” The king waved.","“From the information we’ve gathered, Marquis Zhenyuan is ruthless and decisive. However, he is a loyal man and not a wolf,” Wei Yin said.","“Judging from Lord Chu’s usual style of doing things, it’s impossible unless he was acting from the beginning. It’s not a coincidence that he defeated Li Qianyuan. He is much more powerful than Li Qianyuan. Li Qianyuan wasted his talent, and he did some unscrupulous things. He thought that no one knew about his collusion with the demons and the Demon God Sect. He thought that he would be fine with the Crown Prince’s protection. In fact, he was very wrong.","“Those who do great things should bear great responsibilities. Li Qianyuan, I am so disappointed!”","As the king spoke, he shook his head. He seemed a little cold, but also a little regretful. “However, we have to continue observing Chu Yunfan. We have to listen to his words and observe his actions.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t know that the king and Wei Yin had commented on him and Li Qianyuan in the Diligent Government Hall. But even if he knew, he wouldn’t care. After meeting the king and completing his report, he was officially Marquis Zhenyuan of the Empire. Even when facing the head of the Li clan, he could be on equal footing. At least in terms of nobility, he could be on equal footing.","Chu Yunfan did not stay in the Imperial Capital for long. Not long after leaving for the Imperial Capital, Chu Yunfan returned to Baotai through the teleportation portal. This place had become Chu Yunfan’s fief, and because of him, this place was now called Zhenyuan City.","When Chu Yunfan returned to Zhenyuan, he found out that not long after he left, a construction team from the Ministry of Industry had arrived through the teleportation portal. They had demolished his previous residence and rebuilt it according to his specifications.","Everything was on the right track. The forces in Zhenyuan had also accepted it. From now on, this border town had its own master. The people in the city quickly accepted it and sincerely welcomed this too because those who were not welcome and opposed it had long been eliminated.","As soon as Chu Yunfan returned to the camp, he was informed that there were guests waiting for him."]},{"number":2015,"title":"Chapter 2015 Is He Even Qualified to Threaten Me?","paragraphs":["2015 Is He Even Qualified to Threaten Me?","In Chu Yunfan’s office, a man dressed in white sat beside Chu Yunfan. This man in white was about forty years old. He looked middle-aged and had a noble aura.","“Marquis Baiyi? May I know why you have come?” Chu Yunfan looked at the man in white.","In Grand Xia, although it wasn’t easy to become a marquis, there were many geniuses who would shine for a time. As long as these people were willing to serve Grand Xia, it wouldn’t be difficult for them to become a marquis.","Furthermore, Grand Xia had been established for so many years, and countless people had been conferred the title of marquis. If it wasn’t for the fact that the title of marquis in Grand Xia couldn’t be inherited unless it reached the level of duke, the streets would probably be filled with marquis.","But even so, there were still many marquises in Grand Xia. Chu Yunfan couldn’t recognize all of them. In fact, he didn’t know most of them. However, there was a huge difference between each marquis. Only a few people in every generation could achieve the feat of Chu Yunfan, who had made enough contributions in the shortest time possible. It could be said that they were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns.","Most of them had served in the army for many years and continuously accumulated merit. Because of their merit and seniority, they were conferred the title of marquis.","Chu Yunfan and this white-robed man were both marquises, but compared to Marquis Baiyi, Chu Yunfan was in the limelight and was the center of attention. They were on completely different levels.","However, Chu Yunfan quickly remembered some information about Marquis Baiyi. Although he had never met the man before, the Flying Celestials had sent him a lot of information about the other marquises.","One of them was the Marquis Baiyi, but he only spoke a few words. Marquis Baiyi Yang Yi was from the Yang family, a military aristocratic family. He had served in the army since he was young and was later given the title of Marquis Baiyi. It was an ordinary resume.","Ordinary people naturally wouldn’t dare to underestimate Marquis Baiyi. No matter how ordinary he was, those who could be conferred the title of marquis were the cream of the crop among their peers. But in front of Chu Yunfan, it was nothing.","“Marquis Chu, I’m here on behalf of the Crown Prince,” Yang Yi said.","“The Crown Prince?” Chu Yunfan’s eyebrows knitted together, and his eyes flashed with a fierce light.","Everyone knew that Li Qianyuan was the Crown Prince’s confidant. When Chu Yunfan killed Li Qianyuan, he and the Crown Prince became enemies. He was a little surprised that Yang Yi sought refuge with the Crown Prince. It was different from Li Qianyuan, who was the direct descendant and confidant of the Crown Prince. Yang Yi had clearly sought refuge with the Crown Prince later.","The king was not afraid of the courtiers coming into contact with the princes and princesses. He even encouraged them to form cliques and compete with each other. The final winner would become the next king. However, the current situation was unclear. Even the Crown Prince did not seem to be that outstanding under the competition of many brothers and sisters. Now, smart people would not choose to place their bets so early.","“I’m sure you know about my relationship with the Crown Prince, Marquis Baiyi. Marquis Huntian was the Crown Prince’s trusted aide. Now that Marquis Huntian has died in my hands, could it be that the Crown Prince is here to punish me?” Chu Yunfan smiled.","“Of course not.” Yang Yi shook his head. “Although the previous incident caused you to have a misunderstanding with the Crown Prince, the Crown Prince is broad-minded and will not be calculative with you. As long as you are willing to serve the Crown Prince, everything that happened before can be written off.”","Chu Yunfan looked at Yang Yi with a mocking smile and shook his head. Although he had never met the Crown Prince, he could already tell many things.","Harsh and ungrateful!","Li Qianyuan, as his confidant, had done so many things for him. Now, not long after his death, the Crown Prince had come to recruit Li Qianyuan’s sworn enemy. The Crown Prince was trying to act like he was respectful to the wise, but he was arrogant and refused to visit Chu Yunfan personally.","Whether it was because the Crown Prince was arrogant and thought that Chu Yunfan was just so-so, or because he was afraid of rumors and gossip, he was not a master who could do great things. It was no wonder that even though he had the title of Crown Prince and was born with the title, so many of his brothers and sisters had come out to challenge him. This in itself was a sign that virtue did not match status.","Being conferred the title of Crown Prince was an innate advantage. The gap between him and the others had been widened to an extreme point. But at this point, he was still unable to suppress his many brothers and sisters, and such a person wanted to subdue Chu Yunfan? What a joke!","“If that is all you have to say, please leave, Marquis Baiyu.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","“What did you say?” Yang Yi was stunned as if he had never expected Chu Yunfan to reject him so quickly.","One must know how powerful the Crown Prince’s faction was. Even the last time when Li Qianyuan colluded with the Demon God Sect and the demon, they had managed to settle the matter. Many people wanted to get on the Crown Prince’s boat but were not qualified. In his opinion, it was impossible for anyone to reject the Crown Prince. This was why when the Crown Prince came looking for him, he almost couldn’t wait to agree.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan had offended the Crown Prince. Now that the Crown Prince had expressed that he would let bygones be bygones, shouldn’t he join the Crown Prince’s faction happily?","“Do you not understand what I’m saying?” Chu Yunfan said.","“Marquis Chu, you have to think about this carefully. Even if you are from the Flying Celestials, the Flying Celestials will not be able to protect you in the face of the Crown Prince’s anger.” Yang Yi’s expression immediately turned cold.","There was still some doubt in Yang Yi’s eyes. According to the information he had received, Chu Yunfan did not seem to have joined Princess Yun Yang. Otherwise, the Crown Prince would not have sent him to recruit Chu Yunfan.","Yang Yi’s expression made Chu Yunfan laugh. Although they were both officials, their horizons were too far apart. Yang Yi was relying on the Crown Prince for a better future. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t need to rely on anyone to get what he wanted.","“Are you threatening me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“You can think that way. Not everyone can reject the Crown Prince’s good intentions,” Yang Yi said coldly.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, he felt that even breathing became difficult. A palm formed by spirit energy grabbed his neck and tightened it like an iron clamp. Just when Yang Yi thought he was going to be strangled to death, Chu Yunfan suddenly swung his hand and Yang Yi flew out of the tent.","“Is he even qualified to threaten me? Who does he think he is? Go back and tell the Crown Prince that I have no interest in participating in the battle for the throne. It’s fine if you don’t come and provoke me. Otherwise, I’ll settle all the old and new scores together,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “He wants to control me? He has to wait until he ascends the throne!”"]},{"number":2016,"title":"Chapter 2016 I’ll Teach Him an Unforgettable Lesson","paragraphs":["2016 I’ll Teach Him an Unforgettable Lesson","Yang Yi was in shock. His eyes were filled with shock and anger. However, in reality, the difference in status between them was like the difference between heaven and earth.","It was only when Yang Yi was almost strangled to death by Chu Yunfan that he finally understood why he was only an ordinary marquis, while Chu Yunfan was a top-notch prodigy that everyone knew. Although he was very strong in the eyes of ordinary people and had already reached the peak of the Cosmos Stage, he was weak in front of Chu Yunfan.","All his glory came from his contributions, his title, and the protection of the Crown Prince. In the past, he felt that these were very stable. But now, he was easily defeated by Chu Yunfan.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan’s strength did not come from his status as a marquis of the empire, nor was it because he was a disciple of the Flying Celestials, nor was it because he was number one on the Prodigy List. Instead, it came from his own strength. Only the strength that originated from oneself was the strength that no one could take away.","That was why he was eager to recruit Chu Yunfan to the Crown Prince’s side and did not dare to go against the Crown Prince’s words. Chu Yunfan could say that he did not care for the Crown Prince one bit.","The funny thing was that Yang Yi had thought that Chu Yunfan was so powerful because he had the support of the Flying Celestials. Now, he understood that Chu Yunfan’s strength came from his own strength.","But what was even more tragic was that he realized that even though he knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was the true strength, he couldn’t do it. From the very beginning, he had taken the wrong path.","Thinking of this, although he was still shocked and angry, he did not dare to argue with Chu Yunfan anymore. He only said fiercely, “Hmph, just wait!”","After saying that, Yang Yi stepped on the light and left the military camp as if he was fleeing.","“How can such a person be worthy of being a marquis of the Empire?”","After Yang Yi left, two other people appeared in the commander’s office. They were You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai. Seeing Yang Yi in such a sorry state, Chu Hongcai sneered in disdain.","Beside him, You Chuyun’s lips twitched. His emotions were complicated and he didn’t know how to put it, because this was a normal official title. As for Chu Yunfan, who Chu Hongcai used as a comparison, he was the abnormal one. Among the many marquis in the empire, there were very few who could stand shoulder to shoulder with Chu Yunfan.","Not everyone conferred the title of marquis had great strength. The vast majority of them had endured enough seniority and slowly grinded enough contributions before they were conferred the title of marquis.","“Hahaha, Hongcai, don’t learn from him. You have to rely on your own strength to protect your wife and children!” Chu Yunfan laughed, completely disregarding the conflict just now.","“My Lord, but if this is the case, we’ll have completely shed all pretense of cordiality with the Crown Prince’s faction,” You Chuyun said worriedly.","Chu Yunfan waved and said, “Then we’ll fall out with each other. The princes and princesses are now competing for the throne, but the outcome has not been decided yet. If we rashly join one of them, we will become a thorn in the eyes of all the other princes and princesses. I don’t need to say anything more about the difference between offending the Crown Prince and offending all the princes and princesses.”","Only then did You Chuyun realize in shock that he had only thought of offending the Crown Prince’s faction, but he had never thought that the Crown Prince’s many opponents also had an extremely powerful factions behind them. Offending the Crown Prince was better than offending everyone.","“Moreover, it won’t be so easy for the Crown Prince to deal with me. Ordinary Creators can’t even withstand a single move from me. How many Creators can the Crown Prince recruit? It’s fine if he doesn’t come looking for trouble, but if he dares to come looking for trouble, then I’ll teach him an unforgettable lesson,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“That’s right. So what if he’s the Crown Prince? If he dares to abuse his power for personal gain and take revenge, we might as well rely on other princes and princesses!” Chu Hongcai said loudly.","“The most important thing is not whether the Crown Prince will come to find trouble with us. The most important thing is to increase our strength. As long as we have enough strength, the Crown Prince can only hold back even if he is dissatisfied with us.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","On the other side of the world.","In the Eastern Palace of the Imperial Capital.","A young man wearing a five-clawed golden dragon robe sat on the throne. This man had a handsome face and vaguely resembled a king.","“Did he really say that?” the young man said with a malicious expression.","“That’s right, Your Royal Highness. Chu Yunfan is arrogant and despotic. He has no respect for you. He even said that if you want to control him, you will have to wait until you ascend the throne,” Yang Yi, who was standing before the young man, said hurriedly.","“How dare you, Chu Yunfan!” The Crown Prince slapped the armrest of his throne and shattered it.","“Your Highness, not only did Chu Yunfan kill Marquis Huntian, but he has also turned a blind eye to your good intentions. If we don’t deal with him, I’m afraid the others will also be alienated.” Yang Yi glanced at the Crown Prince.","The Crown Prince’s expression was extremely sinister. After a long time, his expression relaxed again. “Now is not the time to touch him. He has just killed Marquis Huntian, which is the focus of everyone’s attention. The Flying Celestials is even more guarded. It’s not that easy to touch him.","“Besides, my father has already called me over to give me a scolding. The collusion between Marquis Huntian, the Demon God Sect, and the demons made my father very unhappy. It’s not the right time to make a move.”","The Crown Prince shook his head. He knew all too well that although his position seemed to be glorious, he was actually sitting on a pile of gunpowder. He had an unimaginably powerful father and a group of brothers and sisters chasing after him. If he was not careful, he might lose the whole game. The more he did, the more mistakes he made. It was good not to do it.","If he was in an ordinary family, he would definitely be a peerless genius that was hard to come by in a hundred years. However, in the imperial family, his aptitude was rated as mediocre. It was simply a huge joke.","“Bear with him for a few days. After the Prodigy Battlefield opens, we’ll deal with him,” the Crown Prince said coldly.","He recalled being called over by his father and being reprimanded for being narrow-minded and short-sighted. He did some petty things and immediately understood something.","“Besides, it’s just Chu Yunfan. So what? Wait until I go to the Prodigy Battlefield and get that thing. It won’t be difficult to deal with Chu Yunfan. At that time, I’ll personally kill him.","“For now, the one we need to guard against is not Chu Yunfan, but the other ambitious princes and princesses,” the Crown Prince said, “Send someone to keep an eye on my good brothers and sisters. If there’s any movement, report to me immediately.”","“Yes, Your Highness,” Yang Yi said."]},{"number":2017,"title":"Chapter 2017 Changes in the Prodigy Rankings in a Year","paragraphs":["2017 Changes in the Prodigy Rankings in a Year","The Prodigy List was updated again, and Chu Yunfan took the first place, replacing Li Qianyuan’s original position. In the blink of an eye, a year had passed.","One year was enough for everyone to get used to it. The first name on the Prodigy List changed from Li Qianyuan to Chu Yunfan. Many people felt that from the beginning, the number one was always Chu Yunfan, not Li Qianyuan.","This feeling was very subtle, but no one felt that there was anything wrong with it. Within a year, everyone had recognized Chu Yunfan’s strength. He indeed had the qualifications to become the number one in the world.","Unlike Li Qianyuan, when Li Qianyuan was number one in the world, other challengers came to him. There were even masters who could fight with Li Qianyuan for hundreds of rounds. Although Li Qianyuan was obviously stronger than the others, he did not have an overwhelming advantage.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His strength moved almost everyone.","After reorganizing the army and replenishing the troops with new recruits, Chu Yunfan quickly led the army to the battlefield. Only through the experience of blood and fire could an army grow. With Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, he was already a great killing weapon on the battlefield. He could be said to be invincible.","An expert who had surpassed the Creation Stage was an extremely rare top-notch expert in both the human and demon realms. They would not easily attack. Unless it was a war to destroy a country, these people would not easily make a move. Those at the Creation Stage were enough to dominate the battlefield.","Ordinary Creators had their own life-saving techniques and were very difficult to kill. However, when they encountered Chu Yunfan, it was completely useless.","Not long after, Chu Yunfan killed a large number of experts and even caused a commotion among the demons. There were even demon elites who came to kill Chu Yunfan and prove their strength at the same time. However, they were killed by Chu Yunfan with a slap.","The demons’ pride who had fought with Li Qianyuan for a thousand moves before being defeated and retreating. He had an extremely illustrious background among the demons and his strength was extraordinary. He was known as the rising star of the demons, but he was killed by Chu Yunfan with a single slap. This battle made everyone truly realize Chu Yunfan’s strength. There was a fundamental gap between him and the other young prodigies.","There were even traps set up by the demons. Many seventh-level Creators and even peak Creators had joined forces to set up an ambush. If an ordinary prodigy encountered such a lineup, they would only be dead. However, Chu Yunfan managed to escape unscathed after killing a large number of experts.","Chu Yunfan’s name continued to rise. In just half a year, his name had expanded from Grand Xia to the entire world. At this point, no one had any doubts about Chu Yunfan’s first place on the Prodigy List. Whether they liked him or not, everyone had to admit that Chu Yunfan’s strength was beyond doubt.","After his last attack half a year ago, Chu Yunfan had not attacked again for half a year. Within half a year, the huge commotion caused by Chu Yunfan gradually calmed down. Everyone had already accepted this change. After all, a year was enough to calm many people’s memories.","On the Prodigy List, everyone’s strength was advancing by leaps and bounds, especially those prodigies ranked at the top. Their cultivation speed was even faster than before. A year ago, Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance as number one on the Prodigy List stimulated many people. In this year, many prodigies had undergone even more arduous cultivation.","From the Prodigy List, everyone’s strength continued to advance by leaps and bounds. It could be seen that in just a year, the strength of the prodigies ranked in the top 20 on the Prodigy List had already reached the fifth level of the Creation Stage. Because of this, three prodigies ranked in the top 20 had fallen and disappeared from the Prodigy List. This was different from when Chu Yunfan had disappeared.","After that, the factions where these geniuses were from spread the news. To improve their cultivation by leaps and bounds in a short period, these geniuses had all entered a special mystic realm to cultivate. However, in the end, they died in the mystic realm.","For a moment, everyone was in an uproar. At this moment, everyone finally began to realize the price that these geniuses had to pay to grow. It was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","People often only saw those who succeeded, but they did not see that other than those who succeeded, countless geniuses died on the road of cultivation due to various accidents. The path of cultivation could be said to be paved with piles of bones.","Among these people, there was one person whose ranking had quietly changed in the past year. That was Tang Siyu, who had become famous along with Chu Yunfan a year ago. Tang Siyu, who was originally ranked fourth on the Prodigy List, had broken through to the sixth level of the Creation Stage in more than a year. She suppressed everyone and displayed shocking talent.","That was half a year ago!","If Chu Yunfan’s previous battle record was not so valiant that he killed the prodigies with a single slap, his position as the number one would probably be a little unstable. It wasn’t that Chu Yunfan wasn’t strong enough, but that Tang Siyu’s cultivation had improved too quickly.","For a moment, the world was shocked. Emperor physiques were unique physiques that was rarely seen in a hundred years. Li Qianyuan was already ranked first on the Prodigy List with his king physique, while Tang Siyu had an emperor physique. Although a king physique was impressive, it was still far from an emperor physique.","At this moment, everyone finally understood why the usually aloof Elder Princess would make an exception and accept Tang Siyu as her last disciple. This last disciple was the true last disciple. She would pass on all the legacy and would not take in other disciples.","Tang Siyu’s cultivation advanced by leaps and bounds, and there was an even more reasonable explanation. If it was an emperor physique, then it was only natural for her to surpass the geniuses with king physiques."]},{"number":2018,"title":"Chapter 2018 Tang Siyu’s Strength Speeds Up","paragraphs":["2018 Tang Siyu’s Strength Speeds Up","Emperor physique!","One had to know that just a king physique was already the peak physique in the world. As long as one had an emperor physique, as long as they stepped on the path of cultivation, even if they cultivated the most basic cultivation method, their future achievements would be limitless. Not to mention an emperor physique. From ancient times until now, as long as one had an emperor physique, as long as they grew smoothly, they would be an existence at the highest level.","Regardless of whether it was kindness or malice, all eyes turned to Tang Siyu, who was in Serene Immortal Mountain. Many people began to guess who would win between Chu Yunfan’s strength and Tang Siyu’s, whose cultivation had soared.","Currently, Chu Yunfan was ranked first and Tang Siyu was ranked second on the Prodigy List. Both of them had a dazzling aura. Although everyone knew that the two of them had an extraordinary relationship and were engaged, it didn’t stop everyone from guessing.","In particular, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had a supreme treasure that could block the divination of the Mysteries Pavilion. Therefore, no one knew what stage Chu Yunfan had reached.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had landed in the first place of the Prodigy List because he had easily killed Li Qianyuan. According to the combat strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed at that time, it was estimated.","At that time, Chu Yunfan should have had the battle prowess of the sixth-level Creator. Now, Tang Siyu also stepped into the sixth level of the Creation Stage. Who was stronger between her and Chu Yunfan?","It was because Chu Yunfan’s strength was too strong. It was obvious that he was more than a level stronger than the other prodigies. The others could not be compared to Chu Yunfan. It was now that Tang Siyu’s rise gave everyone hope. Someone who could compete with Chu Yunfan had finally appeared.","This was something that had never happened before. After all, everyone believed in the Mysteries Pavilion’s calculations. The first on the Prodigy List was the strongest, and the second was inferior to the first. There was no doubt about it.","However, Chu Yunfan’s strength was a mystery. Everyone wanted to know who was stronger, Chu Yunfan or Tang Siyu. This debate lasted until this day. On the Prodigy List, the record regarding Tang Siyu suddenly changed. Tang Siyu’s cultivation level instantly jumped from the sixth level of the Creation Stage to the seventh level of the Creation Stage.","Everyone who was paying attention to this matter was stunned. No one had expected Tang Siyu’s cultivation to have such a rapid improvement in such a short time. She had completely left the others behind. It could be said that it was not an exaggeration to crush her peers. If Li Qianyuan was resurrected today, he would be no match for Tang Siyu.","Everyone was dumbfounded. Tang Siyu’s rate of improvement was too fast. Since ancient times, there had been too few people with emperor physiques, so they had nothing to compare themselves to. However, compared to king physiques, the emperor physiques improvement speed was too shocking.","A king physique was already very rare in the world. Every year, there would only be a few who had a king physique. They were already the cream of the crop among the geniuses. As for those with emperor physiques, it was even more unimaginable.","Some of the veteran experts were dumbfounded. With such a cultivation speed, Tang Siyu would probably be able to surpass the Creation Stage in less than two years. She would be on par with those old monsters.","“Is this the cultivation speed of one with an emperor physique? No wonder in ancient times, those emperors were rumored to have reached the peak when they were only a few decades old!”","“No wonder the Elder Princess wanted to take her as his last disciple. With such a disciple, there’s no need for other disciples. With such a disciple, one can die in peace.” An old expert sighed.","“I’m afraid that at her cultivation speed, it’s not impossible for her to become the number one expert in the world in the future.”","“But if you count it this way, Tang Siyu should have already surpassed Chu Yunfan’s combat strength.”","Many people quickly recovered from the shock of Tang Siyu’s cultivation advancing once again. The topic that had been constantly brought up for more than a year was once again brought up.","Between Tang Siyu and Chu Yunfan, who was stronger?","That was the seventh level of the Creation Stage!","Now, Tang Siyu’s cultivation had completely left them behind. In the future, as time passed, her strength would only improve faster and faster, to the point that even they could not catch up.","This was even stronger than the despair Chu Yunfan had brought them. After all, Chu Yunfan’s strength was too mysterious. Everyone could still imagine and hope to get lucky.","Tang Siyu was at the seventh level of the Creation Stage. Regardless of her combat strength, she should be the number one person among the younger generation in terms of cultivation. It was even close to catching up to the prodigies on the previous Prodigy List.","There were even rumors that the king wanted to include Tang Siyu’s name in the imperial family’s genealogy. This was a great honor, and it also represented the king’s recognition of Tang Siyu.","For a moment, the wind and clouds were surging. Everyone was attracted by Tang Siyu, whose strength had increased greatly. The attention on Chu Yunfan also dropped to the lowest level in history.","In a courtyard of Marquis Zhenyuan’s Residence, Chu Yunfan sat quietly on a stone bench and looked into the distance. You Chuyun was standing beside him.","“My Lord, that pill has indeed been handed over to Princess Gushe,” You Chuyun said and bowed.","“I know.” Chu Yunfan nodded. In fact, he already knew when he saw the changes on the Prodigy List.","He had asked You Chuyun to send Tang Siyu a Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill. This pill could only be used once. Chu Yunfan had already used it once when he was fighting against the demons and the Demon God Sect, so it was useless to him.","However, it was still useful to Tang Siyu. In the past year, Chu Yunfan collected all kinds of medicinal herbs through the Thousand Treasures Pavilion and successfully made another Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill. He then instructed You Chuyun to send it to Tang Siyu."]},{"number":2019,"title":"Chapter 2019 The Cool-Headed Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["2019 The Cool-Headed Chu Yunfan","With the medicinal strength of the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill, as long as it was delivered to Tang Siyu, it would not be difficult for her cultivation to advance further.","Different from Chu Yunfan, he treated the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill as one of his trump cards in battle. Every time he used it, it would inevitably be accompanied by an extremely difficult battle. Although his cultivation would also make a leap after the battle, most of the medicinal power was wasted in the battle. He had only absorbed a fraction of the medicinal power of the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill or even just a tenth. This was Chu Yunfan’s greatest regret.","Tang Siyu was different though. She was not like Chu Yunfan, who had to face a world-shaking battle. She could digest all the medicinal power of the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill. Its effectiveness was naturally not something Chu Yunfan could compare to.","According to Chu Yunfan’s estimation, Tang Siyu had broken through to the seventh level of the Creation Stage after consuming the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill. It would not be long before she would break through to the peak of the seventh Creation Stage or even enter the peak of the Creation Stage. Whether or not she could break through to the peak was related to whether or not she could surpass the Creation Stage. The peak of the Creation Stage meant that she had already cultivated to the perfection of the Creation Stage.","Once one cultivated to the peak of the Creation Stage, they would have the foundation to break through to a higher stage. This was why Chu Yunfan placed so much importance on it. According to Chu Yunfan’s estimation, Tang Siyu would be able to enter the peak of the Creation Stage in at most two months. At that time, as long as she stabilized her cultivation, it would not be long before she could take a step forward and surpass the Creation Stage.","Such a cultivation speed was shocking to ordinary people and even an incredible miracle. However, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, this was a matter of course. It would be strange if she couldn’t achieve it.","Tang Siyu had an emperor physique to begin with. In terms of talent, she was a rarity. Coupled with the Elder Princess’ support, all kinds of rare treasures were open to Tang Siyu. There was no need for Chu Yunfan to search everywhere for all kinds of treasures and find ways to find enough cultivation resources. Even the Flying Celestials could not do this for Chu Yunfan.","There were countless disciples in the Flying Celestials, but Tang Siyu was the only disciple in Serene Immortal Mountain. The strength of her support was naturally incomparable.","The Wood Spirit Essence that had helped Chu Yunfan improve his cultivation was just one of the treasures the Elder Princess had prepared for Tang Siyu. She did not lack any cultivation resources, so it would be strange if her cultivation speed was slow.","Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t hold anything back from Tang Siyu. After he made the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill, he immediately instructed You Chuyun to send it to her. Along with the pill, Chu Yunfan also sent some notes and notes regarding the cultivation of the Creation Stage and beyond the Creation Stage based on the memories of the Alchemy Emperor in his mind and the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Just these alone could save her decades of comprehension.","It was simply priceless. In terms of value, it was only above the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill and not below it. The cultivation notes contained all kinds of key points for cultivation at this stage. In the eyes of many large factions, the value of these notes was even greater than ten Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pills.","After all, the Six-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill would be used up. Although it could help one’s cultivation advance, it was a one-time consumable. These cultivation manuals, on the other hand, could continuously nurture Creators or even those beyond the Creation Stage. Its value was simply immeasurable.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan knew that after this cultivation manual was given to Tang Siyu, it would probably fall into the hands of the Elder Princess, so he specially told Tang Siyu to give it to the Elder Princess after reading it. Only by handing it over to the Elder Princess would the value of this manual be maximized. Neither Chu Yunfan nor Tang Siyu had such power.","Chu Yunfan took this opportunity to thank the Elder Princess for taking care of Tang Siyu. Originally, Chu Yunfan had a lot of complaints about the Elder Princess. Because the Elder Princess had wanted to find a husband for Tang Siyu, Chu Yunfan was targeted by Li Qianyuan. He had experienced countless life-and-death battles before and after, and he had barely escaped death countless times.","However, the Elder Princess took care of Tang Siyu without reservation. It could be said that Tang Siyu was truly being nurtured as a successor. The Elder Princess was never stingy with all kinds of natural treasures.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t like the Elder Princess, he had no choice but to express his feelings. As for whether the Elder Princess would keep the manual for herself to train the masters of Serene Immortal Mountain or hand it over to the imperial family, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. These things were very precious to others, but to Chu Yunfan, their value was greatly reduced.","Chu Yunfan had the Alchemy Emperor’s vast memories and a peerless cultivation manual like the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. The cultivation comprehension of each cultivation stage in it was beyond the imagination of ordinary people. After all, it was the comprehension of an emperor-level expert.","As long as he copied it and cultivated it step by step, Chu Yunfan was confident that he could build a behemoth like the Flying Celestials in less than a few hundred years. The Flying Celestials had been developing for tens of thousands of years. Chu Yunfan only needed to spend a few hundred to develop a force that could be compared to the Flying Celestials. This speed could be described as flying.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t have too many thoughts. He only had one real goal, and that was to reach the peak of martial arts.","Chu Yunfan was not in the deep mountains, so he naturally heard about the heated discussion about his and Tang Siyu’s strength. The people outside had originally thought highly of him, but now they thought that Tang Siyu was the number one in the world. It could be said that she had gone through many changes.","Within a year, Zhenyuan’s economy improved from its original foundation and became the number one city on the border. After all, Chu Yunfan came from the Federation. His business and city management methods far exceeded the imagination of the natives of Grand Xia. In a year, Zhenyuan City made a complete transformation."]},{"number":2020,"title":"Chapter 2020 Battle Strength Breakthrough, Peak Creation Stage","paragraphs":["2020 Battle Strength Breakthrough, Peak Creation Stage","In this year, Chu Yunfan did not seem to have cultivated much. Instead, he was painstakingly managing his territory. Many people who knew the news secretly laughed at Chu Yunfan for being short-sighted. In today’s world, strength reigned supreme. So what if Chu Yunfan managed the city well? If Chu Yunfan’s strength could not keep up, Zhenyuan would be plundered by others in minutes.","Chu Yunfan knew that everyone thought that Tang Siyu, who was now at the seventh level of the Creation Stage, was already the number one expert among the younger generation. However, only Chu Yunfan himself knew that his combat strength was still above Tang Siyu’s, although his current stage was still not comparable to Tang Siyu’s.","A year ago, Chu Yunfan was already at the third level of the Creation Stage. At that time, he was already above ordinary seventh-level Creators. In the past year, it seemed that Chu Yunfan did not cultivate much, but in fact, he was constantly refining the Wood Spirit Essence in his body. You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai, who had only obtained a little bit of the Wood Spirit Essence, had made great progress in their cultivation, let alone Chu Yunfan.","Under the activation of the Wood Spirit Essence, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation reached the peak third Creation Stage half a year ago. In the past six months, he had been suppressing his cultivation. While everyone was crazily improving their cultivation, only Chu Yunfan was suppressing his cultivation!","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like an unopened sword, constantly sharpening his blade. He repeatedly comprehended the Great Dao of the Creation Stage and constantly tempered his strength. Every time there were signs of a breakthrough, he would suppress it and continue to suppress it. He repeatedly hammered and continuously suppressed it.","One could imagine how difficult it was. It was like a volcano that was about to erupt, but it was suppressed. Moreover, it was suppressed countless times. It was not just once or twice, but many times. Every time he suppressed it, he could feel that his combat strength increased by a little. Under the circumstances, the quality of each tempering increased by a little. Everything Chu Yunfan had done in the past six months was for this moment.","Boom!","Something inside Chu Yunfan seemed to have broken apart. His divine power completely surged, and in an instant, he broke through. Chu Yunfan’s expression remained unchanged. Even You Chuyun, who was beside him, did not notice that Chu Yunfan’s body was undergoing an earth-shattering transformation. This was because all of this was logical. He pushed the boat with the current and completed it.","Chu Yunfan had been tempering his mana repeatedly in the past six months. Now, it was finally time for him to reap the rewards. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation did not break through. He relaxed a little. However, his combat strength had undergone an earth-shattering change. He had originally been at the peak of the seventh level of the Creation Stage, but he had rushed to the peak of the Creation Stage.","Outsiders thought that Tang Siyu’s strength was above Chu Yunfan’s, but only Chu Yunfan himself knew that he was the real number one in the world. However, with their relationship, they naturally would not fight for the title. No matter how big the argument outside was, the two of them would not move.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to break through to the fourth level of the Creation Stage, he would have been able to do so half a year ago. However, he had not made a breakthrough because even though his combat strength would advance further after breaking through, and even ordinary peak Creators would not be his match, no matter how he broke through, his combat strength would still be in the Creation Stage and could not advance further.","However, it was different now. His preparations had been completed. He had tempered himself for half a year. Now, it was time to break through. After he broke through this time, his battle prowess would completely surpass the Creation Stage and reach another stage—the Arcana Stage!","This was the stage above the Creation Stage. When one cultivated to this stage, they had already surpassed the vast majority of experts in the world today. They would be on equal footing with those old monsters.","It was a brand new stage. Chu Yunfan had never been confident of breaking through. Unlike others, Chu Yunfan, who had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, had a deep understanding of the Arcana Stage, even surpassing those old monsters. It was precisely because of this that he spent half a year tempering himself and was not in a hurry to break through.","Before reaching the Arcana Stage, one had to go against heaven and earth and seize fortune. Every step was against the heavens. However, it was different when one reached the Arcana Stage. One’s body formed its own world, and one was the heaven and the will of the world.","This was what the Arcana Stage, being an Arcane, meant.","The strength of an Arcane was not something that Creators could compare to. Defying heaven and earth and seizing fortune was ultimately going against the heavens and acting within heaven’s rule system.","However, the Arcana Stage was different. One would jump out of this system and start to build their own rules. Although it was still very simple and incomplete at the beginning, it could be compared with the real world. However, in essence, it could be compared with the world.","It was like the boss of a small company. Perhaps the company was not strong enough and was very simple. The boss might be the only employee, but the boss was the boss. Compared to the employees working in the top 500 companies, it was completely different.","The difference in combat strength one would have in the Arcana Stage compared to the Creation Stage was more than just heaven-defying. If Chu Yunfan’s idea was spread, he would be denounced as a lunatic by countless people.","Ordinary people would still worry about their cultivation level dropping after being severely injured, but for Chu Yunfan, that was simply non-existent. Once he reached a new stage, he would be rooted in the new stage, and there was no possibility of dropping.","You Chuyun was shocked, but then he was overjoyed. The marquis was finally going to start cultivating again. Chu Yunfan was neither in a hurry nor slow. He had long been anxious, but he did not dare to disturb him. Now, Chu Yunfan was finally starting to cultivate again. Only then did You Chuyun feel at ease.","“Yes, My Lord.”"]},{"number":2021,"title":"Chapter 2021 Fourth Level Creator","paragraphs":["2021 Fourth Level Creator","After You Chuyun left, Chu Yunfan entered the Mountain River Diagram. Only in the diagram could Chu Yunfan cultivate without worry.","This Brahma Fruit was watered with the blood essence of countless Creators. Other than this one, there were two other ripe Brahma Fruits on the Brahma Tree. However, Chu Yunfan did not pluck them and continued to let them grow.","During this time, Chu Yunfan had killed too many Creators. Many of them were powerful existences at the seventh level of the Creation Stage or even the peak of the Creation Stage. After these experts died, they all became nourishment for the Brahma Fruit.","After consuming the Brahma Fruit, the surging divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body was released immediately, breaking through all obstacles like a flood. Waves of boundless mana swept into every inch of Chu Yunfan’s body, crazily charging at the fourth Creation Stage barrier.","Originally, Chu Yunfan could break through to the fourth Creation Stage at any time. However, after half a year, he had continuously tempered himself. It was like sharpening a sword. At the same time, he also polished the barrier of the fourth Creation Stage to become extremely firm.","If it was an ordinary person, they would not dare to do this. Because if they did, it was very likely that they would never be able to break through this barrier in their lifetime. Even for Chu Yunfan, it was not easy to break through. However, once he broke through, he would surpass the Creation Stage and enter the Arcana Stage.","The boundless mana charged toward the fourth Creation Stage, layer by layer, without stopping at all. There was no hope of breaking through for a while, but Chu Yunfan was not frustrated. His heart was as still as water. He had already prepared for this situation.","As time passed, cracks gradually appeared on the originally sturdy fourth Creation Stage barrier. Days flew by, and in the blink of an eye, three months had passed.","During these three months, Chu Yunfan did not come out of seclusion once. Everything in Zhenyuan was in order. The affairs in the city were handled by the officials, and the military affairs were handled by the officers. Chu Yunfan had become like a mascot.","In the past three months, Chu Yunfan had continuously broken through the barrier of the fourth Creation Stage. He did not stop for even a second. Suddenly, in that instant, the fourth Creation Stage barrier that was on the verge of collapse was broken through by a torrent.","Chu Yunfan’s mana fluctuations, which he had suppressed, finally burst out. A terrifying aura was released, sweeping through the entire Mountain River Diagram like a gale. It formed a raging tide that affected the entire space.","Fortunately, it was within the Mountain River Diagram. Otherwise, the phenomenon of Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough would have been immediately known to the people in Zhenyuan.","After a long time, the divine power fluctuation in Chu Yunfan’s body calmed down, and was restrained bit by bit. Chu Yunfan’s mana gradually calmed down, but he could feel that the mana in his body was constantly rising. The moment he broke through, Chu Yunfan felt that his combat strength had increased several times in one breath. Moreover, as time passed, it was increasing at an astonishing speed.","“Is this the power of the Arcana Stage?” Chu Yunfan beamed.","At this moment, his combat strength had undergone an earth-shattering change compared to before. The current him could almost be said to be able to defeat himself, who had not broken through before, with one slap. Compared with the battle strength when he fought with Li Qianyuan, he had made great progress.","If he had such strength back then, he would have easily swept Li Qianyuan away. There would have been no need to use various methods to test Li Qianyuan’s bottom line and trump cards. He could be killed with a slap.","The difference between the Arcana Stage and the Creation Stage was like a cliff. It was completely different.","For a moment, Chu Yunfan felt a sense of heroism. The world was so big that he could go anywhere. After his combat strength had broken through to the Arcana Stage, the gap between him and his peers had widened to an astonishing extent. Even if they were tied together, they wouldn’t be able to stop Chu Yunfan.","On the Prodigy List, Chu Yunfan’s information did not change. Because the Mountain River Diagram concealed secrets, the Mysteries Pavilion seemed to have been blinded. They could only collect information on Chu Yunfan in the most basic ways and evaluate him like the other factions. It was impossible for them to know Chu Yunfan’s combat strength through heavenly deductions.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan was the only one in the world who knew. The others probably thought that Tang Siyu had completely surpassed him. After all, another three months had passed. Tang Siyu, who had already reached the seventh level of the Creation Stage, should have already reached the peak of the Creation Stage. Not to mention being unrivaled among her peers, even many old monsters were no longer Tang Siyu’s match.","At this moment, in a restaurant in the city, three young men in embroidered clothes were sitting in a private room. The window of the private room faced Marquis Zhenyuan’s residence. However, because of the layers of barriers in the manor, they couldn’t see anything clearly.","One of them was dressed in black. He had a square face and a burly figure. His body emitted a faint sinister aura.","The last person was an ordinary-looking young man in black clothes. He looked different from ordinary people. His face was covered with a dense beard, like the thorns on the back of a hedgehog.","The three of them had different temperaments, but without exception, they all looked extraordinary. One look and one could tell that they were not ordinary people.","“I came here ten years ago, but it wasn’t even a tenth of what it is now. I didn’t expect this Marquis Zhenyuan, Chu Yunfan, to have some tricks up his sleeve. In just a few years, he managed to manage a city to this extent,” the black-robed young man said. He grinned, looking a little valiant.","“However, he seems to have exerted his strength in the wrong place. He is set on governing the place. What a joke. He’s not a civil official!”"]},{"number":2022,"title":"Chapter 2022 The Attack of the Ex-prodigies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2022 The Attack of the Ex-prodigies","After saying that, the black-robed young man’s eyes revealed a hint of coldness.","“He still has the mood to govern a city. After today, his name should be removed from the Prodigy List!” the bearded man coldly. His eyes were filled with boundless coldness.","“But he is currently the focus of the Flying Celestials. We only have one chance. Once we miss it, we won’t have another,” the red-robed man said, “Chu Yunfan is not an ordinary person. Even Li Weiyuan died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. If it doesn’t work out the first time, I’m afraid we won’t have a second chance. You all know Li Weiyuan’s strength very well. Even if he can’t compare to us, he’s not much weaker. In the end, he still died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.”","When the black-robed man heard this, he sneered. “I have already seen the picture of that battle. Li Weiyuan was too arrogant. He should have killed Chu Yunfan from the beginning so that he wouldn’t have a chance to swallow the pill. Chu Yunfan would have surely died then.”","“Number one on the Prodigy List? The person he killed was the number one on the Prodigy List. His head is worth a million high-grade spirit stones now. I’m afraid he doesn’t even know it.” The red-robed man smiled wickedly.","“We have to succeed. This is our only chance,” the bearded man slowly said, “We have not been on the Prodigy List for too long. By now, everyone has probably forgotten our names. Now, we will let the world see that newcomers are just newcomers. They are still leagues apart from us!”","In the blink of an eye, the three of them disappeared from the private room. At the same time, a huge blood-red hand suddenly appeared above Marquis Zhenyuan’s manor. This blood-red hand emitted a shocking bloody aura that swept through the entire city.","In an instant, all the experts who were cultivating in Zhenyuan were alarmed. No matter what they were doing, they immediately sensed the terrifying aura emitted by this blood-red hand.","“Who is doing this?!” From inside the manor, You Chuyun reacted immediately. He activated the various barriers in the manor immediately. When Chu Yunfan wasn’t around, he was in charge of the manor’s defenses.","Boom!","The blood-red hand came crashing down. The layers of barriers that had been set up in manor were broken in an instant. Like a piece of paper, it was torn apart in minutes.","Spurt!","You Chuyun spat out a mouthful of blood and was sent flying. The backlash from the barrier being broken landed on his body. You Chuyun felt his internal organs completely shatter. He was severely injured.","“Creator...”","You Chuyun crashed into the ground. His vision turned black. He immediately knew the strength of the person who had come. It must be a top expert above the Creation Stage. If the person was only in the Cosmos Stage, it would be impossible for him to break through this barrier. Not to mention, it would instantly cause him to suffer a backlash. Moreover, ordinary Cosmics would not dare to provoke Chu Yunfan, who was currently in the limelight.","The bloody hand continued to fall. Just as it was about to land on the manor, the army camp outside the city reacted. A huge army spirit appeared above the camp. The spirit seemed to have suffered a huge provocation. The halberd in its hand slashed down at the bloody hand.","Boom!","The halberd and the bloody hand collided. The entire sky shook violently, and countless people in the city cried out in surprise.","Everyone could see that at the critical moment, the bloody hand was blown up. However, the terrifying backlash swept out and injured the army spirit. The army spirit instantly became much more transparent. It was obvious that it had suffered a serious injury.","“You overestimate yourself! Hmph!” A cold snort came from the void. Then, the blood-red hand reappeared and grabbed at the army spirit.","The army spirit was fearless. It charged forward with its halberd and collided with the blood-red hand. Everyone in the city was shocked to find that the army spirit that had been guarding the city was then crushed in an instant. Many soldiers in the army spat out blood and were heavily injured.","Just as this huge hand was about to crush the entire military camp, a cold snort suddenly came from within Marquis Zhenyuan’s manor.","“How dare you.”","Suddenly, at that critical moment, the army spirit that had been crushed condensed again. It was over a thousand feet tall, twice the size of the original army spirit.","The huge army spirit swung its halberd down.","Slice!","The halberd shattered the entire blood-red hand, just like how the blood-red hand had easily crushed the earlier army spirit. But now, the difference in strength had changed.","As the blood-red hand was easily destroyed, a figure in the void revealed his figure. It was a young man in blood-red clothes with an evil face. Beside him was a bearded man and a burly young man in black. The three of them seemed to be unable to hide their figures anymore and appeared before everyone.","“Who are these three people? How dare they attack Zhenyuan and try to destroy the External Army? Aren’t they afraid of death? Our city is very close to Zhenyao City. It won’t be long before a large number of experts will come to support us.”","“That’s right. In the past few years, no one who dared to be presumptuous in Zhenyuan had a good ending.”","Some people looked at the three people flying in the sky and could not help but fall into deep thought. They seemed to have seen these three people somewhere before.","Suddenly, someone seemed to have thought of something and shouted, “I remember now. These three people were the prodigies of the previous Prodigy List!”","“I remember now. No wonder they are only familiar faces. They are not the local geniuses of Grand Xia.”","More and more people thought of something. The attack of the ex-prodigies from the outer realms instantly made many people’s hearts shrink slightly. Chu Yunfan was invincible among his peers. The only person who could compete with him was Tang Siyu, who was also his fiancée. It was impossible for her to fight him.","He had no opponents among his peers, but that didn’t mean that Chu Yunfan was invincible.","There was no doubt that these people were prodigies on the previous Prodigy List. Just these words alone made everyone’s hearts feel incomparably heavy. These talented geniuses had cultivated for so many years more than Chu Yunfan. Their strength was unimaginable."]},{"number":2023,"title":"Chapter 2023 Since You’re in a Rush to Die, I’ll Grant You Your Wish","paragraphs":["Chapter 2023 Since You’re in a Rush to Die, I’ll Grant You Your Wish","“Now that you mention it, I remember. The red-robed man who attacked is the prodigy of the Blood Demon Sect, Wang Xueyi, from the previous Prodigy List.”","“I remember that black-robed man now. He’s the top prodigy of the demons’ Heaven-Devouring Rat clan, Zhang Shushu!”","“Isn’t that bearded young man the Great Force Demon Sect’s Lu Ziyu?”","As everyone talked, the identities of these three prodigies surfaced. The more they did so, the more frightened they felt. It was because these three people were famous before.","Regardless of whether it was the two geniuses of the demonic path or the Heaven-Devouring Rat clan, they had all killed a large number Grand Xia experts on many battlefields. Even now, when they were mentioned, countless people still gritted their teeth in hatred.","Grand Xia had placed a huge bounty on these three’s heads. The moment their tracks were revealed, Grand Xia would send out a hunting squad to hunt them down. Normally, they wouldn’t appear in Grand Xia. But now, they appeared in such a grand manner. From this, one could tell that they didn’t come with good intentions.","Many people tried to spread the news, but they soon realized that it was ineffective. The entire place was blocked off, and they were not allowed to spread the news. It was obvious that the trio had made preparations for the attack. Although the news could not be sealed for long, it should be long enough for them.","Many people tried to spread the news, but they soon realized that it was ineffective. The entire place was blocked off, and they were not allowed to spread the news. It was obvious that the trio had made preparations for the attack. Although the news could not be sealed for long, it should be long enough for them.","Just as everyone was talking and discussing, the reformed soul of the External Army began to move. Its halberd stabbed the trio at an unbelievable angle.","The faces of the trio changed. Lu Ziyu, the disciple of the Great Force Demon Sect, roared and his body grew larger and larger. He was now more than a thousand feet tall. Then, he suddenly jumped like a roc spreading its wings and instantly rushed toward the army spirit of the External Army.","This was the supreme divine power of the Great Force Demon Sect, the great strength of the sky demon!","After using a divine power, one could become incomparably huge. Moreover, as their strength increased, they would become larger and larger. It was even rumored that the founder of the Sky Demon Sect had become a giant that was over 10,000 feet tall—like a pillar that supported the sky.","Boom!","The two giants collided in mid-air, and an unimaginable and terrifying power erupted. Both sides displayed extremely terrifying martial arts cultivation. The martial arts unique skills that they casually blasted out almost caused the world to collapse. If it wasn’t for the defensive barrier that appeared above Zhenyuan, the entire city would have been destroyed by the attacks.","In an instant, the two sides had already exchanged dozens of moves, and the sky and earth changed color.","“Lu Ziyu can’t even take down a mere army spirit?” Zhang Shushu smiled mockingly. “I’ve long heard of the Great Force Demon Sect’s divine power, but unfortunately, it’s only so-so.”","On the other side, Wang Xueyi’s expression was slightly solemn. He naturally understood what Zhang Shushu meant. When ordinary martial arts experts encountered the army spirit of a powerful army, it could be said that they had met their nemesis. There were some cultivators who cultivated demonic techniques who encountered a strong army spirit. When they were rushed by the strong blood qi, their divine power was completely lost and they were even killed. This was a very normal thing.","However, they were different. They were all outstanding individuals among their peers. Their cultivation levels were unfathomable. Ordinary peak Creators were not their match. This kind of army spirit should not be their match at all, just like how Wang Xueyi had easily crushed the army spirit of the External Army earlier.","Once people like them appeared on the battlefield, they would be peerless demon kings or devils. Their ferocity was monstrous, and they would not care about an army spirit.","“Don’t underestimate this army spirit. If it was formed by itself, it wouldn’t be difficult to break it. However, it’s obviously under Chu Yunfan’s control. It won’t be easy to deal with it,” Wang Xueyi said.","Zhang Shushu sneered and did not say anything. Although he thought highly of himself, he did not dare to say that he was much stronger than Wang Xueyi and Lu Ziyu. The performance of the soldiers of the External Army was like two different people, which was enough to let him understand how difficult it was to deal with.","An army spirit was the manifestation of an army’s morale, but whether it was strong or weak, with or without a strong master, it was a completely different matter.","” We must capture the leader first. We don’t have much time to waste here. Zhenyao City is too close to here,” Zhang Shushu said.","When he mentioned Zhenyao, a hint of fear flashed through his eyes. It was this city that blocked all the hopes of the demons to leave the Demon Region. For countless years, countless demons had hoped to break through the defense of Zhenyao and dominate the world. It was a pity that they could not find a way so far. It was not a problem for an expert like him to sneak out, but it was completely impossible for a whole demon army to break through the defense of Zhenyao.","He was famous on the battlefield, but so what? He was still unable to break through the defenses of Zhenyao. There were many experts and fierce generals in the city. It was because of this that he was extremely afraid of Zhenyao. If it weren’t for the high bounty on Chu Yunfan’s head, he wouldn’t have taken the risk.","“Kill Chu Yunfan!” Zhang Shushu roared. His eyes began to turn bloodshot, giving off a strange and evil charm.","“Chu Yunfan, are you not goign to come out? Then, I’ll swallow everyone in the city!” As Zhang Shushu spoke, an incomparably huge, bronze-colored giant rat that was over a thousand feet tall appeared behind him. This giant rat opened its bloody mouth as if it could swallow the heavens in one gulp. This was Zhang Shushu’s true form, the appearance of the Heaven-Devouring Rats.","Everyone in the city panicked. Unlike those cities in the mainland, Zhenyuan was a border city. Back then, it was the first line of defense in the human territory. Therefore, they knew far more about the legends of the various demon beasts among the demons than the average person.","The Heaven-Devouring Rats was very powerful on the human-demon battlefield. In the past, on the battlefield between humans and demons, an old demon king of the Heaven-Devouring Rats appeared and swallowed a hundred thousand human elites in one gulp, shaking the entire Grand Xia Empire.","In that battle, the name of the Heaven-Devouring Rats shook the world. After that, Grand Xia was forced to set up layers of traps. Countless experts besieged this old demon king and finally killed him. More than half of those experts either died or were injured.","“You overestimate yourself. Since you’re in a rush to die, I’ll fulfill your wish.”"]},{"number":2024,"title":"Chapter 2024 Killing the Heaven-Devouring Rat With a Single Punch","paragraphs":["Chapter 2024 Killing the Heaven-Devouring Rat With a Single Punch","Just as everyone was in shock, a figure slowly walked out from Zhenyuan Marquis’s residence. Everyone in the city looked at him. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","“Chu Yunfan, you’re finally willing to come out. Aren’t you going to be a coward anymore?” Zhang Shushu’s face revealed a cruel smile. He wanted to swallow the entire city in one gulp to force Chu Yunfan out.","Now, as he wished, Chu Yunfan had been forced out.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength, although they did not take him seriously, they had to admit that Chu Yunfan still had the ability to protect himself. If Chu Yunfan wanted to escape, it would not be so easy for them to catch him. At that time, what was the use of slaughtering everyone in the city?","In their eyes, the lives of millions of people in the city were not as valuable as Chu Yunfan’s life.","A mocking smile appeared on Zhang Shushu’s face. He was worried about Chu Yunfan’s pedantry. If it were him, he would not have chosen to stand up.","Chu Yunfan raised his head and looked at the two before him, as well as Lu Ziyu, who was busy fighting with the soldiers of the External Army. A cold smile appeared on his face.","“I wanted to play with you guys, but since you’re in a hurry to die, I’ll send you on your way,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“Hahaha, you can still say such things at this point? Chu Yunfan, everyone says that you’re amazing. There are even rumors that you have an emperor-level physique. I don’t believe it. Today, I’ll end you!” Zhang Shushu sneered.","He had accepted this mission to kill Chu Yunfan. Other than the temptation of the millions of high-grade spirit stones reward, he was also unwilling to accept it. Chu Yunfan was too dazzling in this year’s prodigy list. Some people even compared him to the previous prodigy list and thought that no one on the previous list could be compare to him.","Such a person, whether he was real or fake, was enough to arouse the killing intent of many people. If he was fake, then they would use his head to wash away the misunderstanding. If he was real, then they could not keep him alive. Such a person was an extreme threat to them.","The rankings included the geniuses of many races and sects in the world. Among them, there were many people with evil intentions. Suppressing the younger generation and killing the future prodigies of Grand Xia who were enemies with them was a very normal thing.","“End me? You think you can do it?” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","The expression on Zhang Shushu’s face became even colder. The expression on Chu Yunfan’s face made him feel extremely disgusted.","“Cut the crap!” Zhang Shushu roared, and a terrifying demonic aura erupted from his body. The demonic aura spread out and covered the sky. In an instant, he turned into a bronze giant rat, like a ferocious beast that had walked out of the wilderness.","Zhang Shushu opened his bloody mouth, which grew larger and larger, almost swallowing the entire city in an instant, truly displaying the terrifying strength of the Heaven-Devouring Rat clan.","“You’re just a rat, and you dare to be impudent before me?”","In an instant, Chu Yunfan rushed toward the huge rat. A pitch-black sword that was like a giant ruler appeared in his hand. Immediately after, a terrifying sword light that was hundreds of feet long tore through everything, tearing the sky apart.","Zhang Shushu’s all-devouring divine power was instantly broken. The feeling of being swallowed felt by the people in the city was gone. After Zhang Shushu’s Heaven Devouring divine ability was broken, he immediately realized that things were not good. Chu Yunfan’s sword was too fast and its power was too shocking. Up until now, he had never met anyone who could easily break his divine ability with a single strike.","With his Heaven Devouring divine ability, no matter what kind of martial arts or divine arts the other party had, he would swallow them all in one gulp without any accidents.","However, this time, Chu Yunfan shattered his Heaven Devouring divine ability with just one sword strike. This made his heart skip a beat as if he had encountered an extremely terrifying existence.","All the hair on his body stood up as if he had encountered the natural enemy of life. He did not know why, but in the past, he would only feel such a terrifying feeling when he encountered a top-notch demon king whose life level was higher than his.","Different from humans, the bloodline level of the demons’ was innate. Different levels of bloodline almost determined the limits of the demons’ achievements. The Heaven-Devouring Rats’s life essence was comparable to the royal demon tribes. There were not many people who could stand shoulder to shoulder with them among the demons, let alone a human who gave him a huge sense of oppression that only a royal of the demon tribes could give him.","He didn’t know that it was because Chu Yunfan’s body contained the bloodline of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. It was a terrifying monsterthat had been one of the ten ferocities of the immemorial era.","The Heaven-Swallowing Rat bloodline was a top-notch royal bloodline among the demons. However, it was still far inferior to the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, one of the ten ferocities.","That was why Zhang Shuhu instinctively felt like he had to suck in a breath of cold air. It was a suppression of life essence.","“The Heaven Devouring divine ability is nothing more than this,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “Zhang Shushu, you killed countless soldiers of Grand Xia on the human-demon battlefield. Today, I will take your head as a memorial to the soldiers of Grand Xia who died.”","“Such arrogance!” Zhang Shushu roared and opened his bloody mouth. His mouth was about to swallow the entire world.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!” Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and punched out. The fist force transformed into eight huge gods. The gods broke through everything in an instant and tore open the bloody mouth in the air.","Then, the force of the fist did not decrease. After tearing open the bloody mouth, it bombarded Zhang Shushu.","The entire sky trembled, and the eight top gods suddenly blasted into Zhang Shushu’s body. The layers of barriers in front of Zhang Shushu were shattered in an instant. The force of the fist did not decrease and blasted into Zhang Shushu’s body on the spot.","Spurt!","Zhang Shushu spat out a mouthful of blood. Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through his body. A huge hole was blasted through his chest.","“Impossible!” Zhang Shushu couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had pierced through him with one punch. With just one punch, all the vitality in his body had been destroyed.","Just as the huge Zhang Shushu was about to fall, Chu Yunfan put him into the Mountain River Diagram."]},{"number":2025,"title":"Chapter 2025 Easily Destroying Wang Xueyi","paragraphs":["Chapter 2025 Easily Destroying Wang Xueyi","Chu Yunfan killed the Heaven-Devouring Rat with a single punch. His terrifying cultivation was vividly displayed. Even someone as powerful as Zhang Shushu couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Many people had yet to react when Chu Yunfan had already killed Zhang Shushu. Wang Xueyi of the Blood Demon Sect was completely stunned. Chu Yunfan had killed Zhang Shushu too quickly.","“How is this possible?” Wang Xueyi said incredulously.","Zhang Shushu’s cultivation base was at the peak of the Creation Stage. With the bloodline of the Heaven-Devouring Rats, even an ordinary peak Creator was no match for him. It was not difficult for him to fight several of them alone. His ranking on the prodigy list was much higher than Li Weiyuan, who was killed by Chu Yunfan. This was the reason these people were not afraid even when they learned that Chu Yunfan had killed Li Weiyuan.","With Zhang Shushu’s cultivation base, even if he cultivated a supreme demonic cultivation method, it would be difficult to do anything to him. However, Chu Yunfan killed him with a single punch. This was not like the rumored person who relied solely on the medicinal effects of pills to act fiercely.","“Sh*t!” At this moment, Wang Xueyi realized that things were not looking good for them. However, he had no way out. He couldn’t just run away. More importantly, Lu Ziyu was being held back by the spirit of the Faraway Army. He didn’t have much chance left.","“So what if you killed Zhang Shushu?” Wang Xueyi roared. A bloody light burst out of his eyes and he revealed his white fangs. In an instant, he attacked.","“Soul-Scattering Blood Claw!”","Sharp claws grew out of his hands like he was a prehistoric beast. In an instant, he tore through the air. All the experts in the city felt that this claw could tear apart their bodies and even their souls.","Although Wang Xueyi felt that something was wrong, it only made him even fiercer. He didn’t retreat—attacking instead of defending—and grabbed at Chu Yunfan.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him. He made a hand seal, and a huge divine mountain fell from the sky.","This was the Mountain Wrap Seal!","The huge mountain fell and landed on the claw.","Boom!","Everyone heard a huge explosion, and then they heard Wang Xueyi groan. His entire body instantly thrown hundreds of miles into the sky. Everyone sent out their divine wills and saw that Wang Xueyi was panting heavily. His blood-red eyes were shining with a terrifying light, like a bloodthirsty beast. However, he looked so miserable. His entire arm was hanging down. In the collision just now, it had been broken. He had clearly suffered a great loss in the collision.","Everyone was shocked at first, and then they realized that Wang Xueyi was an unimaginably terrifying existence to them. Wang Xueyi alone was enough to wipe out Zhenyuan, but he was nothing to Chu Yunfan. It was not to be forgotten than Chu Yunfan had just killed the similarly famous Heaven-Devouring Rat, Zhang Shushu.","Wang Xueyi spat out a mouthful of blood essence. His body was burning with blood-red mana. In the blink of an eye, his arm had recovered to its original state. However, he did not dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan anymore. From the moment he was at a disadvantage in the collision just now, he understood how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","He did not know how Chu Yunfan cultivated. It was too scary. Previously, when Chu Yunfan killed Li Weiyuan, he had relied on the power of a medicinal pill. But now, Chu Yunfan relied on his own strength to kill the Heaven-Devouring Rat and injure him.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back, as if he wasn’t afraid of Wang Xueyi escaping. He gave Wang Xueyi a feeling that he was unfathomable.","“Chu Yunfan, I’ve underestimated you. I didn’t expect you to improve so much in such a short time.”","Wang Xueyi’s entire body was flickering with an extremely dangerous aura. He roared and said, “But that’s it. You’re the first one who forced me to this point. But as long as I can kill you and absorb your blood, my Blood Demon Technique will improve a hundred feet further. By then, I’ll be the king when I break through to the Arcana Stage!”","“Absorb my blood?” Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a cold smile.","Wang Xueyi’s cultivation was indeed extremely terrifying. He was even stronger than Li Weiyuan, who was killed by Chu Yunfan. Although they were all at the peak of the Creation Stage, the gap between them was very large. After all, the limit of a water tank and the limit of a swimming pool were two different things. The limit of a river and the limit of an ocean were two completely different concepts. Although they were both limits, the difference was like heaven and earth.","However, no matter how strong Wang Xueyi was, he couldn’t cross that boundary and couldn’t cause any trouble. Wang Xueyi didn’t know that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had already crossed that line and reached the Arcana Stage that he had always dreamed of. If he knew, he wouldn’t have dared to take Chu Yunfan’s head to exchange for the reward even if he had ten guts.","At this moment, a terrifying blood-red light burst out from Wang Xueyi’s body. The already terrifying aura of Wang Xueyi doubled, and he was approaching that stage. At the same time, one-third of Wang Xueyi’s hair turned white as if he had entered middle-age in an instant.","“Chu Yunfan, this move burned a third of my lifespan, but it was worth it to kill you!” Wang Xueyi roared. Everyone only saw his body sway. In an instant, the entire sky had turned into a sea of blood.","“Blood Sea World Destroyer!” Wang Xueyi roared and used a divine ability that he shouldn’t be able to use with his current cultivation.","The entire sky was covered in a sea of blood. It had an earth-shattering aura. Wherever it passed, even the sky would collapse. Everyone in Zhenyuan panicked. They felt that the entire city could not withstand the impact of this blood sea.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was still calm as if Wang Xueyi’s attack was not enough to make him look sideways. In an instant, he moved. He did not care about the sea of blood that covered the sky and earth. With a flash, he had already arrived in front of Wang Xueyi. He then threw out a casual punch.","Boom!"]},{"number":2026,"title":"Chapter 2026 Chu Yunfan Is in the Arcana Stage!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2026 Chu Yunfan Is in the Arcana Stage!","“Arcana Stage...”","At this moment, he finally understood that the three of them had made a huge mistake in their previous calculations. In their estimation, even if Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed was tied to a rocket and flew up, he would at most be at the seventh Creation Stage. So what if he had reached the peak of the Creation Stage? Could it be that he could be compared to the three of them? No matter which one of them had reached the peak of the Creation Stage, it was not just a day or two. Naturally, they were much stronger than Chu Yunfan.","As for medicinal pills that could increase Chu Yunfan’s combat strength in a short time, although they had considered it, they did not think it was very likely to encounter it. After all, there should not be many pills of that level even in a colossus like the Flying Celestials.","The truth was similar to what they had thought. Chu Yunfan did not take any pills, but what they had never expected was that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was completely different from what they had thought. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed did not increase like a rocket, but like a spaceship. Just when they thought they could defeat Chu Yunfan, they were easily defeated by Chu Yunfan with a single punch.","However, they couldn’t understand how Chu Yunfan, who hadn’t reached the Arcana Stage, could have the battle strength of the Arcana Stage. The Zhang Shushu had died too quickly and had no way to warn him. Wang Xueyi was the same and was killed in one punch.","If Chu Yunfan had been in the Arcana Stage, they would have been able to sense it. Their first reaction would have been to run away, and they would not have any intention of staying.","‘I can’t accept this!’ These were the only words in Wang Xueshi’s mind.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what Wang Xueyi was thinking. After killing Wang Xueyi with a punch, he put the latter’s corpse away and watered it on the Brahma Tree like Zhang Shushu, turning it into nourishment for the tree.","For a moment, all of Zhenyuan was silent except for the sounds of Lu Ziyu and the army spirit. Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength. First, it was Zhang Shuhu, and then Wang Xueyi. Neither of them could withstand a single punch from Chu Yunfan. Many people with quick reflexes had already thought of something and could not help but suck in a breath of cold air.","“Is the city lord already in the legendary Arcana Stage?” someone said in a trembling voice.","Even in a border city like Zhenyuan, the Arcana Stage was a legend among legends. Usually, a Creator was enough to become a topic of conversation for a long time, let alone an Arcane. It had been many years since they had seen an existence of that level in this place. Now, they seemed to have seen another legendary expert.","“It can’t be wrong. If not for that, how could the city lord’s combat strength be so terrifying?”","“I dare say that even if Marquis Chu’s level has not reached the Arcana Stage, his battle strength is not much weaker than an Arcane.”","Just as the experts of the various large factions in the city were discussing animatedly, even more people had dumbfounded expressions on their faces. However, they did not know what stage this was. To them, the Creation Stage was the highest stage they knew about.","But soon, everyone’s faces revealed an excited expression. There was no doubt that for the people who belonged to Marquis Zhenyuan’s fief, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more benefits it would bring them. Especially since Chu Yunfan was a wise lord that they rarely came across.","Zhenyuan became the core and leader of many border cities in such a short period of because the taxes here were very low. Everyone was willing to gather here. The other city lords had long been dissatisfied, but they did not dare to act rashly because of the Flying Celestials behind Chu Yunfan. Moreover, how many people could a city in Zhenyuan attract?","But now, once Chu Yunfan’s Arcana Stage combat strength was spread, no one would dare to attack Zhenyuan. They would be even safer.","Among them, many people turned their gazes to Lu Ziyu of the Great Force Demon Sect. Previously, they had thought that he was a terrifying existence. But now, for some reason, they felt that Lu Ziyu was a little pitiful.","Sigh, another pitiful child...","Suddenly, Lu Ziyu, who was fighting with the army spirit of the External Army, jumped out of the battle circle. His body shrank back to its original size, and he was panting slightly. Although it was a divine abilities, he had consumed a lot of energy to transform into such a shocking size. However, his cultivation level was high. He was at the peak of the Creation Stage. In just a moment, his consumption had recovered completely.","Under Chu Yunfan’s multitasking control, the army spirit of the External Army was so terrifying that he couldn’t even focus on the other battle. But now that he saw it, his heart almost jumped out of his chest. The two companions whom he had placed high hopes on had actually died at Chu Yunfan’s hands in just a short moment.","Just as Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over, he felt all the hair on his body stand on end. It was as if it was not a person, but a primordial beast in human skin that had awakened.","“It’s your turn next. Go down and accompany them!”","Chu Yunfan’s cold voice made Lu Ziyu feel as if he had fallen into an ice cave. Almost instinctively, his figure turned into a gust of wind and fled into the distance.","Chu Yunfan only gave him a cold glance before slapping him.","Bam!","At that moment, Chu Yunfan’s palm pierced through the void and caught up with Lu Ziyu. He suddenly slapped Lu Ziyu.","Everyone in the city saw a scene that made them tremble with fear. Chu Yunfan’s seemingly ordinary slap had actually sent Lu Ziyu directly into the ground in the distance."]},{"number":2027,"title":"Chapter 2027: All Those Below the Arcana Stage Are Ants","paragraphs":["Chapter 2027: All Those Below the Arcana Stage Are Ants","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Lu Ziyu was slapped into the ground by Chu Yunfan. The entire ground shook violently, and a wave of dust that was hundreds of feet high was raised.","His entire body was smashed into the ground. With his body as the center, dense cracks spread out in a radius of hundreds of miles. It was completely imaginable how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s casual attack was.","Chu Yunfan’s casual slap could probably flatten half of Zhenyuan. If he went all out, this kind of expert could destroy a border city like Zhenyuan with a single blow. Even the various powerful barriers that Chu Yunfan had personally set up were probably useless against Chu Yunfan, whose combat strength had undergone earth-shattering changes.","“Too weak.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. He didn’t even use his full strength when he attacked just now, and Lu Ziyu was slapped into the ground.","He remembered that two or three years ago, an existence like Lu Ziyu was simply terrifying to him. It was almost impossible to win. If it weren’t for the Six-Stripe Purple-Gold Pill, Chu Yunfan would have died at the hands of those demons and Demon God Sect expert who jointly ambushed him.","However, in just a few years, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had undergone earth-shaking changes. If he were to face the situation at that time, Chu","Yunfan alone could kill all the experts of the Demon God Sect and demons. Coupled with the medicinal strength of the Six-Stripe Purple-Gold Pill, he could kill the leader of the Demon God Sect.","It had only been a few years, and the difference between them was like the difference between heaven and earth. Therefore, Chu Yunfan had never been afraid of these experts. The only thing that could stop him was time.","In the distance, in the cracks on the ground, Lu Ziyu was hit until he was dizzy. He did not know how many of his bones were broken, and all the muscles in his body were torn. That terrifying power was much more terrifying than when he was at his peak.","At this moment, he finally understood how the two companions he had ridiculed earlier, who were worse than pigs, died. It was too freaking scary. He had never thought that there would actually be such a terrifying monster on the prodigy list that came one year later than him.","At this time, he completely agreed with the rumors about Chu Yunfan. He was really a legendary figure who could crush his peers. Even the people on the last prodigy list were still stuck at the peak of the Creation Stage. It was easy to imagine how difficult it was to break through to the Arcana Stage. With their talents, they had never been defeated in their cultivation. There were no obstacles at all. As long as they cultivated seriously, the improvement of their cultivation level was as simple as eating and drinking.","However, all of these failed when Creators tried to break through to the Arcana Stage. Even they had no choice but to break through like those old seniors.","However, one of them had broken through to the Arcana Stage at lightning speed. No matter if it was a breakthrough in battle strength or cultivation level, he was a monster. Even a breakthrough in battle strength was a monster among monsters.","At this moment, Lu Ziyu was extremely regretful. For the reward of one million high-grade spirit stones, he actually came to die.","Yes, he came to die.","If Chu Yunfan was at the peak of the Creation Stage, they wouldn’t be in such a miserable state even if they didn’t have a high chance of winning. However, facing Chu Yunfan, whose combat strength had broken through to the Arcana Stage, they were just going to die,","However, at this moment, Lu Ziyu did not have the time to think so much. He made up his mind in an instant. He burned his life force to speed up the recovery of his injuries. In a moment, his injuries had mostly recovered.","In the sky, Chu Yunfan looked down at everything coldly as if he did not care about Lu Ziyu, who was recovering his strength.","Wang Xueyi’s attack, which had burned one-third of his life force, was nothing much in his eyes. Although it was close to the Arcana Stage, it could even be called a pseudo-Arcana Stage. In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was no different from before. Those below the Arcana Stage were all ants.","He now understood this principle completely. It was a completely different concept to enter the Arcana Stage or not. Although he wasn’t in the Arcana Stage, his combat strength was comparable to the Arcana Stage.","He had made the right decision not to break through, but to temper his divine power so that his battle strength could break through to the Arcana Stage in one go. Otherwise, even if he had broken through, his battle strength would at most be similar to Wang Xueyi’s peak attack. At most, he would be in the pseudo-Arcana Stage.","With that kind of combat strength, he would be invincible within the Creation Stage. It would not take much effort to deal with the three people who attacked today. The results seemed similar, but in reality, they were worlds apart. It was just like how someone could get 100 points in an exam because he could only get 100 points, and someone could get 100 points because the full score was only 100 points.","After crossing that boundary, everything was as vast as the sea and the sky. Chu Yunfan’s physical body would reach a new level during the six months of constant hammering. A solid foundation was the foundation for rapid breakthroughs in the future. This was the reason why Chu Yunfan’s","cultivation could advance rapidly. It was not only because of the extraordinary inheritance he had obtained, but also because his own foundation was incomparable.","With the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and the records in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, Chu Yunfan’s height was beyond the imagination of ordinary people from the beginning. Even the ancient emperors could not be compared to Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was confident that he could defeat all the ancient emperors in the same cultivation stage.","“Aaarrrggh!” Lu Ziyu roared angrily. His body suddenly swelled up with the wind, and it grew bigger and bigger. In just a moment, he had actually grown to the size of a pillar that supported the sky.","In the next moment, Lu Ziyu threw a punch at Chu Yunfan. This punch did not make any sound. It broke through the sound barrier, and the sky trembled under his fist attack.","Facing this punch, Chu Yunfan also made a move. He clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out.","Bam!","One big and one small, the two fists with great differences collided fiercely. However, beyond everyone’s imagination, the first to collapse was Lu Ziyu’s huge fist. His entire arm seemed to have suffered a terrifying attack as it instantly exploded.","Lu Ziyu screamed and tried to retreat. He could not fight against Chu Yunfan at all. “You... You have the strength of an Arcane!”","Lu Ziyu finally realized what Wang Xueyi had just discovered. He realized how ridiculous his previous thoughts were. However, it was already too late. A shocking sword light descended from the sky, and blood blossomed. The sword qi pierced through his chest.","Boom!","Lu Ziyu!s huge body fell to the ground, his life force gone.."]},{"number":2028,"title":"Chapter 2028: Changes in the World in a Few Months","paragraphs":["Chapter 2028: Changes in the World in a Few Months","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan had killed three experts in a row, and all of them had been killed easily.","One had to know that this was a prodigy from the previous prodigy list. In terms of strength, he should be far above the prodigies of this year’s prodigy list. In the end, he was killed by Chu Yunfan with a punch and a sword. This was too terrifying, simply beyond everyone’s imagination.","For a moment, everyone fell silent.","Then, all of Zhenyuan was in an uproar. As the city lord of Zhenyuan, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the safer they would be.","“Marquis Chu is getting stronger and stronger. It’s simply unfathomable!” “That’s right. He will have a place among the experts of the current era!”","“Marquis Chu is worthy of being a legendary expert. Not to mention his peers, even the prodigies of the previous generation were no match for him!”","While the people in the city were discussing, Chu Yunfan had already disappeared from where he was. In the next moment, he appeared in his residence. With a wave of his hand, a green life force surged out of his body and poured into You Chuyun. You Chuyun’s body, which had been seriously injured, recovered in an instant.","“Thank you, Marquis.” You Chuyun cupped his hands.","You Chuyun’s expression was a little gloomy. This battle had dealt him a huge blow. He had entered the Cosmos Stage and become a true disciple of the Flying Celestials. He thought that he was considered a master, but reality had slapped him hard.","In front of a true top-notch expert, his strength was not enough. Even by relying on the barrier set up by Chu Yunfan in the residence, he could not withstand a casual palm strike from Wang Xueyi. Even if they were important figures in the eyes of ordinary people and true disciples, in front of these prodigies, how different were they from ants by the roadside?","However, You Chuyun quickly adjusted his mentality because he knew about this situation. Moreover, he was already satisfied. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, his lifelong goal would only be to enter the Cosmos Stage and become a true disciple.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “Send someone to investigate the background and identity of these three people as soon as possible. Also, why did they suddenly come to our door?”","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. He felt that this matter was not simple. After all, with the strength of these three people, they could be said to be the best in the world.","He had gotten a glimpse of their identities from the crowd’s discussions. Such people were so proud that it was not easy to get any one of them to take action, let alone three people at the same time. Moreover, three experts from different forces attacked at the same time. The matter was definitely not simple.","With Chu Yunfan’s order, You Chuyun came back with a piece of information not long after. Chu Yunfan was the Flying Celestials’ precious prodigy. At the same time, he was a marquis of the imperial court, so he could obtain the information support of two behemoths at the same time.","“Hmph, how dare you!” Chu Yunfan sneered at the slips of paper in his hand.","After combining the information from the Flying Celestials and Grand Xia’s Imperial Court, Chu Yunfan quickly figured out what secret was hidden behind this. Someone had offered a reward of one million high-grade spirit stones to Chu Yunfan. At the same time, there was a king-level martial arts or king-level divine ability reward.","No wonder even these three high and mighty former prodigy list experts could not help but make a move. Just this one million high-grade spirit stones alone was equivalent to one billion mid- grade spirit stones. The price itself was already ridiculously high. One had to know that all of Chu Yunfan’s assets added up to only five million high-grade spirit stones. Although most of it had been used by Chu Yunfan for cultivation, it was enough to show how shocking the price of millions of high- grade spirit stones was.","High- grade spirit stones were usually used by Arcanes. After reaching the Arcana Stage, they had a very high requirement for the concentration of spirit energy. Not to mention that the spirit energy in the world was mixed with a lot of impurities, even the mid-grade spirit stones that were pure enough for Creators would have too many impurities for Arcanes. They were of no value at all.","It wasn’t that it couldn’t be used, but it would take a lot of time to polish the impurities in it. The time it would take was still fine for one’s cultivation, but if it continued like this, the cultivation speed would be slowed down by more than ten times, or even dozens of times. This was simply unbearable for these top-notch experts. Therefore, high-grade spirit stones became the spirit stones used by these experts.","However, they were very expensive. Ordinary people could not afford to use it. Therefore, even though a million high-grade spirit stones might seem inconspicuous, it was actually an extremely shocking price. Although Chu Yunfan was ranked first on the prodigy list, even if someone offered a reward for killing an official of the imperial court, someone would dare to take action. Not to mention that there were king-level techniques and divine abilities to choose from.","Normally, this price was more than enough to buy his head. However, they still missed out. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had entered the Arcana Stage.","Bounty for a peak Creator and an Arcane were two completely different things.","But so far, no one knew that Chu Yunfan had already entered the Arcana Stage. Only the three people who had fought with Chu Yunfan knew. However, they were already dead, so they didn’t have time to send out the news.","“Do you know out who is offering a reward for me?” Chu Yunfan asked.","You Chuyun shook his head. “The information I received from the imperial court and the sect is not enough to figure that out. I only know that someone","is offering a reward for you, but I don’t know who it is.”","‘Looks like I need my own intelligence network!’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself. He then said, “Start to set up a secret intelligence network. You can come to me for all the resources you need. You have set up the intelligence network as soon as possible. Otherwise, we will be too passive. In a situation like today, we don’t even know who the mastermind is.”","“Yes, Marquis.” You Chuyun nodded.","Only then did Chu Yunfan begin to check the recent intelligence gathered by You Chuyun. During the few months that he had been in seclusion, the situation in the world had changed again.","Among them, Tang Siyu’s breakthrough to the peak of the Creation Stage was the most popular news in the world recently. When the information on the prodigy list changed, the world was shocked.","“The current generation is going to have an ancient emperor!”"]},{"number":2029,"title":"Chapter 2029: Those on Top Would Always Be On Top!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2029: Those on Top Would Always Be On Top!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was amazed. Although it was within Chu Yunfan!s expectations, no one knew that the effect of the Six-Stripe Purple-Gold Pill was involved. Even so, Tang Siyu’s cultivation speed was truly astonishing.","She had completely left her peers behind. Other than Chu Yunfan, who was mysterious and unfathomable in everyone’s eyes, the strongest person among the others had only barely touched the edge of the fifth Creation Stage.","This speed was very shocking. Such a cultivation was even comparable to the prodigies on the previous prodigy list. In the eyes of many people, Tang Siyu should be the number one on the prodigy list. Although Chu Yunfan was Tang Siyu’s fiancé, his cultivation should not be on par with Tang Siyu.","However, the Mysteries Pavilion hadn’t changed their comments, so no one could be certain that their judgment was true. After all, Chu Yunfan had a magic treasure that could shield him. This was something that everyone knew.","Therefore, if they wanted to determine Chu Yunfan’s true strength, the only way was to get Chu Yunfan to fight Tang Siyu. Whoever won would determine the first place on the prodigy list.","Many people sadly discovered that the first place on the prodigy list seemed to","have become a family matter for the two of them. It could be said that in these","few months, Tang Siyu’s reputation was the best it had ever been. It was even said that it had alarmed the imperial family of Grand Xia.","After all, Tang Siyu was now considered a member of the imperial family. This was written on the list of the imperial family, and she was considered to be part of the eldest princess’ bloodline.","Even Chu Yunfan’s name had been completely overshadowed. After all, Chu Yunfan!s current strength was unknown, but Tang Siyu’s strength was real and everyone could see it.","However, as if they had been stimulated by Tang Siyu’s breakthrough to the peak of the Creation Stage, the prodigies from the previous prodigy list, who had been far away from everyone’s sight for a period of time, appeared one after another.","News of the battle between the previous prodigies and this year’s prodigies spread all over the world as if they were trying to clear their names. One after another, the once famous prodigies appeared, completely defeating this year’s prodigies. This was especially true for many of the top prodigies ranked at the top of the prodigy list. They were even defeated by the prodigies who had not been ranked on the prodigy list in the previous batch.","Even before the top 100 prodigies of the previous batch appeared, they had already defeated the current batch of prodigies. It was as if these ex-prodigies were trying to say that they would always be on top.","The cultivation of this year’s prodigy list was still far from that of the previous prodigy list. This was simply a great humiliation for the current prodigies. However, the difference in strength made them feel speechless. Even the prodigies who did not enter the top 100 in the previous batch had long reached the sixth Creation Stage. Many of them were even at the seventh. This was clearly impossible for the current prodigies on the prodigy list. Obviously, time was not on their side.","The previous prodigies on the prodigy list were not inferior to them in terms of talent. Not to mention, their cultivation time was far above this year’s prodigy list. The gap between the two sides was immediately highlighted.","The return of the last batch of prodigies caught everyone off guard. They were practically swept away. These people suffered only under the hands of one person, and that was Tang Siyu.","A few of the ex-prodigies from the Eastern Sea went looking for Tang Siyu. The result was different from the prodigies in other places. When they faced her, they were unable to fight back and were easily defeated. The images of that battle spread. Several prodigies from the previous prodigy list surrounded Tang Siyu, and all kinds of attacks swept out like a tide.","However, what everyone did not expect was that these sixth or even seventh level Creators could not do anything to Tang Siyu even after joining forces. They could not even break through the dense barrier around Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu’s terrifying cultivation was displayed. She was many times strongerthan the last time she killed several demon prodigies in the Demon Region.","In the picture, Tang Siyu waited for these people to have had enough before suddenly attacking. With lightning speed, she easily defeated these ex-prodigies.","This stimulated the ex-prodigies. When these substitute prodigies were easily defeated by Tang Siyu, a true prodigy of the previous prodigy list appeared. He was ranked 100th on the previous prodigy list, the junior leader of the","Quicksand Sect of the Eastern Sea.","The moment this person appeared, he displayed a terrifying strength that was completely different from those substitute prodigies. He even suppressed those substitute prodigies.","He was a peak Creator.","Unlike the previous battle where the substitute prodigies were completely crushed, this battle could be said to be evenly matched. Both sides were peak Creators. They fought hard and it was only after hundreds of moves that the winner was determined.","What was completely unexpected was that although they were all at the peak of the Creation Stage, they had clearly just stepped into this level not long ago.","The junior leader of the Quicksand Sect had obviously reached the peak of the Creation Stage for quite a long time. The junior leader of the Quicksand Sect should be stronger. However, the reality was completely beyond everyone’s expectations, and it gave some of the prophesiers a hard slap in the face.","After a few hundred moves, Tang Siyu displayed a strength that far surpassed the junior leader of the Quicksand Sect and defeated him.","“This is the might of an emperor-level physique. It’s completely overwhelming. Although she has just reached the peak of Creation Stage not long ago, the power she has accumulated is even stronger than Quicksand Sect’s junior leader, who has reached the peak of Creation Stage for several years. She’s simply a monster!”","“As expected of an emperor physique. She’s invincible among her peers. There are few from the last prodigy list who could match her.”","“King physiques are already terrifying, and an emperor physique is even more so. Do you want us ordinary people to live?!”","Amid the exclamations of countless people, Tang Siyu not only defeated the junior leader of the Quicksand Sect, but she also defeated several famous prodigies on the previous prodigy list one after another.","Each of them was more powerful than the last, and their rankings were higher. However, Tang Siyu’s speed of defeat was even faster. When she defeated the junior leader of the Quicksand Sect, she had spent hundreds of moves. When she defeated the second prodigy from the previous batch, Tang Siyu only used a hundred moves to completely defeat him.","By the time the third one was defeated, he was already within 50 moves. The fourth prodigy was defeated by Tang Siyu in less than 10 moves.","For a moment, Tang Siyu became the hope in the eyes of the current prodigies.."]},{"number":2030,"title":"Chapter 2030: An Unforgettable Gift","paragraphs":["Chapter 2030: An Unforgettable Gift","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There were many conflicts among the current prodigies. There were even quite a few who fought. However, facing the collective suppression of the previous batch of prodigies, the prodigies of this batch could not help but start to band together psychologically.","Especially because they had cultivated longer than them, these ex-prodigies could bully them wantonly. This kind of situation had not happened for a long time. It had always been them who bullied others. When had it ever been their turn to be humiliated like this?","Among these people, Tang Siyu was the second person to defeat the prodigy of the previous prodigy list. Naturally, she was seen as their savior. Although Chu Yunfan was in front of him, when Chu Yunfan killed Li Weiyuan previously, everyone with discerning eyes could see that he relied on the power of a pill to stimulate his combat strength in a short time. It could not be considered a normal strength.","Tang Siyu was different. She had used her own strength to defeat these ex-prodigies fair and square. The evaluation between them was naturally different. Many people even completely ignored Chu Yunfan. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan could not do what Tang Siyu could do with his own strength.","Chu Yunfan only smiled and didn’t take it to heart. How could he be jealous of his wife? Moreover, he was not a high-profile person. Although he had made a name for himself, most of it was not what he wanted.","However, the content that followed made Chu Yunfan’s eyes widen in anger. Tang Siyu had defeated several of the ex-prodigies in a row. Many people even said that the previous generation’s prodigies were far inferior to this generation’s prodigies.","The came the famous junior leader of Divine Maiden House, Maiden Donghua, who was one of the best on the previous prodigy list. Taking advantage of the fact that Tang Siyu was ordered to go to the Imperial City to meet the king, she blocked her outside the Imperial City. Both sides erupted into a world-shocking battle. and the battle ended with Tang Siyu’s defeat. Shocking the world.","Maiden Donghua had already entered the Arcana Stage without anyone noticing. Her combat strength was completely superior to Tang Siyu’s. This battle made everyone look at Tang Siyu and Maiden Donghua in a new light. Although Maiden Donghua was ranked at the top of the previous prodigy list, she was not one of the top few. However, she was one step ahead of the junior leader of the Quicksand Sect and Li Weiyuan of the Li family.","Once one entered the Arcana Stage, the rest are just ants.","Everyone knew this, but Tang Siyu was evenly matched with Maiden Donghua at the beginning of the battle. Her powerful combat strength showed everyone the true power of an emperor physique. Even though she was defeated, she was still defeated honorably, forcing Maiden Donghua into a sorry state.","In the end, Maiden Donghua stabbed Tang Siyu with her sword and defeated her. All of this happened three days ago, right before Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion. At that time, he was in seclusion, so he naturally did not know about this.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know why these ex-prodigies who had been cultivating in seclusion had returned one after another, and they had chosen such a shocking way to return. He only knew that Maiden Donghua had severely injured Tang Siyu.","Beside Chu Yunfan, You Chuyun could feel Chu Yunfan’s killing intent condensing into something substantial.","“Maiden Donghua of the Divine Maidens!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Help me find out where Maiden Donghua is now,” he instructed coldly.","After Maiden Donghua defeated Tang Siyu, all kinds of unbearable rumors exploded from every corner. It seemed to verify the statement that this year’s prodigies were just so. For a time, this battle spread throughout the world.","With the might of her victory, Maiden Donghua became famous for a while.","“Yes, Marquis!” You Chuyun quickly left. After half a day, he returned and handed some information to Chu Yunfan.","“Marquis, Maiden Donghua will be hosting a dao forum in three days,” You Chuyun reported, “Many of the previous and current prodigies have received invitations.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the information. Maiden Donghua was in the limelight now. The other prodigies from the previous batch could not do anything to Tang Siyu, but Maiden Donghua had defeated Tang Siyu. It could be said that she was in the limelight.","Taking advantage of the victory, Maiden Donghua held a forum, and many prodigies expressed that they would attend. It could be said that this was the most eye-catching forum in recent times.","Chu Yunfan understood that Maiden Donghua was trying to create momentum. In Grand Xia, all kinds of resources were limited. One had to fight for more, including prestige. The higher the reputation, the more resources one could enjoy and the more followers one could get. After she had just defeated Tang Siyu, who dared to not give her face?","“Good. Three days from now, I’ll give her a big gift that I guarantee will be unforgettable!” Chu Yunfan grinned, revealing his snow-white teeth. His eyes were burning with anger.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care if Maiden Donghua wanted to increase her reputation and fulfill her wishes, but she actually dared to scheme against Tang Siyu. This was something that Chu Yunfan absolutely couldn’t tolerate. Otherwise, wouldn’t anyone be able to use the two of them as stepping stones? Anyone who wanted to farm reputation could step on them.","After You Chuyun left, Chu Yunfan teleported to the Eastern Sea through the teleportation portal and rushed to Serene Immortal Mountain as fast as possible.","Outside Serene Immortal Mountain, Chu Yunfan met Ruoxi.","“I’m sorry, Marquis Chu. The junior leader is currently in seclusion with serious injuries. It’s not convenient for her to meet you.” Ruoxi looked at Chu Yunfan with an indifferent expression, but she was extremely shocked in her heart.","It had only been a short year since they last met, but Chu Yunfan’s strength was simply unbelievable and unfathomable.","He had thought that Tang Siyu’s cultivation speed was already very shocking and that no one could compare to her. However, when Chu Yunfan revealed a trace of his aura in a moment of desperation, it made her feel frightened. Although she couldn’t sense Chu Yunfan’s strength, she could feel that it was unfathomable.","“l was being too hasty. In that case, I’ll take my leave first. Please pass this healing pill to Siyu for me.” Chu Yunfan took out a white porcelain bottle from the Mountain River Diagram and handed it to Ruoxi.","“l understand. I’ll pass it to the junior leader.” Ruo Xi said.","“I’ll be off now.” Chu Yunfan left without looking back. In a moment, he had disappeared from where he was.","Ruoxi returned to Serene Immortal Mountain. In a secluded realm, Tang Siyu took the porcelain bottle and listened to Ruoxi’s report of Chu Yunfan’s words. Her beautiful eyes watered.","After a long time, Tang Siyu said, “l understand..”"]},{"number":2031,"title":"Chapter 2031: This Is Obviously Different","paragraphs":["Chapter 2031: This Is Obviously Different","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Flying Celestials, in Immortal Ascension Peak owned by the chief disciple, Yang Dengxian.","This place had become the focus of many disciples in the Flying Celestials. It was not because of anything else, but because Chu Yunfan, who was currently in the limelight in the sect, had returned.","In the eyes of many disciples in the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan was the most popular disciple. The disciple who had been the most popular previously was the chief disciple, Yang Dengxian. Now that the two of them had collided, there was no doubt that in the eyes of many people, the collision was going to produce the most dazzling light.","Some time ago, Situ Xuan, the sect leader, had given the order to promote Chu Yunfan to a vice- sect leader of the Flying Celestials. To many people, this was the most obvious signal that they wanted to nurture Chu Yunfan as the next sect leader.","Generally speaking, only after the chief disciple had gone through a certain amount of tempering would they be promoted to become a vice-leader.","This was a very obvious signal, and the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials had changed their minds. They had originally favored Yang Dengxian, but now they favored Chu Yunfan. In the eyes of many people, these two people should be like fire and water. However, no one knew that the two of them were sitting opposite each other. They were not as hostile as many people thought.","In a courtyard, Chu Yunfan and Yang Dengxian sat opposite each other. Yang Dengxian poured a cup of tea for Chu Yunfan and then said, “l heard you’ve been in the limelight recently, Junior Chu. Even someone like me who is in seclusion has heard about it.’","Yang Dengxian smiled. Contrary to what many people thought, the two of them were not incompatible. For many people, the higher-ups valued Chu Yunfan more, which was equivalent to invading Yang Dengxian’s domain. This was unprecedented in the past. After all, he was simply unrivaled among his peers. If not for Chu Yunfan, he might have been the only true disciple of the same generation in the Flying Celestials who had stepped into the Creation Stage.","The position of the next sect leader would have been decided internally. Even if another king-physique appeared among the younger disciples, it was impossible for them to catch up with Yang Dengxian. After all, Yang","Dengxian’s cultivation speed was extremely fast when he was cultivating.","However, as the saying went, man’s plan was not as good as God’s plan. Just when everyone regarded him as the next sect leader, Chu Yunfan suddenly?? appeared. It was as if Chu Yunfan had jumped out from a crack in a stone.","It was impossible for Yang Dengxian to not feel anything. After all, whether he was to be nurtured as the next sect leader or not, the difference in power was secondary. The key was that the cultivation resources might be worlds apart.","The reason why Yang Dengxian’s cultivation speed was so fast, far surpassing the other true disciples, was not only because of his own extraordinary talent, but also because the Flying Celestials had invested all its strength in nurturing him. However, there was not much conflict between him and Chu Yunfan now. This was because the news that Situ Xuan wanted to promote Chu Yunfan to be a vice sect leader had caused a stir.","However, there were only a few people who really knew the inside story—Chu Yunfan had rejected the promotion. Yang Dengxian was one of the few people who knew the inside story.","Chu Yunfan’s refusal to be promoted to vice sect leader meant that he had indirectly rejected being the future sect leader of the Flying Celestials. Clearly, he did not have this ambition. In the future, he would only be a carefree grand elder, so the conflict with Yang Dengxian was reduced to the minimum. This also meant that Situ Xuan’s plan to rope Chu Yunfan into the Flying Celestials had completely failed. Clearly, Chu Yunfan did not fall for his trick.","Although the future was uncertain, Yang Dengxian was not stupid enough to treat Chu Yunfan as an enemy. Moreover, as the chief disciple and the next sect leader, it was naturally impossible for him to not have this bit of tolerance.","However, although his tone was a little mocking, it was not nonsense. It was because of what had just happened. Although it was only a short time, it had spread throughout the circle of experts almost overnight. Chu Yunfan couldn’t hide it even if he wanted to.","Chu Yunfan had taken care of three ex-prodigies. This news spread like thunder among the current prodigies. After all, they couldn’t even defeat the ex-prodigies. Clearly, they wouldn’t be able to catch up to these ex-prodigies in a few years.","However, now, someone had taken care of these prodigies. This was the first person other than Tang Siyu. Yang Dengxian was shocked. Others had only heard rumors, but he was different. He had fought one of these ex-prodigies.","Of course, he suffered a crushing defeat. With his current cultivation, he had only just touched the fourth Creation Stage. Although his cultivation had improved very quickly, he was still far from the fifth, sixth, or even seventh Creation Stage. This made him quite unhappy.","But under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan managed to defeat the last batch of prodigies, and experts at the peak of the Creation Stage nonetheless. Such existences would be considered top experts even within the grand elders of the Flying Celestials.","Moreover, according to the information, Chu Yunfan had easily defeated the three great experts. He did it faster and easier than Tang Siyu, who had defeated the ex-prodigies.","The extent of Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had shocked Yang Dengxian when he received the news. It was simply unbelievable. It was really infuriating to compare people.","He was also a prodigy of his generation, but because of his cultivation time, he couldn’t compare to the ex-prodigies. As for Chu Yunfan, his cultivation time was even shorter than his, but he could crush the ex-prodigies like ants. Even an idiot could see the difference between them.","Yang Dengxian had to admit that if he was a top genius in the eyes of the world, then Chu Yunfan was a genius among geniuses—a monster among monsters. He wanted to cut open Chu Yunfan’s head to see what it was made of. Chu Yunfan was obviously different.","Thinking of this, Yang Dengxian felt uncomfortable. His enthusiasm for Chu","Yunfan today was related to the news he heard yesterday. He was a genius of","Grand Xia who had been properly trained according to the process, but Chu Yunfan was different. He was clearly an unorthodox person who did not play by the rules.","No one knew what kind of physique Chu Yunfan had. What he had learned outside of the Flying Celestials was even rarer. The resources he had used to cultivate until now were pathetically few in comparison.","In Yang Dengxian’s eyes, Chu Yunfan used the Flying Celestials as just a shield.."]},{"number":2032,"title":"Chapter 2032: Is He Trying to Cause Trouble?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2032: Is He Trying to Cause Trouble?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In fact, Yang Dengxian was right. The reason why Chu Yunfan had never been able to integrate into the Flying Celestials’s system was because of this. Chu Yunfan’s inheritance had formed its own system. Ever since he started his cultivation path, he had been relying on himself. He had never relied on anyone to get to where he was today. How could he not have pride in his heart?","Under such circumstances, he had only joined the Flying Celestials to seek a protective shield. Although he had suffered many assassinations during this process, the name of the Flying Celestials had already blocked many murderous intentions for him.","Chu Yunfan was well aware of this. He wanted the Flying Celestials as a protective shield, but he did not want to get too deep into the Flying Celestials’ system. Otherwise, he would only be restricted by the Flying Celestials. Any sect with a long history had their requirements for their inheritors. No one could not act recklessly. There were too many things to consider.","This was not what Chu Yunfan wanted either. He wanted to maintain his position of being independent of the system but not stepping out of it. Therefore, when Situ Xuan wanted to promote him to vice sect leader, he refused. There was no other reason than that he would be too restrained.","Unlike Chu Yunfan, other than asking for protection, Chu Yunfan could rely on himself for everything. He almost didn’t need to use the Flying Celestials. Since Yang Dengxian’s cultivation, all the resources, connections, and inheritances came from the Flying Celestials, it was impossible for him to leave the Flying Celestials now. Because of this, he was a little envious of Chu Yunfan, who was now free and easy to advance and retreat.","Chu Yunfan’s strength made him even more envious, or rather, he was envious. However, since Chu Yunfan had no intention of fighting for the position of the sect leader, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more benefits he would have. In the future, after he took over the Flying Celestials, with such a powerful expert in charge, the Flying Celestials would be able to speak much more firmly.","The reason why the Flying Celestials’ ranking among the ten great sects had been dropping continuously in recent years, and why some ordinary sects had even dared to come and provoke them, was because it had been too long since the Flying Celestials had produced a top-notch expert who could crush their peers.","Now that Chu Yunfan had no intention of competing for the position of sect leader, Chu Yunfan’s advantage and his advantage could complement each other. Not only did the two of them not have to compete with each other, but they could also become partners.","“They’re just a few jumping clowns. 1 just casually dealt with them,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently as if those experts who made people tremble with fear were really just three clowns.","Yang Dengxian’s face flushed. It was because he had been holding it in. At this moment, he didn’t know what to say in his heart. There was nothing wrong with this pretentious act, and Chu Yunfan had a solid record to support him.","Although he was posturing, it was the truth.","After this battle spread, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan would consolidate his position as the number one on the prodigy list. After all, although Tang Siyu!s performance was astonishing and she had also defeated the previous Creator prodigies, there was still a gap between her and Chu Yunfan’s ability to kill three people with ease.","“I came to visit you today with a reason. I hope to get your help, Senior Yang,”","Chu Yunfan said.","“Junior Chu, go ahead and tell me what it is. As long as it’s within my ability, I’ll naturally agree.” Yang Dengxian nodded, but he was a little puzzled. With Chu Yunfan’s strength and skills, what did he need to ask him for?","I heard that Maiden Donghua is going to hold a dao forum. Did you receive an invitation?” Chu Yunfan took a sip of tea.","“l did.” Yang Dengxian nodded. “But I haven’t decided if I want to go.”","Yang Dengxian remembered that he had received an invitation from Maiden Donghua, but he was still hesitating whether he should go. After all, the premise of Maiden Donghua holding this dao forum was because she had severely injured Tang Siyu and was using that incident to become famous. Naturally, everyone knew about the relationship between Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu. If he went, it would be equivalent to publicly slapping Chu Yunfan’s face. He had been hesitating, but after he learned that Chu Yunfan had easily crushed Wang Xueyi and the other two yesterday, he instantly gave up on the idea of going.","What a joke. A mere dao forum was not enough for him to offend Chu Yunfan.","“Feel free to attend, but I hope you will bring me along. I want to see how lively this forum will be.” Chu Yunfan grinned, revealing his neat teeth.","For some reason, this smile seemed especially dangerous to Yang Dengxian. It made his hair stand on end. He immediately thought that something was wrong. Maiden Donghua had just been seriously injured, and Tang Siyu and","Chu Yunfan were about to attend her forum? What was Chu Yunfan trying to do?","He was stirring up trouble!","“Junior Chu, although I understand your thoughts, Maiden Donghua is not to be trifled with,” Yang Dengxian said, “Besides, there’s someone behind her.","That person should even more not be provoked.”","“Oh?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes and smiled. “And who or what has made you so timid, Senior Yang? I still remember that you weren’t afraid even when facing Li Qianyuan.”","Speaking of this, Yang Dengxian couldn’t help but reveal a bitter smile. Although his cultivation was not as good as Li Qianyuan at that time, he was not afraid of Li Qianyuan. Li Qianyuan’s cultivation was stronger than theirs, but his strength was limited. In general, they were on the same level. All the top experts of this generation had similar cultivation levels, except for Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu, who were strange newcomers. Some people were already calling Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu monster rookies.","“You might not have heard of that person before. He’s the previous top ranker of the prodigy list, Jun Tianci of the Destiny Sect,” Yang Dengxian said, “When","I had just become a true disciple, Jun Tianci was already the top of the prodigy list. He was able to suppress all the others. His power was even greater than that of mv seniors.”","pursed his lips and did not comment. He was different from Yang Dengxian because he did not grow up in Grand Xia. Many things that were common knowledge to Yang Dengxian were unknown to Chu Yunfan.","However, Jun Tianci’s strength must be unfathomable to be able to make Yang Dengxian so fearful.","“And Maiden Donghua is Jun Tianci’s fiance.” Yang Dengxian paused for a moment. “l heard that Jun Tianci once praised Princess Gushe and thought that Princess Gushe was worthy of him..”"]},{"number":2033,"title":"Chapter 2033: Chu Yunfan Enlightens Yang Dengxian","paragraphs":["Chapter 2033: Chu Yunfan Enlightens Yang Dengxian","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Yang Dengxian had hinted at this point. How could Chu Yunfan not understand that Maiden Donghua’s sudden attack on Tang Siyu was probably related to Jun Tianci?","It was because Jun Tianci had once expressed his admiration for Tang Siyu that Maiden Donghua had acted against Tang Siyu. It was not difficult to guess the reason behind this.","It had been many years since the ranking of the prodigy list had changed. It had been many years since Jun Tianci had changed to Li Qjanyuan, and it had been some time since Li Qjanyuan had changed to Chu Yunfan.","However, he could still feel the immense pressure Jun Tianci had exerted on Yang Dengxian. Even now, Yang Dengxian understood that his current cultivation was still far from Jun Tianci’s. He didn’t know what level Jun Tianci’s cultivation had reached.","Moreover, Jun Tianci was from the number one sect in the world, the Destiny Sect. That sect was even more powerful than the Flying Celestials, which Jun Tianci was proud of.","“Jun Tianci? Interesting.” Chu Yunfan sneered. Whether it was Li Qianyuan or Jun Tianci, there was no difference to him.","“You still want to participate in the forum, Junior Chu?” Yang Dengxian immediately realized that Chu Yunfan was definitely up to something.","He was hesitant. After all, bringing Chu Yunfan to the forum was to completely fall out with Maiden Donghua, and even Jun Tianci, who was behind Maiden Donghua. But if he didn’t help Chu Yunfan, it was obvious that Chu Yunfan and him would grow further and further apart. No one would want to follow an irresponsible chief disciple, not to mention a top genius like","Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked at Yang Dengxian and didn’t say anything because he knew that Yang Dengxian was struggling. In fact, he didn’t really care if Yang Dengxian agreed or not. It was just a dao forum. Yang Dengxian wanted to participate, but he was afraid.","Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t participate in the forum, he would have plenty of ways to find trouble with Maiden Donghua. He just wanted to see how much pox,ver this junior leader, who bore the future hope of the Flying Celestials, had.","Yang Dengxian was an outstanding true disciple of one of the top ten sects, and he was to be the next sect leader. If he didn’t have the courage to face Jun Tianci, it would be too disappointing for Chu Yunfan.","After a long time, Yang Dengxian finally made a decision. He looked at Chu","Yunfan and said, “Junior Chu, come with me in two days.”","After making this decision, Yang Dengxian heaved a sigh of relief. For him, this was a spiritual struggle. To them, Jun Tianci was a huge shadow in their hearts. Now, he had personally broken through this huge shadow. He felt that his soul had been baptized, and he had completed a transformation from the inside out.","At this moment, he realized that he could understand Chu Yunfan even more. The aura emitted by Chu Yunfan was completely different from theirs. They didn’t have the courage to advance and the courage to win when they met on a narrow road.","The education Yang Dengxian had received since he was young could be said to be the most elite education. It could even be said that even if he were to die now, as long as it was meaningful, he would not frown. However, he lacked the ruthless spirit in Chu Yunfan’s heart—a deep-rooted contempt for rules and authority.","If Chu Yunfan was afraid, then he wouldn’t have opposed Li Qjanyuan several times, and he wouldn’t have the courage to fall out with Jun Tianci. This was the difference in power structure. And now, after this incident, Yang Dengxian finally understood this point.","“Junior Chu, you have given me a lot of benefits. Thank you!” Yang Dengxian cupped his hands.","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. He could naturally see Yang Dengxian!s transformation. Although this transformation did not involve the transformation of talent and strength, a person with a broader mindset would have a better future. Otherwise, he might be in the shadow of Jun Tianci for the rest of his life, unable to escape.","“You’re too polite, Senior Yang.” Chu Yunfan waved. “All right then, I’ll be back in two days.” He got up and left.","Outside Immortal Ascension Peak, many people who were staring at the Immortal Ascension Peak saw Chu Yunfan walk out first. There was no conflict between him and Yang Dengxian as many people thought.","This made some people happy, but also made some people disappointed. Currently, the two strongest true disciples did not have a conflict, which made many people’s plans to fish in troubled waters become a joke.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left, the news that Chu Yunfan had killed three disciples from the previous prodigy list in Zhenyuan spread. This news was not only spread among the top experts, but through the masses.","For a moment, everyone was shocked. Many people began to realize that their initial thought that Chu Yunfan was dying was undoubtedly wrong. Even though Tang Siyu had already displayed amazing talent, Chu Yunfan still firmly suppressed her and was still first on the prodigy list.","Two days was enough for the news of Chu Yunfan killing the three previous prodigies of the prodigy list to spread throughout the world. Chu Yunfan’s reputation grew bigger and bigger.","Maiden Donghua’s forum was held on time. It was on an island in the Eastern Sea. This was the private territory of Maiden Donghua and also an external blessed land of the Divine Maidens.","On the island, immortal energy lingered. All kinds of spiritual birds and beasts were everywhere. Strange flowers and plants could be seen everywhere. On this day, the barrier around the island was opened to welcome the geniuses from all walks of life.","For a time, this place became the focus of attention of all the forces in the Eastern Sea. Especially since the famous Maiden Donghua had just severely injured Tang Siyu and was guarding this island, countless people did not dare to underestimate this island.","On this day, in the sky, lights streaked across the sky like a storm. It looked extremely gorgeous and shocking from afar. Each beam of light carried an extremely powerful aura that made people shudder. They were all experts from various places who had come to participate in the dao forum. The weakest among them were fourth-level Creators. It could be said that any one of these people had the ability to establish a sect in the Eastern Sea. Now, there were hundreds of such masters gathered here. One could imagine how much commotion it would cause.","“Oh my god, how many masters have 1 seen since this morning? It’s only because Maiden Donghua is so influential that she can attract so many masters to attend her forum.’","“That’s right. Maiden Donghua is now very popular. No one wants to offend her.. After all, isn’t there that person behind her?”"]},{"number":2034,"title":"Chapter 2034: He’s Just a Clown!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2034: He’s Just a Clown!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Many people from the previous prodigy list came too. After all, the cultivation time for this year’s prodigy list is still limited. There’s no way to compare it to the previous prodigy list. This aura can be judged.”","“In addition to the prodigies of the previous and current batches, there are also many legendary seniors from throughout the Eastern Sea. Tsk, tsk. These legendary big shots are usually rare to see, but now I’m seeing so many of them at once.’","“Even if one doesn’t respect her, they have to respect the person behind her.” Many people in the Eastern Sea felt as if their horizons had been broadened when they saw the streaks of light flying past in the sky. Each of them was a high and mighty figure, and any one of them was a powerful existence that was rarely seen on ordinary days.","Melodious music was playing on the island. The dao forum was about to begin, and the flying lights in the sky were getting fewer and fewer. Many people were itching to go in and take a look. However, none of them dared to get within a hundred miles of this island.","Suddenly, another two streaks of light streaked across the sky in the distance.","Many people focused their eyes and immediately revealed a somewhat incredulous expression on their faces. Although the light flashed and disappeared without a trace, they could still see the two people clearly.","One of them was Yang Dengxian, the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials. The person next to him could be said to have become famous recently.","Chu Yunfan, the number one on this year’s prodigy list!","“How is this possible? It’s the two of them!” someone exclaimed. He recognized these two people.","The others also came to their senses. Soon, the experts behind these two streaks of light were known by everyone.","Everyone quickly reacted. Previously, the matter of Tang Siyu being severely injured by Maiden Donghua had caused a stir. It was because of this that Maiden Donghua could hold such a huge forum. That battle had shown everyone Maiden Donghua’s true strength. She had surpassed the Creation Stage and entered the Arcana Stage.","It could be said that she was stepping on Tang Siyu’s shoulders, and Chu","Yunfan happened to be Tang Siyu’s fiance. At this time, Chu Yunfan followed Yang Dengxian here, and he was afraid that he came with ill intentions.","For a moment, everyone was shocked. Many people realized one thing. Chu Yunfan’s arrival at this time obviously meant that he had bad intentions. To them, there was no doubt that there was a big show to watch.","“I’m afraid this forum won’t end so easily.”","Niany people sighed. Niost people thought of Jun Tianci was standing behind Maiden Donghua, the terrifying number one on the previous prodigy list. Without a doubt, this could also be considered a collision between the previous and this year’s prodigy list.","“A clash between two generations of top rankers. I wonder who’s the real monster and who’s more terrifying.”","Chu Yunfan followed Yang Dengxian into the island. Chu Yunfan clearly felt that when the two of them entered the sky above the island, a barrier flashed. However, a ray of light flashed from Yang Dengxian’s body, canceling out the","barrier, allowing them to fly into the island smoothly. Yang Dengxian’s invitation card must have worked. This was to prevent people without an invitation card from sneaking onto the island.","After entering the island, Chu Yunfan saw a blessed land that looked like a paradise on earth. The spirit energy on the island was fixed on the island by a special array. Countless spirit energy surged and almost liquefied. It was very dense.","In the distance, there was a huge stadium. Hundreds of participants were sitting in their seats and discussing fervently. On a throne in the center of the stadium was a beautiful woman wearing a light green robe. Although there were many experts present, and each of them could establish a sect in the Eastern Sea, they could not hide the existence of this woman. Instead, they were like stars surrounding the moon, making her even more outstanding.","‘An Arcane!’ Chu Yunfan instantly determined that this woman was Maiden Donghua of the Divine Maidens.","Maiden Donghua’s cultivation was just as the legends said. She had indeed surpassed the Creation Stage and entered the Arcana Stage. Although she had just entered the Arcana Stage, she had indeed entered the Arcana Stage. Only in this way could the group of top Creators be like stars surrounding the moon, making her temperament even more outstanding. The difference between the Creation Stage and the Arcana Stage was like the difference between heaven and earth.","Everyone soon noticed the two newcomers. Suddenly, many people fell silent because they recognized Yang Dengxian and Chu Yunfan, who was beside him.","They knew about the grudge between Tang Siyu and Maiden Donghua, and Chu Yunfan was Tang Siyu’s fiance. Just like the experts from the various forces outside, they immediately interpreted that the person who came had bad intentions.","More people noticed that something was wrong, because they did not know Yang Dengxian and Chu Yunfan. After all, these experts often went into seclusion for decades. Some even went into seclusion for decades. Once they came out of seclusion, they did not know the newcomers who were the most popular at the moment.","However, they immediately noticed that the atmosphere was not right. Soon, they turned their eyes to Chu Yunfan. They could sense that the person who seemed to have changed the atmosphere of the entire forum was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Maiden Donghua had a smile on her face, but she immediately felt that the atmosphere was not right. She only knew Yang Dengxian and had met him once many years ago. She didn’t know who was the person standing next to Yang Dengxian.","However, she soon received a secret voice transmission from the others and immediately knew the identity of the person in front of her—Tang Siyu’s fiance!","She had heard about Chu Yunfan’s limelight. He was currently the hottest and most popular person. However, she had only heard about it. In fact, she didn’t care about Chu Yunfan. What she really cared about was Tang Siyu. Chu Yunfan was just a gootnote.","And Chu Yunfan came with ill intentions? He was just a clown!","Maiden Donghua sneered. Who was Chu Yunfan? He was just a junior. If she had to be careful with such a junior, who did they think she was?","“Chu Yunfan, I don’t think I sent you an invitation. Are you planning to abandon that b*tch and turn over a new leaf?” Maiden Donghua smiled, her lips revealing a hint of disdain.."]},{"number":2035,"title":"Chapter 2035: Killing With One Strike, Intimidating Everyone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2035: Killing With One Strike, Intimidating Everyone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was silent as they fixed their eyes on Chu Yunfan. Many people already knew his identity, and it was clear he came with ill intentions.","“To a sl*t like you?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. “You’re just relying on your age and cultivation time. Do you think you’re that great just because you beat Siyu? If she had cultivated for as long as you did, crushing you would not be much harder than crushing an ant. You actually dare to be so smug just because your cultivation time is several times that of hers and you defeated her by luck?”","“You’re courting death...” Maiden Donghua’s expression was extremely ashen.","Maiden Donghua’s cultivation time was several times longer than Tang Siyu’s. Although she could barely be considered a member of the younger generation at her age, she was obviously not on the same level as Tang Siyu. The reason why she could crush Tang Siyu now was largely because her cultivation time far exceeded Tang Siyu’s. Otherwise, the outcome would have been determined long ago. But even so, it was a different matter if it was exposed.","“Strong is strong, weak is weak. What cultivation time? This is the language of the weak. On the path of cultivation, before reaching the peak, the so-called geniuses are meaningless. What’s the difference between a fallen genius and a mediocre person?” said a tall man with a sinister expression.","He and the others looked at Chu Yunfan unkindly. Chu Yunfan’s words not only hurt Maiden Donghua, but also affected them. They were one of the mediocre people that Chu Yunfan had mentioned. If they had cultivated for the same amount of time, they would have been beaten up by Tang Siyu.","No, it should be said that they had already been beaten up by Tang Siyu. In fact, among the previous prodigies, only Maiden Donghua had defeated Tang Siyu. The rest of the people had lost to Tang Siyu more than one or two times. In comparison, if they were to face Tang Siyu, the outcome would not be any better.","Under such circumstances, they naturally wouldn’t treat Chu Yunfan nicely.","“Do the younger generation nowadays not know how to respect their seniors?” the tall man said.","‘Be careful, Junior Chu. This is an itinerant cultivator from the Eastern Sea. His name is Daoist Hai,’ Yang Dengxian said to Chu Yunfan via telepathy.","Obviously, as the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials for many years, Yang Dengxian’s intelligence network was much stronger than Chu Yunfan’s.","‘This person looks young, but he’s actually very old. He’s very experienced and is of the same generation as the sect leader. He’s not easy to deal with.’","“Daoist Hai?” Chu Yunfan grinned and looked at Daoist Hai coldly. “How dare you jump out. Are you from the same generation as our sect’s sect leader, Sir","Situ?”","“That’s right. I’ve met your sect leader once,” Daoist Hai said proudly. Speaking of experience, it was exactly his strong point.","“How laughable. You actually have the face to admit that you and our sect leader are of the same generation. However, Sir Situ is one of the top experts in the world, while you are actually still at the Creation Stage and have not advanced an inch. Don’t you feel ashamed? Are you that thick-skinned?” Chu Yunfan mocked without hesitation.","“How arrogant of a junior!” Daoist Hai’s expression suddenly changed. Chu Yunfan’s words had simply poked his wound, and he was instantly furious.","Suddenly, in the next moment, a black light cut through the sky as fast as lightning and instantly rushed toward Chu Yunfan. Everyone only saw a blur and couldn’t see what had happened.","The black light arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. There were only a few people who could see this attack clearly. Even if everyone present was the best among the Creation Stage, Daoist Hai was clearly the best among the best.","“Small tricks, you dare to be impudent in front of me?” Chu Yunfan stretched out two fingers and caught the black light. At this moment, everyone saw that the black light was actually a sword light.","It was a long black sword. As the sword light flickered, it brought out a black light. In an instant, it pierced toward Chu Yunfan like a poisonous bug. Daoist Hai had attacked Chu Yunfan with his sword light in an instant, wanting to kill him.","“What great strength!” Daoist Hai felt that his sword was clamped by Chu Yunfan and couldn’t move. It was simply unbelievable.","Suddenly, at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s fingers moved slightly. He suddenly felt a shocking force sweep over, and the long sword in his hand shattered inch by inch.","“Can’t even withstand a single blow,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“What did you say?” Daoist Hai was furious, and a monstrous bloody aura erupted from his body. It was a cultivation that had reached the seventh Creation Stage. He opened his bloody mouth and seemed to have transformed into a ferocious beast in the sea.","This was Daoist Hai r s true form. Daoist Hai was not a human or a marine, but a ferocious beast of the sea. Many people present knew that Chu Yunfan was indeed extraordinary to be able to force Daoist Hai to this point.","Daoist Hai walked toward Chu Yunfan step by step. His entire body was emitting an extremely dangerous and desperate aura as if he could suppress the heavens with just his cultivation.","“Boring. This is as far as you go.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Suddenly, a black light flashed in Chu Yunfan’s hand. It was the fragment of Daoist Hai r s sword. The fragment turned into a black light and tore through the sky. The sky trembled violently as if a huge crack had been torn open.","Slice!","Wherever the black light passed by, Daoist Hai r s blood energy was instantly broken. Then, the black light pierced Daoist Hai.","In the next moment, blood spurted out of Daoist Hai r s head. Blood mixed with brain matter splashed out. A huge hole appeared on his head, almost blowing off half of his head. Daoist Hai r s eyes flashed with disbelief, as if he still could not believe that he had been killed by Chu Yunfan so easily.","Suddenly, the entire place was dead silent. Many of them had heard of Chu Yunfan’s achievements, but hearing it and seeing it with their own eyes were two completely different things.","Many people had heard of Daoist Hai r s ferocity, especially since he was a veteran and had been in the Eastern Sea for a long time. Many people could even say that they had grown up listening to the legend of Daoist Hai.","Now that the legend in their hearts had been killed by Chu Yunfan in one blow, many people could not help but feel a chill run down their spines.."]},{"number":2036,"title":"Chapter 2036: Breaking Out? Too Troublesome! Whoever Stands in My Way Dies!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2036: Breaking Out? Too Troublesome! Whoever Stands in My Way Dies!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There were many people who felt like the fox was grieving over the death of the rabbit. Although Daoist Hai was not the strongest, he had lived for a long time. Many people had grown up listening to his legends. Now, the new generation was overtaking the old. He had died so easily at Chu Yunfan’s hands. He had no way to fight back at all.","Yang Dengxian, who was not far from Chu Yunfan, was even more dumbfounded. This was the first time he had encountered such a situation. He had kindly advised Chu Yunfan that Daoist Hai was not easy to deal with.","That was because he was using his own strength as an evaluation. In terms of his strength, Daoist Hai r s strength was indeed above his, so it was not easy to deal with him. He only had the confidence to protect himself, but it was almost impossible to deal with Daoist Hai.","Who knew that the troublesome Daoist Hai in his eyes was just an ant that could be easily killed by Chu Yunfan?","Previously, when Yang Dengxian had received news that Chu Yunfan had killed three top-notch geniuses at the peak of the Creation Stage, he had not been so deeply affected. Now, he had seen with his own eyes how Chu Yunfan had easily killed an expert that he could not fight against.","At this moment, he truly felt that Chu Yunfan’s strength had already surpassed the level he could touch now. He could not help but shake his head and smile bitterly. His good intentions seemed a little ridiculous now. He was extremely shocked.","“How dare you kill someone in front of me!” Maiden Donghua shouted, her beautiful eyes bursting with killing intent.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was unfathomable to her. At least, from the attack just now, she could not tell what kind of strength Chu Yunfan had. This feeling reminded her of Tang Siyu, who had been severely injured by her previously.","She had thought that Tang Siyu was only in the Creation Stage and that it would be easy to take her down. However, she had been forced into an extremely sorry state. In the end, she could only severely injure Tang Siyu and could not kill her.","Now, this feeling came again, and it was even stronger.","Thinking of this, the killing intent in Maiden Donghua’s eyes became even colder. Although she was proud, she was not stupid. Of course, she understood that if such a person continued to grow, he would pose a huge threat to her. Just like Tang Siyu, it was fine if she didn’t offend her, but since she had offended her, she had to kill her.","“So what if I kill someone in front of you?” Chu Yunfan grinned. His eyes were equally cold.","He finally understood why Maiden Donghua wanted to hold the forum in the Eastern Sea. Many of the experts present had the aura of the foreign tribes, and these tribes were life-and-death enemies of Grand Xia. If it were in the Central Plains, many people wouldn’t come here, but the Eastern Sea was much more free. The laws of Grand Xia couldn’t control this place.","“A life for a life. It’s only right and proper” A cold smile appeared on Maiden","Donghua’s beautiful face. “Kill yourself and 1 will leave your corpse intact.”","“You want me to commit suicide? You? The person who can make me commit suicide hasn’t been born yet!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Then I will end you,!” Maiden Donghua said. Her entire body began to emit an extremely dangerous aura as if an archaic ferocious beast was about to hunt. She stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Holy Maiden, why are you angry? Just let us deal this ignorant brat.”","At this moment, six figures walked out from the group of itinerant cultivators and surrounded Chu Yunfan. There were men and women, young people, old women, and old men among these figures. They were all different. However, without exception, all of them emitted an extremely dangerous aura.","Peak Creators!","These six people were all peak Creators. They surrounded Chu Yunfan and formed a battle formation.","“Oh? Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island.” When Maiden Donghua saw these six people, she immediately nodded. She recognized the strength of these six people, “Since you’re interested, I’ll leave it to you. When you’re done, I’ll ask for credit on your behalf.”","“Thank you, Holy Maiden.” An old woman among the Six Friends bowed slightly.","‘Junior Chu, be careful!’ Yang Dengxian was really anxious this time. If he had only felt that Daoist Hai was not easy to deal with, then the Six Friends were truly in danger.","‘The Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island are famous itinerant cultivators in the Eastern Sea. Their strength is unfathomable. Moreover, when the six of them join forces, even a Peak Creator will die. They can even resist a Arcane for a while!’ Yang Dengxian hurriedly said to Chu Yunfan via telepathy. The strength of these six people was enough to pose a fatal threat to Chu","Yunfan.","“Junior Chu, let’s break out of the encirclement immediately. We’re disciples of the Flying Celestials. They won’t dare to do anything to us. They can’t afford to offend the Flying Celestials,” Yang Dengxian quickly said.","This was the advantage of being with a famous sect. One could use the sect as a shield anytime and anywhere.","“No need to break out of the encirclement. It’s too troublesome!” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “l didn’t come here today with the intention of fleeing. Whoever dares to stand in my way will die.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, his body shook slightly and he instantly disappeared from where he was. In the next moment, he appeared in front of the old woman. A long sword that looked like a black ruler had appeared in his hand at some point, and he slashed it down at the old woman.","“Sh*t!” The old woman was scared out of her wits. She hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to be so fierce. He actually attacked as he said. She was unprepared and could only raise her dragon-headed cane to block.","An old dragon appeared from the dragon-headed cane. The old dragon roared and stood in front of the old woman. However, in the next moment, the black longsword began to slaughter. It slashed the long dragon into nothingness. The sword light continued to slash down, and in an instant, it slashed onto the dragon-headed cane, cutting it in half.","Bam!","Slice!","These two different sounds were the result of Chu Yunfan’s Ocean Overturner splitting the dragon-headed cane and the old woman into two. The old woman’s body fell into two halves and was then taken away by Chu Yunfan’s hand.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it had all happened in just a short breath. By the time everyone reacted, the old woman of the Six Friends had already died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","It was deathly silent. So silent that one could hear a pin drop.."]},{"number":2037,"title":"Chapter 2037: The Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island, Exterminated","paragraphs":["Chapter 2037: The Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island, Exterminated","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In a breath’s time, almost as soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he had already killed the old woman of the Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island.","One hit kill!","Instant kill!","Before anyone could react, Chu Yunfan had already finished off the old woman, not giving anyone any time to react.","Yang Dengxian finally understood what it meant to break out of the encirclement. Compared to being able to kill in one move, breaking out of the encirclement was indeed too troublesome. Only now did he truly connect Chu Yunfan to the terrifying existence who had killed three peak Creator ex-prodigies as mentioned in the intelligence report.","Although there was already complete information, just looking at the information and watching Chu Yunfan kill a peak Creator as easily as killing a chicken were two completely different concepts. He knew that Chu Yunfan was very strong, but he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan could actually be this strong.","‘So strong. How did he cultivate to this level? Isn’t his combat strength a little too exaggerated?’ Yang Dengxian couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation time was less than half of his, but his combat strength far exceeded his. Even he, who prided himself on his strong mental fortitude, could not help but feel a huge sense of defeat.","The rest of the people were a little scared, especially many of them who were still restless. They had originally wanted to join the ranks of targeting Chu Yunfan in order to gain Maiden Donghua’s favor and curry favor with the person behind her. Now, they were frightened by Chu Yunfan’s attack. If it were them, what difference would it make? They would also be killed in one strike. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was the same as the rumors.","No, it was even more terrifying than the rumors.","“How dare you...” One of the remaining Six Friends reacted.","The six of them cultivated together all year round and could be said to be as close as family. Now that the old woman had been killed by Chu Yunfan, the other five were all in pain.","“Kill him! I want him in pieces!” the old man among the remaining five roared in anger. He and the old woman were dao companions and had a deep relationship for many years. Now that she had died, the pain was simply bone-deep.","“You want to kill me? I’ll start with you! Chu Yunfan sneered. In the next moment, his figure had disappeared from where he was.","“Be careful!”","Everyone quickly reminded the old man. Chu Yunfan had disappeared just like that and then suddenly attacked. However, by the time they reacted, it was already too late. Chu Yunfan had already appeared behind the old man and slashed down with the Ocean Overturner.","“Aaarrgh!’","The old man let out a loud roar. At the critical moment, the blood essence in his body exploded like a vast ocean, and his killing intent soared to the sky. Although he looked old, his combat strength was actually very shocking. He was one of the best among peak Creators. Although his hair had turned white, in reality, he had killed countless living beings. That terrifying killing intent instantly erupted.","Then, the old man turned around and threw a punch at Chu Yunfan. Only then did many people suddenly remember that the old man now looked old. When he was young, he had been known as a god of death. Who knew how many lives he had killed to reach his current cultivation.","Chu Yunfan suddenly smiled when he saw the old man’s sudden outburst. It was a very calm smile, and his gaze was very calm. The old man’s sudden outburst of killing intent had no effect on him at all. This old man had killed people like flies, but compared to Chu Yunfan’s number of kills, it was still far from enough. Chu Yunfan was the real killer.","The Ocean Overturner slashed down. It was just a normal sword strike, but it shattered the killing intent and the terrifying blood energy that was like an ocean that the old man had erupted with.","Slash!","Chu Yunfan’s sword light continued to slash down. It looked so calm, but everyone saw that the old man’s arm was cut off and flew away.","“D*mn it!” The old man wanted to retreat, but he was shocked.","He now understood how the old woman had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Chu Yunfan’s sword light was the most terrifying thing in the world. No matter what kind of strong enemy it was, he would kill them with one sword.","The old man couldn’t care less about his arm being cut off. He kept retreating, trying to avoid Chu Yunfan’s attack. The remaining four also rushed in Chu Yunfan’s direction, wanting to save the old man.","However, their speed could not catch up to Chu Yunfan’s speed. Chu Yunfan’s sword light simply slashed down, and then suddenly slashed the old man in half.","The old man couldn’t believe that his death had come so easily and that he had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. All of this was done in a casual manner, but it was as smooth as flowing water. It was almost easy to complete the killing.","The old man’s corpse fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands, just like the old woman’s.","“Aaah!”","The remaining four exploded in anger. The battle formation formed by the four people suddenly erupted with terrifying combat strength. The aura of the four was drawn together. With the power of the battle formation, all four of them were gathered together in an instant, forming a flood that bombarded","Chu Yunfan.","The entire venue was engulfed by this terrifying torrent. Many people even instinctively set up a barrier in front of them. Even if it was not aimed at them, it was a terrifying scene when four peak Creators attacked. Just being affected by it could cause them serious injuries.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and golden fist force suddenly burst out, turning into eight powerful gods. The gods blocked in front of Chu Yunfan and shattered everything. In an instant, the torrent was shattered. After the torrent was shattered, the fist did not lose its momentum and smashed toward the remaining Six Friends.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The remaining four members of the Six Friends were hit by the explosion and flew backward. They spat out a mouthful of blood and were instantly severely injured. The battle formation that they were so proud of had exerted 120% of their strength, but it could not block Chu Yunfan’s punch. This feeling made them despair.","However, at this moment, the Ocean Overturner flew into the sky and split into four shocking sword intents, slashing down at the four of them.","Slice!","The heads of the four were shattered, and they died miserably.","The Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island were all killed!"]},{"number":2038,"title":"Chapter 2038: Showing His Strength, Shocking Everyone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2038: Showing His Strength, Shocking Everyone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The downfall of the Six Friends of Purple Bamboo Island shocked everyone.","Many people felt a chill run down their spines, but at the same time, they were secretly rejoicing.","The Six Friends weren’t the only ones who wanted to curry favor with Maiden Donghua, or even the person behind her. They had only been one step ahead of them. Many people even thought that they were lucky. Even if the Flying Celestials would be unhappy after finding out about it, they would just follow the crowd.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s strength would be so terrifying? The Six Friends were able to form their own branch in the Eastern Sea and form a powerful rogue cultivator force. One could imagine how powerful they were.","However, even the powerful Six Friends could barely withstand a few moves from Chu Yunfan. How could everyone else not be frightened?","At this moment, they truly felt that it was far from enough to describe Chu Yunfan as someone with ill intentions. This was not just someone with ill intentions. To be precise, it was clearly a fierce dragon crossing the river.","Chu Yunfan had dared to come here. He clearly had absolute confidence. He was definitely not what many people thought. He was here to demand an explanation for his fiancee.","“Chu Yunfan! How dare you kill someone in front of me! You won’t be able to escape today!” Maiden Donghua shouted. The blood energy in her body swept over like a monstrous blood wave. The true power of the Arcana Stage instantly erupted.","It instantly suppressed all the experts on the scene. The huge gap between the Creation Stage and the Arcana Stage was like a natural chasm. In an instant, many experts on the scene began to circulate their energy to resist. Although they knew that this was directed at Chu Yunfan and not at them, they still felt a huge pressure that was overwhelming.","“Didn’t you want to kill me since the beginning? Why would a viper-like woman like you pretend to be a fairy from heaven? You’re despicable!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“You’re courting death!” Maiden Donghua was furious.","Suddenly, she made a hand seal, and the hand seal turned into a beautiful heavenly maiden. This maiden was huge, like a small mountain. From in the air, she coldly stared at Chu Yunfan with her beautiful eyes as if she was looking at a dead man.","“The Divine Maidens’ Maiden Seal? As expected of the Divine Maidens’ supreme technique. It’s amazing!’","“Although Maiden Donghua is a little domineering, her cultivation is indeed far superior to ours.”","“I’m afraid this Chu Yunfan won’t be able to do well.’","As the crowd discussed, they saw the Maiden Seal fall toward Chu Yunfan.","Everyone could feel the entire island trembling. As a matter of fact. if a Arcane used all their strength, it would be enough to destroy an entire island that did not have a barrier.","However, they only saw Chu Yunfan sneer and slap out with his palm. This slap wasn’t very powerful, but when it hit the Maiden Seal that was falling down, the huge and mighty seal instantly shattered, turning into a rain of light that scattered in all directions. It was unable to cause any damage to Chu Yunfan.","“What?” Maiden Donghua’s eyes widened slightly, and the originally cold expression on her face changed slightly. Chu Yunfan’s strength made her slightly moved.","She didn’t hold back just now. She wanted to kill Chu Yunfan in an instant so that no one had time to stop her. Then, she would be able to kill Chu Yunfan. After all, Chu Yunfan was backed by the Flying Celestials.","“Hmph!” Maiden Donghua snorted coldly and scattered flowers all over the sky. “The Maiden Scatters Flowers!”","The flowers that filled the sky fell down, turning the world into a sea of flowers. However, the terrifying energy fluctuations contained in those flowers made people shudder. Many people felt their hearts tighten, and they felt a great danger jump out of their hearts.","Just as they were about to lose control of their instincts and flee, the countless flowers instantly swept toward Chu Yunfan like countless sharp swords. In an instant, they turned into a petal storm and drowned Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","In an instant, the flower exploded around Chu Yunfan. The terrifying explosion swept out within 30 feet of him. In that instant, the area around Chu Yunfan was blasted into powder.","However, Maiden Donghua had controlled her divine ability to the extreme. All the explosions were concentrated within three feet of Chu Yunfan, and not a single one of them leaked out.","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief. However, before they could react, they saw that the explosion that filled the sky was grabbed by a large hand and instantly disappeared without a trace. When the explosions disappeared, Chu Yunfan’s figure was revealed.","The crowd gasped. Everyone could clearly see that Chu Yunfan was unharmed. Even his clothes hadn’t changed.","“How is this possible? Chu Yunfan didn’t even react?” Many people couldn’t help but gasp.","Even Maiden Donghua had not expected Chu Yunfan to be completely unharmed.","“D*mn it!” She gritted her teeth, and a ferocious expression appeared on her beautiful face.","In the next moment, Maiden Donghua attacked again, and her palm struck down. Immediately after, all kinds of ultimate skills emerged from her body and attacked Chu Yunfan. These martial arts techniques were like a flood that attacked Chu Yunfan.","“Are you trying to say that if you wanted to make a move, I would already be dead? Is that so?!” Maiden Donghua shouted, her voice becoming sharper. She had clearly seen Chu Yunfan’s disdainfully smile, which completely angered her. Although she was a woman and a peerless beauty, she was also a top-notch expert and a peerless prodigy. Naturally, she had her pride.","Now, she had been underestimated by Chu Yunfan, who she had never even looked at. Suddenly, all kinds of terrifying attacks swept toward Chu Yunfan like a storm. Another large hand broke through these attacks and grabbed all of them. In an instant, these attacks disappeared.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan moved. His figure flashed and he appeared in front of the Donghua Goddess.","‘My life is about to end...’ Maiden Donghua suddenly felt a sense of extreme danger as if a primordial beast was pouncing toward her.."]},{"number":2039,"title":"Chapter 2039: Slapping Maiden Donghua","paragraphs":["Chapter 2039: Slapping Maiden Donghua","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This feeling made Maiden Donghua tremble all over. She had never felt this way before. Even if it was those prehistoric ferocious beasts in ancient legends, Maiden Donghua was confident that she could compete with them and even kill those ferocious beasts.","Not to mention ordinary people, she didn’t care about them at all. Who knew that when she faced Chu Yunfan, she would feel as if she was being targeted by an ancient ferocious beast.","In fact, her perception was not wrong. This was due to the bloodline of the","Immemorial Dark Phoenix in Chu Yunfan’s body. It was one of the Ten Ferocities of ancient times. Among the countless ferocious beasts in the immemorial era, the Immemorial Dark Phoenix had been a terrifying existence at the peak.","The stronger one’s cultivation was, the clearer one could feel it. Maiden Donghua even lost control of her body for a moment. For a top-notch expert, an instant was enough to decide many things. This was also why she felt that her life was over.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had reached her and reached out with one hand.","Slap!","A loud slap was heard. Everyone saw that Maiden Donghua was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s slap and she fell to the ground.","Spurt!","Maiden Donghua spat out a mouthful of blood, which contained a few teeth. One side of her face was completely swollen, like a pigs head.","“Why you...” Maiden Donghua’s voice was muffled, but her eyes were fixed on","Chu Yunfan.","Her mind was blank because she had not expected to be sent flying by Chu Yunfan!s slap. Chu Yunfan didn’t kill her, but it made her even angrier than killing her.","The whole place was dead silent. Facing Maiden Donghua who had already entered the Arcana Stage, Chu Yunfan attacked her as he wished. It was almost an instant, and she was completely defeated. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan as if he was a terrifying monster.","Chu Yunfan grinned. “Just one swollen side is too ugly. Let me help you!’","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan slapped her again.","Slap!","Another loud slap, and the other side of Maiden Donghua’s face became swollen. She spat out another mouthful of blood and a few teeth.","Maiden Donghua almost fainted from the slaps. She felt a splitting headache as her skull had almost been shattered by Chu Yunfan.","“That’s more like it. It’s symmetrical now!” Chu Yunfan grinned, looking at Maiden Donghua whose face was swollen from his slaps.","Upon hearing this, Maiden Donghua almost fainted. She had been slapped until her face was like a blown up balloon by Chu Yunfan, and for a person who loved beauty, there was no doubt what this meant.","“Looks like it isn’t enough though. I’ll continue to help you out of kindness!” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly and then he gave a few more slaps.","Maiden Donghua was beaten until blood flowed out. Her entire head was swollen like a pigs head, and she looked extremely miserable. Although her clothes were messy and occasionally revealed her shocking snow-white color skin underneath, everyone lost interest when they saw her face.","Many people were secretly shocked. Chu Yunfan’s means were too shocking. Some of them almost fainted. Maiden Donghua was an Arcane, the most powerful and terrifying existence in the world. However, she was easily injured by Chu Yunfan and dealt with like a slap to a child.","This was equivalent to completely subverting their worldview. If Maiden Donghua was the kind of top-notch master that everyone imagined, then Chu Yunfan’s existence completely overturned their current judgment. They felt that it was extremely terrifying. If he could teach a Arcana Stage warrior a lesson so easily, how powerful was Chu Yunfan?","Not far away, Yang Dengxian watched as Chu Yunfan slapped Maiden Donghua’s face. He was incomparably shocked. At this time, he finally understood how Chu Yunfan had easily defeated Wang Xueyi and the others.","It wasn’t like what he had originally thought. Chu Yunfan had relied on his own ability to restrain them and easily defeat them. It was because Chu","Yunfan’s strength had surpassed the limits of the Creation Stage. Even Maiden Donghua, an Arcane, was not a match for him.","No, it was a little inappropriate to describe her as not a match. To be precise, she was simply crushed and beaten up. Chu Yunfan’s strength far exceeded that of Maiden Donghua.","Before Chu Yunfan came, he was worried that Chu Yunfan would act on impulse and find trouble with Maiden Donghua in a fit of anger. If Maiden Donghua had the intention to kill, then Chu Yunfan would probably be in danger.","Even though Chu Yunfan was currently ranked first on the Prodigy Roll, in Yang Dengxian’s eyes, there was still a huge gap between him and Maiden Donghua, who was ranked above average on the previous Prodigy Roll.","He even thought of using the Flying Celestials to stop Maiden Donghua at the critical moment. After all, he was the chief disciple. It was fine if he was not there, but since he was present, how could he allow Maiden Donghua to easily deal with Chu Yunfan?","Especially in the beginning, the strength of Maiden Donghua completely suppressed Chu Yunfan. All kinds of terrifying attacks swept over like a storm. In his opinion, any attack would take Chu Yunfan’s life, and at the very least, he would be charged.","Who knew that the result would turn out like this? Maiden Donghua failed to deal with Chu Yunfan and was dealt with by him instead. There was nothing more ridiculous than this.","It was a crushing defeat!","And Chu Yunfan’s cultivation time was not even half as long as his. When Chu Yunfan reached his age in the future, it was simply unimaginable what kind of cultivation level he would have, not to mention, if he had the age of Maiden Donghua. How terrifying would it be? This was no longer within the scope of geniuses. This was a monster—an incomparably terrifying monster.","How did had Chu Yunfan trained? Could it be that he had obtained the enlightenment of a certain senior?","Yang Dengxian had been thinking about this for countless years, and he had no choice but to think so. Other than that, he didn’t even have a reasonable explanation.","Facing this monster, he had to have a big heart in order to accept Chu Yunfan’s brilliant achievements. At this moment, he finally understood what some people had said. When one person’s light was too dazzling, the others could only be considered as a foil.","It was a situation where the stars surrounded the moon.","Just as Yang Dengxian was letting his imagination run wild, Chu Yunfan arrived in front of Maiden Donghua with a calm expression.."]},{"number":2040,"title":"Chapter 2040: A World-Wide Sensation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2040: A World-Wide Sensation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Chu Yunfan... How dare you...” Maiden Donghua was on the verge of fainting. She felt that this was an unprecedented humiliation.","Before she could finish her sentence, Chu Yunfan stepped on her face and said coldly, “I’m not killing you today not because I don’t dare to kill you, but because I want to leave you to Siyu. You’re not worthy of me killing you.”","When many people heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they heaved a sigh of relief.","Although Chu Yunfan’s strength exceeded their expectations, at least Chu Yunfan did not kill Maiden Donghua. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable. It was even possible to attract the existence of that person.","However, they quickly realized that Chu Yunfan’s words were full of confidence. He was confident that Maiden Donghua was no match for Tang Siyu. When everyone thought of Tang Siyu’s years of cultivation, it was only natural that Tang Siyu would be able to defeat Maiden Donghua in the future. Tang Siyu’s future was limitless. Although she was not a match for Maiden Donghua now, her future was obviously not limited to this.","What was even more shocking was that many rumors had said that Chu Yunfan was already at the end of his rope. The first place on the prodigy roll should be Tang Siyu, not Chu Yunfan. But now, Chu Yunfan had used his absolute strength to tell everyone that he was still the boss and that he deserved to be the number one in the world.","With that, Chu Yunfan turned around and left the island on a streak of light. The rest of the people looked at each other. Chu Yunfan had indeed come with ill intentions. What made them speechless was that Chu Yunfan had suppressed Maiden Donghua with absolute strength.","Back then, when Maiden Donghua severely injured Tang Siyu, in many people’s eyes, even it it was not bullying the weak, it was definitely bullying the weak. However, Chu Yunfan!s method of beating up Maiden Donghua was fair and square. He won cleanly. Even the people who hated Chu Yunfan had nothing to say.","Yang Dengxian looked around and knew that today’s forum would definitely not continue. Maiden Donghua who presided over the conference had been severely injured by Chu Yunfan, and no one else had the prestige to continue the forum.","Not to mention, Chu Yunfan was brought here by him. There were already many unfriendly gazes around him. If it wasn’t for the Flying Celestials behind him, someone would have attacked him.","After Yang Dengxian left, the result of this battle spread throughout the world at the fastest speed. For the people of the world, this matter could be said to come wave after wave, with constant climaxes.","First, Tang Siyu kept attacking and defeating the ex-prodigies. Then, Maiden Donghua who severely injured Tang Siyu. Before everyone could recover from their shock, Chu Yunfan went to the dao forum organized by Maiden Donghua and stepped on her face.","The layers of this matter could be said to be wave after wave.","Many people enjoyed watching the show, but more people sucked in a breath of cold air when they heard the news. Just when everyone thought that Tang Siyu was the number one in the world, Chu Yunfan’s powerful attack announced that the number one in the world was still very stable.","“I heard that Maiden Donghua’s entire face was stomped into the mud.","Marquis Zhenyuan, Chu Yunfan, didn’t give her any face at all!”","“That’s right. What do you mean by a strong slap in the face? This is a strong slap in the face!”","“Chu Yunfan is so domineering, and Maiden Donghua surely won’t let this matter. After all, everyone knows the person behind her.”","“It’s not just the person behind Maiden Donghua. I heard that the Divine Maidens’ sect leader has personally visited the Flying Celestials’ sect leader, clamoring to make Chu Yunfan pay the price in blood. Blood for blood!”","“And the result? What happened?”","“Of course, there won’t be any results. Chu Yunfan is now the treasure of the Flying Celestials and the hope for the rise of the Flying Celestials. How could they possibly hand him over just because of the Divine Maidens’ sect leader? Otherwise, who in the Flying Celestials would dare to serve the sect?","“Not to mention that Chu Yunfan only injured Maiden Donghua and did not kill her. You know, he could have done it.’","Everyone was discussing Chu Yunfan’s matter, especially the series of events after he severely injured Maiden Donghua. It was even more heated and countless people were paying attention.","The Flying Celestials quickly expressed their stance, No matter how angry the Divine Niaidens were, the Flying Celestials had accepted this grudge. Of course, they would not attack the hope of their sect’s rise for the sake of Maiden Donghua. Many people to want to see the collision between the two giants.","At this moment, Situ Xuan, the sect leader of the Flying Celestials, shouted at the Divine Maidens’ sect leader, “Let the younger generation handle the matters of the younger generation! Maiden Donghua had already reached this point! Does she need the older generation to step up for her?!”","Many of the grand elders of the Divine Maidens were furious, but they could not refute. After all, they had lost in the competition of the younger generation. Especially Chu Yunfan, who was not even considered Maiden Donghua’s peer.","He had cultivated for less than half of her time, but even so, Maiden Donghua still lost to Chu Yunfan. Even if they were unwilling, this was reality. They had nothing to say. They could only blame Maiden Donghua for being disappointing.","On top of that, Chu Yunfan did not kill Maiden Donghua. He only humiliated her severely. Thus, in the end, the Divine Maidens did not choose to attack the Flying Celestials. Moreover, from the attitude of the Flying Celestials, they knew that the Flying Celestials would not punish Chu Yunfan for the sake of Maiden Donghua. Even if they forced him, he would only be punished internally.","In the end, the Divine Maidens could only give up and not speak anymore.","During this process, Chu Yunfan’s reputation soared. His cultivation speed was so fast that many people did not dare to treat him as an ordinary genius of the younger generation. No matter how one looked at it, Chu Yunfan was one of the top geniuses in the world. His cultivation base alone had already surpassed 99% of the grand elders of the top ten sects. On the surface, there were not many people who could defeat Chu Yunfan.","For a time, Chu Yunfan’s reputation soared, and many people were paying attention to the subsequent developments of this matter. Although the Divine Maidens had quieted down, it did not mean that they had completely given up on revenge. As long as there was a suitable opportunity, they would attack instantly.","Not to mention, there was still an extremely terrifying existence behind Maiden Donghua who had yet to make a move—Jun Tianci.."]},{"number":2041,"title":"Chapter 2041: An Arcane Attacks","paragraphs":["Chapter 2041: An Arcane Attacks","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Overnight, Chu Yunfan once again stirred up the world’s wind and clouds, attracting the attention of many experts.","At the same time, in Marquis Zhenyuan’s residence in Zhenyuan, an old man in black sat in Chu Yunfan’s usual seat. He smiled as he looked at Chu Yunfan, who had just returned from the island in the Eastern Sea.","“Marquis Zhenyuan, you’re finally back. I’ve been waiting for you for a long time!” The old man in black smiled at Chu Yunfan, but his smile was cold and emotionless as if he was looking at a dead man.","Chu Yunfan cocked an eyebrow and became vigilant. Someone had come, but no one had reported it to him. The entire residence seemed to have no idea that someone had come as it was still operating normally outside.","And this person had came with ill intentions!","Chu Yunfan immediately judged that if it wasn’t for the fact that he had come with ill intentions, there was no need to be so sneaky. He could have come to visit openly.","“Who are you? Why are you waiting for me?” Chu Yunfan questioned the old man in black","The black-robed man paused for a moment and then said, “I’m Master Scarlet Cloud. I’ve come here this time to borrow something from you.”","“Borrow what?” Chu Yunfan said in a deep voice, his eyes fixed on Chu Yunfan.","“Lend me all your heart blood,” Master Scarlet Cloud said with a grin.","“Are you kidding me?” Chu Yunfan asked coldly, “How dare you joke with me like this? Are you prepared to use your life to pay for it?”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes burst out with light. Heart blood was one’s essence. It was the essence of a cultivator’s body. To a cultivator, it was extremely precious. Not to mention all the heart blood, even a little loss would make the cultivator feel heartache for a long time.","For example, an ordinary Creator might have to cultivate hard for months or even a year to replenish a drop of heart blood. For cultivators with divine powers, even if all of their blood was drained in an instant, they would not die. However, if their heart blood was extracted, they would die.","Master Scarlet Cloud was not here to borrow blood—he was clearly here to borrow life.","Moreover, even if it was just a drop, Chu Yunfan would not lend it to him. It was obvious that Master Scarlet Cloud did not come with good intentions. Who was Chu Yunfan? How could he let it go so easily?","“Hmph!” Master Scarlet Cloud’s expression changed immediately as he snorted coldly. “You will pay for refusing me. Since you are unwilling to lend it to me, then I will extract it personally.”","In the next moment, Master Scarlet Cloud attacked. In an instant, he disappeared and reappeared in front of Chu Yunfan. He reached out with a hand that was completely red, as if it was made of light. He directly at Chu Yunfan’s heart, trying to grab it out.","“Scarlet Cloud Blood Hand!”","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him and threw a punch.","Bam!","The fist and claw clashed, and dazzling divine light rippled out. The interior of the entire room was reduced to ashes, but these divine lights did not continue to shake and were blocked by the barrier in the room. This was the barrier that Chu Yunfan had set up.","Thud!","Master Scarlet Cloud took a few steps back before he finally managed to neutralize Chu Yunfan’s fist force. At this moment, the way he looked at Chu Yunfan had changed slightly. He was no longer looking at Chu Yunfan as if he was a dead man or an ant. To be able to force him back with one strike was enough to make him look at him in a new light.","“Not bad. Chu Yunfan, you are indeed quite capable of shaking the world. You are only in the Creation Stage, but your monstrous strength can reach such a level. Rumor has it that you have an emperor-level physique. It seems that it is true.”","Master Scarlet Cloud was not angry, but he laughed instead. The stronger Chu","Yunfan was, the happier he was. “No wonder that lord wants your heart blood. However, no matter how strong you are, you’re only at the Creation Stage. I’ll show you see the difference between you and me.”","Boom!","Streams of divine ability burst out from Master Scarlet Cloud’s body, flickering with a dazzling red light, rippling into pieces of divine fire. It was extremely terrifying.","Master Scarlet Cloud’s fire divine ability had already reached the peak of perfection. He had stepped into the Arcana Stage with this.","“You’re in the Arcana Stage?” Chu Yunfan looked at Master Scarlet Cloud. Although Master Scarlet Cloud had just entered the Arcana Stage, he had already entered the Arcana Stage and surpassed the Creation Stage.","Hearing Chu Yunfan mention the thing he was most proud of, Master Scarlet Cloud cackled. “That’s right. 1 1 m already in the Arcana Stage. I’m different from you. With the lord’s guidance, my future is boundless. Now, as long as I","take your blood to report to the court, my strength will be further improved.” “Lord? Who do you speak of?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. When he heard Master Scarlet Cloud mentioning “lord,” Chu Yunfan could feel that this lord he was talking about was probably the mastermind.","If Master Scarlet Cloud didn’t have a strong backing, Chu Yunfan was sure that even if he had the guts of a bear or a leopard, he wouldn’t dare to attack him so brazenly. After all, the Flying Celestials was behind him. This was a well-known fact. It wasn’t that there weren’t any Arcana Stage warriors among the ordinary itinerant cultivators. However, they didn’t dare to attack him easily. It didn’t matter if they succeeded or not. The key was that they couldn’t bear the revenge of the Flying Celestials. Not to mention ordinary itinerant cultivators, even ordinary sects would be uprooted.","“You don’t need to know. You’re going to be a dead man soon anyway.” Master Scarlet Cloud immediately became alert.","It was too late to say, but at that moment, Master Scarlet Cloud attacked again. Different from before, this time, Master Scarlet Cloud really showed the means of the Arcana Stage. He opened his mouth, and a terrifying divine flame tore through the sky. The whole space shook violently, and the whole room turned into a sea of fire. In an instant, it formed an earth-shattering force that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“Petty tricks. You dare to be impudent in front of me!”","Chu Yunfan sneered. He understood that Master Scarlet Cloud had been here for some time and haven’t learned that he had beaten up Maiden Donghua in the Eastern Sea. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be so arrogant.","Maiden Donghua was much stronger than Master Scarlet Cloud. In Master Scarlet Cloud’s opinion, there was no reason for an Arcane to fail when he personally attacked a junior in the Creation Stage.","“Since you won’t say it, I’ll beat you until you say it.” Chu Yunfan’s eyes were cold.."]},{"number":2042,"title":"Chapter 2042: In Your Hands, It’s Simply a Waste","paragraphs":["Chapter 2042: In Your Hands, It’s Simply a Waste","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s power exploded and transformed into countless thunderbolts. These thunderbolts swept out and covered the room in an instant. The sea of fire that was sent out by Master Scarlet Cloud was instantly annihilated by Chu Yunfan’s thunderbolt power.","At the same time, Master Scarlet Cloud made his move. He stretched out his hand and a red talisman appeared. The talisman flickered with a dazzling divine light, containing an unimaginable terrifying light. In an instant, it brought about a raging fire and attacked Chu Yunfan again.","“Godfire Talisman! ”","Master Scarlet Cloud’s Godfire Talisman broke through Chu Yunfan’s lightning in an instant and landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. The terrifying power formed a huge explosion that overturned the entire room.","Rumble!","The terrifying explosions continued to ring out. Master Scarlet Cloud revealed a cold smile and hurriedly used a barrier to protect himself. In fact, if it weren’t for the barrier set up by Chu Yunfan in this small room, the aftermath of this battle alone would have been enough to destroy half the city.","There was no need to doubt the Godfire Talisman’s power. This was Master Scarlet Cloud’s trump card. This was a fortuitous encounter he had when he was young. He had obtained the inheritance of an ancient practitioner in a lost cave, and his fire-type divine art had originated from this.","Once the Godfire Talisman erupted, its power was beyond doubt.","However, before Master Scarlet Cloud could think about it, his smile froze. He saw a big hand suddenly reach out from the sea of fire and explosion. His Godfire Talisman was caught by that big hand.","Immediately after, a seal appeared on the Godfire Talisman. He instantly felt that his control over the fire had disappeared without a trace. The connection between him and the Godfire Talisman also disappeared.","“This is impossible.” Master Scarlet Cloud’s eyes went wide, his wrinkled face revealing an incredulous expression.","He had never encountered such an opponent before. Chu Yunfan had actually ignored the power of his Godfire Talisman and captured it in an instant. Moreover, he had even sealed his Godfire Talisman and made his connection to the Godfire Talisman disappear.","“This is a Godfire Talisman?” Chu Yunfan looked at the Godfire Talisman. He was sure that it was indeed a Godfire Talisman refined by an ancient divine talisman sect.","In the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he had seen this kind of Godfire Talisman before. However, Godfire Talismans were divided into levels. The low-level ones could be refined by Divines. The high-level ones could severely injure experts with one strike.","The one before him should be a relatively high-level Godfire Talisman. In the hands of Master Scarlet Cloud, not even one-tenth of its power could be unleashed.","“This is a good thing, but in your hands, it’s simply a waste of a heavenly treasure.” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“Little b*stard! You’re courting death!” Master Scarlet Cloud was instantly enraged. It was one thing for Chu Yunfan to snatch his Godfire Talisman, but he actually dared to mock his control of the Godfire Talisman. This was simply too much.","In the next moment, Master Scarlet Cloud attacked again. A red hand reached out and grabbed Chu Yunfan!s head. He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan first. “You overestimate yourself.” Chu Yunfan sneered and threw a punch.","Bam!","Another terrifying divine light flashed and turned into a terrifying tide. Master Scarlet Cloud took a few steps back, but at this time, his expression was extremely ugly. His entire arm was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s punch, and he turned into a cloud of blood mist.","At this moment, he was no longer as arrogant and despotic as before. He finally understood that he had made a huge mistake. He had thought that his strength as an Arcane should be able to suppress a Creator.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was so abnormal? He was clearly only in the Creation Stage, but when they fought, even he, an Arcane, was seriously injured. When he looked at Chu Yunfan again, his eyes were filled with horror. It was as if he was not looking at a person, but a terrifying monster in human skin.","How had the situation turned out like this after such a short time?","Master Scarlet Cloud didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had just beaten up Maiden Donghua in the Eastern Sea. Otherwise, he would have left without looking back. No matter how arrogant he was, he had absolute confidence in his strength. If his strength was not enough, he certainly wouldn’t dare to act so recklessly.","“l will come back for you!” Master Scarlet Cloud immediately made a decision. He turned around and wanted to escape. He turned into a streak of fire and fled.","“Trying to escape? A little too late now!” Chu Yunfan roared, and a lightning whip appeared out of thin air. It instantly chased after him like an electric snake.","Bam!","In the next moment, Master Scarlet Cloud was bound by the lightning whip and fell to the ground. Master Scarlet Cloud couldn’t care less about the pain of his broken arm and kept struggling to escape. However, it was useless. He couldn’t break free from the lightning whip. On the contrary, as he kept struggling, the lightning whip became tighter and tighter.","Master Scarlet Cloud kept letting out cries of pain. The lightning covered his entire body, tearing his flesh apart and causing his soul to tremble. He no longer looked at Chu Yunfan with the arrogance and carelessness he had in the beginning. On the contrary, there was only fear in his eyes. It was as if Chu Yunfan was like a god who had descended from the heavens. With a casual attack, he could beat him up without any strength to fight back. What kind of shocking strength was this?","Even until now, Chu Yunfan had not shown his strength. He could not see through Chu Yunfan’s strength.","“Will you tell me now? Who are you and who is this lord you speak of?” Chu Yunfan walked step by step and stood before Master Scarlet Cloud.","“l will never talk!” Master Scarlet Cloud shook his head. He thought of that lord’s methods. If he betrayed that lord, the consequences would be much more terrifying than death. He had no other choice.","“In that case, don’t blame me for using the Soul Assimilation Technique,” Chu Yunfan said.","This was a technique that could search memories. It was simple, violent, and extremely powerful. It was a technique that many people liked to use in ancient times. However, there was a side effect to this technique. Once it was used, the target would become a vegetable.","However, he didn’t show any mercy to Master Scarlet Cloud. After all, this person wanted his life.."]},{"number":2043,"title":"Chapter 2043: Half a Year Passes, Fifth Creation Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2043: Half a Year Passes, Fifth Creation Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan formed a seal and grabbed Master Scarlet Clouds head with one hand. He heard Master Scarlet Cloud’s scream and countless memories flooded into his mind.","It was Master Scarlet Cloud’s entire life. He was one of the countless itinerant cultivators of Grand Xia, and he came from a small sect. Although there was a sect, based on the scale of the existing sects, it was no different from an itinerant cultivator.","Later on, he stumbled upon the cave of an ancient expert. That was where he had obtained the Godfire Talisman. Through his many comprehensions of the Godfire Talisman, he slowly rose to fame and became a rather famous itinerant cultivator. Later on, he even stepped into the Creation Stage.","Although there wasn’t much of a comparison to the geniuses on the Prodigy List, in truth, a single list only had a record of 100 people, and it was distributed among the various races. There were only around 30 people from Grand Xia who could make it onto the Prodigy List, and there were countless cultivators within one generation.","However, just when Chu Yunfan came across the memory of Master Scarlet Cloud meeting that lord, Master Scarlet Cloud’s head suddenly exploded. Red and white brain matter and blood splattered all over the ground. Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold. There was a seal in Master Scarlet Cloud’s mind. Once his memories were searched, the seal triggered.","“What ruthless methods, what deep schemes,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","The lord mentioned by the Master Scarlet Cloud Zhenren was very meticulous.","When it involved his secrets, he decisively detonated the seal in Master Scarlet Cloud’s mind. It was clear that he was prepared. It was to prevent anyone from using methods like the Soul Assimilation Technique to investigate his secrets.","However, what shocked Chu Yunfan was that Master Scarlet Cloud was an Arcane, who could be regarded as a famous expert in this world, was willing to let someone set a restriction in his mind. It could be said that he was dead set on it.","However, other than the identity of this so-called lord, Chu Yunfan was more curious about why he wanted his heart blood. Chu Yunfan believed that there were countless people in the world who wanted to kill him, and there were even more people who hated him. He had no doubt that not everyone in the Flying Celestials would find him unpleasant to the eye, but why did he want his heart blood?","There was no doubt about how precious the heart blood of a top expert was. Even the main ingredient of many pill recipes was the heart blood of such a top expert. However, Chu Yunfan felt that the lord mentioned by the Master","Scarlet Cloud would definitely not simply want his heart blood to make pills. Then, what was the reason behind it?","Chu Yunfan’s expression turned slightly cold. There were simply too many mysteries in this world. Even if he had reached his current position, there were still many unsolved mysteries for him.","After Chu Yunfan finished sighing, he put Master Scarlet Cloud into the Mountain River Diagram, turning him into flesh and blood and pouring him onto the Brahma Tree. After the Brahma Tree absorbed Master Scarlet Cloud’s flesh and blood, it began to grow crazily. It only stopped after growing by a third.","Chu Yunfan was slightly stunned, but he soon realized what had happened. This was probably the first time the Brahma Tree had swallowed the flesh and blood of an Arcane. The energy of the flesh and blood of an Arcane was far more shocking than that of ten peak Creators. The difference between the two was not only in quantity, but also in quality. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","At the same time, on the Brahma Tree, another Brahma Fruit grew out on top of the original two Brahma Fruits. Moreover, the color of the original two Brahma Fruits became even richer as the energy contained within them became denser.","‘l have to seize the time to break through to a higher stage. It’s best if I can break through to the Arcana Stage as soon as possible. In this way, I can protect myself in this complicated situation,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","Today, the attack of Master Scarlet Cloud had given him a huge sense of crisis. Although there were many people in the world who feared the Flying","Celestials, it was obvious that there were those who did not. With his strength, although he could be considered powerful, there would always be people stronger than him in the world.","Now that three of the Brahma Fruits had ripened, one of them was enough for his cultivation to advance to the fifth Creation Stage. At that time, his cultivation would increase by a lot.","Chu Yunfan left the Mountain River Diagram and called You Chuyun over. When You Chuyun entered, he saw that the room was in a mess. It was as if it was a doomsday battlefield. Countless interior decorations had long been reduced to dust. He was instantly shocked.","He had no idea that such an intense battle had taken place in the residence. He only felt cold sweat dripping down his back. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t blame him. After all, Master Scarlet Cloud was an Arcane. How could You Chuyun detect his existence?","Even if he could sense it, he wouldn’t be able to do anything to Master Scarlet Cloud. On the contrary, it would be a disaster if he was discovered. No one knew what Master Scarlet Cloud would have done if he was discovered. After Chu Yunfan instructed him to clean up the place, he entered the","Mountain River Diagram to cultivate in seclusion.","While Chu Yunfan was cultivating in seclusion, many things caused by him in the outside world became more and more intense. In particular, he beat up Maiden Donghua, which was equivalent to stepping on the Divine Maidens’ faces.","In the Divine Maidens, the angry voices of some legendary big shots kept coming, clamoring to make Chu Yunfan pay the price in blood. The Flying Celestials was competing with them. For a time, the Divine Maidens and the Flying Celestials clashed in various fields, and the situation was turbulent.","However, for many people with discerning eyes, this was just a temporary shock. After all, the Divine Maidens and the Flying Celestials were both huge entities with deep roots in Grand Xia. They had many hidden forces. It was impossible for them to truly fight just because of the relationship between two disciples. Otherwise, it would probably cause Grand Xia to suffer a heavy blow, and the Imperial Court would surely not let it go.","However, since he was able to cause the collision of two giants, Chu Yunfan’s name was extremely resounding. Among the younger generation, he was second to none.","In the blink of an eye, half a year passed. In Zhenyuan, in Niarquis Zhenyuan’s mansion, Chu Yunfan’s figure finally appeared again in his exclusive seclusion room. He walked out of the Mountain River Diagram.","“Half a year has passed, and my strength has finally improved. I’ve stepped into the fifth Creation Stage..”"]},{"number":2044,"title":"Chapter 2044: Jun Tianci Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 2044: Jun Tianci Arrives","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan stretched and all the bones in his body crackled. For half a year,","Chu Yunfan didn’t move much, but every time he moved, he felt comfortable.","Once he came out of seclusion, Chu Yunfan’s strength had improved further. He had charged into the fifth Creation Stage. Every time he improved, it wasn’t just the increase of his cultivation stage, but also the crazy increase of his battle strength. This time was no exception. His strength had improved a step compared to when he had just entered the Arcana Stage.","Chu Yunfan had reached the intermediate Minor Arcana Stage.","The Arcana Stage was divided into three stages, namely the Minor Arcana Stage, the Middle Arcana Stage, and the Major Arcana Stage. Each realm was further divided into three sub-realms—fledgling, intermediate, and peak.","Although it was only a step forward, in terms of combat strength, it was an increase from before. In half a year, Chu Yunfan had not only stepped into this stage, but he had also consolidated his stage and cultivated it to perfection.","Although Chu Yunfan had a sense of crisis, he knew that the foundation was the root of everything. If the foundation was not solid, then everything would be in vain. It could be said that, aside from the sect leader and the supreme grand elders, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was one of the top within the Flying Celestials.","However, Chu Yunfan felt that the experts on the surface was only a part of the Flying Celestials’ strength. Otherwise, how could the Flying Celestials be worthy of being one of the top ten sects in the world?","Chu Yunfan could have continued cultivating. He had only consumed one of the three Brahma Fruits. The remaining two were enough for him to cultivate all the way to the peak of the Creation Stage.","After absorbing the essence of Master Scarlet Cloud, the energy contained in the fruits had been further enhanced. However. Chu Yunfan could no longer hold back his longing for Tang Siyu. He planned to head to Serene Immortal Mountain to see her.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to leave, he saw that someone had appeared in his room.","“You’ve made me wait for a long time, Chu Yunfan.”","This person was dressed in black. He was tall and handsome. He stood in front of Chu Yunfan, straight as a spear. There was a terrifying pressure on his body as he approached Chu Yunfan.","“Who are you?” Chu Yunfan immediately became vigilant.","The feeling the black-robed man gave off made his hair stand on end. It was the warning of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix in his body. The living environment of these ferocious beasts far exceeded the imagination of people now. Their perception of danger also far exceeded the imagination of ordinary people.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan recalled who this person was. It was Jun Tianci, the previous number one on the Prodigy Roll. Ever since Maiden Donghua had injured Tang Siyu, as the man behind Maiden Donghua, how could Chu Yunfan not pay attention to it? With Jun Tianci’s popularity, Chu Yunfan naturally easily obtained Jun Tianci’s portrait.","The person in front of him was exactly the same as Jun Tianci in the picture. To be precise, he was ten times more terrifying than the Jun Tianci in the picture. There was no way such a terrifying pressure could be drawn out.","“What do you want Jun Tianci?” Chu Yunfan instantly assumed a defensive stance, because he knew that there was absolutely no possibility of him and","Jun Tianci coexisting peacefully.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re quite capable to have recognized me so quickly.”","Jun Tianci revealed a cold smile. He sounded like he was praising, but it was also a form of mockery.","“Are you here to avenge Maiden Donghua?” Chu Yunfan’s mind was immediately filled with countless thoughts, trying to guess Jun Tianci!s purpose for coming here.","“Avenge her? I wouldn’t do such a boring thing. Someone who can’t keep up with me and is defeated by a junior isn’t qualified to be my companion,” Jun Tianci said indifferently.","His cold tone was chilling like a robot without any emotions. Or rather, ordinary people thought that he would support Maiden Donghua. However, in his eyes, supporting Maiden Donghua was really boring. One could imagine how cold this person was. He would only acknowledge a woman with enough strength as his companion.","“Then what are you here for?” Chu Yunfan asked coldly.","Jun Tianci smiled, then walked to Chu Yunfan and said, “The first thing is that I’ve heard of your name. At first, I thought you were just so-so. However, you were able to defeat that trash Li Qianyuan, which shows you have some ability. But now it seems that you are pretty talented.”","Jun Tianci didn’t care how much of an uproar his words would cause if they were to spread. Li Qianyuan had been defeated by Chu Yunfan, and in many people’s minds, Chu Yunfan was terrifying. If it wasn’t for his bad luck to meet","Chu Yunfan, who was a monster that only appeared once in a hundred years, Li Qianyuan would have no opponent among his peers. But in Jun Tianci’s words, Li Qianyuan was nothing.","Jun Tianci’s eyes were calm. Comparing Li Qianyuan to a waste was not belittling Li Qianyuan, nor was it intentional. In his eyes, Li Qianyuan was indeed a waste.","“Perhaps you can become my opponent when you grow up, but you won’t have the chance now.” Jun Tianci’s face revealed a faint look of pride. It was as if, in his opinion, it was Chu Yunfan’s supreme honor to be recognized as a potential opponent.","“What do you want?” Chu Yunfan asked coldly.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan thought of something. A thought flashed across his mind like a bolt of lightning. In an instant, he understood what was going on.","“You sent Master Scarlet Cloud!” Chu Yunfan growled.","Jun Tianci seemed a little surprised that Chu Yunfan could think of this. However, he said indifferently, “Yes, I sent him. However, he was absolute trash. He couldn’t even handle such a simple task and made me come in person. ”","Jun Tianci was not moved by the death of Master Scarlet Cloud. Instead, his face was filled with disdain and indifference. To him, Master Scarlet Cloud failing his task and making him come personally was a heinous crime.","Chu Yunfan felt a chill run down his spine. The person before him did not have any feelings. Be it his partner or his subordinates, they seemed to be insignificant to him.."]},{"number":2045,"title":"Chapter 2045: The Extremely Terrifying Jun Tianci","paragraphs":["Chapter 2045: The Extremely Terrifying Jun Tianci","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This kind of person was a hundred times more terrible than Li Qianyuan. Although Li Qianyuan had been cold and wanted to kill him, he was not so cruel. Moreover, Li Qianyuan also had his pride—the pride of a genius. Although he would do whatever it took, he still had his pride.","However, Jun Tianci was different. To achieve his goal, he came here personally and did not hide anything. In his eyes, there was no jealousy or killing intent. It was just a very normal expression. It was just like how people pulled grass on the roadside. When ordinary people pulled grass, would they show killing intent toward the grass? That was simply impossible.","Li Qianyuan had regarded Chu Yunfan as a threat, but Jun Tianci barely thought anything of Chu Yunfan. In the beginning, Chu Yunfan thought that Jun Tianci was here to take revenge for the humiliation of Maiden Donghua. However, through the matter of the Master Scarlet Cloud, Chu Yunfan realized that this was not the case at all.","When Master Scarlet Cloud was sent out by Jun Tianci, Chu Yunfan did not show any intention of dealing with Maiden Donghua. Therefore, it could be seen that Jun Tianci’s desire to steal his heart blood had nothing to do with","Maiden Donghua. From the very beginning, Jun Tianci had wanted to kill him.","Regardless of whether Chu Yunfan attacked Maiden Donghua or not, it wouldn’t have stopped Jun Tianci from attacking him.","However, Chu Yunfan was even more confused. Why was Jun Tianci attacking him? This could not be explained by the fact that the previous number one wanted to suppress the current number one.","“What do you want my heart blood for?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Jun Tianci looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “There’s no reason for you to know that. All you have to know that it’s your honor to be able to contribute to my great cause.”","He then spotted the jade slip in Chu Yunfan’s hand. He sneered and said, “No need to send any messages out because you can’t. Besides, do you think they will be able to save you in time after you send the message?”","Chu Yunfan saw that his plan to stall for time and spread the news had been seen through, but he did not care. He just looked at Jun Tianci coldly and said, “Are you so sure you can take me down? Maiden Donghua is of the same generation as you, but she’s no match for me.”","“Hahaha, you’re comparing her to me?” Jun Tianci looked as if he had heard something very funny. This was the first time he had shown a different expression. “She’s only a Minor Arcane. Compared to me, there’s a world of difference. It won’t take long for me to kill you!”","Jun Tianci had absolute confidence in his own strength.","“All right, let’s end our idle talk here. Your strength is not bad, and it’s worth me talking to you for so long. However, it’s time for you to be on your way.”","In the next moment, Jun Tianci made a move. His hand was like a sharp claw as he clawed at Chu Yunfan. It looked like it was just a casual grab, but its power had reached a shocking level. It was as fast as lightning and in an instant, it rushed toward Chu Yunfan’s chest.","Clang!","At that critical moment, sparks flew. Chu Yunfan took a few steps back to get rid of the terrifying force. The Ocean Overturner in his hand was trembling. He had used the Ocean Overturner to protect himself at the critical moment. Otherwise, his heart would have been torn apart by Jun Tianci in an instant.","Jun Tianci’s arrogance was not without reason. He had far surpassed all the Arcanes that Chu Yunfan knew. Compared to him, Maiden Donghua and Master Scarlet Cloud were like babies facing adults.","‘He’s at least in the Middle Arcana Stage.’ Chu Yunfan frowned.","There was no doubt that Jun Tianci’s strength was at least one major stage above his. This also meant that the difference in their combat strength was also at least one major stage. Against such an existence, Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning.","‘l have to get out of here!’","Chu Yunfan’s first reaction was flee, but he immediately realized that Jun Tianci had probably set up all kinds of barriers nearby. It was impossible for him to escape in a short time.","Jun Tianci’s attacks were flawless. No wonder he had told him so many things without a care. In Jun Tianci’s eyes, he was no different from the four of them. So what if Chu Yunfan knew some things? He could only bring all he knew to hell.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan had faced such a terrifying opponent and such a terrifying situation. Previously, Li Qianyuan was also very strong, but it was not strong enough to make him seem invincible.","“Hm?” Jun Tianci revealed a strange expression when he saw that he had failed to kill Chu Yunfan in one strike. He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to successfully block his attack.","“Interesting, but that’s all.” Jun Tianci’s expression started to turn serious.","Swoosh!","Jun Tianci disappeared from where he stood. When he reappeared, he was right in front of Chu Yunfan.","‘He’s fast!’ Chu Yunfan felt a terrifying aura sweep over him. He had no other choice and no time to judge. He could only rely on his instincts to attack. The Ocean Overturner in his hand slashed down.","Boom!","The Ocean Overturner cut through the space in front of Chu Yunfan and blocked Jun Tianci’s attack. The terrifying power almost sent the Ocean Overturner in Chu Yunfan’s hand flying. Chu Yunfan’s arm was trembling violently, and blood was flowing from the corner of his mouth. For him, this was a very rare disadvantage in terms of strength.","Jun Tianci’s cultivation stage was much stronger than his by more than one major state, or even two major states, with his Imperial Physique, he could withstand Jun Tianci’s attacks.","“Your intuition is pretty good, like that of an ancient beast. However, the gap between us can’t be smoothed out by intuition.”","Jun Tianci!s voice rang in Chu Yunfan’s ears. He didn’t seem to be in a hurry to kill Chu Yunfan. It was like an old cat toying with a mouse.","“Die!” Chu Yunfan roared and slashed the Ocean Overturner across the sky. He instantly determined Jun Tianci’s position and slashed at his head.","Clang!","With the sound of metal clashing, the Ocean Overturner was blocked.."]},{"number":2046,"title":"Chapter 2046: Fight to the Death, Mutual Destruction","paragraphs":["Chapter 2046: Fight to the Death, Mutual Destruction","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jun Tianci had blocked the Ocean Overturner with one hand. The sword slashed at Jun Tianci’s arm, but it couldn’t advance any further.","‘What a terrifying physique!’ Chu Yunfan’s pupils contracted slightly. He had often fought against divine weapons with his bare hands, and it had even shocked everyone.","However, it was also because of this that he knew how powerful Jun Tianci’s body was to block a divine weapon with his bare hands. Even if Jun Tianci’s cultivation was far stronger than Chu Yunfan’s, his physical body should not be more terrifying than Chu Yunfan’s.","Even so, Jun Tianci’s physical strength was one of the strongest among all the experts Chu Yunfan had seen. It could even be said that such an expert had almost no flaws to speak of. Unless one’s strength was comparable to or even surpassed him, it was impossible for one to contend with an existence of this level.","Jun Tianci’s overall attributes were almost invincible!","Because Chu Yunfan was also an expert of this type, he understood the power of an expert who had not a single flaw on their body. Chu Yunfan had no difficulty beating up experts of the same stage. This was largely due to his all-round development and the fact that he had no shortcomings.","For any cultivator, there were strengths and weaknesses. For example, in the same stage, Chu Yunfan could compete with any expert, or even be stronger. This was very terrifying. Now, Chu Yunfan had encountered an expert similar to him.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re really interesting, but it’s a pity that you’ve met me. In front of my absolute strength, you have no chance of winning,” Jun Tianci said calmly.","It seemed that it was not shameful for him to crush Chu Yunfan with absolute strength and use his cultivation experience to deal with Chu Yunfan. Such a person was extremely cold and only pursued the law of the jungle. Strong was strong, and weak was weak. The weak did not even have the chance to resist.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold. Even in the face of such a powerful opponent, he had no intention of surrendering. He kept slashing out with the Ocean Overturner in his hand. The sword lights swept across the sky, almost cutting through space.","Chu Yunfan displayed an extremely exquisite sword technique. This was very rare because the opponents Chu Yunfan had encountered in the past were not enough to force him to this point. He could completely crush them with absolute strength. His ability to defeat ten experts with his strength was vividly displayed.","However, when facing Jun Tianci, the power that Chu Yunfan was so proud of was completely suppressed, so he had to use all kinds of exquisite sword and movement techniques that he usually didn’t use.","Jun Tianci, on the other hand, felt no pressure at all. He easily broke Chu Yunfan’s attacks. In fact, many of Chu Yunfan’s attacks could not even land on him.","In terms of strength, Jun Tianci completely crushed Chu Yunfan, just like how Chu Yunfan had crushed his opponents. However, this time, his offensive and defensive stance was different.","Jun Tianci had forced Chu Yunfan into a dead end time and time again. However, to his surprise, Chu Yunfan was able to dodge his attacks continuously. Every time he thought that Chu Yunfan would die for sure, Chu Yunfan would always be able to dodge his attacks at the critical moment by relying on his beast-like intuition.","This piqued Jun Tianci’s interest. Chu Yunfan definitely had other secrets, but this interest only lasted for a while. After all, it didn’t matter what kind of secrets Chu Yunfan had. He too had secrets that ordinary people could not imagine. Otherwise, he would not have been able to reach his current status. No matter how many secrets Chu Yunfan had and how powerful the inheritance he had obtained was, it was not worth mentioning to him.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan could clearly feel that he was on the verge of danger. Although he was constantly dodging, in reality, the space he could move around was getting smaller and smaller. The area in this closed door cultivation room was too small.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan’s Nine Cyclone Phantoms technique was exquisite. He kept dodging and was able to hold on until now. If it were any other person, they would have been killed by Jun Tianci long ago.","Even so, every time an attack missed, the terrifying rebound force was reflected back. In addition, after being swept by the aftershock of Jun Tianci!s attack, Chu Yunfan!s body gradually had more wounds, and every pore in his body was bleeding. One could imagine what kind of terrifying counterattack Chu Yunfan had suffered. If it was an ordinary person, their body would have collapsed long ago.","Especially for Jun Tianci, as time went by, his initial curiosity about Chu Yunfan had disappeared without a trace. On the contrary, what was left was only boundless killing intent. He was tired of playing with Chu Yunfan and wanted to get rid of him as soon as possible.","Finally, Chu Yunfan couldn’t hold out any longer. He was sent flying with a blow, and his body was covered in blood as he fell to the ground.","“You should be proud of yourself for being able to persist until now with your cultivation,” Jun Tianci said coldly.","In the blink of an eye, Jun Tianci attacked Chu Yunfan’s chest.","Slice!","Chu Yunfan’s chest was cut open, and a huge wound appeared. His bright red heart kept beating, but in the next moment, a terrifying suction force came over. The blood essence in Chu Yunfan’s heart was instantly absorbed, and his originally strong heart stopped beating.","Jun Tianci looked at the heart blood flowing in his palm with satisfaction. This blood was different from the dark red color of ordinary people. It even had a faint golden color.","“That’s right. Rumors have it that you have an emperor-level physique. From this heart blood, I can tell that you do.” Jun Tianci said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","Although he didn’t know what kind of physique Chu Yunfan had, he didn’t care anymore. As long as it was the heart blood of an emperor, he didn’t care. “Seeing that you’ve given me what I want, I’ll give you a quick death!”","Jun Tianci looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and was about to attack. Suddenly, a","flame-like talisman flew out of Chu Yunfan’s body. The flame-like talisman instantly shattered the entire seclusion room.","Boom!","In an instant, a mushroom cloud slowly rose. For a moment, all of Zhenyuan was shocked.."]},{"number":2047,"title":"Chapter 2047: Resurrection","paragraphs":["Chapter 2047: Resurrection","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A mushroom cloud rose into the sky along with a shocking wave of fire, breaking through the enchantment set up by Jun Tianci. In an instant, all of Zhenyuan was shocked. The explosion came from the heart of Zhenyuan—the city lord’s residence where the god-like city lord was.","“What happened? Is the city lord’s residence under attack?”","Many people’s first reaction was that this was impossible. From what they knew, although their city lord was a junior, he was one of the top experts in the world. How many people had the guts to provoke him?","Moreover, they had not sensed any enemy attack. However, even the slowest person could sense an explosion of this degree. Something big had probably happened to the city lord’s residence.","“Oh no!” You Chuyun, who was in the army outside the city, saw the explosion.","Ordinary people would not have thought much about it, but he was different. He knew that Chu Yunfan had already been attacked once, and this should be the same. Without any warning, Chu Yunfan was ambushed.","Later, Chu Yunfan revealed to him that the enemy who came to ambush him was very strong. Even if all the experts in the city were combined, they were not that person’s match. That was why he could easily sneak into the city lord’s estate.","The inexplicable explosion in the residence made him think of the same situation, and You Chuyun immediately gathered his men and rushed into the","Jun Tianci, who was caught off guard by Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack, was in a rage in the residence.","“D*mn it, d*mn it!”","He was no longer as relaxed as he was at the beginning. His clothes were extremely tattered, and his body was injured in many places. Many of them were charred black. That was the terrifying power caused by the explosion of","the Godfire Talisman.","The talisman belonged to the Master Scarlet Cloud and later fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands. Jun Tianci had seen this Godfire Talisman before. At that time, he didn’t think it was anything special. Who knew that the Godfire Talisman, which was originally unremarkable in his eyes, would actually explode with such great power?","Even he had been seriously injured. If his appearance was only a little miserable, then only he knew that his internal organs had been severely injured by the explosion. It was just that his physical body was strong and did not explode all at once.","This was caused by Chu Yunfan. He had never thought highly of Chu Yunfan before. He even felt like a cat chasing a mouse, enjoying the pleasure of toying with Chu Yunfan. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would take the opportunity to ruthlessly attack him? This was all thanks to his extremely powerful physical body. If it were an ordinary person’s physical body, it would have exploded long ago. Even an expert of the same level as him would find it difficult to defend against this sudden move. The only way out was to die.","Both sides would die!","This was clearly Chu Yunfan’s suicidal move. After his heart blood was drained and his heart stopped beating, Jun Tianci thought that Chu Yunfan had no way to fight back. The trump card that Chu Yunfan had been holding back finally exploded.","“Such shrewdness!” Jun Tianci’s eyes flashed with anger, and the anger in his heart continued to burn.","If Chu Yunfan had used the Godfire Talisman from the beginning, then Jun Tianci would have been heavily guarded against Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan would have only been able to make him look a little embarrassed, but not injure him severely.","Chu Yunfan must have thought of this as well, which was why he had been holding it in. In the process, he had deepened his belief that Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning, which was why he had finally made this move.","Jun Tianci had strength, talent, and scheming. Even someone as high and mighty as him, who regarded prodigies as ants, had the intention to kill Chu Yunfan. However, his killing intent immediately dissipated. Chu Yunfan was already dead. In the explosion just now, even he was severely injured, let alone Chu Yunfan, who was already dead.","Sure enough, as he looked over, Chu Yunfan’s corpse was pitch black. It was obvious that he had also been killed by the explosion.","“Consider yourself lucky!” Jun Tianci resisted the urge to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces. He knew that it was not a good time to stay here.","From the moment Chu Yunfan took out the Godfire Talisman, everything had gone out of control. This place was close to the border, and there was also the existence of a behemoth city—Zhenyao City. The explosion would definitely alarm a large number of experts.","Jun Tianci immediately turned into a stream of light and disappeared.","When You Chuyun and the others arrived, they saw the practice room that had turned into ruins. Because of the barrier that Jun Tianci had set up, the entire manor had not turned into ashes. However, just from the crystallized environment in the room, one could still see how shocking the explosion was. “Marquis Chu, Marquis Chu!” You Chuyun shouted in grief because he saw Chu Yunfan, who was charred black in the ruins.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was beaten to such a state. One could imagine how shocked they were.","Suddenly, You Chuyun noticed that Chu Yunfan’s fingers moved slightly. He, who should have been dead, suddenly began to have a weak vitality flowing out from the deepest part of his body. Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes.","“Marquis Chu!”","You Chuyun and the others were overjoyed. They thought that Chu Yunfan had met with misfortune, not expecting him to still be alive.","“Marquis Chu, who ambushed you?” You Chuyun asked.","In his opinion, other than a sneak attack, how could anyone else injure Chu Yunfan to this extent? He had watched Chu Yunfan grow from an ordinary inner sect disciple to the legendary figure he was today. Even he had become numb to it. Like CHu Hongcai, he began to feel that Chu Yunfan was omnipotent.","“It was Jun Tianci,” Chu Yunfan finally croaked out.","“Jun Tianci?” You Chuyun said incredulously.","Unlike Chu Yunfan, who was an outsider, he had naturally heard of Jun Tianci’s existence as he was a local here. After Chu Yunfan had severely injured Maiedn Donghua, Jun Tianci, who was behind her, had entered everyone’s attention. However, You Chuyun had never expected Jun Tianci to be so bold as to attack Chu Yunfan. This was a serious crime.","“We have to report this to the Imperial Court. We can’t let him off so easily!’ You Chuyun shouted.","“You will be responsible for contacting the sect to do these things later.","However, this is not the most urgent matter,” Chu Yunfan said with labored","breath.."]},{"number":2048,"title":"Chapter 2048: The World Is in Chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 2048: The World Is in Chaos","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan looked at You Chuyun and said, “Although I didn’t die in the battle with Jun Tianci, I was beaten to the point where I lost all my life force. If it wasn’t for the secret technique, I wouldn’t have been able to hold on.”","The battle with Jun Tianci could be said to be the closest he had ever been to death. It was even more tragic than the time he was chased by the big shot of the demons. Although he had been chased by that big shot, he had still managed to escape. But this time, Jun Tianci had come for his heart blood.","The heart blood he had cultivated for so many years had been taken away. It was equivalent to his entire life’s cultivation being taken away. If it was an ordinary person, they would have died long ago. They would not have been killed by the explosion of the Godfire Talisman.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His vitality was so strong that he just barely managed to hold on to a sliver of life force. He burst out with the Godfire Talisman and severely injured Jun Tianci. The Godfire Talisman was not even able to exert one-tenth of its power in the hands of Master Scarlet Cloud, but in Chu Yunfan’s hands, the situation was completely different.","Chu Yunfan had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so his understanding of many treasures, divine powers, and magic treasures far exceeded the imagination of ordinary people. Only then could the Godfire Talisman unleash its greatest power.","However, this last strike had also cut off Chu Yunfan’s last trace of life.","Otherwise, Jun Tianci wouldn’t have been so easily deceived. However, in the end, he still managed to survive this round. He relied on the Immemorial Dark Phoenix in his body.","Although the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was a mutant among phoenixes, it was still a phoenix. Rebirth was one of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s intrinsic divine powers. Chu Yunfan only had a portion of the bloodline of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix and did not know about this rebirth power. However, after dying once, Chu Yunfan automatically activated this divine power, allowing him to hang on to his last breath and not die completely.","There were many reasons for this, and they were also based on luck. If it was an ordinary person, even if they had a portion of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix bloodline, it would be impossible for them to awaken this power and would have died long ago. Because their bodies were too weak, they could not last until the time of rebirth and would be completely dead.","“I’m afraid that I’ll have to enter a state of nirvana in the following days. The External Army will be handed over to you,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan’s face was dark, and his entire body was charred. He was truly in a state of exhaustion. If not for this, Chu Yunfan would not be in this state.","With his recovery ability, he was already at the end of his rope. He had no other choice but to completely activate the rebirth divine power to let his body enter the nirvana state and recover. This was also the only feasible method at the moment.","The rebirth power was the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s natal divine power.","Every time it went through a rebirth, it would be a new life. Every time it went through rebirth, it would also cause a world-shaking change in the essence of life. It was also the only way for it to extend its life.","However, Chu Yunfan did not know when he would reappear after nirvana. In ancient times, there were even rebirths that lasted for hundreds of years. Every time one went through rebirth, one didn’t know when he would appear the next time. Chu Yunfan had to explain these things clearly.","“Also, help me pass this jade slip to Hongcai. I’ll leave the rest to you. Wait for me to come back.” Chu Yunfan panted as he handed a jade slip to You Chuyun.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan entered the Mountain River Diagram. You Chuyun and the others were left, looking at each other with a sorrowful expression.","“From now on, I will be in charge of the army until Marquis Chu returns. From today onwards, anyone or anything related to the Destiny Sect and Jun Tianci will be the mortal enemy of the army. We will kill them every time we see them!”","Overnight, earth-shattering news spread throughout the world. Chu Yunfan, who was ranked first on the Prodigy List, had been attacked and killed. After he was seriously injured, it was unknown whether he was dead or alive. And the person who had attacked was none other than the previous number one on the Prodigy List, Jun Tianci.","When this news first spread, no one believed it. After all, it had been more than half a year since Maiden Donghua was beaten and humiliated by Chu Yunfan. At first, everyone thought that Jun Tianci would make a move. However, he didn’t, and in everyone’s opinion, he was afraid of the Flying Celestials.","However, just as many people had forgotten about the incident half a year ago, Jun Tianci made his move. The result of the attack shocked countless people. Chu Yunfan was severely injured and it was unknown whether he was dead or alive.","Everyone was silent. Jun Tianci’s vicious methods were enough to silence the entire world. No one knew Jun Tianci’s true motive for attacking Chu Yunfan. To them, there was only one possibility for Jun Tianci to attack Chu Yunfan, and that was the matter of Maiden Donghua.","For a moment, the world was in an uproar. All kinds of news and rumors continued. There were even many rumors that Chu Yunfan was already dead. As time passed, more and more information came out of Zhenyuan. The explosion back then had been sensed by too many people, and many people had seen it. The mushroom cloud formed by the explosion soared into the sky. Such news could not be hidden even if the people involved wanted it so.","Many people spread the news that Chu Yunfan was dead. After that, whether it was the investigation team of the Flying Celestials’ higher-ups who were furious or the investigation team of the Grand Commandant’s Office who rushed over after receiving the news, no one could see Chu Yunfan.","It was as if the rumors said, Chu Yunfan was already dead, but he wanted to seal off the news when he was alive, so he had the External Army lie that he was not dead. It was even more tempting to point out that this might be fake news released by the army to maintain their own interests.","All kinds of news became more and more intense, and the friction between the Destiny Sect and the Flying Celestials became more and more serious. After that, Serene Immortal Mountain even issued a warrant for Jun Tianci’s arrest. Although there were rumors that Princess Gushe had acted willfully and forced her way through, it seemed to further prove that Chu Yunfan was already dead.","For a time, the world was in an uproar. Although Serene Immortal Mountain was not as powerful as the Flying Celestials and Destiny Sect, it could not withstand the fact that there was a top-notch expert like the Elder Princess behind it. Even the Destiny Sect might not dare to provoke Serene Immortal Mountain. Even though Destiny Sect’s grand elder went to the Serene Immortal Mountain, he was chased out before he could even meet with the Elder Princess.","For a moment, the entire world was in chaos because of Chu Yunfan’s death.."]},{"number":2049,"title":"Chapter 2049: Changes in the Wind and Clouds, Time Flies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2049: Changes in the Wind and Clouds, Time Flies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Zhongzhou City was located in the heart of Grand Xia. It was located at the core of the empire, and was also the center of transportation for the entire world, extending in all directions. Ever since the establishment of Grand Xia, Zhongzhou had been one of the few majestic cities in the world.","The Dao Seekers Teahouse was a famous top-notch teahouse in the world. Countless experts from the cultivation world traveled thousands of miles to this teahouse just to have a drink. There were no ordinary people among the customers. One had to pay for the tea here using spirit stones, and ordinary people could not afford to drink it.","On this day, many experts who were rarely seen came to the teahouse. These experts all carried powerful auras that ordinary people did not dare to approach.","“The young geniuses of today are really more powerful than the previous ones.","They’re not the slightest bit inferior to the generation from decades ago.”","“That’s right. Three years ago, after the rankings changed, it became the new generation of prodigies ‘turn to rule the world.’”","“New prodigies are popping out like raindrops. Previously, they were suppressed by the older generation and couldn’t show themselves. Now that the older generation has all been removed from the Prodigy List, these new prodigies have finally shown themselves. I suddenly realized that there are actually so many powerful prodigies!’","In the teahouse, everyone was discussing animatedly. It seemed that something was going on, and everyone was especially excited to discuss it. Especially since these were experts from the South and North, they knew many things that ordinary people did not. Many people listened attentively, using this method to understand the general situation of the world.","“However, the new Prodigy List is being finalized right now. The competition for the rankings is too intense. Many geniuses are fighting for it, but the victor has yet to be determined. It’s not like the previous Prodigy List, where it’s already fixed. There’s basically no change in the top few spots.”","“Back then, Tang Siyu appeared out of nowhere and crushed countless of her peers to become number one on the Prodigy List. Up until now, who knows how many people are still suppressed by her until they can’t breathe.”","“Tang Siyu has stolen everyone’s spotlight. Once her emperor-level physique appeared, she became the ruler of the world and crushed her peers.”","“Fortunately, she entered the prodigy battlefield. Otherwise, her peers would really have no dignity.”","“It’s different now. I can finally see some new faces. But in general, no matter which year’s Prodigy List it is, it all depends on the prodigies of the ten great sects. ”","Everyone nodded in agreement. No matter which year it was, the top ten sects would definitely not be absent. The remaining ones would be the royal families of the marine folks, the demons, the Hus, and some royal families of the barbarians. They would constantly produce prodigies on the Prodigy List. It was hard to say for the other forces, but at the same time, the competition was even more intense because the spots left for them were too few. Each of them was the hope of the next generation of the sect.","“Speaking of this year’s Prodigy List, the Flying Celestials is not bad. The Twin Stars of the Flying Celestials are both on the roll. Hua Xianyuan has an amazing appearance and is ranked 18th on the list. His powerful cultivation is almost invincible.’","“However, the one who is truly shocking is the other person from the Flying Celestials’s Twin Stars, the Sword Path Killer God—Chu Hongcai. This is the third time that he and Xiang Yunfei from the Destiny Sect have fought for first place on the Prodigy List. The previous two battles were hard to determine the winner, and it almost gave the Mysteries Pavilion a headache. They couldn’t determine who is the winner. This time, they have agreed to fight in Zhongzhou City. It should be the end.”","When these names were mentioned, many people present could not help but reveal a somewhat amazed expression. These few names, without exception, were the most dazzling names in recent times. No matter what time it was, other than the few people who stood at the top of the world, what everyone paid the most attention to was definitely the change in the Prodigy List. Every time there was a change in the name list of the Prodigy List, it would trigger a heated discussion among the crowd.","This was especially different this time. There were two geniuses who had the qualifications to be first on the Prodigy List at the same time, Both sides were at loggerheads, displaying terrifying talent that far exceeded their peers.","In the past few years, the two sides had fought twice, and it was difficult to determine the winner. The second time was when the Prodigy List was changed. Chu Hongcai went to seek out Xiang Feiyun, but the battle was difficult to determine the winner. In the end, the Mysteries Pavillion ranked the two of them as the first on the Prodigy List.","“The confrontation between these two should be a continuation of the confrontation between them. I didn’t expect that back then, I was still listening to the legends of those two people. Now, their descendants have already appeared.” A middle-aged man grinned as if he was thinking of the stormy days back then.","“That’s right. Chu Hongcai and Xiang Feiyun are undoubtedly the successors","of those two people. Chu Hongcai is that person’s clan brother and has received that person’s true inheritance. Xiang Feiyun is another person’s true disciple. Hehe, the confrontation between Chu Hongcai and Xiang Feiyun can be considered to have continued the competition between those two. Unfortunately, that person died too early back then. The world-shocking battle that could have been seen became a bubble,” another person said with a","Two amazing figures flashed in front of his eyes. Each of them had left behind a legend of an era, making countless people of the same generation pale in comparison. At that time, they were so high-spirited and could swallow mountains and rivers. Now, even their disciples were famous figures in the world and could be ranked among the experts.","A young man who seemed to be 17 or 18 years old entered the teahouse under the guidance of his elders and said with some dissatisfaction, “Who are you talking about? Why does it feel like you’re always speaking in riddles? Just say who it is. What’s there to hesitate about?”","“Ask your master. Your master should know,” the person calmly answered him.","The young man immediately looked at his master. It was a middle-aged man who looked to be in his forties. He asked, “Master, who is that person they are talking about? Was it some big shot whose name can’t be mentioned?”","He knew that even mentioning the names of some of the top figures in the world was taboo. He was usually warned that some people could not be provoked or even mentioned, or else a great disaster would befall. However, he was a newborn calf that was not afraid of tigers. He did not believe in evil. He did not believe that someone was so powerful that even the mention of their name could bring disaster.","The middle-aged man shook his head. Then, he brought the young man to sit dovvn. Then, he said, “They are considered big shots. However, they are not so powerful that even mentioning their names is taboo.” “Then who are they?” the young man asked again.."]},{"number":2050,"title":"Chapter 2050: Chu Yunfan’s Remnant Might","paragraphs":["Chapter 2050: Chu Yunfan’s Remnant Might","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The young man’s question made many people reminisce, as if they were recalling the past.","The middle-aged man smiled and said, “It’s normal that you don’t understand them. They are two legends. Even compared to the geniuses on the current Prodigy List, they are still two legends.","“One of them is Chu Yunfan, the number one on the previous Prodigy List. The other is Jun Tianci, the number one on the Prodigy List before that,” the middle-aged man said slowly.","There was no need to say anything more. Just their status as number one on the Prodigy List was enough to show their weight. Even a substitute prodigy on the Prodigy List was an unattainable figure for most people in the teahouse. And these two people were each the number one on the Prodigy List of their era. The weight of it was self-evident.","“That’s not right, Master. W asn’t the previous number one on the Prodigy List Tang Siyu? Who is this Chu Yunfan?” the young man said in confusion.","Ever since he was born, the number one on the Prodigy List that he knew of was Tang Siyu. Where did this Chu Yunfan come from? It was like a stone monkey that had appeared out of thin air.","The middle-aged man just smiled and shook his head. “That was something that happened after he was in power. When he was in power, he swept through his peers and crushed the prodigies of the world. Now, those big shots you’ve heard of, Zi Buyu of Great Change Faith, Meng Tianren of the Virtuous Academy, Hu Qingxuan of the Heavenly Foxes, and so on, were all defeated by him back then. He alone killed all the heroes of the world. There were many legendary figures who died in his hands. He was a figure who truly surpassed his peers.","The middle-aged man continued after a pause. “Even Tang Siyu, the previous number one, could only be ranked second when he was still in power.”","The young man’s expression changed. Although he didn’t know how powerful Chu Yunfan was back then, the fact that those legendary figures had to bow down to him when facing him was enough to prove this person’s might.","Many people opened their mouths but did not say anything. Even those who had been defeated by Chu Yunfan had not fought for several years. Or rather, they had not fought in front of the secular world. These people all had cultivation bases that surpassed the supreme elders of the various sects, each one more powerful than the last. Some of them had entered Grand Xia to serve, and their positions were extremely high. Those young prodigies of the past were now the giants of the entire world. The situation was completely different.","“He was already the only marquis of his generation a long time ago. He was extremely glorious!” the middle-aged man said, “Moreover, in terms of age, Chu Yunfan is actually not very old. If we really count him, he should be considered a prodigy of this year’s list. However, he had already made a comeback more than ten years ago. Among his peers, he was invincible.","Therefore, the Mysteries Pavilion listed him on the Prodigy List.”","There was an upper limit to the age on the Prodigy List, but there was no lower limit. That was why Chu Yunfan, who was far younger than those prodigies, could be on the list. This kind of situation was very rare since ancient times, and it was almost impossible to do it. The Prodigy List was the most outstanding people of a generation. Talent, fortune, inheritance, resources, all of them were at the top. Under such circumstances, to reverse the situation and sweep away all the powerful enemies to become the number one on the Prodigy List, no one had ever been able to do it.","“Chu Hongcai, who is currently on the list, is his clan member. The two of them aren’t much different in age. Hua Xianyuan was also his fellow disciple back then and entered the Flying Celestials with him. However, Hua Xianyuan’s brilliance was overshadowed by Chu Yunfan alone,” someone said emotionally, “Now that Hua Xianyuan is at the top of the Prodigy List, it’s enough to prove that his talent is extraordinary. In the future, he will definitely be a big shot that will shake the world. However, such a person was suppressed to the point where he didn’t shine at all ten years ago. Chu Yunfan is simply a monster!”","The young man was extremely shocked. Just Chu Yunfan’s many deeds were already legendary, not to mention that Chu Yunfan’s age should be considered a prodigy of this generation. He had used his astonishing talent to turn the tables and become the previous generation’s number one on the Prodigy List. This was the same as how he was supposed to turn the tables and become the current number one on the Prodigy List.","Just thinking about it, he knew how difficult it was. It was simply impossible. However, Chu Yunfan had done it. Such a person was indeed a legend.","“Back then, even Tang Siyu couldn’t compete with him?” the young man asked in disbelief.","In his impression, Tang Siyu was undoubtedly a legendary super genius. He grew up listening to many legendary stories about her. However, such a character was suppressed by Chu Yunfan when he was in power. The young man could hardly believe the difference.","“That’s right. Even though Tang Siyu has an emperor-level physique, she was still inferior to him. Hoxuvever, the two of them were dao companions, so they did not fight for the title. Later, someone said that Tang Siyu arrived first.","Even if Chu Yunfan was still around, he might not be able to suppress her. However, in the end, there was no way to prove it. After all, he is no longer around. No matter how convincing Tang Siyu’s supporters are, they have no way to prove it,” the middle-aged man said with a nod.","He was extremely emotional. Back then, Tang Siyu, who had an emperor-level physique, swept away all her peers. But in the end, she could only be ranked second in the world. It was not that Tang Siyu was not good enough, but that","Chu Yunfan was too monstrous.","All sorts of information about Tang Siyu had been made known to the public over the years. They knew that she had an emperor physique and that her talent was shocking. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was too mysterious. Back then, they had guessed that he had an emperor physique, but now it was just a guess and could not be verified.","“You might not be able to imagine how powerful he is now, but you only need to know that Chu Hongcai’s current achievements are all because of his legacy,” the middle-aged man said.","After the young man digested the shock, he asked, “But since he’s so powerful, why haven’t I heard his name before? Where did he go? Did he die?”","How could he not have heard of such a powerful person since he was young? This was completely illogical. Even if he was active before he was born, as long as he was alive, there would always be news. It was impossible that there was no news at all.."]},{"number":2051,"title":"Chapter 2051: The Battle Begins, Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2051: The Battle Begins, Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The young man was extremely curious. Just by listening to his master’s description of such a legendary figure, he could tell that he was a legendary figure.","The middle-aged man paused for a moment and then said, “It has something to do with Jun Tianci, the other number one I told you about. It was rumored that Jun Tianci had personally visited Zhenyuan City and attacked Chu Yunfan. Since then, Chu Yunfan’s life and death have been unknown. No one knows if he’s alive or dead.","“Although the Flying Celestials and Zhenyuan have always insisted that he is still alive, it has been fifteen years since then, and there has been no news of him. Everyone thinks that he has probably fallen.”","At this point, the middle-aged man could not help but sigh. Only now did the young man understand why there was no news of such a legendary figure until now—the matter involved another legendary figure. The previous top ranker of the Prodigy List was killed by another previous top ranker. This situation was simply shocking to him. He never knew that the battle between the geniuses on the Prodigy List would be so intense.","“Master, is the Imperial Court not going to care about such a big matter?” the young man asked in puzzlement.","Perhaps Grand Xia wouldn’t care about the battles between ordinary people, but the top ranker of the Prodigy List the essence of the geniuses of an era. The fall of any one of them would be a huge loss for Grand Xia.","The middle-aged man sighed and said, “Of course, they care. The 19mperial Court immediately sent an investigation team. The Flying Celestials also sent an investigation team. However, there was no evidence from the dead. Chu","Yunfan could not be found to testify. In the end, the matter was left unsettled. The Imperial Court could only give up.","“After that, there was an endless war. Tang Siyu even declared war on Jun","Tianci. According to various uncertain rumors, in the past ten years, Tang","Siyu had killed more than twenty of Jun Tianci’s powerful Arcane followers. She was even ambushed by Jun Tianci and almost died of serious injuries. The conflicts and friction between the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect had never stopped. The experts who had a friendship with Chu Yunfan had never stopped taking revenge on the Destiny Sect and Jun Tianci.”","A thought suddenly sprang into the young man’s head. “Could the battle between Xiang Feiyun and Chu Hongcai today be related to what happened back then?”","The middle-aged man nodded. “That’s right. Although the battle between the two of them had a part to play in the fight for the top spot of the Prodigy List, the root of the matter was still the battle where Jun Tianci killed Chu Yunfan.”","The young man finally understood that the battle that had attracted so much attention today was related to the legendary figure from back then.","At this moment, he heard the discussions of many customers.","“Too many people have come for todays battle, Many experts of the current era have come. There are more than one or two people who suffered at Chu Yunfan’s hands. I’m afraid they all have ill intentions.”","“Hehe, these people aren’t easy to deal with either. Back then, they were beaten to a pulp by Chu Yunfan. In the past few years, they have attacked Chu Hongcai more than once or twice, both openly and covertly. However, Chu Yunfan has the same momentum as Chu Yunfan back then. He’s actually getting stronger and stronger as he fights.”","“Maybe there will be more foreign experts coming. Those foreign races suffered a lot from Chu Yunfan back then, so no one wants to see Chu Hongcai","rise. ”","Suddenly, there was a commotion among the guests.","“The battle has begun. Xiang Feiyun is here!”","These words immediately caused a commotion. The crowd of customers disappeared one after another. In a moment, the originally bustling teahouse became cold and quiet. In the corner, a figure sat alone in a seat, looking especially different.","This person looked to be in his twenties. He was thin and sat upright on his seat, as straight as a spear. His face was ordinary, and it was as if one could see such a person anywhere on the street. However, to be able to appear in this teahouse meant that he was definitely not an ordinary person.","After a long while, this person put down the teacup in his hand and sighed. “1 didn’t expect that in the blink of an eye, fifteen years have passed. Hongcai is already able to compete for first place on the Prodigy List.”","This man sighed with emotion. His face was plain, but his eyes kept bursting with light, showing that his heart was not calm. Only he knew that he was none other than the legendary figure of the previous generation, Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan sighed. This time, the rebirth through the Immemorial Dark Phoenix had been exceptionally long. In the blink of an eye, fifteen years had passed. The people and things that he was familiar with back then were also very different. Those who were on the Prodigy List with him back then were now famous figures in the world. Chu Hongcai, who had followed him back then, and Hua Xianyuan, who had entered the Flying Celestials with him, were now famous geniuses on the new Prodigy List. This change made him feel that the world was changing.","Chu Yunfan remembered that when he first met Chu Hongcai, he was still a young man. Now, he was already a prodigy whose name shook the world. Over the past ten years, the world had changed, and he had finally completed this transformation. Back then, Jun Tianci’s attack had caused him to be so severely injured that he had been on the verge of death. It was only a few days ago that he had finally completed the rebirth and escaped from serious injuries.","However, he did not alarm anyone. He even changed his appearance and became another person. After hearing about the battle between Chu Hongcai and Xiang Feiyun, he immediately rushed to Zhongzhou. Just as many of the customers had said, if this battle spread throughout the world, it would probably attract many experts, and there would be no lack of enemies among them.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had offended many people during his rise. Even he himself did not know. When Chu Yunfan was around, they couldn’t do anything to him, but that didn’t stop them from attacking Chu Hongcai.","Fifteen years ago, he had been defeated by Jun Tianci, which had left a deep impression on Chu Yunfan. At the same time, he understood that no matter what kind of talent one had, if they didn’t grow up, they would eventually fall.","There were countless people in the world who wanted to kill prodigies. He would not interfere in the battle between Chu Hongcai and Xiang Feiyun, and there was no need for him to interfere. Xiang Feiyun was just a stepping stone for Chu Hongcai’s future, a whetstone. Xiang Feiyun was just a tool for Chu Hongcai to train, but it was different when those top experts attacked.","“It’s best if nothing happens. If those people attack without caring about their dignity...” Chu Yunfan’s voice became deeper and deeper, almost inaudible.."]},{"number":2052,"title":"Chapter 2052: The Arrival of Two Great Prodigies, Shocked Heroes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2052: The Arrival of Two Great Prodigies, Shocked Heroes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Above the barrier of the Central Plains City, an arena formed by the energy of the barrier appeared in the air. This arena was not purely made of energy, but a magic treasure.","In this magical treasure, they could fight as much as they wanted without worrying about the energy leaking out and destroying the entire city.","This was a Dharma treasure arena specially prepared for the two Heaven’s Favorites. After all, the strength of the two Heaven’s Favorites had already entered the peak of the Cosmos Realm. If such experts attacked at full force, they would be able to destroy the world.","On the arena, a man in yellow clothes with a square face and a knife-like face stood with his hands behind his back, as if he was waiting for someone.","Many figures had already gathered around the a_rena. However, many of them were hidden in the space, concealing their figures. They all knew the identity of the yellow-clothed man in front of them. He was none other than Jun","Tianci’s Pro-disciple, the strong candidate for the first place on the Prodigy Roll, Xiang Feiyun.","“Xiang Feiyun’s strength is indeed impressive. It’s said that he has already defeated all the elders of the Tianming Sect more than a year ago. He’s invincible. It won’t be long before his strength can be comparable to the Grand Elder of the Tianming Sect!”","Someone sighed. He looked at Xiang Feiyun who was just standing there like a towering snow mountain.","” With Jun Tianci’s strength and vision, if Xiang Feiyun hadn’t displayed his outstanding talent, how could he have taken notice of him?”","“Now that I’ve seen you today, you live up to your reputation!”","“l didn’t expect that after more than ten years, those all-powerful figures in the past could now even make their descendants famous!”","An old man sighed.","” Back then, Chu Yunfan had done so many evil things. It’s simply too many to count. Now that his successor has made his debut, his style of doing things is exactly the same as his. He should have been beheaded long ago!” Many of the people present had malicious intentions.","In particular, many people had suffered losses at Chu Yunfan’s hands. No one had ever been as ruthless as Chu Yunfan. He killed experts one after another. Many sects had been shaken by Chu Yunfan’s killing.","“When Chu Yunfan was around, why didn’t you dare to say these words in front of him? Why did you only dare to plot against his disciples? If Chu Yunfan returns, will you still have the confidence?”","Some people couldn’t stand it and said disdainfully. In their opinion, these people only dared to target Chu Yunfan’s disciples. Back then, they were beaten up by Chu Yunfan and had no temper. They were just bullying the weak and fearing the strong.","Back then, Chu Yunfan was an amazing talent, and the impression he left on them was so deep that even now, they still could not forget it.","“So what if Chu Yunfan dares to appear now? Did he still think that the world was still the same as it was back then? There’s no need to say anything about Tang Siyu. He killed his way into Heaven’s Favorites City alone. Now, which of the Heaven’s Favorites who were left behind by him back then are still weaker than him?”","” That’s right. Even if he returns now, he’ll just be like everyone else. Everyone is improving, but he’s the only one who’s still standing. Does he think he can still be as fierce as he was in the past?”","Many people said disdainfully. In their opinion, even if Chu Yunfan was lucky enough to survive Jun Tianci’s attack, as the people from Zhenyuan City had said, he was just trying to drag out his days.","He must have been seriously injured or even dead. Otherwise, how could there be no news of him for more than ten years? If his injuries were slightly better and he was born, there would be no news.","Even when Tang Siyu was ambushed by Jun Tianci, she didn’t appear.","The geniuses of the past had been eliminated by the times and had become ordinary people.","“Disappearing in the crowd? Don’t forget that Chu Yunfan is the same as Tang Siyu. In terms of age, he should be from the same generation as this year’s prodigy roll. Even if Chu Yunfan hasn’t improved in the past ten years, and his strength has even greatly declined, based on the strength he displayed back then, he has far surpassed the current prodigies, right?”","“That’s true. Can Xiang Feiyun, who you’re praising so much, block a casual attack from Chu Yunfan? If this can be considered as being ordinary, then everyone’s standards are too high!”","In the crowd, there were people defending Chu Yunfan. Back then, Chu Yunfan had offended too many people, but at the same time, his invincible figure had also attracted the attention of countless people. There were also many young people who regarded him as an idol. At this time, there were many potential supporters of Chu Yunfan, and there were also many people who refuted him.","For a time, many noises came from the space around the arena.","“Chu Hongcai is here!”","Suddenly, someone shouted.","A streak of light flashed over from afar and appeared in front of everyone in an instant.","It was a white-robed man with a black crown on his head. His entire person was like a treasured sword, and even before he was unsheathed, he had a faint and shocking deterrent force.","” This is a natural sword bone. It’s the unique physique of a rare genius in the sword path. In the past few years, Chu Hong has only managed to achieve an earth-shattering sword cultivation. He has almost no match for his peers!”","The cultivators who cultivated the sword art exclaimed. Only those who cultivated the sword art could understand how amazing the so-called natural sword bone was.","Some people were born with outstanding talent in the way of the sword, and their comprehension ability was outstanding. However, that was just talent. Some people were different. Their bodies were born to cultivate the way of the sword.","These people were almost born with an astonishing sensitivity to the way of the sword. They did not even need to learn much to be able to easily control sword techniques that others could not comprehend.","In their hands, the power of any sword technique would easily double. They were top-notch physiques that could only be encountered but not sought after in the cultivation of the sword path. In many people’s eyes, they were not inferior to those with the emperor physique.","” It’s hard to tell who’s the better one. It’s strange that such a pair of twin stars appeared in this generation!”","” This battle can almost be seen as a continuation of the battle between those two. Although it can’t reproduce the glory of those two, it’s still passable!”","Suddenly, there was a commotion in the distance. Everyone looked over and saw many young figures in the sky. Each of these figures had a powerful aura that stirred the wind and clouds. More importantly, they were all so young. “It’s the other geniuses on the prodigy roll. They’re here too!”","” Clearly, theyre here to scout the enemy’s situation. These two are their strongest opponents for the first place on the Prodigy Roll!”","“l didn’t expect this battle to attract so many prodigies on the prodigy roll.. I’m afraid that it’s not impossible for a true victor to determine the number one in","the world! “"]},{"number":2053,"title":"Chapter 2053: Only One Person Can Be Number One","paragraphs":["Chapter 2053: Only One Person Can Be Number One","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This battle between Chu Hongcai and Xiang Feiyun was not only related to their rankings but also to the changes in the entire Prodigy List. Many geniuses received the news and those who had the ability to rush over came.","These people were basically powerful geniuses who ranked relatively high and thought they had a chance of becoming the number one, This battle was about to change the current Prodigy List.","“Chu Hongcai, the grudge between you and me should be settled today. How can there be two number ones? That’s just the biggest joke in the world. From today onward, I will be the world’s only number one!”","Xiang Feiyun stood with his hands behind his back. He carried an extremely powerful aura, lightning shot out from his gaze, and the void shook. As he spoke, he flew straight into the energy arena in the sky.","“l have the same intention as well,” Chu Hongcai Cai said indifferently, and in the next moment, he too arrived in the arena.","Xiang Feiyun immediately launched an attack. His speed was unbelievably fast. The saber in his hand glimmered with a light that filled the sky. It covered the sky and earth. The expressions of many experts present changed. The power of this attack had clearly exceeded the limit.","“What a mighty Destiny Saber!” an expert said in shock.","At this moment, the martial art that Xiang Feiyun was using was none other than the supreme technique of the Destiny Sect, the Destiny Saber. One slash sliced the heavens and earth apart. Once the saber was formed, it was invincible.","The expressions of the prodigies who had come to watch the battle changed. Many of them revealed unwilling expressions. Just this saber alone was something that they felt would be difficult to block. Not to mention these prodigies, even many of the famous big shots present felt that the power of this saber was really amazing.","“Let’s go!’","Facing such an attack, Chu Hongcai wasn’t afraid. On the contrary, he used his finger as a sword and shot out a shocking sword light that swept across the sky.","Boom!","The saber light and sword light collided in the air. The terrifying attack bloomed with a terrifying light and scattered into light spots that filled the sky. However, many people with discerning eyes could see that these light spots were not harmless. Any one of these unremarkable light spots could easily end the life of a Cosmic.","Many people’s expressions changed. How old were these two people? If they really grew up, the future would be theirs. Especially the two people they represented, they made many people feel suffocated.","In the crowd, a young man wearing the moon-white robe of the Flying","Celestials was slightly shocked. Everyone knew who this person was. He was Hua Xianyuan, who was known as the other Twin Star of the Flying Celestials.","He looked extremely shocked. He knew his strength best. Just that attack had exceeded his current limit. It could even severely injure him. Although they were both stars of their sect, he knew that the difference between him and Chu Hongcai had already been determined. He knew that this was the case, and he had fought Chu Hongcai many times, but he had failed every time.","Among the younger generation of Grand Xia, Hua Xianyuan’s cultivation could even be ranked in the top few. And the gap between him and Chu Hongcai did not shrink. Instead, it became even wider.","Among the many prodigies, Chu Hongcai and Xiang Feiyun were on the same level. The others were on a lower level and could not be mentioned in the same breath. What really troubled him was that the current powerful Chu","Hongcai reminded him of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was the same back then, or even stronger.","In fact, he himself was of the same generation as Chu Yunfan was back then. He was even on par with Chu Yunfan for a while, but he was soon surpassed by Chu Yunfan. It was so much so that even Chu Yunfan’s taillights could not be seen.","Chu Yunfan had made a comeback and rushed to the first place on the Prodigy","List in a short time, while he was far inferior—confined to the bottom of the Prodigy List. It wasn’t until this year’s Prodigy List was changed that he managed to rush to the top of the rankings. He was already one of the few people in the world, so there was nothing to be dissatisfied about.","Since ancient times, everyone had been like this. Even people as talented as Xiang Feiyun and Chu Hongcai had to wait until the rankings changed before they could make it on the list. However, there was an existence like Chu Yunfan. His deeds told everyone that there was nothing impossible.","Hua Xianyuan felt despair when he thought about it. He could not even hope to catch up. It was fine if he couldn’t beat Chu Yunfan back then, but now he couldn’t even beat Chu Yunfan’s successor. This made him feel a little defeated.","Just as Hua Xianyuan was sighing with emotion, the other prodigies also had the same expression on their faces. It had been a while since they last met, but the gap between them and these two people had not narrowed. Instead, it had widened. Without a doubt, this was a very frustrating feeling.","In the arena, the battle had already entered a white-hot stage. Xiang Feiyun’s saber strike was unleashed to the extreme. The Destiny Saber slashed toward the sky. The snow-white saber light cut the entire sky into countless pieces.","Chu Hongcai was even more shocking though. He opened his mouth and let out a breath of sword light, which swept across the void, making the entire void seem like water.","All kinds of terrifying attacks blasted toward both sides, and both of them displayed their top strength Whether it was the sword light or the saber light, they both had unimaginable power. They landed on both sides, but neither side stopped.","A golden armor appeared on Xiang Feiyun’s body. All the attacks that landed on the golden armor could not pose any threat to him. Chu Hongcai, on the other hand, simply used his body to resist the saber light. His body completely ignored the saber light and could withstand it.","“Chu Hongcai is almost a replica of Chu Yunfan. His physical strength is terrifyingly strong. He can fight against magic tools with his bare hands!”","Many people recalled that when Chu Yunfan was fighting, it had been the same scenario. No matter what kind of attack it was, it could not cause the slightest threat to him. Chu Hongcai’s fighting techniques were almost exactly the same as Chu Yunfan’s. When faced with someone who relied on his strong physique to bully others, others really had no other way.","However, Xiang Feiyun wasn’t weak. Although he didn’t have Chu Hongcai’s astonishing physique, his golden armor was enough to close the gap between them. He fought Chu Hongcai to a standstill, not showing any weakness.","“l didn’t expect Hongcai to have mastered the Indestructible Sword Physique in just a dozen years,” Chu Yunfan said calmly from afar.."]},{"number":2054,"title":"Chapter 2054: Killing Xiang Feiyun and Winning Back the City","paragraphs":["Chapter 2054: Killing Xiang Feiyun and Winning Back the City","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was a little emotional. From this series of exchanges, he could see that Chu Hongcai!s strength had undergone an earth-shattering change in the past ten years. Those who understood Chu Hongcai’s strengths would truly understand how amazing his improvement over the last ten years was.","Now, Chu Hongcai could fight with the top prodigies. He was not at a disadvantage when facing a peerless genius like Xiang Feiyun. In fact, he was even more powerful. However, only Chu Yunfan knew that among these people, the one with the worst foundation was actually Chu Hongcai. Among these people, Chu Hongcai was the youngest.","Moreover, when these prodigies had already shown their talents, Chu Hongcai had barely entered the Flying Celestials. He couldn’t even be considered an inner disciple. Even if his speed was not as fast as Chu Yunfan’s, it was not much different.","Ordinary people might not understand how Chu Hongcai could rise to this level. Only Chu Yunfan knew best that this was because he had left a jade slip for Chu Hongcai. The jade slip recorded a top-notch cultivation technique, the Indestructible Sword Physique.","This was a special physique that was similar to the Imperial Physique.","However, unlike the Imperial Physique, which was comprehensive, the Indestructible Sword Physique’s limitation was that it was attached to the sword path.","After cultivating the Indestructible Sword Physique, all the techniques of the sword path could be said to be at one’s fingertips. One would be reborn with a physique to cultivate the sword path, and one’s cultivation of the sword path would advance by leaps and bounds. The speed of building the foundation in the early stages of this technique was not fast, but the later it was, the faster it would be for him to cultivate the sword path.","It was just that his cultivation method was too profound, and it was not inferior to his innate special physique. That was why others thought that Chu Hongcai developed sword bones. If Chu Hongcai had been born with sword bones, he wouldn’t have been silent for so long. Those who were born with the sword bones were practically born geniuses in the sword path. As long as they cultivated, they would definitely shine brightly. It was impossible that no one knew.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had decided to impart the Indestructible Sword","Physique to Chu Hongcai in a split second. He had not even thought that Chu","Hongcai would be able to successfully cultivate it. This was because the Indestructible Sword Physique was a peerless cultivation technique that could be gradually improved and cultivated, turning from Acquired to Innate. The more he cultivated, the more his physique would improve. Even if he was only cultivating a semi-finished product, he would not be at a disadvantage compared to ordinary geniuses.","Chu Yunfan’s initial expectations were only this. Who would have thought that Chu Hongcai would be able to turn the tide and cultivate the Indestructible Sword Physique to the stage of minor success?","A minor success Indestructible Sword Physique was comparable to a king-level physique. In terms of battle strength, it was one of the best among king physiques. And once it was cultivated to completion, the Indestructible Sword Physique would be comparable to an emperor-level physique.","However, although everything seemed wonderful, according to the Alchemy","Emperor’s memories and the records in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, even in the ancient times when geniuses were born in large numbers, only the creator of this method had managed to cultivate the Indestructible Sword Physique to the great success stage. There were not many who even managed to cultivate it to the minor success stage, Such instances were extremely rare.","It was unknown how much effort Chu Hongcai had put in to reach this step.","One had to know that every step of the cultivation process of the","Indestructible Sword Physique was accompanied by extreme pain. He had to forcefully reverse his ordinary Acquired physique into an Innate physique and nurture the sword light in his body. If he was not careful, all his previous efforts might go to waste. The sword light would wreak havoc, and he would self-destruct.","If it weren’t for the pain and danger, there wouldn’t have been so few people who had succeeded in cultivation during ancient times. This was similar to Chu Yunfan’s cultivation of the Imperial Physique. Unlike those geniuses who had extremely powerful special physiques, it was easy to imagine how difficult it was to reverse the difference in talent. The probability of doing so was very, very low.","Even Chu Yunfan didn’t expect Chu Hongcai to be able to do this. However, he was quickly attracted by the two people fighting in the arena. The power of the saber and sword almost tore the arena apart. Just as everyone was amazed by the strength of both sides, the battlefield changed again. The entire energy arena instantly exploded.","Boom!","The energy arena collapsed under everyone’s watchful eyes. Both of them were pure martial arts cultivators. Their pure martial arts attacks brought down the entire arena. It was also at this time that the battle between the two sides finally ended. In the series of collisions earlier, Xiang Feiyun’s figure retreated and spat out blood.","Only then did everyone see that there was a huge hole in Xiang Feiyun’s chest. He was wearing golden armor, but a huge hole had been cut out by the sword. In Chu Hongcai’s palm, a small black flying sword was spinning and emitting a chilling light. It was this flying sword that had severely injured Xiang Feiyun.","“Such deep thoughts. This Chu Hongcai waited until now before he finally attacked with his full strength and heavily injured Xiang Feiyun in one move.”","“The winner is finally decided. He has made a comeback. This is the third battle. Chu Hongcai’s cultivation has become more profound. He has finally reversed the disadvantage of his age and surpassed Xiang Feiyun in terms of cultivation.’","“The first place on the Prodigy List is finally about to be decided. How could there be two number ones?”","For a moment, it was as if everyone was in an uproar. Everyone was boiling over. Chu Hongcai had severely injured Feiyun in one move. The outcome was already decided.","Suddenly, at this moment, Chu Hongcai attacked again. The flying sword in his hand turned into a black light. The black light tore through the sky and pierced through Xiang Feiyun’s head. Everyone was completely dumbfounded. No one had expected Chu Hongcai to kill Xiang Feiyun when the outcome was already decided. Although the battle hadn’t ended, it was already over.","Under everyone’s shocked gazes, Chu Hongcai said coldly, “We’re collecting interest today. Jun Tianci bullied the weak and attacked my cousin. Xiang Feiyun’s fate today will be Jun Tianci’s fate in the future.”","For a moment, the crowd was in an uproar. Many people remembered that Chu Yunfan had been ambushed by Jun Tianci. It was not an exaggeration to describe him as a bully. Jun Tianci’s assassination of Chu Yunfan, who had yet to achieve full mastery of his martial arts, had caused a stir back then. Everyone had thought that the matter had been settled, but they had never expected it to be brought up again in such a manner. It had even become more intense. The grudge and battle between Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci extended from the two of them to their descendants.","Back then, Jun Tianci had severely injured Chu Yunfan, causing his fate to be unknown. It could be considered a victory. Now, Chu Hongcai had killed Xiang Feiyun, which had truly helped Chu Yunfan’s lineage regain their victory.."]},{"number":2055,"title":"Chapter 2055: Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci’s Animosity Never Stop","paragraphs":["Chapter 2055: Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci’s Animosity Never Stop","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This grudge had never stopped, and the intermittent fighting had never stopped. It was just that ordinary people did not know about it.","For ordinary people, Chu Yunfan had already fallen more than ten years ago. It was already a thing of the past. Even for some of the younger generation, the legend of Chu Yunfan had never been heard of before. However, for some people, this grudge had never been broken. Over the years, the two factions had never stopped clashing.","Only now did everyone truly realize this point. This grudge would probably not end easily. Endless conflicts would erupt until one of the two sides fell.","More importantly, Chu Hongcai had officially issued a challenge to Jun Tianci. Many people realized that this would cause a huge commotion in the world.","The next generation successor that the Destiny Sect had spent all their efforts to nurture had died at Chu Hongcai’s hands.","The Destiny Sect was not the Li clan that Li Qianyuan, who was killed by Chu Yunfan, belonged to. In terms of power, although the Li clan was a military family, they were not even worthy of carrying shoes for the Destiny Sect. When Li Qianyuan died, it caused a big commotion. However, compared with the strength of the Destiny Sect, there was still a difference between heaven and earth.","The Destiny Sect was the number one sect in the world. Even the strength of the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect was quite different. Although they were both one of the top ten sects, the difference between them was unquestionable. Now that Xiang Feiyun was dead, the Destiny Sect would definitely not easily let this matter go.","Suddenly, just as everyone was still in shock, an angry roar came from the void. A huge hand grabbed over from the void, grabbing toward Chu Hongcai, wanting to grab him to death in an instant.","This large hand contained a sharp killing intent. It did not give Chu Hongcai any chance to resist and tried to grab Chu Hongcai to death on the spot. The speed at which the hand reached out was so fast that it surpassed the speed at which Chu Hongcai could react. In an instant, it had already reached Chu Hongcai.","At this moment, a huge palm slapped down from behind Chu Hongcai. It slapped down on this big hand.","Boom!","The giant palm print shattered the giant hand in the air. Then, everyone saw an old man in black clothes appear behind Chu Hongcai. This man was the one who had shattered the big hand that was about to grab Chu Hongcai.","“That’s... Chu Hongcai’s protector?” Someone looked at the white-haired old man in black.","The black-robed old man’s body was surging with a terrifying energy and blood. His strength gave off an unfathomable feeling as if his energy and blood could shatter the entire world.","What he had just used was the Flying Celestials’ ultimate technique—the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. In his hands, this ultimate technique had unleashed a power that ordinary people could not imagine.","After the black-robed man appeared, another black-robed old man appeared not far from Chu Hongcai. Different from the first black-robed old man, the second one emitted a sharp killing intent. This killing intent was all at Chu Hongcai. From his almost unhesitating attack just now, everyone guessed his identity immediately. He was Xiang Feiyun’s protector.","Chu Hongcai had just killed Xiang Feiyun. To him, it was the greatest dereliction of duty. Most importantly, the benefits he could have obtained from Xiang Feiyun had all disappeared. The protector was not purely","obligated to the prodigy he was protecting. There was a benefit to it. Now that Xiang Feiyun was dead and had yet to grow up, it could be said that the previous ten years had been useless.","Xiang Feiyun’s protector had not expected Chu Hongcai to be so decisive and ruthless. He killed Xiang Feiyun after Xiang Feiyun was defeated. He was both anxious and angry. With the power the Destiny Sect possessed, no one in the world had ever dared to attack their successor. If it wasn’t for Chu Hongcai’s protector blocking the attack, Chu Hongcai wouldn’t have been able to block his attack.","“Arcanes?” Chu Yunfan looked at the two protectors and was surprised to find that they were both Arcanes.","He felt this a little strange. Even Li Qianyuan’s protector was only at the peak of the Creation Stage. What was the concept of the Arcana Stage? Even among the behemoths of the top ten sects, it was a rare existence. This seemed to be a little different from what he knew back then.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t know that the reason why the situation had come to this was because he had been ambushed by Jun Tianci and almost died. It was precisely because even with his strength, Chu Yunfan could not avoid being ambushed by powerful masters that the sects felt a serious sense of crisis. For those who could make it to the Prodigy List, their protectors were promoted from peak Creators to Arcanes in order to better protect these prodigies.","“Chu Hongcai, you killed the chief disciple of my sect. You’re dead meat!” the black-robed old man growled, like an injured wild beast.","“You want to kill someone in front of me? Let’s see if you have the ability.” As Chu Hongcai’s protector, the first black-robed old man naturally did not show any weakness in his confrontation. “Destiny Sect’s disciple was not skilled enough and was killed in the arena, and now you want to talk about revenge?”","This was where Chu Hongcai was the most reasonable. In the arena, no matter who won or lost, whether they lived or died, it was all up to fate.","“Hmph! I don’t care about the challenge. I only know that Chu Hongcai of the Flying Celestials killed the chief disciple of the Destiny Sect. You have to pay the price!” The black-robed old man coldly snorted. “Do you think that the reputation left behind by Chu Yunfan can protect you? Even the Flying Celestials can’t protect you. You will die today!’","“Bullying the weak is indeed the tradition of your Destiny Sect. However, I’m not afraid of you. Since I’m here, I’m prepared. If you have any tricks up your sleeves, feel free to use them.”","Chu Hongcai was completely fearless. He had killed Xiang Feiyun not on a whim, but he had planned it for a long time. He had wanted to kill Xiang Feiyun during the previous two battles, but he was not strong enough to do so.."]},{"number":2056,"title":"Chapter 2056: All the Powerful Experts Gather","paragraphs":["Chapter 2056: All the Powerful Experts Gather","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The first time he fought with Xiang Feiyun, he was even at a slight disadvantage. The second time he challenged Xiang Feiyun, he only tied with him.","And now, after the third battle with Xiang Feiyun, he finally got what he wanted.","Xiang Feiyun’s own cultivation speed was constant, but Chu Hongcai was different. As the Indestructible Sword Physique reached the small success stage, his true cultivation speed exploded. The higher the completion of the Indestructible Sword Physique, the stronger his strength would be, and his cultivation speed would continue to increase.","Only then did he finally arrive first. His strength surpassed Xiang Feiyun, and today’s battle was decisive.","“How arrogant. You don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!”","“Shameless boasting!’","For a moment, roars could be heard from the city.","There were many experts who were either from or related to the Destiny Sect. At this moment, all of them were shouting angrily.","“Chu Hongcai, number one on the Prodigy List. Chu Yunfan was like this back then, so he got his retribution. Today, you will go through the same!”","A loud shout came from Zhongzhou City. It was a man with disheveled hair and dressed in cotton clothes. He stepped out of the void step by step and arrived in front of Chu Hongcai.","“Li Yuanjia!” Chu Hongcai enunciated each word and looked coldly at the man in front of him.","“Gasp! It’s Li Yuanjia! Even he has come!”","“Isn’t he one of the top geniuses from Destiny Sect’s previous list? Even he’s attracted to this battle!”","“That’s right, it’s him indeed. He’s one of the prodigies from the Destiny Sect’s previous genius list. It’s been a few years since he last fought in front of others. Who would have thought that he would appear at this time!”","“I’m afraid Destiny Sect has made two preparations. If Xiang Feiyun wins, then it will be fine. But if he loses, then they’ll probably do the same to Chu","Hongcai as they did to Chu Yunfan!”","“That’s right. Chu Hongcai’s growth is too fast. If he continues to grow at this speed, he will definitely be another Chu Yunfan in the future. Moreover, such a person has great hostility toward the Destiny Sect. If I were the person in charge of that sect, I wouldn’t let Chu Hongcai off so easily!’","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but they were all guessing that this was the Destiny Sect’s trump card. The victory or defeat of this battle didn’t mean anything. In fact, the death of the number one rank on the Prodigy List wasn’t a big deal to the Destiny Sect, which had a deep foundation. However, a top-notch expert who was hostile to them would serve as a big threat.","Of course, Chu Hongcai wasn’t a top expert now, but there was no doubt that with his growth rate, he would become a major figure in the future.","“A life for a life! The heavens are fair and just! You killed a disciple of my Destiny Sect! Today, I will kill you!” Li Yuanjia’s eyes were extremely cold, and the blood aura in his body surged, directly destroying the confrontation between the black-robed elders.","At this moment, the black-robed old man’s face became serious. He didn’t care about his other opponent as they were at most on par with each other. However, there was an even more terrifying Li Yuanjia now, and everything was different.","After more than ten years, the situation in the world had already undergone massive changes. The people on the Prodigy List of the generation before were just like the ones on the list in this generation. Although they had potential, they had not grown up yet. They only had what it takes.","However, more than ten years have passed. They had already grown up and become big shots. The threat they posed to him was even greater than that black-robed old man.","Li Yuanjia’s blood energy surged faster and faster, and his terrifying aura shocked the whole surroundings. He stood in the air like a god.","“The Destiny Sect has always been so despicable and shameless!” At this moment, a cold snort came from afar. A figure in a moon-white robe appeared in front of everyone.","It was a man with sword-like eyebrows and starry eyes. He had a handsome face and was domineering without any anger.","He was confronting Li Yuanjia, and his body was also surging with shocking divine power. The terrifying aura he released was not inferior to Li Yuanjia’s.","“Yang Dengxian! It’s Yang Dengxian!”","Many people cried out in surprise. Unlike Li Yuanjia, Yang Dengxian had a higher status in the Flying Celestials. He had been promoted to the position of deputy sect leader several years ago and had been confirmed as the next successor of the sect.","It could almost be said that he was the sect’s next leader!","In the past few years, Yang Dengxian had been cultivating while dealing with various matters in the sect. He didn’t appear in public for a while. Now, he arrived in front of everyone because of Chu Hongcai’s battle with Xiang Feiyun. This could not help but shock many people.","The Destiny Sect was well-prepared, but the Flying Celestials were not to be trifled with.","Li Yuanjia’s aura surged like a monstrous wave, but Yang Dengxian was not any weaker.","The crowd even realized that the latter’s ranking which used to be slightly lower than Li Yuanjia’s was now even higher.","‘The Arcana Stage?’ In the crowd, Chu Yunfan didn’t say a word. However, he noticed that both Li Yuanjia and Yang Dengxian had entered the Arcana Stage.","In a dozen years, they had already transformed from rising stars to giants of a region. They were enough to influence the entire world’s situation. They were genuine big shots.","Moreover, their cultivation levels were even deeper and more terrifying than Maiden Donghua from more than a decade ago. They were indeed worthy of being ranked in the top 20 of the Prodigy List.","Back then, Maiden Donghua was only ranked in the middle, and Li Weiyuan and the others were ranked at the bottom of Jun Tianci’s batch. There was a huge difference in potential between different grades.","“Today, Chu Hongcai must die. Otherwise, it will be difficult to appease the hatred in my Destiny Sect’s heart!”","At this moment, more than ten extremely powerful auras appeared in Zhongzhou. They were not inferior to the two protectors.","In the city, the experts from all sides almost fainted. Others didn’t know, but they knew that these people were all terrifying people in the Arcane Stage.","Not to mention those old masters, even rising stars like Li Yuanjia and Yang Dengxian were terrifying existences who had entered the Arcana Stage. They couldn’t be mentioned in the same breath.","A dozen years ago, Chu Yunfan was the only one who could beat Maiden Donghua who was in the Arcana Stage. However, after a dozen years, his peers who could only look up to him had also stepped into the stage that they could only hope to reach.","Now that these big shots had arrived because of this battle, many people could not help but become nervous.. Could it be that a shocking battle was going to erupt in the sky above Zhongzhou?"]},{"number":2057,"title":"Chapter 2057: The Great Battle Erupts, and the Outsiders Invade","paragraphs":["Chapter 2057: The Great Battle Erupts, and the Outsiders Invade","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“There are actually the demons, the marine folks, the Hus, and the barbarians.","What a mash-up!’","Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Among the dozen or so powerful auras, other than a few elders of the Destiny Sect, the rest were actually from a mix of so many different tribes and races. These were all foreign races that were Grand Xia’s enemies.","Grand Xia was very vigilant against the infiltration of ordinary foreign races, not to mention ones who had such high levels. Once one of these experts went crazy, destroying a city was simply a matter of minutes. Not to mention that so many experts had actually sneaked in. This lineup was a huge threat even to a majestic city like Zhongzhou. The other small cities would probably be destroyed in a short while.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with killing intent. These experts wouldn’t easily infiltrate Grand Xia because they knew that these people were the empire’s focus, worrying that they would come and cause trouble.","Not long after they appeared, there would be a hunting team following them.","In fact, if they were not careful, they would be permanently detained in the empire.","Not everyone would do their best for their own race and die for it. It was normal to cherish their lives.","Therefore, if it weren’t for the huge temptation of benefits, how could these experts gather together here?","Obviously, they were here for Chu Hongcai.","Some of it was because of Chu Yunfan, and some of it was because they wanted to kill the human race’s top genius.","No matter which one it was, it was Chu Yunfan’s bottom line.","“Bullying with numbers? Princess Gushe has ordered that the life and death of today’s battle are determined by fate. The Destiny Sect is not allowed to break the rules!”","Suddenly, at this moment, a cold shout came from afar. A beautiful woman sat on a phoenix-like monster that was burning with raging flames. Her powerful aura suppressed the entire place.","Instantly, the entire place was in an uproar.","“That must be Miss Ruoxi from Serene Immortal Mountain!”","“That’s right, it’s her! The monster she’s sitting on should be Princess Gushe’ s mount, the Fiery Phoenix!”","“It really must be the Fiery Phoenix. It’s a descendant of the ancient phoenix species. Although its bloodline isn’t pure, it already has the blood of a top-notch divine beast!”","The crowd discussed the person’s identity. It was none other than Ruoxi from Serene Immortal Mountain. Although she was the weakest among the experts, her phoenix mount was the strongest. It was not inferior to the top experts who had entered the Arcana Stage.","Especially since behind her was Princess Gushe’ s will, no one in the world dared to underestimate her.","Back then, those Prodigy List geniuses had all become giants of a region, and Tang Siyu was the best among the best. She far surpassed everyone. Even if she did not come in person, she still had a huge deterrent force representing her. Its effect was not inferior to the personal arrival of these giant prodigies.","Everyone was incomparably shocked. Due to the battle between Xiang Feiyun and Chu Hongcai, these top experts that were rarely seen on normal days had also appeared. Many of them had not even made a move for many years.","In an instant, a battle erupted. The core target of it was obviously Chu Hongcai, who was in the sky.","Li Yuanjia made his move in an instant, a long saber appearing in his hand. It was none other than the Destiny Sect’s supreme technique, the Destiny Saber.","Swoosh!","The saber tore the sky apart in an instant. It was at least a hundred times stronger than what Xiang Feiyun had just used.","Terrifying saber light surged into the sky, turning into lights that swept over.","At this moment, Yang Dengxian, who was opposite him, also made his move with an incomparably cold expression. He turned his hand into the Flying Celestial Palm Strike and directly collided with the Destiny Saber.","Rumble!","The two terrifying Arcanes collided against each other and unleashed their top powers. The sky above Zhongzhou turned into a battlefield.","“This is so terrifying. Is this the strength of the previous generation’s prodigies?”","Many of the prodigies on this generation’s Prodigy List could not help but feel incomparably shocked when they saw the battle between the two. This was the previous generation’s strength, which was much higher than theirs. Any aftershock from the battle could easily kill them, who were still in the Cosmos Stage.","At this moment, they seemed to understand why Chu Yunfan, who was rumored to be so powerful, had fallen at Jun Tianci’s hands. The strength of each generation’s Prodigy List might be worlds apart. Only when they reached the end and reached the peak could they be on equal footing. Before that, the difference between the two sides was clear at a glance.","“Back then, Yang Dengxian’s ranking was slightly lower than Li Yuanjia’s, but now it seems that he’s not as inferior anymore. As the Flying Celestials Sect’s deputy sect leader and the next sect leader, he must have received more nurturing than Li Yuanjia!’","“At the same time, this also represents the clash between the two top forces. This isn’t the first time, and it certainly wouldn’t be the last!”","Just as Li Yuanjia attacked, the black-robed elder also attacked, fighting his other opponent.","The two protectors from different sects erupted with the most terrifying strength in their lives.","One wanted to kill, while the other wanted to protect. They were both risking their lives!","At the same time, the few elders of the Destiny Sect who were hiding in Zhongzhou also attacked and flew in Chu Hongcai’s direction. However, before they could make a move, they saw the phoenix spit out flames that filled the sky, blocking their way forward and forcing them to retreat. They all used their divine powers to block the flames.","They looked at each other, feeling a little afraid of the Fiery Phoenix and the person behind it.","However, the two sides were enemies to begin with, so it was naturally impossible for them to hold back now.","But for a moment, they were still blocked by the Fiery Phoenix’s flames.","At the same time, more than ten figures appeared in mid-air. When the experts in Zhongzou saw this, they were instantly stunned. This was because these people clearly were neither humans nor from Grand Xia.","Each of them was dressed differently, but they had a valiant aura.","Instantly, many people were enraged. No matter what the battle between the Destiny Sect, the Serene Immortal Mountain, and the Flying Celestials was, it was still Grand Xia’s internal battle. But now, these outsiders wanted to interfere.","This was something that the empire could not tolerate.","These experts understood the current situation and immediately shouted, “Let’s end this quickly!’"]},{"number":2058,"title":"Chapter 2058: Today, None of You Will Escape!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2058: Today, None of You Will Escape!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In Zhongzhou, many experts could not help but be restless. This was just like how human experts would be attacked by many demon experts if they ventured deep into the Demon Region.","In the city, other than the prodigies who came to watch the battle from all over the world, there were also many local experts. If it was just a grudge between the Destiny Sect and the Flying Celestials, these experts might not be willing to interfere. Neither of the two giants was suitable to interfere with.","However, now that there was an unexpected foreign expert sneaking into the city, they could no longer tolerate it. Did these creatures think they could no longer lift their blades?","These foreign races were getting more and more arrogant!","The experts from the foreign races naturally understood that they didn’t have much time left. Before the experts in the city could react, they had to kill Chu Hongcai.","If they wanted to kill a Arcane, it wouldn’t be that easy. However, Chu Hongcai, who was only at the peak of the Creation Stage, could be killed easily.","“Hongcai, leave!” Yang Dengxian shouted and was about to come to Chu Hongcai’s aid, but he was stopped by Li Yuanjia.","How could Li Yuanjia let him go so easily? The Flying Celestials were at a disadvantage now.","The dozen or so experts of the foreign tribes pounced at them. They were so fast that no one could react in time.","Suddenly, endless lightning descended from the sky, forming a sea of lightning that blocked Chu Hongcai and the other experts.","“Who is it?” At this moment, those foreign experts halted, almost crashing into the sea of lightning.","Even Chu Hongcai was shocked. This time, he had been extremely careless. Even he himself was a little scared. If it weren’t for the sudden appearance of this sea of lightning, he would have been killed.","Those Arcanes could kill him in an instant.","At this moment, he finally understood one thing. The Brother Fan that he had worshipped back then had experienced so many dangers. How much danger had he been in? It was not as simple as it seemed on the surface.","Brother Fan was able to overcome those dangers time and time again, but if he was not careful, he could die.","Everyone looked up and saw a completely ordinary young man walking up into the sky step by step.","Chu Yunfan slowly said, “You outsiders actually dared to set foot in Zhongzhou City and attack our human race’s geniuses. Today, none of you will escape!’","At the critical moment, Chu Yunfan finally made a move and saved Chu Hongcai. Only he had such strength to do this.","“You’re courting death. You think you can stop us by yourself?”","“What’s wrong with killing Chu Hongcai? Even if Chu Yunfan was here, we’d still kill him!”","“Human, I advise you not to make a mistake. Chu Yunfan is already dead, and there are countless people who wish for him to die without a burial place. Can you block each and every one of them?”","These foreign experts were enraged by Chu Yunfan’s words. Although these people had sneaked into Zhongzhou, their auras weren’t weak. Each of them was a terrifying existence in the Arcana Stage. Any of them would be a top expert in any place.","Now, Chu Yunfan was actually bragging shamelessly that he wanted them all to die. It was simply preposterous.","Chu Hongcai said coldly, “Why didn’t you say something like this when Brother Fan was around? Now, you only dare to say such words because he isn’t here, You’re just pitiful worms who bully the weak and fear the strong!’","His eyes were filled with disdain. If it were Chu Yunfan back then, these people would not have dared to attack. The strength that he had displayed ten years ago was already very terrifying, let alone now.","A dozen years was enough for Chu Yunfan to grow to a point where no one dared to look up to him.","“Arrogant!”","“Impudent! ”","“Even if Chu Yunfan is here, we could still kill him!”","These experts seemed to have been hit in the gut and were furious. Although they were very afraid of this guy who suddenly appeared, they did not recognize that he was Chu Yunfan. Many top experts who used thunder techniques appeared in their minds, but none of them could be connected to him.","Chu Hongcai didn’t show any weakness and said, “How can my Brother Fan’s reputation be tarnished by villains like you? Although I have the heart but lack the strength now, I will kill all of you one by one in the future!”","Even Chu Yunfan had a whole new level of respect for Chu Hongcai’s strength. The brave would win when they met on a narrow road. What was a brave man? Someone who dared to draw his sword even in the face of the strong. Those who bullied the weak could only be called cowards.","After more than ten years, Chu Hongcai was no longer the little cousin who only followed Chu Yunfan and needed his protection. Over the past ten years, Chu Hongcai had not only grown in strength but his entire body and mind had also undergone earth- shattering changes.","Although his strength had improved in the past, he was still a fledgling under the protection of Chu Yunfan’s wings. However, after more than ten years, without his protection, he had no choice but to stand up and fly independently.","There were countless people who had a grudge against Chu Yunfan back then. They didn’t have the chance to deal with him, so many of them turned their attention to Chu Hongcai.","All kinds of attacks were too numerous to count. Along the way, Chu Hongcai had experienced countless attacks. Step by step, he had arrived at his current position. He hadn’t faked anything at all.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t gone into seclusion to recuperate, Chu Hongcai might have been able to reach this step in terms of strength. However, his energy hadn’t changed. It was impossible for him to be so sharp that he could even kill Xiang Feiyun and become the number one in the world of this generation. “Waiting for you to kill us? You won’t have such a chance. We’ll kill you first!”","At this moment, taking advantage of the moment when the lightning dissipated, an expert from the marine folks attacked. His entire body seemed to have turned into a blue ocean as he rushed in front of Chu Hongcai.","His eyes were filled with killing intent. Chu Hongcai was already performing so well. If he continued to grow, he would definitely be the next Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had caused various races to suffer heavy losses. They naturally did not want another one.","At that critical moment, when the marine folk expert was about to pierce Chu Hongcai with his trident, a blue spear appeared in the sky and clashed against it.","Boom!","An incomparably loud explosion sounded, and the entire sky seemed to shake. Everyone only saw that the trident had exploded.."]},{"number":2059,"title":"Chapter 2059: One Spear, One Arcane","paragraphs":["Chapter 2059: One Spear, One Arcane","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This spear almost shattered the entire sky, let alone the trident.","The sound of metal clashing shook the surroundings. A blood-red light bloomed, and a shrill scream echoed. Everyone looked over and saw that the palm marine folk expert’s trident had exploded.","When his weapon collided with the spear, it was shattered by the terrifying power.","Fresh blood and flesh rained down. It was extremely terrifying.","“How is that possible? What kind of monster is that?!”","The marine folk expert was instantly shocked. The intense pain made his entire body tremble.","If Chu Yunfan had only sent his trident flying, it would still be within his understanding. However, the man was blown up by his trident with a single spear.","His trident was an indestructible magic tool that he had refined with Deep Sea Pure Gold.","It could even pierce through an expert of the deep sea. He had never heard of anyone blowing it up before. This man was simply a monster!","He looked up again and saw Chu Yunfan holding a blue spear. The spear was shining with lightning. He realized that this spear was not a magic weapon. It was just condensed from lightning power.","Condensing ordinary lightning into a spear actually gave it such terrifying power. The marine folk expert simply could not believe it.","‘Who is he?’ This was the only thought that flashed through his mind. However, in the next moment, his only reaction was to continuously retreat. He was afraid of this spear.","Despite that, Chu Yunfan didn’t give him such a chance at all. The blue spear in his hand shot out.","Boom!","Heaven and earth shook violently as the spear light pierced through the sky. With a clang, it shattered everything. It was directly swung in front of the marine folk expert.","Slash!","The marine folk expert didn’t have time to react. He could only let out a miserable scream, which made people’s hair stand on end. Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast that no one could see clearly how he attacked. They only saw that as soon as he attacked, his spear had already pierced through the marine folk expert’s chest and nailed him to death in the air.","Blood poured down like a waterfall. In an instant, his internal organs shattered. The marine folk expert struggled to escape, but he couldn’t move at all. He died a few breaths later.","Silence!","Only dead silence prevailed!","This brutal scene stunned everyone. Almost all of them were terrified!","This spear attack was too terrifying. It was as fast as thunder, and it was enough to shatter the surroundings. One of the famous Arcanes couldn’t even block this spear attack. He couldn’t even escape.","This wasn’t a weapon that could be found anywhere!","Creators were considered as big shots in the Eastern Sea. They could establish a sect and become the ancestor of the sect.","On the other hand, Arcanes had the power to establish a first-class sect. They were the top fighting force in the whole world.","Now, an existence of such a level was actually killed by a spear!","This was brutal, too brutal!","“That’s... An old being within the marine folks. He was active for a while more than 200 years ago. I didn’t expect him to advance to the Arcana Stage!’","After the marine folk expert died, his divine power dissipated. Everyone finally saw his appearance. His identity was no longer hidden by the black fog.","There weren’t many people present who knew him, but there were still some who did.","Although the others didn’t know the background of these marine folk experts, they knew how terrifying an Arcane was.","An Arcane from the marine folks was easily killed by Chu Yunfan like a piece of paper.","The entirety of Zhongzhou City was silent. Only the clashes between Li Yuanjia, Yang Dengxian, and the other masters could be heard.","With the strength of one person, he actually intimidated all the other experts present. It was extremely rare for him to look so ferocious.","Chu Yunfan stood in the air like a demon god, filled with monstrous killing intent.","Even those experts in the city were somewhat frightened.","They had wanted to attack, but the terrifying power from Chu Yunfan’s casual attack had scared them.","An expert from the marine folks was actually killed by a spear just like that. The shock in everyone’s hearts could be imagined.","Many people even felt that Chu Yunfan’s body had an oppressive aura that made it difficult for them to even breathe.","The most important thing was that his divine power fluctuation was not obvious. It could even be said that there was basically none of them. This meant that without even using his full strength, he had already killed a strong marine folk expert using his spear.","“Who is this person? There shouldn’t be many experts who can cultivate to this level. How can I not recognize them?”","In the depths of Zhongzhou City, someone said in a low voice. To them, the most unbelievable thing was not Chu Yunfan’s strength, but that there was no news of him before this.","It was as if he had jumped out from a crack in the rock.","“But fortunately, it looks like it’s a human expert, not a foreign one!”","Someone couldn’t help but say.","The foreign experts looked at Chu Yunfan warily. The fact that the marine folk expert had been killed in an instant had greatly shocked them.","Chu Yunfan held a blue spear in his hand. On the spear, endless lightning power was flowing, constantly flashing with terrifying light.","He said coldly, “You barged into Zhongzhou City, and now you want to escape unscathed? What wishful thinking!’","At this moment, someone could not help but think of something. “This person is an expert I’ve never heard of. Could he be a member of the legendary Heavenly Punishment Army?”","Hearing someone say that, everyone’s memories were suddenly unlocked, as if they had thought of an extremely terrifying existence.","“If it’s the Heavenly Punishment Army, it’s really possible. These foreign experts think they’re virtuous and dare to sneak into Zhongzhou. However, they might have already attracted the attention of the army. It’s very normal for them to send an expert to clean them up!’","“Heavenly Punishment Army? Is it the legendary terrifying force that is directly under the Grand Commandant’s Office?” Some people couldn’t help but gasp when they thought of this.","“It’s said that there aren’t many people in that army, but every single one of them is a top-notch expert. They specialize in dealing with problems that ordinary armies can’t deal with, such as those high-level experts who have infiltrated Zhongzhou City and those who have betrayed the Imperial Court.. I’ve only heard of them before, but I’ve never seen them myself!”"]},{"number":2060,"title":"Chapter 2060: Killing Arcanes Like Killing Ants","paragraphs":["Chapter 2060: Killing Arcanes Like Killing Ants","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After hearing this, many people recalled the legends about the Heavenly Punishment Army. They were an extremely terrifying group.","They did not just have many people, but over countless years, they had created a terrifying reputation that could even stop a child from crying.","It was said that only those who had reached the Arcana Stage were qualified to join the Heavenly Punishment Army. Those who were lower than that stage were only candidates.","Every Heavenly Punishment Army member had extremely powerful strength. They were in charge of hunting down the best of traitors toward Grand Xia, as well as dealing with some experts who had infiltrated Zhongzhou City.","Just like the experts of the foreign races today, their levels were already high enough for the Heavenly Punishment Army to personally take action.","They were very mysterious. There were even rumors that many sect leaders had actually joined the Heavenly Punishment Army, but they were tight-lipped about some of the things.","Chu Yunfan was not in anyone’s sight before, yet he suddenly appeared. It was difficult for people not to think of that mysterious army.","It seemed that he had come specifically to deal with these foreign races, so it was inevitable that these people would think too much.","“That’s impossible. Every single member of the Heavenly Punishment Army wears a uniform. They’re different from him!”","However, some insiders soon denied that Chu Yunfan was a member of the Heavenly Punishment Army. Every time the army went out, they would wear a fixed uniform. If they didn’t wear it, then they weren’t part of the army.","Many people had seen that uniform before, but no one dared to imitate it. Otherwise, it would be blasphemous to the Heavenly Punishment Army, and it would cause them to pursue the culprit relentlessly.","After denying the possibility that Chu Yunfan was part of the army, everyone was even more confused. Where did this Chu Yunfan come from?","At the same time, Chu Yunfan looked coldly at the foreign experts. He locked his next target on a man with disheveled hair.","It was a middle-aged man who had an extremely valiant aura. There was actually wind surrounding him, making him look like the legendary storm god.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s gaze locked onto him, the middle-aged man immediately became nervous. The speed at which Chu Yunfan killed the marine folk expert was too fast. It was appalling.","“Human, are you treating us like air? You want to deal with so many of us alone?” The man with disheveled hair suddenly became agitated, wanting the others to join forces to deal with Chu Yunfan.","However, these foreign experts weren’t fooled. They had already been at odds with each other for a long time. However, they maintained a consensus on the matter of killing Chu Hongcai today. Naturally, they weren’t willing to take the risk for him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan attacked again. The spear in his hand instantly tore out a blue lightning bolt that traversed the sky. In an instant, it aimed directly in front of the man.","“Not good! Roar!”","The man let out an angry roar and formed a wind shield in front of him. However, before the shield could display its full effect, it shattered under the spear.","Immediately after, everyone saw the blue spear pierce through his chest in an instant.","Stab!","The man struggled with the spear inside him for a moment before he stopped moving.","After being pierced, all of his vitality was sucked away. At this moment, he finally revealed his true form. He was actually from the Winged Tiger Tribe.","Only then did everyone come to a realization. Ten years ago, Chu Yunfan had once killed a prodigy from the Winged Tiger Tribe. He had also eliminated a number of experts from that same tribe afterward.","Even though the tribe was the demon race’s royal tribe and had many experts, it had almost been ruined by Chu Yunfan alone.","Although they weren’t Arcanes, they were the backbone and hope of the Winged Tigers. However, they were all buried in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","It could be said that it caused a break and a vacuum session in the tribe.","There was no doubt about how much they hated Chu Yunfan.","This time, in order to kill Chu Hongcai, their Arcane had even come personally. Who would have thought that before he could kill Chu Hongcai and rebuild the Winged Tigers’ dignity, he would die on the spot?","“Roar!”","At this moment, another female expert among the foreign experts roared. Her eyes were filled with tears as she rushed toward Chu Yunfan. “Are you going to watch him kill people?!” She also released terrifying wind and a strong demonic aura swept across the sky.","Everyone immediately judged that she was exactly the same as the man from just now. She was actually another Winged Tiger.","This time, the tribe actually had sent two experts. Moreover, they seemed to be husband and wife. Now that her husband had been killed, the remaining female expert was enraged. Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Hmph!’","The long spear in his hand shot out. In an instant, it was like a blue lightning bolt. The void was distorted by the pressure, and it made a terrifying sound as it formed a strong wind.","Boom!","The spear’s energy rippled out like a violent storm as it went toward the female expert.","Stab!","The female Winged Tiger transformed into her original form in midair. She wanted to pounce on Chu Yunfan, but she was pierced through by the spear first. The terrifying lightning energy shattered all her internal organs and cut off all her vitality.","In Zhongzhou City, everyone was horrified. This scene was really frightening. Chu Yunfan killed people like he was killing ants. No matter what kind of expert they were, they seemed to be unable to survive one move in front of him and were directly pierced through by a spear.","It was a simple spear, but it contained such terrifying power!","“How is this possible? This is terrifying!’","“Let’s not talk about the marine folk. The Winged Tigers are the masters of the wind element. Their speed has always been unparalleled in the world and they have never lost to anyone, However, when they faced this man’s attack, they couldn’t even react in time and were directly killed!”","“So what if they can react? They wouldn’t be able to block it either. The two sides aren’t on the same level at all!”","“Just who is this person?”"]},{"number":2061,"title":"Chapter 2061: A Slaughter Feast","paragraphs":["Chapter 2061: A Slaughter Feast","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","One by one, Chu Yunfan had killed Arcanes who were deemed as beyond reach for many people around the world. It finally caused an uproar among all the warriors in Zhongzhou City.","Everyone was shocked. They had never thought that an Arcane could be so weak. They could actually be killed like ants. This outcome was obviously beyond their imaginations.","This kind of terrifying murder aroused fear in their hearts.","Chu Yunfan, in particular, was expressionless. He stood in the sky like a demon god while the spear in his hand was still inside the Winged Tiger woman.","These giant Winged Tigers had been shrunk to two meters in size by a special divine power. It was especially shocking.","No one knew who Chu Yunfan was, but there was no doubt that they could feel how powerful he was. Many people could not help but hold their breaths and quietly watch the scene in front of them.","At this moment, they remembered when they first saw Chu Yunfan stand up. Many people thought that he was overestimating himself, but now they really understood who the person who overestimated himself was.","Chu Yunfan put away the corpses of the three experts he had killed and said coldly, “You think too highly of yourselves!”","Then, he held the spear in his hand and continued to sweep in the direction of the other foreign experts.","“Kill him! Let him die without a burial place!”","At this moment, the foreign experts were all shouting. They wanted to kill Chu","Yunfan.","Although his strength was extremely shocking, they were not too afraid. They were just jealous.","After all, the three people that Chu Yunfan had killed were the weakest among the group. They had just entered the Arcana Stage, and could only be considered Minor Arcanes.","In their opinion, Chu Yunfan would only dare to attack the weakest among them. Therefore, he obviously wasn’t that strong. He was just pretending. Otherwise, why didn’t he pick the strongest among them from the start?","“Don’t worry, it will be your turn soon!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t get angry. He only spoke slowly, and the blue spear in his","hand burst out with shocking blue lightning.","In the next moment, the battle finally broke out. Five experts began to attack almost at the same time, directly rushing toward him. The rest also scattered around and began to surround him.","Every single one of them exuded a terrifying aura, one that was even stronger than the ones that Chu Yunfan had killed. There was even a Middle Arcane amongst them.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan didn’t even bother. The blood and energy in his body surged wildly. This sea of energy turned into a torrential air wave that spread in all directions.","Swoosh!","The five experts who had just rushed toward him were immediately blasted back. Then, they spat out a mouthful of blood. They were injured by his blood and energy.","Everyone’s faces were filled with shock. Just his energy and blood was already so powerful.","He was powerful, so powerful to the point where he could not be looked up to. “What kind of monster is this? How can his body be so powerful?” someone could not help but mutter. One had to know that the strength of one’s blood and the strength of one’s body could be said to be closely related.","They were a combined force, yet they were still injured by his energy and blood, which stemmed from his own strength. From this, it could be seen how terrifying the energy waves he formed were.","“Kill him! We can’t let him continue to be arrogant!”","Suddenly, one of the five people roared. However, in the next moment, blue light tore through the sky and pierced through him in an instant.","His eyes widened. He had never thought that he would die like this, and he could not even fight back.","At the same time, more than a dozen other foreign experts attacked at the same time. All of them swept toward Chu Yunfan. All kinds of weapon lights, martial arts attacks, as well as divine power blows bombarded Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was even simpler. He just opened his big hand and formed a large amount of lightning. Then, he absorbed all of the incoming attacks with his hand and destroyed them in one fell swoop.","Immediately after, he stabbed out with the blue spear in his hand. In front of him, a sea of blue lightning formed, crushing the void and erupting with a terrifying sound.","The remaining four experts were instantly struck by the sea of lightning, making them cough out blood and be thrown backward. Before they could even reach the sky, their bodies had already exploded.","They couldn’t even take Chu Yunfan’s shot and were already defeated.","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand again, grabbed their flesh, and sent them into the Mountain River Diagram.","These were Arcane blood essences. They were rare treasures that couldn’t even be seen.","Before these foreign experts could reveal their true forms, Chu Yunfan had already taken their bodies.","“Why does this person look so familiar?”","At this moment, Chu Hongcai, who was watching from the side, couldn’t help but reveal a suspicious expression. Although he was sure that he had never seen Chu Yunfan’s appearance before, his fighting style, as well as the way he killed people and even took their bodies away, seemed like he had seen it somewhere before.","However, he only had a faint suspicion and didn’t think too much about it because the most likely choice was the least likely to him.","The battle here finally alerted Yang Dengxian and the others. They all paid attention to this battle with their divine will. For the people and experts in Zhongzhou City, this battle was extremely shocking. For Yang Dengxian and the other big shots who had long been successful, it was the same.","They even had a feeling in their hearts that this was a peerless expert. Normally speaking, how could they not recognize such a person?","“This person is really terrifyingly strong. How can we not have heard of such a powerful expert?”","“Who is he?","“Damn it, why did he interfere?!” This was the Li Yuanjia and the Destiny Sect’s other experts’ anger.","However, Yang Dengxian and the others couldn’t help but reveal a happy smile. No matter how they looked at it, Chu Yunfan was helping them. No matter what their standpoint was, they were now on the same side.","With Chu Yunfan’s intervention, their pressure was greatly reduced.","At the same time, the remaining eight experts in the battle saw Chu Yunfan killing all the foreign experts like killing ants. They were almost scared out of their wits and planned to escape.."]},{"number":2062,"title":"Chapter 2062: Destiny Sect Is a Joke!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2062: Destiny Sect Is a Joke!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","What did it mean to scare the whole world with one’s own strength? This was its meaning.","These experts had naturally considered the danger involved when they first sneaked into Zhongzhou City to kill Chu Hongcai.","Putting aside the relationship between Chu Hongcai and Chu Yunfan, just the fact that they had ambushed and killed the geniuses of Grand Xia in such a grand manner would definitely incur the empire’s wrath.","If these foreign races were allowed to infiltrate the empire so arrogantly, there would be no more geniuses left in Grand Xia.","They might even attract the pursuit of the legendary Heavenly Punishment Army, but that was only a possibility. If they ended the battle quickly, the danger would be greatly reduced.","The entire Grand Xia Empire was simply too vast. If experts of their level truly wanted to flee, it would be too difficult to chase them down.","It wasn’t as if they hadn’t thought about the possibility of being hunted down by the supreme existence under the Grand Commandant’s Office.","However, the only thing they didn’t expect was that a master they had never seen before had appeared and slaughtered these Arcanes as if they were ants.","They were a little suspicious. Perhaps they had been in seclusion for too long and did not understand the experts in the world now at all.","After all, any one of them could go into seclusion for decades. The speed at which experts appeared in the world was too fast. They were just like leeks; after cutting a batch, another one would appear.","The fact that the Prodigy List constantly changed batch by batch was evidence of this.","Thinking of this, these experts instinctively began to escape.","However, how could Chu Yunfan let them off so easily?","“Do you think you can leave? Today, all of you will stay here!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and countless thunderbolts boiled in his hand, turning into eight blue spears in the air. They were exactly the same as the spear he had previously held.","Swoosh, swoosh!","The spears swept across the sky like bolts of lightning tearing through the night, heading toward those experts.","These Arcanes couldn’t resist these spears. They were pierced through one after another and died miserably.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “You want to kill the geniuses of our human race? 1 want to see how capable you are!”","He also collected their corpses.","When everyone heard this, their expressions changed drastically as if they had seen the most terrifying thing.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was like a demon god of the present age. He had an amazing killing ability that far exceeded the imagination of ordinary people.","His words made the experts in Zhongzhou feel extremely excited. At this moment, Grand Xia was fighting in all directions, and they were invincible.","The citizens of the empire were extremely ambitious. No matter how much resentment they had against each other, they didn’t want these foreign races to take advantage of them.","To many people, Chu Hongcai could die, but he couldn’t die in the hands of the foreign races.","After killing these foreign creatures, Chu Yunfan turned his gaze to the experts of the Destiny Sect. Immediately, the other side felt as if they had been targeted by a ferocious beast and had fallen into an ice cave.","“What do you want? It’s one thing to kill those foreign races, but now, do you want to interfere in the battle between our sect and the Flying Celestials? 1 don’t think you have the ability. Don’t make a mistake!” At this moment, one of the Destiny Sect’s elders who was fighting with the Fiery Phoenix flew out and stood in front of Chu Yunfan.","However, his heart was pounding. Chu Yunfan’s performance just now was too powerful. Those Arcanes couldn’t even withstand one move from him and were easily slaughtered.","This also gave everyone else a great shock. His fearsomeness made them tremble in fear.","“Destiny Sect?” Chu Yunfan sneered and looked coldly at the elder.","He hadn’t been out for a long time, but he had already learned a lot of things. During his seclusion, the Destiny Sect had used all kinds of methods to deal with him, Chu Hongcai, the External Army, and so on.","It was very easy for them to do this. If it weren’t for the Flying Celestials’ support, Chu Hongcai probably wouldn’t have been able to do this.","It could be said that from the moment Jun Tianci attacked Chu Yunfan, the grudge between the two sides had reached the point where they would not rest until one of them died. Jun Tianci almost killed Chu Yunfan, and this hatred was irreconcilable.","The Destiny Sect wouldn’t hand over Jun Tianci just because he had attacked Chu Yunfan. They would definitely protect him until the end.","From that moment on, there was no room for reconciliation between the two sides.","“Destiny Sect is a joke!”","In an instant, Chu Yunfan moved. He strode forward, and the blue spear in his","hand suddenly shot out. Its tip exploded into a blue ocean that spread out like waves.","“Why you...” The elder was shocked and furious. Chu Yunfan was too ruthless.","He didn’t care about the Destiny Sect’s reputation and was about to attack.","“Kill him!”","The elder was naturally not someone to be trifled with. A long saber appeared in his hand and he slashed at Chu Yunfan with a backhand.","The Destiny Saber!","Swing! Swing! Slash! Slash!","It was as if the fate of the entire world was about to be cut apart. The so-called “destiny” in their names was nothing in front of this blade.","The Destiny Sect’s elder was clearly much stronger than those foreign experts.","Those foreign experts were only Minor Arcanes while this elder was a Middle","Arcana. He was at least twice as strong as those foreign experts. The difference between the two of them was simply incomparable.","This was also the reason why he dared to jump out to stop Chu Yunfan.","However, in the next moment, everyone realized that their judgment was wrong. In front of Chu Yunfan’s spear, there was no difference at all.","Chu Yunfan’s blue spear pierced through everything and instantly shattered the Destiny Saber’s saber light. Then, the spear light did not slow down and swept toward the elder.","Slash!","The elder didn’t even have time to react before the spear pierced through his head. A bloody hole appeared, and his brain was instantly minced. All of his defensive magic treasures exploded in an instant, shattered by the spear.","‘Impossible!’ The elder was still in disbelief. He couldn’t even block Chu Yunfan’s spear with his strength.."]},{"number":2063,"title":"Chapter 2063: Peak of the Creation Stage, Minor Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2063: Peak of the Creation Stage, Minor Arcana Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan took the body of the elder of the Destiny Sect with a flip of his hand, and his eyes were calm.","A Middle Arcane?","More than ten years ago, before he was on the verge of death and went into seclusion to undergo rebirth, he was already enough to sweep away experts of this stage, let alone now.","Ten years of rebirth was a complete transformation for him. His entire life level had increased by another level.","The bloodline from the Immemorial Dark Phoenix brought this point to full play. Coupled with his Imperial Physique and Thunderclap Physique, it could be said that it was like adding wings to a tiger.","Until now, no one could see how far he had reached because these people did not even have the qualifications to make him use his full strength. Only he knew how much he had grown.","After more than ten years of rebirthing, his cultivation had already soared to the peak of the Creation Stage.","Compared to a dozen years ago, this was a drastic improvement. Even his battle prowess had risen from the Middle Arcane Stage to the Major Arcane Stage.","Even after more than ten years, many people thought that even if Chu Yunfan was lucky enough to survive and his cultivation didn’t fall sharply, he would still be stuck in the same spot.","Those who had been left behind by him had also advanced with great strides, completely surpassing his original stage.","Now, even Yang Taxian and the others had all stepped into the Arcana Stage. It seemed that they weren’t any weaker than when Chu Yunfan had gone missing more than ten years ago. It was even said that the top few had already stepped into the Middle Arcana Stage, and were even stronger than Chu","Yunfan.","In fact, although his cultivation speed was much slower than expected, he could still beat Yang Dengxian, Li Yuanjia, and the others.","The phoenix’s rebirth. Every rebirth was an improvement in the essence of life. Naturally, his strength would also increase hugely.","If it were an ordinary person, they would have been able to soar all the way in a dozen years. This speed was naturally not considered slow.","However, for Chu Yunfan, this was far from enough. Ten years ago, Jun Tianci was probably already at the Minor Arcana Stage. Now that more than ten years had passed, it was hard to say what level he had reached.","This was also the reason why Chu Yunfan did not choose to return to his original identity immediately. Instead, he changed his identity.","Of course, his fighting style was certainly distinct. It was only a matter of time before he was recognized.","However, he still wanted to buy himself some time. As long as he broke through to the Minor Arcane Stage, he would be able to break into the Middle","Arcane Stage in terms of combat power. He might even be able to fight against Jun Tianci from a decade ago.","At that time, he wouldn’t be as passive as he was in the past, even when facing","Jun Tianci.","Time was still the most precious thing to him. Although his strength had improved in the past ten years, most of it was still laying its foundation. This time, the phoenix rebirth allowed him to rebuild his foundation. As long as he was given some time, his cultivation would soar like a rocket and make up for the blank period of ten years.","At that time, he would be able to fight Jun Tianci!","Although his strength was still a bit weak for a master like Jun Tianci, it was more than enough to deal with these Arcanes.","After he killed the Destiny Sect’s elder, the entirety of Zhongzhou City was in an uproar. It was different from those foreign experts who had infiltrated the city.","Those foreign race experts dared to sneak into Zhongzhou. They were simply courting death.","However, the Destiny Sect was the number one force in the mainland. This person actually dared to completely fall out with them. Where did this fierce person come from?","“Who is this person? He doesn’t even care about the Destiny Sect!”","“Not only the foreign experts, but he didn’t even show mercy to the masters in the Destiny Sect!”","Many people were shocked by this massacre. Chu Yunfan was way too ruthless and powerful. Many of them even guessed that he might be the Destiny Sect’s mortal enemy.","This was also very possible. The Destiny Sect was the leader of the ten great powers of Grand Xia. In terms of strength, they were naturally the strongest among all of them. They had friends, but they had more enemies.","In the past countless years, they had offended countless people and forces. It was not impossible for a few of them to cultivate to their current level.","“Who exactly are you?” At this moment, the remaining four elders of the Destiny Sect also became vigilant. One of them restrained the Fiery Phoenix, while the remaining three blocked Chu Yunfan.","Terrifying energy and blood surged from these three, and their divine power was endless. In fact, their auras were connected together, almost causing the sky to tremble.","Their faces were filled with anger, but they did not attack rashly. They even used their defensive magic tools to block in front of them, afraid that Chu Yunfan would suddenly attack.","This was not the first time Chu Yunfan had done something like this. How could they not be prepared?","“Who exactly are you? You dare to go against my Destiny Sect? You’re courting death!”","At this moment, one of them spoke out. This elder was clearly stronger than the others. He had white hair and a youthful face, and in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, his cultivation base was at the Major Arcana Stage.","The others obviously followed his lead.","Chu Yunfan said calmly, “Name? You don’t need to know that. So what if I go against your sect? I’m going to kill you today to collect some interest from Jun Tianci and your sect. I’ll come back and kill him later!”","His words caused an uproar. Everyone finally understood that his true enemy wasn’t a senior from the Destiny Sect.","It was Jun Tianci, the most brilliant and talented person in the sect.","At this moment, the people from the sect finally understood why Chu Yunfan would help Chu Hongcai. It turned out that he was implicated by Jun Tianci.","However, they still couldn’t remember who this Chu Yunfan was.","After all, when Jun Tianci rose to power, he had defeated countless enemies. They were enemies that they knew on the surface. As for how many people he had defeated in secret and offended, even Jun Tianci himself couldn’t tell.","The leader of the Destiny Sect’s elders said coldly, “Aren’t you going too far? If you dare to appear today, you’ll be making an enemy of the entire Destiny Sect. Just you wait.. When that time comes, there won’t be a place for you in the sky or on the ground!”"]},{"number":2064,"title":"Chapter 2064: Stabbing Him to Death With One Spear","paragraphs":["Chapter 2064: Stabbing Him to Death With One Spear","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan looked at the leader of the elders and said, “So what if it’s the","Destiny Sect? Is your sect’s life more precious than others?”","The elder didn’t avoid it and said directly, “That’s right. The lives of my Destiny Sect are more noble than others!”","The pride of being born in a famous sect had already seeped into his blood. This was also the source of all their strength and pride.","The Destiny Sect was more noble than other sects!","This was the principle of the world. The death of a disciple in the Destiny Sect was more shocking than the death of a sect leader from an ordinary small sect.","Just the name of the Destiny Sect was enough to intimidate everyone. This was the name of the sect that countless ancestors had fought for.","Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile, “What’s the difference? It’s just a corpse anyway!’","Many experts in Zhongzhou were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s words. In their eyes, he was extremely powerful, making people feel excited.","Chu Yunfan was too powerful. Forget about those foreign experts, he didn’t even care about the Destiny Sect.","He dared to find fault with the sect alone.","“What kind of person is he? Why haven’t I heard of him before? Judging from his style of doing things, he shouldn’t be unknown!”","Many people were discussing animatedly. Opposite Chu Yunfan, the killing intent in the eyes of the Destiny Sect’s elders became even colder.","They weren’t afraid of powerful opponents, but they were most afraid of people like Chu Yunfan, who had no respect for the sect. This kind of person was more difficult to deal with than any other powerful existence.","Without respect in their hearts, they might cause even greater losses to the Destiny Sect. However, an expert who knew respect was not worth mentioning because such a person would not dare to attack the famous sect.","Many people held their breaths as they watched Chu Yunfan walk toward the three elders. Blood was still flowing from the tip of his spear as it dripped, forming an extremely terrifying scene.","With the Destiny Sect’s power, there were very few forces in the world that could defeat them, and this man wanted to challenge such a powerful behemoth.","“All of you can stay here!” Chu Yunfan looked at them and asked, “Doesn’t your Destiny Sect like to kill geniuses and its opponents? I’ll give you a chance now! ”","The three elders’ expressions drastically changed because they could already feel that Chu Yunfan had already made up his mind. He would not be scared away by the sect’s name.","It was impossible for them to ask to settle the scores now.","Chu Yunfan raised the blue spear in his hand. The light that belonged to lightning bloomed on it, and the blood essence in his body instantly erupted to the extreme.","Boom!","In an instant, he struck out with the spear. Its light swept across the sky and directly turned into a blue lightning bolt that covered the three elders.","Swoosh!","At this moment, the three elders of the Destiny Sect reacted in an instant. The three of them cooperated very well. Two of them actually hid in front of two shields to block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","The last one, who was the leader, had a long saber in his hand. He slashed through the sky and earth, also attacking Chu Yunfan.","The Destiny Saber—one slash to cut the heavens, one slash to cut the earth, and one slash to cut fate!","Boom!","The spear and saber lights collided. The terrifying attack turned into a dazzling light that filled the sky, forming a small mushroom cloud.","This was an astonishing clash between Arcanes!","Then, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s spear light shatter the Destiny Saber’s light almost instantly. The blue light seemed to have turned into a blue dragon that crossed and shattered the entire atmosphere in an instant.","Above Zhongzhou City, the array was activated, covering the entire city.","It was automatically activated by the aftershock of the battle between the two sides. The aftershock of the battle spread out layer by layer and was blocked outside by the array in Zhongzhou City.","When the experts in the city saw this scene, they felt their hair stand on end and their backs turn cold. It was as if they had just been fished out of an ice cave.","Just the aftershock of the battle could completely annihilate them. The existence of these two people in the sky was really too terrifying.","Boom!","Immediately after, everyone saw that the Destiny Saber in the leader’s hand had instantly shattered. After a loud sound, it turned into ashes.","The power of the azure spear in Chu Yunfan’s hand was too terrifying.","On the other side, the elder took a few steps back, only extreme shock in his eyes.","In the one-on-one collision, he was completely at a disadvantage. At this moment, he could feel his internal organs trembling and even bleeding from the rupture. If it weren’t for his powerful cultivation that forcefully kept his internal organs from exploding, his entire body would have combusted by now.","At this moment, he truly understood how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. One had to know that his aura was hidden too well. It could be said that he looked like a person who had never cultivated, but the moment he attacked, all of his hidden strength instantly erupted.","This was like a wild beast hunting. Before it could attack, it would retract its fangs and claws, waiting for an opportunity to kill its prey in one strike.","Once they attacked, their hidden fangs and claws could kill their target in one strike.","Yes, now he finally understood what Chu Yunfan’s calm gaze meant. He was just his prey.","At first, he was furious, but then, boundless fear surged up.","He understood in an instant that he was no match for Chu Yunfan. If he continued to stay, he would die.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it had only happened in an instant!","After Chu Yunfan’s blue spear shattered the Destiny Saber’s light, its momentum did not decrease. It directly smashed into the defensive array formed by the Destiny Sect’s other two elders.","The two shields grew bigger and bigger in the wind, directly blocking in front of Chu Yunfan.","On the other hand, the spear was like a roaring dragon, killing gods and buddhas in its way. It pierced through the two shields in an instant.","Stab!","After successfully piercing, the spear stabbed into one of the elders and killed him instantly.."]},{"number":2065,"title":"Chapter 2065: Kill All of Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 2065: Kill All of Them","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The spear pierced through the shield and the two elders suffered backlash from it. They spat out a mouthful of blood almost instantly and flew backward.","However, the leader of the elders was even more miserable. He was instantly stabbed to death by Chu Yunfan.","Although he was obviously stronger than the others, it was meaningless in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s battle prowess was already at the peak of the Minor Arcana Stage. It could even be said that there was no one stronger than him among the Minor Arcanes. In fact, there was no one who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him.","Unless he encountered someone in the Middle Arcana Stage, nobody would be any different when facing Chu Yunfan!","Power... This was the meaning of power.","The lead elder’s eyes were still wide open before he died. He couldn’t believe that with his current cultivation, he couldn’t even block a single spear strike from Chu Yunfan.","One had to know that even when facing a Peak Middle Arcane, he would still be able to fight back. Even though he couldn’t beat them, he would still be able to protect himself. With the help of the other two elders, even if he couldn’t beat the opponent, he wouldn’t have ended up like this.","However, he didn’t understand that comparing Chu Yunfan with others was the beginning of his death.","“Run!”","At this moment, the remaining two elders who were severely injured immediately had the thought of escaping. They instantly began to make their move.","“Trying to escape? You’re too late!” Chu Yunfan sneered and made a hand seal.","In the sky, countless lightning bolts gathered together. Then, he grabbed them in his hand and turned them into two spears before throwing them out.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","The spears tore through the sky and exploded with extremely unpleasant sounds. In the next moment, they had already pierced through the two elders and nailed them to death in the air.","Their bodies could not move at all. Almost in an instant, all their vitality had","been cut off.","Chu Yunfan reached out with his big hand and grabbed their corpses and put them into the Mountain River Diagram.","His moves were simple and direct.","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing slaughter. All kinds of supernatural powers and martial arts techniques were useless against him. Moreover, a spear he formed from lightning could actually be so powerful.","This made many experts who had been thinking about refining magic weapons all day feel ashamed, because even if they had magic weapons, they could not display Chu Yunfan’s strength.","The extent of power which a magic treasure could display depended on the strength of the user.","Chu Yunfan’s level was obviously higher. He was like a magic weapon that could fight against other weapons with his bare hands. His own strength was invincible, and no one could compare to him.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in just a moment, the three elders of the Destiny Sect had already died before Chu Yunfan.","“You’re courting death!” the last elder yelled. His eyes were bloodshot and he was extremely furious.","He had seen Chu Yunfan slaughter his companions with shock and anger, but it was impossible for him to leave the battle. He had been holding the Fiery Phoenix back so that it could not support Chu Yunfan in time.","However, now that Chu Yunfan had killed all of the Destiny Sect’s elders, it was now the Fiery Phoenix that was blocking his way. Even if he wanted to break out of the encirclement, there was no way for him to escape from its sea of flames.","“The Destiny Sect won’t let you off!”","At this moment, he grabbed at the void and took out a flag. This flag swelled up with the wind and instantly grew to the size of a small mountain.","He waved it with great difficulty. The flames that the Fiery Phoenix had spat out were flying in the opposite direction. Instead, they were blowing in the phoenix’s direction.","The Fiery Phoenix was instantly flustered. Although it had spat out these flames and had the divine power to control fire, these flames were not ordinary flames. They were a divine type.","Even the powerful phoenix could not resist these divine flames.","Immediately, the Fiery Phoenix retreated, and the elder’s face revealed a hint of joy. He had accidentally obtained this magic weapon. It was called the Clear Spirit Wind Stabilizing Flag. It was a wind-type weapon. Once used, it would cause a strong wind and blow away all kinds of attacks.","It could be said that it was a combination of attack and defense. The divine wind that blew out could even dissipate the flesh and bones of a person. It was extremely terrifying.","However, he was facing a terrifying divine bird like the Fiery Phoenix. It was almost impossible for him to blow away the phoenix’s flesh and bones. However, he never planned on doing such a thing. He only wanted to stall for time and find a gap to escape.","‘Leaving is the best plan!’ The elder grabbed the flag and fled into the distance almost instantly.","In an instant, he turned into a stream of light and wanted to escape from Zhongzhou.","This place was really too terrifying. Such a terrifying being was actually hiding here.","All of the Destiny Sect’s previous plans had failed. Not only did Xiang Feiyun, who was originally regarded as their next generation’s hope, die in Chu","Hongcai’s hands, but even a large number of their Arcane elders had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. He didn’t have time to care about anything else, not even Li Yuanjia.","At this moment, Li Yuanjia also began to panic. He roared repeatedly, trying to push Yang Dengxian back and buy himself enough time to escape.","However, Yang Dengxian suddenly became serious and kept blocking his way.","“Yang Dengxian, is the Flying Celestials Sect trying to completely fall out with the Destiny Sect?!” Li Yuanjia shouted in alarm.","Yang Dengxian sneered. “So what if we fall out? The Destiny Sect organized such a lineup of experts to ambush Chu Hongcai. Isn’t that the same as starting war with us?”","The Flying Celestials were indeed not as strong as the Destiny Sect, but they were not pushovers either.","The Destiny Sect’s painstaking efforts to kill Chu Hongcai made him furious.","Jun Tianci!s ambush on Chu Yunfan had already infuriated the entire Flying Celestials. If Chu Hongcai’s incident happened again, the whole sect would be thoroughly enraged.."]},{"number":2066,"title":"Chapter 2066: Jun Tianci Reappears?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2066: Jun Tianci Reappears?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Yang Dengxian had long understood that the conflict between the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect was getting more and more intense. It was not the first time that the two sides had clashed in various fields.","Over the years, their hostility had only grown more intense!","It was because the competitiveness between the two sects in various fields had only increased over the years!","Even if they didn’t fall out with each other, they were only missing a layer of skin before they would start fighting.","For many years, they had maintained their bottom lines without breaking it!","This time, the Destiny Sect was the first to shed all pretense of cordiality and wanted to kill Chu Hongcai. Even if they died here, they had nothing to say. This was also one of the rules.","Moreover, the person who attacked was not an expert from the Flying Celestials. Instead, it was an unknown expert who had suddenly appeared, despite his slightly familiar attacks.","However, just as Yang Dengxian was still in shock, a terrifying bolt of lightning suddenly tore through the sky and caught up to the Destiny Sect elder who was trying to flee.","It was just a simple strike, but it had pierced through the elder and nailed him in the air.","This scene was too shocking, and it immediately scared the remaining two experts of the Destiny Sect.","At this point, besides Xiang Feiyun’s original protector, there was only Li Yuanjia left.","Just as Yang Dengxian was about to hold Li Yuanjia back, Xiang Feiyun’s protector suddenly exploded. He broke through Chu Hongcai’s protector’s blockade and directly in front of Yang Dengxian, forcing him back in one fell swoop.","The old protector said to Li Yuanjia, “Hurry up and leave. I’ll stop him!”","“As long as I’m alive, your family will be glorious!” Li Yuanjia said without turning his head.","Afterward, his figure instantly fled without stopping. The old protector was about to erupt with his last bit of energy to fight Yang Dengxian.","However, a blue light descended from the sky and pierced through his body. The defensive barrier and magic tools he had shattered in an instant. He had no ability to resist at all and was pierced to death.","However, his face revealed a gratified expression. As long as Li Yuanjia escaped, his family would not decline.","Although the Destiny Sect was a colossus, it was also divided into different forces, branches, and families. It was like a hodgepodge.","His existence was the pillar of his family. With his strength, he wanted to personally become Xiang Feiyun’s protector because he had taken a fancy to his potential. In the future, it was almost the instinct of many experts in Grand Xia to help his family advance.","They were born in their clans and sects, and they rose up in those same places. Therefore, they were destined to risk everything for their clans and sects in this life.","However, at the same time, there were many internal struggles for power in the Destiny Sect. Without him, the benefits that his family had swallowed would be forced out and they would never be able to turn things around.","However, with Li Yuanjia’s care, everything was different. He could rest in peace.","Since he was going to die anyway, it was better to die for something more valuable.","However, in the next moment, he saw something that made his eyes widen in anger. Li Yuanjia, who had just escaped, was frozen in midair as if he was bound by a huge force.","A huge foot stomped down along with endless netherworld water.","Bam!","Li Yuanjia tried his best to defend himself, but when faced with the foot, he was unable to resist. His body was crushed by it.","The old protector let out a miserable cry before dying, “l can’t accept this!” At this point, all of the Destiny Sect’s experts had been wiped out.","The entire battlefield was deathly silent. The experts in Zhongzhou were frightened by this terrifying massacre.","Before this, they had clearly seen Li Yuanjia run far away. Logically speaking, he should have been able to escape. However, he was caught by Chu Yunfan in an instant. Everyone only saw a beam of light streaking across the sky. In the next moment, Chu Yunfan caught up with Li Yuanjia and trampled him into pieces.","Not only was there a difference in strength between the two sides but also an absolute difference in speed. That was why Chu Yunfan could easily catch up.","“He’s way too strong and terrifying. I’m afraid the Destiny Sect is going to go crazy!’","Many people couldn’t help but say with their mouths agape. The sect had lost so many experts in one go, and they had even lost two of their top geniuses, Li Yuanjia and Xiang Feiyun. They would probably explode the moment they received the news.","Everyone could imagine how furious they would be when they found out. With their strength, the entire world would probably tremble.","Especially since this matter was related to the Flying Celestials Sect, the confrontation between the two giants would be even more terrifying.","Although the Destiny Sect was in the this time and set up an ambush to deal with Chu Hongcai, they didn’t expect that not only did they fail to kill him, but they would also suffer a huge loss.","However, the Destiny Sect had always been one where those who obeyed would prosper, and those who resisted would die. How could they give up so easily?","Even if they were facing a behemoth like the Flying Celestials, who was also one of the top ten forces, they would not let this matter rest so easily.","Suddenly, just as the protector was about to die, a terrifying aura was released from his body. Then, a figure drilled out of his body.","An extremely cold voice rang, “Who is it? How dare they attack my successor?” Then, a handsome man appeared before everyone.","“That... Isn’t Jun Tianci, is it?” someone said with uncertainty because this person looked very much like Jun Tianci.","However, everyone knew that Jun Tianci couldn’t possibly be here, so this person looked very strange.","Especially since he had come out of the corpse of Xiang Feiyun’s protector. All of this seemed so bizarre.","“That’s Jun Tianci!”","There were also people who were very certain that the person who had appeared was Jun Tianci. His face was too impressive. With his identity, strength, and status, who would dare to impersonate him and deceive people? Wasn’t that just asking for death?","“It really is him!”","At this moment, Yang Dengxian had just recovered from the joy of Li Yuanjia’s death when he realized the identity of the person in front of him. Wasn’t he Jun Tianci?","The others had never seen the man before, so they could only make vague guesses. However, Yang Dengxian had seen Jun Tianci before, so he was all too familiar with the latter’s aura.."]},{"number":2067,"title":"Chapter 2067: The Horror of That Blade, You’re Not Jun Tianci!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2067: The Horror of That Blade, You’re Not Jun Tianci!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","That was because Jun Tianci’s aura was like a saber that dominated the world.","It was impossible for anyone to imitate it.","It was impossible for anyone to impersonate that terrifying existence.","Even though his cultivation base was vastly different from the first time he met Jun Tianci, it was more than a thousand times stronger.","His cultivation had even entered the Arcana Stage, and he was ranked among the top in the world. However, he was still very afraid when he thought of Jun Tianci.","Jun Tianci was the Destiny Sect’s chief disciple and their next sect leader, while Yang Dengxian was the Flying Celestials Sect’s next sect leader.","They were both future sect leaders, but the difference between them was like heaven and earth. Apart from the disadvantage brought about by their age gap, even he had to admit that Jun Tianci was stronger than him in terms of talent.","Even if they were the same age, he was probably no match for Jun Tianci.","This was a great humiliation for him, but he had to admit the existence of that gap. To ordinary people, he was already a genius that could only be seen in myths and legends.","However, there was a huge difference between the geniuses themselves. If he was an ordinary genius, then Jun Tianci wasn’t a human. He was a monster.","In all these years, he had only seen one person who could rival this monster, and that was Chu Yunfan!","Unfortunately, Chu Yunfan had fallen at Jun Tianci’s hands before he could grow up. It could be said that this alone was enough to make the Flying Celestials feel bitter and furious.","Chu Hongcai’s protection standards were much stronger than Yang","Dengxian’s in order to prevent similar things from happening again.","A peerless prodigy who could lead the Flying Celestials Sect to rise up had already fallen. They could no longer afford to lose another one.","Although Yang Dengxian, a high-ranking official in the sect, knew far more than the average person and knew that Chu Yunfan did not die at that time, so many years had passed and no news had spread. Many people deduced that Chu Yunfan was probably doomed.","Others also guessed some things from the traces left on the battle. If it were them, they would not even have the ability to resist. They would basically die if they touched it.","Even if Chu Yunfan survived, his strength would probably be greatly reduced, and he would not be able to climb up to where he was before.","The person who had caused all this was Jun Tianci. One could imagine how fearful Yang Dengxian was.","Almost instantly, his hair stood on end, and the divine power in his entire body was condensed to the extreme. If anything was wrong, he would immediately escape.","Yes, he had to. He had no chance of winning against Jun Tianci. It would already be very difficult for him to survive.","Jun Tianci had even dared to attack Chu Yunfan, let alone him.","However, after Jun Tianci appeared, he didn’t even look at Yang Dengxian. It seemed that he didn’t care about him at all. Despite that, his movements weren’t slow. He turned his hand and slashed at Yang Dengxian.","“Destiny Saber! ”","Yang Dengxian’s pupils contracted slightly. Jun Tianci’s level was obviously not the same as the others. He was able to display the power of the Destiny Saber using only his hand. He didn’t need a magic weapon.","The power he displayed was at least several times stronger than Li Yuanjia, who was facing Yang Dengxian just now.","Yang Dengxian hurriedly retreated. He activated all sorts of defensive moves, barriers, and magic tools in an instant. However, they were still cut open by Jun Tianci’s hand.","Yang Dengxian’s defenses were like paper, being demolished in an instant.","Swoosh!","Soon, a huge crack appeared on his chest. He was just a little bit away from being cut in half by the saber light that erupted from Jun Tianci’s hand.","At this time, Yang Dengxian had already run more than a hundred kilometers away.","“Huff, huff, huff!”","He panted heavily, his entire body trembling.","Just now, he was on the knife’s edge. He did not choose to resist head-on. The moment he cast all kinds of defensive barriers and divine arts, he retreated.","And now, reality had proven that his combat talent and premonition were extremely sharp.","Even though he had reacted so quickly, he was still almost cut in half by Jun Tianci’s hand. Even so, a huge crack still appeared on his chest.","But at this moment, he was covered in cold sweat, and the intense pain was suppressed. He only felt lucky that he had escaped death.","Although many years had passed, he suddenly recalled the first time he saw Jun Tianci in action.","At that time, Jun Tianci had defeated a prodigy on the Prodigy List who had tried to challenge him with an unstoppable force. Just like that unknown expert, he had killed him with one blow and swept the whole area.","Among his peers, no one was his match at all.","The second place on the Prodigy List was not inferior to Li Qianyuan, who was in the following year. However, when he faced Jun Tianci, he had no power to fight back.","Their battle was almost a replica of the scene when Chu Yunfan beat Li Qianyuan up. This was why many people thought that only Chu Yunfan could compete with Jun Tianci.","After so many years, he had almost forgotten the shock that Jun Tianci’s battle had given him. But now, just a simple hand chop had instantly reminded him of that terrifying memory.","However, just being able to escape from this attack made him feel very fortunate.","“You’re not Jun Tianci!”","Yang Dengxian said slowly. His eyes were clear with a hint of fanaticism.","“Although 1 don’t want to admit it if even Yang Dengxian said so, then there must be something going on!’","Yang Dengxian’s words immediately caused an uproar in Zhongzhou.","The strike just now was too fast and looked too ordinary. Many people couldn’t see the mystery behind it, but they could compare it. Of course, they knew Yang Dengxian’s name and strength.","Compared to a decade ago, he was now one of the top figures in the Flying","Celestials Sect.","No one dared to treat him as a junior and ignore him.","Even in the battles with many seniors, he wasn’t at a disadvantage. Now, he had entered the Arcana Stage.","However, a person of this level was severely injured by Jun Tianci with just one simple move and almost died.","Everyone could see that if they hadn’t dodged quickly, that slash would have been enough to cut Yang Dengxian in half.","Despite all that, Yang Dengxian claimed that this person was not Jun Tianci.","Instantly, the entire city was in an uproar!"]},{"number":2068,"title":"Chapter 2068: I’ll Kill You First, Then I’ll Kill Your Original Body!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2068: I’ll Kill You First, Then I’ll Kill Your Original Body!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“If it’s not Jun Tianci, who else could it be?”","“Someone is impersonating Jun Tianci?”","“That’s impossible! Who would be so bold as to impersonate him?!”","For a moment, everyone was stunned by this explosive news.","This person wasn’t Jun Tianci, but he had Jun Tianci’s looks. Many people felt that today’s events came in waves of shock, and they didn’t seem to stop at all.","“He is indeed not Jun Tianci, but just an incarnation of him!”","Just as everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan spoke. He looked at Jun Tianci coldly.","Of course, he knew that the person in front of him wasn’t Jun Tianci, but he was related to that man.","Just like Yang Dengxian, there was no need to think too much about it. Even a dozen years ago, Jun Tianci’s level wasn’t so low.","Back when Jun Tianci had dealt with Chu Yunfan, he had played with Chu Yunfan like a cat toying with a mouse. Back then, Chu Yunfan was already several times stronger than Yang Dengxian.","If the real Jun Tianci had been present, it would not have been difficult for him to kill Yang Dengxian instantly.","After all, even Chu Yunfan could easily kill Li Yuanjia, whose strength was similar to Yang Dengxian’s.","This was also why Yang Dengxian could easily determine that this wasn’t the original Jun Tianci at all.","However, his eyesight was still not as good as Chu Yunfan’s. He couldn’t tell that this wasn’t just a simple impostor, but an incarnation.","“So it’s an incarnation!”","Everyone was enlightened. No wonder he looked like Jun Tianci and appeared out of thin air at this time. Many people knew about the divine ability to incarnate, but generally speaking, the incarnations’ strength was usually far inferior to the original body.","However, they couldn’t tell because neither Jun Tianci’s original body nor his incarnation was an existence that they could look up to.","“l knew it. Who would have the guts to impersonate Jun Tianci?!”","“However, this happening should be no surprise. Xiang Feiyun is his disciple, and he’s even a disciple who has a chance of reaching the top of the Prodigy List. There shouldn’t be many such talents among his followers. If he’s properly nurtured, he’ll definitely be a helping hand for him in the future!”","“That’s right. It’s normal for him to leave a backup plan on Xiang Feiyun!’ Many experts in Zhongzhou immediately understood the situation.","There were many types of divine powers when it came to incarnating, but generally speaking, the strength the incarnation had was often less than one percent or even one-thousandth of the original body’s strength.","There were some powerful incarnation spells that could make the manifestation have the same strength as the original body, but at the same time, they also had to pay a considerable price. This came in either the price of their life or from various natural treasures.","It was obvious that the cost of condensing such an incarnation was not small. After all, this version of Jun Tianci could almost kill an Arcane like Yang Dengxian. It wasn’t ordinary.","However, if he had placed it on the disciple he thought highly of, then everything made more sense.","After all, no matter how much it cost to do incarnation spells, it wasn’t more important than Xiang Feiyun.","Chu Yunfan could see it clearly. Jun Tianci’s incarnation did not come out from Xiang Feiyun’s body but from his protector’s body. It was obvious that Jun Tianci wanted to use it at a critical moment to protect Xiang Feiyun.","Generally speaking, protectors would risk their lives to protect the person they chose.","Otherwise, all their previous efforts would be in vain.","However, Jun Tianci probably didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be able to kill the protector in one hit. He didn’t even have the chance to use it.","Jun Tianci must have used some kind of secret technique to condense this incarnation when the protector died.","While everyone was discussing, Jun Tianci’s incarnation frowned slightly. He knew his mission. If he didn’t show up, it wouldn’t be a big deal. However, once he did, it often meant that the worst situation had happened.","However, the reality was worse than he had initially expected. Xiang Feiyun’s protector was already dead, but Xiang Feiyun could not see it.","He didn’t care that he didn’t kill Yang Dengxian with one strike. He just looked at Chu Yunfan. He could feel that the strongest person in the scene was none other than Chu Yunfan.","The aura of the protector who killed him was exactly the same as Chu","Yunfan’s aura.","He said coldly, “Hand over Xiang Feiyun’s corpse and I will leave your body intact! ”","This made everyone feel a little strange. Logically speaking, Jun Tianci had paid a huge price to prepare an incarnation that could stay by Xiang Feiyun’s side and protect him. He should have valued this disciple very much.","However, from his words, one could only feel endless coldness. It was as if he","did not care about Xiang Feiyun.","He only cared about the corpse.","Chu Yunfan grinned. He wasn’t surprised. Ten years ago, Jun Tianci didn’t even care that his fiancee had been humiliated. If it weren’t for the fact that he needed Chu Yunfan’s heart blood, he probably wouldn’t have come personally.","At most, he would’ve had the Destiny Sect and his followers target Chu","Yunfan.","Even his fiancee was treated so coldly, so it was only natural for him to be so heartless to his disciple.","However, since he did not care much about Xiang Feiyun, why did he leave such a method by Xiang Feiyun’s side?","“Xiang Feiyun’s corpse is in my hands. Come and get it if you have the ability!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","Just now, he had sealed Xiang Feiyun’s corpse in the Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan asked with interest, “Hey, since you don’t care much about Xiang Feiyun, why did you hide such a method? What do you want from this disciple of yours?”","Jun Tianci frowned and replied coldly, “You’re playing with fire. I don’t care who you are or what your intentions are. If you don’t hand over Xiang Feiyun’s body, I’ll kill you!","“Hahahahaha, kill me? Do you think this is your true body?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter, his eyes flashing with sharp killing intent. “You and your original body are equally annoying. Fine, I’ll kill you first before I kill him!”","His declaration completely shocked many experts in Zhongzhou. Chu Yunfan must have a life-and-death grudge with Jun Tianci. Otherwise, no one would be willing to offend such a top expert for no reason.","Despite that, he actually wanted to find trouble with Jun Tianci?","“What an arrogant tone.. But for some reason, he’s still somewhat believable!”"]},{"number":2069,"title":"Chapter 2069: Killing Jun Tianci’s Incarnation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2069: Killing Jun Tianci’s Incarnation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s words were extremely arrogant. Not only did he want to kill Jun","Tianci’s incarnation, but he also wanted to kill his original body. He was really arrogant.","However, for some reason, everyone felt that his words weren’t unbelievable since they came from Chu Yunfan.","It was a wonderful feeling. They couldn’t even tell why they trusted him so much.","His statement wasn’t only arrogant, but also implausible. Despite that, without any basic common sense, it was still very believable under Chu Yunfan’s calm expression.","Jun Tianci said coldly, “Kill my true body? Can you achieve that?”","His expression didn’t change at all. It was as heartless as ever.","However, his gaze toward Chu Yunfan was already filled with murderous intent.","No matter what, this unknown fellow must not be left alive!","In the next moment, Jun Tianci made his move. He grabbed at the empty space with his big hand, and countless spirit energy condensed into a long saber. The light instantly cut through the sky and shook the space.","The power of his attack was obvious. It was almost at the peak of the Minor Arcana Stage and was more than twice stronger than the Destiny Sect’s chief elder, whom Chu Yunfan had killed.","Although he was only an incarnation and the power he could use was far from his original body, it was undeniable that his comprehension of martial arts was still there.","With this move, he displayed his extremely powerful strength.","At this moment, the elegance of a true top-notch prodigy was completely displayed.","However, Chu Yunfan only sneered and then shot out with his spear.","The spear’s radiance shook the space, forming a terrifying shockwave that swept toward Jun Tianci.","The martial arts displayed by both sides were not based on divine weapons, but rather condensed by their divine arts. However, the power of these martial arts was much stronger than ordinary magic tools. This was the style of top-notch experts.","Boom!","A huge mushroom cloud slowly rose above Zhongzhou. Everyone was terrified. The terrifying aftershock caused by the battle between the two sides shook their hearts.","It could be said that they wouldn’t even be able to see such a terrifying collision like that in their lifetime.","In the distance, Yang Dengxian protected Chu Hongcai and retreated. At this moment, only Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci were left on the battlefield. The others did not dare to join them. Otherwise, they would simply die.","Yang Dengxian looked at the two figures on the battlefield with a complicated expression in his eyes. Chu Yunfan’s background was unknown, so his feelings were not deep.","However, Jun Tianci was different. Everyone knew that he was a top-notch expert in the world.","If his true body had come personally and only had such strength, Yang Dengxian could still comfort himself.","After all, everyone knew Jun Tianci’s talent and strength. Not only did he crush his peers, but even some of the older generations were no match and were easily defeated by him.","But now, it was only his incarnation, yet it actually had strength that Yang","Dengxian could not match. Just how powerful was Jun Tianci’s original body?","At the thought of this, even with his firm cultivation heart, he felt a little shaken.","With his talent, he might not be able to catch up to Jun Tianci even if he cultivated for a lifetime. This was not just caused by the difference in age.","When the next generation took over, both sides would be on the same level, but he would still be one level lower than Jun Tianci.","This feeling was not good, but he had to accept it.","Presumably, since ancient times, those geniuses who were born in the same era as the monsters probably had the same depressed mood as he did.","At this moment, he could understand the way ordinary geniuses looked at him. It was probably the same way he looked at Jun Tianci now.","The difference between the two was so great that it was difficult for him to even have the thought of comparing. If he even tried to, the one who would be hurt would still be himself.","Just as Yang Dengxian was letting his imagination run wild, the situation on the battlefield suddenly changed again. From the mushroom cloud, a figure rushed out at lightning speed.","He took a closer look. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan was holding the spear in his hand. In an instant, he appeared in front of Jun Tianci as if he had teleported.","Jun Tianci kept retreating, his face slightly ashen. In the collision just now, he was actually at a disadvantage.","Although he was only an incarnation, it was already a great humiliation for him.","Ever since he started his career, no one had ever been able to put him at a disadvantage. The only time he was at a disadvantage was more than ten years ago with that annoying fellow.","Thinking of this, the long saber in his hand that had been shattered by Chu Yunfan condensed again, emitting waves of terrifying light.","The saber light swept out in an instant and slashed toward Chu Yunfan. However, almost in the next moment, he saw a scene that shocked him. Chu Yunfan slapped down with his palm.","Bam!","The saber light he slashed out was shattered, turning into light spots that filled the sky and dissipated in the air.","“What kind of physical cultivation is this?” Jun Tianci’s face revealed a look of horror.","Chu Yunfan had been using spear techniques all this time and had not really used his physical cultivation. This made him misjudge that his physical cultivation was only so-so.","But now, Chu Yunfan had given him a hard slap in the face.","Suddenly, after his saber shattered, Chu Yunfan’s spear tore through the sky. Like the beak of a phoenix, it instantly pierced into his body.","The spear tore Jun Tianci’s body apart. His body, which was made up of pure energy and primordial spirit, shattered on the spot and turned into a rain of light that filled the sky.","At this moment, everyone finally saw that there was a wooden puppet in Jun Tianci’s body. The puppet was emitting powerful energy fluctuations, but Chu","Yunfan had pierced through the puppet with a spear.","From this, it shattered inch by inch.","Although it was hiding in Jun Tianci’s body, Chu Yunfan still saw through it and pierced right through the puppet.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “So he used an incarnation puppet. No wonder he had such strength!”","The incarnation puppet was a special magic treasure that could condense a powerful incarnation by using the puppet as the core.","However, this kind of incarnation puppet was quite rare and its price was extremely high.."]},{"number":2070,"title":"Chapter 2070: A Storm Bound to Rise","paragraphs":["Chapter 2070: A Storm Bound to Rise","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, with Jun Tianci’s status, it wasn’t strange for him to have such an incarnation puppet.","Although it was a rare thing for ordinary people, it was not too rare for Chu","Yunfan.","The entirety of Zhongzhou City fell silent.","“He did it!”","When someone spat out this sentence. , it was as if a pot of oil had exploded.","Everyone was stunned by Chu Yunfan’s shocking attack.","Their previous judgments had completely collapsed.","That was Jun Tianci!","Although the chances of ordinary people seeing Jun Tianci in action were very few in recent years, the image of him running amok in the world still kept appearing in everyone’s mind.","Not to mention, even his disciple had grown up and could compete for the number one position on the Prodigy List.","Jun Tianci had grown to become a legendary figure.","He had not fought in front of others for a long time. In the eyes of everyone, he was already a legend.","The last time he made a move was when he was dealing with Chu Yunfan.","However, everyone remembered that Chu Yunfan was number one on the previous Prodigy List. When he was around, it could be said that the prodigies were helpless. Even Tang Siyu, who later became the number one on the Prodigy List, could not surpass his existence.","Many people believed that Chu Yunfan was someone who could possibly contend with Jun Tianci in the future. This was also why many people believed that was the reason why he had attacked Chu Yunfan. It was to eliminate his future obstacle as soon as possible.","Only Chu Yunfan himself knew how proud Jun Tianci was. He didn’t even care about getting rid of him.","Even if he wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, it was definitely not because he was afraid of him!","Jun Tianci didn’t care about anyone else.","If Chu Yunfan stood in his way and hindered his interests, Jun Tianci would’ve still killed him, but it was definitely not because he was afraid of Chu Yunfan’s threat.","A threat? To him, such a thing didn’t exist!","If Li Qianyuan was resurrected now, would Chu Yunfan put him in his eyes?","Of course not!","When his strength was far inferior to Li Qianyuan, Chu Yunfan was not afraid, let alone now that his strength was far above Li Qianyuan.","With his current strength, killing Li Qianyuan was even easier than when Jun Tianci dealt with Chu Yunfan. He could easily kill Li Qianyuan with one blow.","Moreover, this gap would continue to increase as time passed.","Even if ten Li Qianyuan were tied together, they would still not be Chu","Yunfan’s match!","Of course, if he had to, Chu Yunfan would still find a way to kill Li Qianyuan as soon as possible. It was not because he was afraid that Li Qianyuan would threaten him, but he just needed to avoid some trouble.","After all, although Chu Yunfan was fearless, it was inevitable that Li Qianyuan would do something that he would regret.","Therefore, he understood Jun Tianci!s thoughts all too well.","The others didn’t know what Chu Yunfan was thinking. They only thought that Jun Tianci had killed Chu Yunfan because he felt threatened.","However, when Chu Yunfan killed the incarnation, it still caused a huge commotion.","There was only one incarnation of Jun Tianci present, but was his incarnation really so weak?","Anyone with discerning eyes could see that his incarnation was extremely powerful!","Yang Dengxian was already considered a first-class giant and expert. His battle with Li Yuanjia was earth-shattering, and he even had the upper hand. It could be said that he had far surpassed the people on the Prodigy List who were above him in the past.","However, he was still no match for Jun Tianci’s incarnation.","After all, he was almost killed by just the incarnation’s hand!","That scene was something that many people would never forget for the rest of their lives.","Despite that, Jun Tianci’s incarnation was still no match for Chu Yunfan.","“Who is he? How can he be so terrifying?!”","“He isn’t afraid of Jun Tianci at all. I’m afraid he must have a huge conflict with Jun Tianci!”","“I’m afraid there will be a huge storm next. The top prodigies of this generation that they nurtured have died, and a large number of their elders have died. It would be strange if the Destiny Sect let this matter go!’","“However, I reckon that this man’s identity won’t be able to be concealed for long. After doing such a thing, I’m afraid that everyone in the world will be looking for information about him!","Many people talked animatedly. In their opinion, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to hide his identity for much longer.","Even if he had jumped out from a crack in the rock, the Mysteries Pavilion still existed.","With them around, it would be too difficult for a person to hide their identity.","Someone said, “The most important thing now is that Jun Tianci’s closest disciple is dead. He might return ahead of time, right?”","Everyone knew that Jun Tianci was currently walking on the path of transcendence and was seeking a breakthrough. Under normal circumstances, he would not appear in front of everyone.","However, now that Xiang Feiyun was dead and his incarnation had been killed, he might appear earlier. That would be the time for a boundless storm to really set off.","After all, how could Jun Tianci just swallow his anger?","Not to mention, many people knew that this matter involved the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect, two giants that had been getting increasingly hostile recently.","Chu Hongcai of the Flying Celestials killed Xiang Feiyun, but the Destiny Sect was the one preparing to ambush Chu Hongcai at the start. The things that happened came in waves.","It could be said that many events had happened within a short time!","Many people’s eyes fell on Chu Yunfan, wanting to see through his identity, but it was useless. Whether they had opened their Heavenly Eye, various divine powers, or divine thoughts, they couldn’t see through his identity.","Chu Yunfan looked at the crowd with a calm expression. His gaze swept across the entirety of Zhongzhou City.","At this moment, only the Flying Celestials, Ruoxi, the Fiery Phoenix, and the others were left above Zhongzhou City. Other than that, only Chu Hongcai was left.","At this moment, Chu Hongcai stepped forward and said, “Senior, thank you for saving my life! May I know your name? I will definitely repay your kindness in the future!”","Chu Yunfan grinned and said, “No need. We’ll meet again in the future!” When Chu Hongcai heard his words, he suddenly felt a little strange. He only","felt that the person in front of him was a little familiar, but he couldn’t tell where they had met before.","Chu Hongcai paused and said, “Senior, you’ve killed Jun Tianci’s incarnation this time. I’m afraid the Destiny Sect won’t let you off easily. Why don’t you return to the Flying Celestials with us? They will definitely treat you as an honored guest. Even the Destiny Sect won’t be able to easily take you away from them!”","In his opinion, this should be the best for Chu Yunfan. In this world, only the Flying Celestials could stand up to fight against the Destiny Sect.."]},{"number":2071,"title":"Chapter 2071: Return","paragraphs":["Chapter 2071: Return","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, if the Destiny Sect wanted to attack Chu Yunfan, only the","Flying Celestials had the strength and willingness to protect him.","“No need!” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “I have my own plans!”","A gratified expression appeared on his face. In the past ten years, Chu Hongcai trained well and had matured. He had a sense of propriety and was calm and extraordinary. He was no longer the impetuous youth he used to be.","Only such a Chu Hongcai could bear the title of number one on the Prodigy List!","After a pause, Chu Yunfan said, “You don’t have to worry about my matters, but be careful. Don’t come out before you break through to the Creation Stage!’","Chu Hongcai was confused by Chu Yunfan’s concern for him. However, he could tell that Chu Yunfan had good intentions. He immediately replied, ‘1 1 understand!”","Chu Yunfan saw that Yang Dengxian and the others were about to surround him, so he didn’t plan to stay and talk to them anymore. He knew that his identity would be exposed sooner or later but now was not the time. He wanted to buy as much time as possible.","He would be able to freely meet with his old friends again in the future...","As he said that, Chu Yunfan’s figure had already disappeared from where he was, vanishing into the sky.","Yang Dengxian muttered to himself, “Who is that person? Why does he feel a little familiar?”","“No matter what, we’re lucky this time. I didn’t expect the Destiny Sect to be so shameless. They sent so many experts to deal with Hongcai! r","In the distance, Chu Hongcai’s protector had already arrived in front of everyone, but he was filled with fear.","This time, he was caught off guard and even felt lingering anxiousness.","The Destiny Sect’s preparations were far more thorough than they had imagined.","Before this, they didn’t have much hope for the Destiny sect’s character, so they naturally prepared as much as they could.","In addition to him, the protector, he also invited Yang Dengxian and sent an invitation to Serene Immortal Mountain.","Who knew that even with that, Chu Hongcai almost got into trouble? The Destiny Sect’s determination to kill Chu Hongcai secretly shocked him. “It is also our fault for being negligent.” Yang Dengxian’s face was as dark as water, and his expression was extremely ugly.","This was because not only did Chu Hongcai’s protector underestimate the Destiny Sect’s determination, but he also underestimated the determination of the Destiny Sect.","He was also on the Prodigy List in the past, and he had suffered countless attacks and assassinations. However, there had never been an ambush by such a lineup of experts.","Chu Hongcai was only in the Cosmos Stage. Even a slightly stronger Creator could easily kill him with no difficulty at all.","In his opinion, it was most likely that the Destiny Sect would have a Creator. Moreover, they would have at most one or two Arcanes.","Those were all people in the fields that he could deal with. Who knew that in order to deal with Chu Hongcai, the Destiny Sect had set up an inescapable net? They actually sent out so many powerful experts.","It could be said that if it weren’t for the sudden appearance of that unknown mysterious expert, he, the dignified Yang Dengxian, would have lost his horse. At that time, he would have suffered heavy losses along with the Destiny Sect, which had lost Xiang Feiyun.","He was still at his lowest point. The number one on the Prodigy List was an eyesore to many people.","Although he was previously ranked in the top 20 of the list and could be considered one of the best among the prodigies, he was ranked in the top 10 among his peers in Grand Xia.","However, the top ten, top twenty, and first place were completely different. They were on completely different levels.","“No matter what, 1 can’t just let the matter of the Destiny Sect ambushing Hongcai go. Otherwise, the tragedy from back then might repeat itself!”","Yang Dengxian’s eyes shone brightly. He was talking about how Jun Tianci had ambushed and killed Chu Yunfan.","That battle caused the Flying Celestials to lose a top genius who could make the sect prosper. Even now, the sect was still heartbroken.","Yang Dengxian said, “You don’t have to go anywhere in the following period. That person was right. Before you reach the Creation Stage, don’t go out. It’s safest to stay in the sect’s territory.”","“Okay.” Chu Hongcai naturally understood what was good for him.","Zhenyuan City, in the camp of the External Army.","After more than ten years of development, Zhenyuan had become the largest city within a thousand miles. Although Chu Yunfan had not appeared for more than ten years, the entire External Army insisted that he was still alive.","Therefore, the city’s development had always followed Chu Yunfan’s original development route. After continuously doing so, it had developed administrative, military, and economic centers nearby.","In addition, there was also the rising star Chu Hongcai, who had made a name for himself in the world. Just like Chu Yunfan, not only was the External Army not suppressed, but they were also constantly replenished.","Over the years, they would occasionally take turns to participate in the battle between humans and demons in front of Zhenyao City. They had long been famous for their invincibility.","You Chuyun was sitting on the main seat in the External Army’s commander’s office. Over the past ten years, he had become more weathered. The small beard on his face made him look more mature.","Before Chu Yunfan went into seclusion, he had entrusted You Chuyun with the management of the army. After more than ten years of training, You Chuyun had long become a qualified commander.","Just as You Chuyun was thinking about the army’s future development, a figure suddenly appeared beside him. It was as if it had appeared out of thin air.","“Who is it?” You Chuyun instantly became alert and unleashed his cultivation. He had already entered the Cosmos Stage and could be considered an expert.","He had encountered this situation a few times. The External Army was stationed in the city, sweeping away all the foreign races and offending countless people. As the commander under Chu Yunfan, he had also been assassinated more than once.","Due to this, he was extremely vigilant.","However, when he saw that person’s face, he immediately became excited.","“Marquis Chu!”","You Chuyun’s voice was trembling, and there was a hint of choking.","In front of him was a handsome man in a moon-white robe. He had a pale face and no beard, and he looked to be in his twenties. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","He even rubbed his eyes in disbelief, but he immediately confirmed that a person’s appearance could be faked, but his own aura could not be faked. It was indeed Chu Yunfan, whose return he had been looking forward to day and","It was the External Army’s true backbone!"]},{"number":2072,"title":"Chapter 2072: The Happenings of the Last Ten Years","paragraphs":["Chapter 2072: The Happenings of the Last Ten Years","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","You Chuyun invited Chu Yunfan to the main seat, then stood still and reported about the External Army’s development over the past ten years.","With the illustrious reputation Chu Yunfan left behind, You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai then stepped into the Cosmos Stage one after another.","A Cosmic could become an elder or a true disciple in the Flying Celestials. They could be considered a member of the upper echelons.","In theory, they could lead the army independently, but neither of them did. They stayed in the army.","As a result, the resources that the two of them could have obtained had also flowed to the External Army. After years of continuous development, the army had long become the mainstay on the human-demon battlefield.","Afterward, the army expanded again and again. In addition to You Chuyun, there were also several Cosmics. They were all people who followed him and Chu Yunfan back then. With the secret manuals that Chu Yunfan had left behind, these people were quite talented, so they all entered the Cosmos Stage one after another.","These were all peerless secret manuals that could not be bought with money outside. It required the experience of people to be accumulated from generation to generation.","During this process, the army gradually expanded to 100,000 people and became an independent legion. The position of the legion commander had always been vacant, reserved for Chu Yunfan.","Of course, in the eyes of outsiders, Chu Yunfan had already fallen. It was only","because the entire army of the External Army insisted that Chu Yunfan had not fallen that they gave up.","Zhenyuan City’s size had also expanded again and again in this process. In just a dozen years, the original outskirts had become the inner city, and the size of the main city had expanded by more than three times.","On the other hand, the External Army’s soldier quality had also improved. More than half of them had already entered the Abstract Stage. They could be considered a very elite army and were famous among the nearby races.","All the other races had basically fled when they saw the army’s flag.","Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction. “Well done. Thank you for handling things while I wasn’t around for all these years. It’s all thanks to you that the External Army has reached this stage!’","“This is the foundation you left behind, Marquis Chu,” You Chuyun hurriedly said, “l wouldn’t have been able to do this on my own!”","You Chuyun had not been blinded by what he had. He naturally understood that the reason why he could do all this was because of Chu Yunfan. If he were to take over the army alone, he would not be able to suppress the various leaders it had.","Even the defenders of Baotai back then could have given him a hard time.","Not to mention that his cultivation had advanced by leaps and bounds. Before this, it would’ve been almost impossible!","His greatest hope in this life was to enter the Cosmos Stage. Now that he had reached his dreams and become one of those true disciples, there was naturally nothing to be dissatisfied about.","You Chuyun said, “The pressure from all sides has been increasing over the years. Fortunately, you have returned, Marquis Chu.”","He wasn’t spouting nonsense, but as time passed, Chu Yunfan never showed his face again. Many people had long suspected that he was definitely dead, or else it wouldn’t be like this.","There were countless people who coveted the External Army as if it were a big cake, all wanting to reach their hands out. A few years ago, Chu Yunfan’s reputation could intimidate a region. In the later stages, it was basically the reputation brought by the newly risen Chu Hongcai that suppressed the evil hands.","Otherwise, the entire army would have changed hands long ago.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan had returned, and You Chuyun finally heaved a sigh of relief.","He quickly said, “I’ll tell everyone the good news right now!”","Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “Don’t tell anyone about this. I don’t want anyone to know that I’m back for the time being. You have to keep it a secret for me for a while!”","Chu Yunfan knew that his return would be exposed sooner or later, but before that, it was best to stall for time. At least now was not the time to tell the news.","He had to seize this time to cultivate and improve his cultivation to the Arcana Stage. By then, he would be able to fight Jun Tianci, who had been here for more than ten years.","“I understand!” You Chuyun quickly nodded. Although he didn’t know why, he still followed Chu Yunfan’s advice.","“What happened after I went into seclusion all these years?” Chu Yunfan said.","You Chuyun paused for a moment before telling Chu Yunfan everything that had happened over the years. Only then did Chu Yunfan know that after he left, the world was in turmoil, and it was not inferior to when he was around.","When he had just entered seclusion, almost everyone in the world believed that he had already died. The Mysteries Pavilion could not calculate Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts at all, not even a little bit of information.","On the other hand, the Flying Celestials were furious. It could be said that Jun Tianci’s actions against Chu Yunfan had exceeded the limits of what the sect could tolerate.","The two great sects had once clashed intensely outside of Grand Xia!","The Destiny Sect definitely wouldn’t lower their heads and admit that they had done something wrong, much less hand over Jun Tianci to be punished by the Flying Celestials.","As for the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan had suffered countless assassinations, including from Jun Tianci, a top genius of the previous generation.","If the Flying Celestials appeared weak now, who would dare to join their sect in the future? They would probably take a detour when they saw the Flying Celestials’ signboard.","Both sects had reasons to not back down. All kinds of fierce conflicts and collisions had been going on outside Grand Xia for three years. Due to this, both sides suffered heavy casualties and even infuriated the empire. Thus, Grand Xia’s Grand Commandant personally came to pay a visit, and only then did the two sects turn their hostility into friendship and stop fighting each other in the outer regions.","However, everyone knew that this was just a temporary hibernation between the two sides. The three-year battle had caused heavy losses to them. Moreover, the Grand Commandant had personally intervened, so both sides had no choice but to give face.","However, this battle had also shaken the world. All the major forces had seen how terrifying the situation would be if the ten great sects were enraged.","After the Flying Celestials temporarily calmed down and accepted the fact that Chu Yunfan had died, another party joined the battle against the Destiny Sect.","It was Serene Immortal Mountain.","Although they were nothing to a colossus like the Destiny Sect, it was guarded by a top-notch expert like the Elder Princess.","Even if they weren’t from the top ten sects, no one dared to underestimate their existence.."]},{"number":2073,"title":"Chapter 2073: Ten Years, Wind and Rain","paragraphs":["Chapter 2073: Ten Years, Wind and Rain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In fact, to many people, Serene Immortal Mountain was even more difficult to deal with than the Flying Celestials. As they didn’t have many factions, they could attack without any scruples. Due to this, many of the Destiny Sect’s factions in the Eastern Sea were attacked by them.","Although Serene Immortal Mountain’s power wasn’t even worth mentioning to the Destiny Sect, it was an out-and-out overlord in the Eastern Sea.","There were quite a number of experts who obeyed the organization’s orders, or more accurately- the Elder Princess.","When she established Serene Immortal Mountain, it could be said that she had offended countless people. However, in the process, she also killed many heroes in the Eastern Sea. Thus, countless heroes were forced to follow her.","This battle truly showed Serene Immortal Mountain’s strength in the Eastern Sea. The name of the Destiny Sect was useful in the inner regions of Grand Xia, but in the Eastern Sea, it didn’t have much influence.","It was not even as famous as Serene Immortal Mountain.","For a time, all of the Destiny Sect’s forces in the Eastern Sea were forced to retreat. They even retreated to the coastal areas where there were garrisons to protect them.","And all of this was exposed. The person who really made a move was not the Elder Princess, but Princess Gushe herself.","As the young mistress of Serene Immortal Mountain, Tang Siyu was naturally qualified to mobilize the sect’s resources.","For a time, the various factions under them launched a continuous attack on the Destiny Sect. It could be said that for the first time, Serene Immortal Mountain truly revealed its fangs in front of outsiders.","Tang Siyu, who led all of this, became even more famous. In fact, a genius within the Destiny Sect who was ranked in the 30s on the Prodizy List died","while on duty in the Eastern Sea.","Although no one had concrete evidence, there were still many people who believed that this was not done by anyone else but Tang Siyu.","She personally went to snipe that expert and killed him with a single sword strike.","For a moment, the entire world was in an uproar, especially the Destiny Sect. They had always been the ones who attacked others, but it was rare for others to attack their disciples.","After all, not everyone had the guts to face the few behemoths in the world.","Although Serene Immortal Mountain did not explain the reason behind their actions, everyone knew that it was related to Chu Yunfan’s death.","Tang Siyu was Chu Yunfan’s fiancee, and in the eyes of ordinary people, Jun Tianci had targeted him because of her.","Therefore, it was not impossible for Tang Siyu to vent her anger personally. It was even very logical.","Furthermore, this was just the beginning. Not long after, Tang Siyu came out of seclusion again. This time, her target was Maiden Donghua of the Divine Maidens.","It could be said that their battle was one of the most eye-catching ones back then.","Previously, Maiden Donghua had bullied the weak and defeated Tang Siyu, almost causing her to die on the spot. However, this time, Tang Siyu had personally come to find Maiden Donghua, and she was probably prepared.","Sure enough, as many people expected, this time, Tang Siyu defeated Maiden Donghua at lightning speed.","Back then, Maiden Donghua defeated her with great effort, and her victory made her famous.","However, this time, Tang Siyu defeated her almost effortlessly. The outcome was determined in a few moves.","Even Maiden Donghua was severely injured in a few moves and almost died. If it weren’t for her protector who risked his life to snatch her back, she would have died there.","But even so, she was severely injured by Tang Siyu and her strength was greatly reduced.","Just from that, Tang Siyu became famous overnight.","Back then, she was already considered to be famous and ranked second among the top prodigies in the world.","However, she was still too young. This also verified many guesses. It was too difficult to make a comeback at such a young age. Not everyone was like Chu Yunfan, and not everyone had such terrifying strength.","However, after this battle, all the gossip had turned into nothing.","Tang Siyu had proven herself with absolute strength. Not only had she entered the Arcana Stage, but she had also defeated the previous generation’s expert on the Prodigy List, Maiden Donghua.","With Chu Yunfan’s life and death unknown, and there was a high chance that he had already died, her ranking had climbed up one place. She was already recognized by many as the number one on the Prodigy List.","This battle made Tang Siyu a thorn in the side of many forces.","In addition, a genius on the Prodigy List had died in her hands, infuriating the entire Destiny Sect.","It was said that their sect leader had personally led a large number of supreme elders to come and interrogate Tang Siyu.","However, before they could even get close to the mountain, they were crushed by a huge hand that came from the sky. Even the sect leader could only protect himself.","The others were even more shocked, spitting out blood and retreating. It was impossible for them to resist such a huge hand.","In the end, they had no choice but to return to the Destiny Sect before they could go to Serene Immortal Mountain to kill and take revenge.","For a time, not only Tang Siyu but also Serene Immortal Mountain and the Elder Princess’ divine powers became the focus of countless people’s discussions.","The news that came was extremely explosive!","This was especially so for the Elder Princess. The younger generation no longer knew much about her. Many people only knew that she was originally the empire’s Elder Princess. After that, she had a conflict with Grand Xia and moved out of the capital, coming to Serene Immortal Mountain to establish a sect.","There were even rumors that she was the number one expert in the world, but Serene Immortal Mountain did not admit it.","Other than that, Grand Xia’s reputation this time as the top of the world was confirmed.","This was because the Destiny Sect would not deliberately act for the Elder Princess and make them a laughingstock.","Ever since the Elder Princess made her move, all the forces in the world had gone silent. It could be said that they had been killed in one go.","Her terrifying strength made many people involuntarily tremble in fear.","Only many of the itinerant cultivators on the Eastern Sea did not think much of it, because they were already used to the fear of being dominated by her power.","With such an expert guarding the sect, they didn’t have many members, but? they were already a huge threat to the Destiny Sect.","Later on, the feud between Serene Immortal Mountain and the Destiny Sect continued, and there was no time for it to stop.","This was especially true in the Eastern Sea, where Serene Immortal Mountain had its main base.."]},{"number":2074,"title":"Chapter 2074: The Prodigy Battlefield (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2074: The Prodigy Battlefield (1)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Since then, the grudges between the two sides continued. The conflict between Serene Immortal Mountain and the Destiny Sect continued to erupt. However, after the battle on the Eastern Sea, the Elder Princess never attacked again.","However, the power of that battle was enough to make everyone in the Destiny Sect feel fear.","During these years, the various forces had been constantly clashing and had never stopped.","It was only when the Prodigy Battlefield opened and Tang Siyu, who had been in charge of various matters around Serene Immortal Mountain, entered the battlefield herself that everything came to an end.","“The Prodigy Battlefield? Where is that?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. He had heard of this place many times not long after he came out of seclusion.","Not only Tang Siyu but it was also said that Jun Tianci and many other geniuses were also in that place.","You Chuyun shook his head and said, “I don’t know what kind of place it is, Marquis Chu.”","A bitter smile appeared on his face as he said, “We aren’t qualified to go there with our aptitude!”","Chu Yunfan asked in confusion, “Is there a talent requirement to enter the Prodigy Battlefield?”","“Yes.” You Chuyun nodded. “Only those with king-level physiques or higher can enter, and there’s also an age limit. If you are too old, you won’t be able to enter!”","The Prodigy Battlefield!","These words flashed through Chu Yunfan’s mind. Soon, You Chuyun told him all the information he knew.","Afterward, Chu Yunfan finally knew what kind of place this was.","No one knew when it first existed, but it seemed to have come from ancient times, after the end of the era when the emperors stood side by side. At that time, the battlefield suddenly appeared between heaven and earth.","The entire place was located in an alternate dimension, not in Zhongzhou City. It only appeared once every few hundred years.","There were many legends on that battlefield as well as all kinds of fortuitous encounters and powerful inheritances that could not be seen outside. It was even said that there were inheritances passed down from emperors.","These legends attracted generations of prodigies to join the Prodigy Battlefield. Every time it opened, it would attract many geniuses of that generation to join.","Almost all the experts who dominated the region today were trained in the Prodigy Battlefield.","The one in this generation had also opened several years ago. At that time, the entire place had opened with a huge commotion and attracted the whole world’s attention. Only Chu Yunfan, who was in seclusion at that time, did not know about it.","On the other hand, Jun Tianci and the others had entered the Prodigy","Battlefield at the first moment. Later on, Tang Siyu joined them. Until recently, the people on the same Prodigy List as Chu Yunfan had also entered the battlefield one after another.","There weren’t many people like Yang Dengxian who had yet to enter the battlefield.","Although it was huge, not everyone had the qualifications to enter. Its doors could only be opened with the blood essence of a king.","Moreover, those who exceeded a certain age could not enter. If those who did not meet these two requirements forcefully entered the Prodigy Battlefield, they would only explode and die on the spot.","Since ancient times, it wasn’t as if there hadn’t been anyone who had the idea of entering the battlefield. In fact, there were quite a number of them who had even tried to enter. There were even kings in the past who personally took action and tried to open its doors with their absolute strength.","However, the truth was that even with their strength, they were unable to enter the Prodigy Battlefield. This was why the people who came later gave up.","There were even rumors that this battlefield was not formed naturally. Instead, it was a special small world that was personally refined by a certain emperor. Only those who met specific requirements could enter it.","Since it was personally created by an emperor-level master, then a mere king would not be able to open this battlefield.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. “This is a little interesting. The Prodigy Battlefield, huh?”","He could not find any memories of this battlefield in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Moreover, the Alchemy Emperor’s memories ended all the way to the era when the various emperors stood side by side, which was also the end of the ancient generation.","Before that, he had never heard of this Prodigy Battlefield. With the Alchemy Emperor’s strength and status at that time, there were still some secrets in the world that he did not know. This was also very rare.","Therefore, it could be speculated that this battlefield was probably as the rumors said- It should have appeared after the end of the ancient era.","As for whether or not it was created by an emperor and why they would create such a place for training, no one knew.","Too much time had passed. The Prodigy Battlefield had already existed before Grand Xia was established. It was unknown how many geniuses had entered it and obtained great fortuitous encounters. Generation after generation, its reputation was established.","Therefore, although Chu Yunfan still did not know what the essence of this battlefield was, there was no doubt that there were many secrets that ordinary people did not know. There were even many inheritances and various benefits that were rare to outsiders.","That was why so many geniuses were attracted to the Prodigy Battlefield.","Chu Yunfan’s train of thought suddenly became clear. If it were because of this battlefield, then many thoughts that he couldn’t straighten out before were all clarified now.","He clearly didn’t care about Maiden Donghua, so why did Jun Tianci suddenly appear in front of him? Moreover, it wasn’t for anything else but for Chu Yunfan’s blood essence.","Before, Chu Yunfan didn’t understand why Jun Tianci did this. After all, since ancient times, there were many pill recipes, special secret techniques, and divine powers that could use the blood essence of the heart.","Now, he seemed to have figured it out. Although he still didn’t understand Jun Tianci’s specific purpose, it was definitely related to the Prodigy Battlefield.","Since he knew that Jun Tianci’s goal was to be in that place, Chu Yunfan couldn’t let it go so easily.","Jun Tianci had almost killed him back then, and he would be a weak man to not take revenge!","Moreover, Tang Siyu was also there. Chu Yunfan, who had fought with Jun Tianci before, knew very well how dangerous Jun Tianci was.","She had followed Jun Tianci into the battlefield. If she were attacked by him, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Even if her strength was on par with his, she probably wouldn’t have much chance of winning against Jun Tianci.","All these things made Chu Yunfan decide to make a trip to the Prodigy","Battlefield.."]},{"number":2075,"title":"Chapter 2075: The Prodigy Battlefield (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2075: The Prodigy Battlefield (2)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","From the information that had been passed down, there must be something in the Prodigy Battlefield that could greatly increase the strength of many prodigies.","From the information You Chuyun had found about the place, it could be seen that after many geniuses went through training within it, their strength would often increase greatly when they appeared again.","There were even geniuses who became top-notch experts in one fell swoop.","Although he didn’t know how they did it, Chu Yunfan felt that he had to go and find out.","There was a gap in strength between him and Jun Tianci. If he wanted to catch up, he would need to rely on this battlefield.","Chu Yunfan said, “l understand. I’ll be going to the Prodigy Battlefield, so I’ll need you to take charge of the External Army!’","“Understood!” You Chuyun nodded. He didn’t find this order strange. He was already used to doing this.","Although Chu Yunfan was the army’s spiritual pillar, he didn’t directly manage its various affairs. The army itself was used to his way of handling things.","As he said that, Chu Yunfan casually pointed his index finger, creating a ray of light that directly entered You Chuyun’s mind.","You Chuyun immediately felt a cultivation experience manual appear in his mind. He only needed to read a few sentences to see its incomparable exquisiteness. One by one, many of the problems he encountered in his cultivation had solutions to them.","The various teachings in this manual pointed straight to the peak of the Cosmos Stage. It even seemed to point to the Great Dao.","Without a doubt, this was a priceless treasure,","“Many thanks, Marquis Chu!”","You Chuyun was overjoyed. This was what he needed the most at the moment.","As the Flying Celestials was such a colossus, of course, he had no lack of Cosmos Stage cultivation methods.","As a true disciple of the Flying Celestials, it would be a joke if he still lacked those.","However, the methods he had were only methods. The issue was that the various problems he had during his cultivation were often not mentioned in the teachings.","The methods and handwritten notes that could solve these problems were the most precious. Their values weren’t lower than the cultivation methods themselves, or even higher.","This was because there existed various methods and ways to obtain cultivation techniques. However, the steps to solving problems were secret information for any family. Due to this, it could be said that those who weren’t core disciples couldn’t obtain actual inheritance at all.","Originally, it would have taken him many years to reach the Cosmos Stage, but it was different now. With the help of Chu Yunfan!s manual, he could save decades and hundreds of years of fumbling.","As long as he cultivated step by step, it was not difficult for him to break through to the peak of the Cosmos Stage.","He might even have the chance to enter the Creation Stage in the future.","Thinking of this, You Chuyun almost couldn’t help but tremble. He was really too excited.","There had never been a Creator in his family. If he could do it, he would be the number one person to do so. Even his family’s future generations would remember his name.","He would be known as the one who led the family to revival.","Chu Yunfan treated him so well, so how could he not be moved to tears? He felt like a scholar who would die for a confidant.","“Yes.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “You should digest this manual well. I hope that the next time I see you, you will be able to break through to the peak of the Cosmos Stage!’","Of course, he understood why You Chuyun was so excited. However, for him who had the Alchemy Emperor’s memory and the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, this matter was nothing at all.","He had long surpassed this level!","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Work hard for me, and I won’t let you down in the future. Even if you break through to the Creation Stage, I still have ways to help you level up!’","“Thank you, Marquis Chu. I will do my best for you until I die!” You Chuyun said excitedly. Even with his cultivation, he could not help but feel happy when he thought of the chance to break through to the Creation Stage.","“Then I’ll be going now.” After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he disappeared from the tent.","Only then did You Chuyun stand up. His face was no longer as disappointed as before, and he was completely in high spirits.","Previously, the entire army had insisted that Chu Yunfan was not dead, but in fact, many of their experts, including him, were also nervous.","Without Chu Yunfan, it was only a matter of time before the External Army","fell apart.","However, things were different now. Chu Yunfan had confirmed that he had recovered, and the External Army had a backer and backbone again. Their future was bright.","A day later, Chu Yunfan appeared in the boundless sky. His body was surrounded by intense gales that tried to blow his bones and flesh apart.","These gales were extremely terrifying, resembling steel blades. If an ordinary Abstract were to encounter them, they would probably be blown to pieces in an instant and die immediately.","Even a Cosmic could get severely injured and die tragically. It was just a matter of holding on for a little longer.","Only Creators could barely walk through this endless gale. However, they still had to be careful. If they weren’t, they might get seriously injured.","On the other hand, those who had reached Chu Yunfan’s level of cultivation could walk freely in this boundless storm.","Even so, the higher the sky was, the more Chu Yunfan wouldn’t easily step into it.","The astral winds in that place were ten to even a hundred times more violent than here. Even Arcane could get severely injured or even killed if they got close.","Above this layer of wind was the boundless starry sky. Countless dazzling stars enveloped it.","However, those who could reach this sky were very rare in the entire world.","The Elder Princess going there in search of heavenly treasures to give to Tang Siyu wasn’t something that ordinary people could imagine.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s eyes were completely focused on the place in front of him, hundreds of meters away.","A huge city that was thousands of meters tall appeared in front of him.","It only had one gate, and the other walls seemed to be hidden in the endless void, making it invisible. However, that didn’t stop Chu Yunfan from feeling overwhelming pressure.","A huge stone plaque hung on the city gate,","On it were letters that spelled out, “The Prodigy Battlefield!”","It was unknown what kind of expert had written these words, but just these three words had formed a powerful aura.","It was as if he had entered an unimaginable bloody battlefield in an instant.","This was Chu Yunfan’s destination, the Prodigy Battlefield!"]},{"number":2076,"title":"Chapter 2076: Enlightenment, Becoming a Minor Arcane","paragraphs":["Chapter 2076: Enlightenment, Becoming a Minor Arcane","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Behind this incomparably huge city was the location of the Prodigy Battlefield.","Chu Yunfan looked at the plaque with the words written on it. Suddenly, he felt his heart skip a beat and his vision changed.","He was no longer outside the city in the boundless sky, but he was instead within chaos.","In this boundless mayhem, countless seven-colored lights appeared in front of him. Then, he discovered that these lights were none other than the laws of the Great Dao.","The Great Dao’s laws were actually displayed before Chu Yunfan!","These rainbow lights were like fish swimming around his body.","Chu Yunfan casually grabbed one of them and immediately felt countless pieces of information about the Great Dao flowing through his mind.","From this, that clear but confused feeling suddenly emerged in his mind.","It was like a primary school student reading a university student’s question. Even if he saw the entire process of solving the question, he would not understand it at all.","It had already far surpassed the level that he currently possessed!","However, even if he had only seen it once, it was still an irreplaceable benefit to his enlightenment. Although he could not understand it, it had already broadened his horizons.","There were countless benefits he could get from this!","Chu Yunfan didn’t know where this place was, but he knew that this was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for him. Enlightenment had always been the most difficult fortuitous encounter in the cultivation world.","Compared to comprehending one’s stage, one’s power could only be considered as a supporting process. As long as they reached their stage, their power could improve rapidly through various ways.","It could be from enlightenment through a senior, pill consumption to increase one’s strength, natural treasure consumption, and even many evil techniques that absorbed other people’s strengths to increase one’s strength.","There were thousands of methods out there. As long as a person’s level was high enough, achieving them wouldn’t be difficult.","On the other hand, if their level wasn’t high enough and they forcefully increased their strength, they would only end up suffering from energy deviation or death by explosion.","Moreover, enlightenment was something that could only be encountered by chance.","At this moment, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind emitted endless light and absorbed the rainbow light. Each light absorbed would have a large amount of information analyzed in them.","Although it was still a drop in the bucket compared to the huge amount of information contained in the Great Dao laws themselves, Chu Yunfan could only be considered to have a glimpse behind the curtain.","However, for him, it was still a great harvest!","He could even feel that his own comprehension of the Great Dao was rising continuously. His understanding was already on par with a Minor Arcane.","In just a short time, his comprehension had already surpassed the Minor Arcana Stage and entered the Middle Arcana Stage.","The speed he was on was simply like riding a rocket as it increased.","Chu Yunfan seemed to be cheating. When others received the test questions, they still had to think hard to come up with a solution to the problem before they could be considered to have mastered it.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan received a standard answer sheet with a process of answering the questions. One could imagine how convenient his position was.","Coupled with his godhead’s analysis, all kinds of information were deeply introduced into Chu Yunfan’s mind.","Chu Yunfan felt that his level was constantly increasing!","After an unknown amount of time, he finally stopped. He looked again and saw that the colorful light had disappeared without a trace.","All of them were absorbed into the godhead.","In the next moment, his expression flickered and he reappeared outside a city. Around him were endless astral winds, and in the distance was the Prodigy Battlefield’s city.","Chu Yunfan counted with his fingers. Only two hours had passed, but he felt as if decades or even hundreds of years had passed.","He could clearly feel that his comprehension of the Great Dao had undergone earth- shattering changes. If his understanding before was originally at the level of a primary school student, then now it has risen to the junior high level in one breath.","It could be said that there had been an appalling change!","When he looked at these surroundings again, he already had a completely different feeling. When he looked at the plaque hanging on the city gate again, he didn’t feel the same.","He didn’t know who wrote this plaque, nor did he know if anyone had discovered the secret of this plaque like he did throughout the years.","However, he had to admit that the person who made it must be so powerful that even if he only saw the tip of the iceberg, it was enough to shock him.","Even the Elder Princess would be no match for the person who wrote this plaque.","No wonder the Prodigy Battlefield had existed for so many years, but no one knew who set it up and what its purpose was.","On Chu Yunfan’s body, divine power surged and rose layer by layer. It directly rushed to the peak of the Creation Stage, but it did not stop and continued to rise.","In the next moment, it released from his body like a tidal wave. After a long time, it finally calmed down. Afterward, he was able to completely control his divine power again.","He had completely stepped into the Minor Arcana Stage from the peak Creation Stage.","Even though he was only in the Minor Arcana Stage, his battle prowess had increased several times over.","There was almost a whole leap in development!","His strength had risen from Minor Arcana to Middle Arcana Stage!","Now, he didn’t even put any other Arcanes in his eyes. If Jun Tianci’s incarnation appeared in front of him, he could kill him in one move, It would be much easier than before.","After all, Chu Yunfan could even fight Jun Tianci back then.","Now, he was even more certain that Jun Tianci was in the Middle Arcana Stage a dozen years ago.","After Chu Yunfan absorbed all the mana in his body, he began to carefully sense all his physical changes.","Compared to the Creation Stage, the Arcana Stage was more deeply integrated with heaven and earth.","If one were to say that the Cosmos and Creation Stages were the equivalent of reversing the universe and snatching the world’s fortunes while fighting for that sliver of life within the heavens and earth, then the Arcana Stage was different. They were a form of their own, but they had a deeper fusion with heaven and earth, allowing them to borrow more power from above.","With just a raise of his hand, he could borrow heaven and earth’s power to break free from the shackles of his own strength.."]},{"number":2077,"title":"Chapter 2077: The Unceasing Enlightenment","paragraphs":["Chapter 2077: The Unceasing Enlightenment","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After breaking through to the Minor Arcana Stage, other than his strength increasing, Chu Yunfan could also feel that his compatibility with this world was increasing.","His comprehension of heaven and earth had clearly increased by more than one level. In fact, his cultivation perception had far exceeded his current level.","After the breakthrough, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level did not stop. On the contrary, as time passed, it continued to increase.","He could feel that the godhead in his mind was constantly analyzing those laws, turning into countless pieces of information that surged into his mind.","This meant that he was in a state of enlightenment. He was even eating, sleeping, standing, and sitting in that state.","A short period of this for an ordinary person was very impressive. Every time one had an epiphany, it was an opportunity for one’s cultivation to advance by leaps and bounds.","However, Chu Yunfan was enlightened almost all the time, which was extremely terrifying.","With this speed, he felt that he would soon catch up with those top experts. For the first time, he really had a feeling of awakening overnight and soaring to the sky.","In just a short time, he had stabilized his current cultivation. However, its state was still rising at an astonishing speed.","Soon, Chu Yunfan noticed that something was wrong. If he continued to improve at this speed, he would not be far from death.","In the process of constantly improving his level, his entire body was evolving toward a higher place.","The cultivation of all things in the world was a process of jumping from a low-level life state to a higher-level one.","In this process, one would gain even greater power and a longer lifespan until they could live forever and become a true god.","However, doing this meant that he needed to absorb a large amount of energy. The huge amount of energy originally contained in Chu Yunfan’s body was almost exhausted in a very short time.","His body was constantly swirling with divine power, but it could not keep up with the energy he was consuming, as if he was in a position where he couldn’t make ends meet.","At this rate, he would probably dry up soon.","This reminded Chu Yunfan of some people in the history of cultivation. Some people reached enlightenment overnight and ascended during the day. From this, they directly turned into a rainbow light and disappeared, while their physical bodies directly dried up or even turned into dust that disappeared into the air.","This was because their enlightenment speed was too fast. Their bodies couldn’t help but jump to a higher level, but they had insufficient energy in their bodies to support this transformation.","Knowing this, Chu Yunfan turned pale with fright. He hurriedly used the Celestial Devouring Art and absorbed the spirit energy from the surrounding endless astral winds.","The spirit energy was extremely violent. When it entered Chu Yunfan’s body, it began to wreak havoc. However, he quickly absorbed it.","It was visible to the naked eye that the space around him seemed to have collapsed as he absorbed abundant amounts of spirit energy. The commotion this caused was extremely huge.","In Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram, a large number of spirit stones turned into powder, while the spirit energy surged into his body like a river.","Other than that were also countless pills that increased his strength and turned into waves that flowed into his body. Even so, it barely filled up Chu Yunfan’s energy requirement during this process.","It just barely relieved the feeling of almost draining his body.","He finally heaved a sigh of relief and quickly disconnected from the godhead. Otherwise, if he continued to do this, he would probably disappear from the world before he could even ascend.","This made him even more certain of one thing. The physical body itself was the foundation of all cultivation. Without a strong one, all sorts of cultivation was useless.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but smile bitterly as he said, “I have to find a large energy source to devour. Otherwise, just enlightenment alone will be enough to suck me dry!”","This was the first time he had encountered such a situation. He had never been at risk of being sucked dry because of a long enlightenment before.","This was also unprecedented in the history of cultivation during ancient and modern times. Even in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he had never heard of such a thing either.","This was because even if ordinary people displayed the Great Dao in front of them, the things they could absorb would be different because of their levels.","When they reached a certain level, they would naturally stop. It was impossible for them to go on comprehending.","However, Chu Yunfan had the exceptional godhead. His other abilities had reached an unimaginable level, and there was no end to it.","This forced him to cut off his spirit energy supply to the godhead, which stopped its operations.","If he hadn’t done so, he would’ve been killed by enlightenment.","“Forget it, let’s just enter the Prodigy Battlefield first! ”","Chu Yunfan made a hand seal and forced out a drop of blood from his heart. Then, he entered the city gate.","Immediately, the door of the entire battlefield slowly opened with a loud sound.","It was like an ancient door that led to a huge and boundless world. The feeling of vastness appeared before him.","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and disappeared into the door.","When he saw what was happening in front of him again, he was already in the mountains.","It was a boundless mountain range with peaks resembling sharp swords that shot into the sky. This didn’t seem to be a mountain rage, but a huge sword array.","Chu Yunfan could even faintly feel sword light gushing out of the array.","Boundless and desolate!","This was the feeling that the entire battlefield gave him. It was different from what he had imagined. It was vast, and there was no end to it. With his current cultivation, he could not even explore the entire place with his divine will. Even with his divine will, he could only explore a hundred miles. He would not be able to explore further.","It was as if there was a mysterious force between heaven and earth that restricted everyone’s divine will.","The spirit energy in the battlefield could be said to be comparable to those extremely rare blessed lands in Zhongzhou; extremely dense and with very few impurities. Even with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, he could absorb it directly without refining it.."]},{"number":2078,"title":"Chapter 2078: A Monster in Human Skin","paragraphs":["Chapter 2078: A Monster in Human Skin","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was very rare. For a top-notch expert like Chu Yunfan, his demand for spirit energy was very high. Ordinary spirit energy had too much impurity for an expert like him, and there was almost no way to directly use it.","If it were otherwise, spirit stones would not have become a hard currency among cultivators. This was because if they used those stones, they could save more than half of the time needed to refine spirit energy.","Other than the extremely dense spirit energy, Chu Yunfan also discovered that compared to the obscure Great Dao laws of Zhongzhou City, the laws on the Prodigy Battlefield were clearly more active.","This also meant that cultivators would be able to gain insights and cultivate far more than they would in Zhongzhou.","Although it couldn’t be compared to the way Chu Yunfan felt the laws’ bare manifestation on the board, it was still much better than Zhongzhou City.","Chu Yunfan muttered to himself, “No wonder the prodigies who entered here could develop by leaps and bounds in such a short time!”","He now knew that even if there were no other benefits to this place, the abundant spirit energy and the more active laws of the Great Dao were worth the risk of entering.","It was like playing a game that was normally in hellish difficulty. When the game suddenly changed to an easy difficulty, one would realize that the game was far simpler than they assumed.","However, the sturdiness of the laws on Earth was the most terrifying. In comparison, Grand Xia could only be considered as an ordinary representation. The sturdiness of Earth’s laws was the true hell-like replica.","The stronger the law, the harder it was for others to catch it. The probability of cultivators appearing was also lower, and that was including the powerful ones.","After all, compared to heaven and earth, cultivators were equivalent to using the leaked source code as a cheat. They were just picking up the loopholes from heaven and earth.","The more active the laws were, the more likely it was for experts to appear. However, at the same time, it was also easier for heaven and earth to collapse.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know who had created this battlefield, but he had to admit that it was powerful enough to force the natural law to such an extent that it was convenient for people to comprehend.","Just based on this point alone, the cultivation of the person who created the Prodigy Battlefield should be limitless.","But soon, Chu Yunfan discovered that the entire battlefield was too big, so big that it was endless. It was far from his assumption that it was just a small place.","“l have to think of a way to find those prodigies who came in first as soon as possible! ”","He quickly made a decision. He was definitely not the only one who had entered this place. The fastest way to find out the current situation was to find prodigies around.","Suddenly, a black cloud appeared in the sky. In just a moment, it had arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","He took a closer look. It was not a cloud, but a huge bird.","This bird was pitch-black in color and had scales on its body. It looked like an eagle, but it had a golden horn on its head. It was extremely ferocious, and its entire body emitted an extremely terrifying aura.","It resembled a ferocious beast from ancient times.","“Black- scaled Horned Eagle!” Chu Yunfan immediately determined the species of this beast. It was a ferocious bird that was famous among the demons.","It was said that this bird had the bloodline of a ferocious beast from ancient times. Moreover, it was famous among the demons and could be ranked among many other birds within them.","It could be said that every time this kind of Black- scaled Horned Eagle appeared on the battlefield, it would cause a huge panic. In the early years, before Grand Xia’s army entered the Demon Region and built Zhenyao to suppress the demons, there were defense lines everywhere on the human race’s battlefield. These Black- scaled Horned Eagles moved quickly and were powerful. Wherever they went, they would cause endless slaughter. They could easily attack a city and devour all the humans in it.","Among the human experts, this was definitely a famous ferocious beast. There was an irreconcilable hatred between the two races.","When the eagle appeared in front of Chu Yunfan, its huge eyes immediately burst with a terrifying murderous light. One of its heads even revealed a human-like cruel expression.","In an instant, it opened its bloody mouth and pounced toward Chu Yunfan, wanting to swallow him whole.","Chu Yunfan sneered, “What a good beast!”","Without even looking at it, he slapped the eagle.","Bam!","The Black- scaled Horned Eagle was sent flying. Its huge body crashed into a mountain peak, shattering the entire peak into pieces.","There was a look of disbelief on it, just like a human’s expression.","It seemed to be wondering what was going on.","It was clearly here to hunt this human in front of it, but why was it sent flying by this human’s slap?","There was no way it could have sensed the human’s aura wrongly. Even though the human had concealed it well and only a tiny bit of it leaked out, it was merely ripples of the nature’s law caused by a Minor Arcane.","He was just another prodigy who had just entered.","The eagle had thought it had picked up a huge bargain, but who knew that it would actually be sent flying with a slap?","However, it immediately became even more ferocious. The vicious aura in its bloodline made it cry out again. His huge black body was like a meteor as he instantly zoomed toward Chu Yunfan.","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","This Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s speed was extremely fast, and its horn was aimed at Chu Yunfan. Even a Minor Arcane wouldn’t be able to escape death if they got hit directly by this.","Bam!","However, after a loud bang, the eagle flew backward at an even faster speed, its huge body slamming into the ground.","The entire ground shook violently from the impact.","The eagle was even more confused from being sent flying by another one of Chu Yunfan’s slaps.","Looking at his small figure that was almost invisible, the eagle was a little confused. Who was the monster here right now?","Why did it feel like this human in front of it was a monster in human skin?"]},{"number":2079,"title":"Chapter 2079: 100,000 Prodigies, It’s as if They’re Cabbages!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2079: 100,000 Prodigies, It’s as if They’re Cabbages!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, the Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s body was already covered in cracks, as if a dense spider web had enveloped its entire body.","Chu Yunfan’s two slaps had severely injured it.","It was a little stunned. After all, it had its own reasons for daring to hunt alone. Its cultivation base had long been at the peak of the Minor Arcana","Stage. Any human newbie who had just entered would not be a match for it.","As for those who were obviously the strongest among the human experts, it had always taken a detour from them. Although the Black-scaled Horned Eagle was ferocious, it was not stupid.","It had been wandering around the novice area and succeeded many times before finally encountering a tough opponent.","The Black- scaled Horned Eagle instinctively wanted to escape. However, before it could do so, a huge palm slapped down from the sky, slamming it into the mountain peak.","Chu Yunfan’s voice came from the horizon, “Whatever I ask next, answer it and you can still keep your life. Otherwise, you will die!”","The Black- scaled Horned Eagle nodded its head like a mouse, a human-like expression on its ferocious face.","“Are you a prodigy of the demons?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Chu Yunfan had thought that this Black-scaled Horned Eagle should be a prodigy of a senior within the demons. The demons’ situation was even more chaotic than Grand Xia’s as there were many species mixed together. Even the Prodigy List might not be able to capture all the geniuses they had, let alone their many senior prodigies who had reached the age limit.","The ones Chu Yunfan knew were only Flying Tiger, Hu Qingxuan, and a few other demon prodigies.","Unexpectedly, this Black- scaled Horned Eagle shook its head. It actually wasn’t a demon prodigy.","Chu Yunfan was a little puzzled. The demons had many experts. Although Minor Arcanes were rare, they weren’t unique. It was just that many of them were already very old and would be blocked outside the Prodigy Battlefield.","This place not only tested one’s bloodline but also had an age requirement. Entry was impossible after a certain age limit was breached.","This made Chu Yunfan even more certain that the battlefield was not formed naturally, but was specially refined by someone.","It was just that he did not know what that person’s purpose was.","Soon, Chu Yunfan learned from the Black- scaled Horned Eagle that it didn’t come from the demons outside, but it was born and raised in the Prodigy Battlefield.","The battlefield would only appear once every few hundred years. Every time, it would be open for ten years before it would disappear again. Before it did so, the prodigies who entered would leave.","However, some geniuses were unable to leave in time for various reasons and got trapped. Slowly, these geniuses and their descendants became natives of the battlefield.","This Black- scaled Horned Eagle was a native of this place.","Moreover, its ancestor was a powerful Black- scaled Horned Eagle. Later on, because of other matters, the ancestor also got trapped in the Prodigy","Battlefield, so their bloodline remained.","This was something that Chu Yunfan had not expected. There were actually natives on this battlefield. After all, he did not receive much information from You Chuyun.","He didn’t intend to expose his identity at this stage, so he didn’t return to the Flying Celestials. The information he got from You Chuyun was limited.","Furthermore, You Chuyun’s rank was too low. Although he was a true disciple of the sect, his rank was only enough to hear some rumors about the Prodigy Battlefield. He did not even have the qualifications to participate.","That was why Chu Yunfan didn’t kill the Black- scaled Horned Eagle with a single strike. He wanted to get the information he wanted from it.","Through the eagle’s explanation, he finally understood that the entire battlefield was far larger than he had imagined.","The entire place was divided into the outer region, then the central region in the middle, and the core region in the center. The place where one could obtain the most benefits and the most inheritances in the entire place was undoubtedly the core region.","Next was the central region, and then the outer region.","Therefore, almost all the elites inside the Prodigy Battlefield were in the core region.","In the outer region, there were basically only Minor Arcanes. There were even peak Creator. They did not dare to casually step into the core region, so they could only look for some fortuitous encounters in the outskirts.","On the other hand, some Minor Arcanes and above would choose to enter the central region, and only the strongest would enter the core. Or rather, only those who dared to enter the core region were the ones who had the strength to protect themselves.","What shocked Chu Yunfan even more was that the experts who entered the battlefield this time were more than he thought. There were hundreds or thousands of people.","There were tens of thousands of people. If the natives were included, there should be around more than 100,000 people.","Chu Yunfan said in shock, “Why are there so many people?”","Tens of thousands of experts with king-level physiques or higher were gathered together. Including the top experts among the natives, there were a total of 100,000 people.","When did these geniuses become so common? They were like cabbages!","Among them, Chu Yunfan stood out the most. After confirming that Hua Xianyuan had a king-level physique, the entire Flying Celestials valued him very much. It could be said that he was being nurtured as their next successor.","If king-level physiques were so common, the sect wouldn’t have paid so much attention to that man.","The Black- scaled Horned Eagle quickly said, “These prodigies are neither from the current nor previous generation. They are the ones accumulated over countless years in the long river of history!’","It was basically telling him everything it knew.","It didn’t dare to play any tricks on Chu Yunfan. After all, it could already be seen that this man could kill it with one slap.","In front of Chu Yunfan, its strength was not worth mentioning at all.","Chu Yunfan asked, “How did these prodigies survive until now? Moreover, with their age, they shouldn’t be qualified to enter the Prodigy Battlefield.”","The eagle replied, “Sir, these prodigies are all famous geniuses of a certain era. However, after shining for a while in the current era, they chose to seal themselves. When the Prodigy Battlefield appears, they will reappear. Therefore, although they’re from many years ago, in terms of age, they meet this place’s entry requirements..”"]},{"number":2080,"title":"Chapter 2080: The Path to Godhood Reappears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2080: The Path to Godhood Reappears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle’s words immediately reminded Chu Yunfan of the self-sealing technique recorded in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. It could be said that it was a rather strange technique.","No one knew who invented it, but it had been extremely popular since ancient times.","Using a self-sealing technique could completely seal one’s life force, completely stopping the flow of time on their body. If they were only eighteen years old when they were sealed, then after countless years, they would still be the same age.","This was the best way for ancient experts to resist the passage of time. After all, even powerful existences like the emperors were helpless against time.","As long as they didn’t become a god, they would grow old and die of old age. However, the lifespan of emperor-level experts was extremely long, far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","The others could only speculate about the many things that had happened in the ancient era. They could only guess what had happened back then and what it looked like.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to learn many things that ordinary people had never heard of through the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","It was extremely difficult for the heavens and earth to give birth to an emperor. There was no need to doubt that in all the years since Grand Xia was founded, there had never been a single person who had become an emperor.","Therefore, the empire’s current ruler could only call himself a king and not an emperor. Even a powerful king wouldn’t dare to call himself an emperor if he wasn’t on that level.","This was because an emperor wasn’t only a position, but also a level in terms of strength. If one were to forcefully claim its title without reaching the required stage and strength, it would only be a joke.","Every emperor who existed had once suppressed an era and was invincible.","However, in ancient times, there was a time when they stood side by side. In the end, when it came to the fight for Godhood, many emperors attacked each other, causing the world to collapse.","It could be said that it was them who joined forces to destroy the glorious ancient era.","However, the prehistoric books of the later generations could no longer clearly explain why these emperors could stand side by side. They were vague and unclear, and too much information had been lost in the lengthy turmoil.","Only Chu Yunfan knew that they relied on this self-sealing technique. Powerful emperors sealed themselves and waited for the time when they needed to be reborn.","Almost every generation of emperors would do this to seek some opportunities for eternal life. This led to many of them appearing simultaneously in the same era and fighting for the same opportunities.","Even until the final battle for Godhood, a long time ago, an emperor who was good at divination had made a prediction. He divined that a godhead would be born, and there would be a chance for them to prove their Dao and become a god.","Many emperors believed in that deduction and chose to seal themselves in various ways. They would only appear once in a while and travel the world before sealing themselves again.","Only after countless years of accumulation from prehistoric times did the world see the shocking scene of the emperors merging into one.","Even the emperors had no choice but to rely on such a method to extend their lifespans. This was in order to fight for the final opportunity to become a god, let alone ordinary people.","Therefore, after the initial shock, Chu Yunfan quickly accepted this matter.","Black-scaled Horned Eagle said, “According to the teleportation records of our past generations, when the Prodigy Battlefield opened in the past, less than 10,000 geniuses came. Usually, only a few thousand of them would appear! There has never been something like this, where more than 100,000 local and foreign geniuses are participating in the expedition. It’s a rare sight even in history!","“Why?” Chu Yunfan frowned.","These prodigies were just like those emperors in the past. After they sealed themselves, they delayed their aging. Usually, they would not break out of the seal under ordinary circumstances. Every time they did, they must have calculated that some opportunity would appear many years later, so they would break out at the right time.","This was because self-sealing was not a simple matter. It was not just a technique that could seal a person; it required a lot of heavenly and earthly treasures. It cost a huge price,","The stronger one was, the more treasures they needed to self-seal.","Therefore, only the most valued geniuses could receive such treatment and be sealed away to wait for a future opportunity.","On the other hand, ordinary geniuses simply didn’t have that chance.","Therefore, these self-sealed ones rarely broke out of their seals to obtain the opportunities they wanted.","This time, 100,000 geniuses had revived at the same time. What a shocking scene. If they all appeared in the outside world, it would probably cause a huge commotion. Who knew how many waves it would cause?","Even Grand Xia would be in a terrible state.","It was unknown how many of these people had survived since the recent or even ancient times. After all, the sects and factions that many of them belonged to had already been destroyed. It was unknown how many years had passed, but no one could control them anymore.","Moreover, these were the top geniuses in the past countless years. The cultivation techniques they practiced and the fortuitous encounters they obtained were all the strongest.","Almost all of them were geniuses at the top of the Prodigy List.","Once these people chose to break out of their seals, it wouldn’t take much time for them to grow to the point where they could shake the whole world.","Such a situation was not rare since ancient times!","In Grand Xia’s history, there were many top geniuses who seemed to have suddenly jumped out from the cracks of a rock. In a short time, they became influential figures around the world.","These people were often the ancient prodigies who had survived from the distant past.","These geniuses could be said to have caused Grand Xia to be extremely worried.","Every time they broke out of the seal, the price was very high. These people seemed to have discussed a plan beforehand where they would sing and then appear to avoid appearing simultaneously.","The world’s resources were limited. With so many geniuses awakening at the same time, the consumption would be extremely great. It would harm others but not benefit oneself.","This was also the reason why the Black-scaled Horned Eagle had said that there were usually not so many geniuses awakening at the same time.","Moreover, this was also why Chu Yunfan felt that this matter was unusual. He had entered the Prodigy Battlefield much later than ordinary people, so he didn’t see the prodigies raining down onto the battlefield. However, he could imagine how shocking it was.","There must be a reason why these geniuses, who usually did not meet each other, had all awakened.","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle glanced at Chu Yunfan and then carefully said, “Sir, I don’t know when it started, but a rumor has been spreading. It is said that in this life, the godhead will appear again.. The path to becoming a god will reappear!’"]},{"number":2081,"title":"Chapter 2081: My Life Is up to Me, Not the Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 2081: My Life Is up to Me, Not the Heavens","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The path to Godhood!","Chu Yunfan instantly understood why so many experts had chosen to awaken at the same time.","Since ancient times, it was this path that countless cultivators had yearned for!","The path of cultivation was an arduous one.","Countless talented geniuses chose to embark on this route with various goals.","However, everyone’s common goal was to become a god and live forever.","If they couldn’t become a god, so what if they were as powerful as the emperors?","In the end, they’d have no way to resist the passage of time,","Only by becoming a god could one live forever!","No matter how amazing a person was when they were alive, once they died, they would only be a cup of yellow soil.","Ever since the end of the ancient era, countless talented geniuses had been trying to find the whereabouts of godheads. However, many people had spent their entire lives without being able to find them.","Moreover, what they were bitterly seeking was the path to becoming a god!","Although he didn’t know how they knew that the path to godhood would open in this life, it was an indisputable fact that these prodigies had awakened all at the same time in this era.","Others could treat it as a rumor, but Chu Yunfan was different. He couldn’t treat it as something that didn’t matter, and the reason was simple; Others didn’t know that the godhead had appeared, but he knew that it had.","It wasn’t on anyone else but on him.","The godhead had indeed appeared in this life and found a new host!","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what kind of powerful person had divined it in such a distant era, but this was a huge crisis for him at the moment.","100,000 geniuses had appeared together in search of godheads. Once the news was leaked, the consequences would be unimaginable!","Fortunately, he was the only one who knew the godhead’s whereabouts!","The godhead was the foundation of everything. It was even more precious than the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, the Mountain River Diagram, and other things.","Godheads were the manifestation of all Great Daos itself!","As long as Chu Yunfan had it, cultivation was not difficult at all. As long as he had enough resources, there was almost no magical technique that he could not cultivate.","Over the years, he had constantly surpassed many experts, masters, and prodigies by relying on the godhead’s power. The more he advanced, the more precious it became. Many people might need to spend a lot of time to master a divine power, but Chu Yunfan could easily master it.","Just the time they could save from cultivating was enough to make countless people go crazy.","“The Path to Godhood!” Chu Yunfan said emotionally. “How many years have passed? From the immemorial era, to the ancient era and modern era, and then to the present. How many years have gone by? I’ve tirelessly pursued the path of becoming a god, but is there really immortality?”","He murmured in a low voice, his expression somewhat emotional.","Countless years had passed. Who knew how many geniuses had tirelessly pursued becoming a god? Was it really for the sake of becoming one?","Of course not- it was only for longevity!","In the era when the emperors stood side by side, which of them weren’t a top-notch expert that suppressed an era? Even if there were gods, these emperors would still dare to attack and personally kill the gods for you to see.","They were confident that their strength was not inferior to the gods, but they could not live forever like the rumored gods.","However, until now, no one could achieve the long-term vision that countless people wanted to achieve. Even Chu Yunfan suspected that this so-called vision did not exist at all.","Thinking of this, even his Dao heart wavered!","If the gods who lived for a long time and were high above really existed, why would they leave behind their divinity? Why would such a powerful god die?","If they didn’t exist, then what kind of existence were they?","The more he thought about it, the more confused he became. However, in the next moment, he regained his calm.","No matter what kind of view the road ahead had, he had to reach the peak before making a decision!","No one in the world could control his fate and force him to do things he did not want to do.","Afterward, his Dao heart became firm again.","The Black- scaled Horned Eagle clearly saw Chu Yunfan’s Dao heart wavering, along with the process of regaining its resistance. Its eyes flashed, but it still did not take the opportunity to attack. Chu Yunfan’s powerful suppression just","now was enough to let it understand how big the gap between them was.","Chu Yunfan turned to look at the eagle. He smiled faintly and said, “You didn’t attack just now. Very good. You know your place!”","The eagle was covered in sweat as if it had just walked through the gates of hell. Its thoughts just now did not escape Chu Yunfan’s eyes. If he wanted to kill it, it would only take one move.","In fact, even when his Dao heart was shaken, he was not completely defenseless. Even if he was, this Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s strength can’t even break through his defense.","The difference in strength between the two sides was so great that there was already a fundamental difference.","Chu Yunfan shouted, “Release your primordial spirit!’","The eagle didn’t dare to disobey. It quickly released its primordial spirit and let Chu Yunfan leave its mark on it, putting its life and death in his hands.","It had no other choice. Their strengths were too different.","Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction. From now on, this Black- scaled Horned Eagle was completely under his control. As long as he thought about it, he could kill it with ease.","“This Great Celestial Demon Art is your reward!”","Chu Yunfan flicked his finger, and a beam of light directly entered the eagle’s head.","Immediately after, its face revealed an ecstasy. Its pitch-black face was filled with rich expressions.","This was an extremely high-level cultivation technique. It was many times stronger than the cultivation technique inherited by its bloodline.","It was simply a world of difference!","Even it had to admit that the cultivation technique it had practiced before was simply dog shit. In fact, the one before had a huge limitation. Basically, it could only cultivate it to a certain extent before it automatically stopped.","It could be said that the nobler the bloodline, the higher the upper limit was. The Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s bloodline could only be considered ordinary among the many monster royal tribes. Even if one cultivated it to the extreme, there was still a huge restriction.","The strength of the demons was closely related to one’s bloodline. Thus, it was extremely difficult to break through one’s bloodline and advance to a higher stage, almost impossible.","Only one in a million could succeed in doing so!"]},{"number":2082,"title":"Chapter 2082: You’re Doomed!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2082: You’re Doomed!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The most famous one was when a carp leaped over the Dragon Gate, transforming its bloodline to become a true dragon.","However, that kind of thing was still only a legend among many demons!","The Dragon Gate was only a legendary divine item. Since the ancient era, no one had heard of the existence of such a thing.","However, the Great Heavenly Demon Technique was different. This was a top-notch cultivation technique that could completely transcend one’s bloodline.","Back then, there was an almighty figure called the Heavenly Demon Emperor among the emperors. His bloodline was very poor. Under normal circumstances, it was almost impossible for him to have greater achievements.","However, Heavenly Demon Emperor relied on his supreme aptitude and willpower to break through his bloodline’s limitations and became a Supreme Emperor. The Dharmic formulations he cultivated were also famous for a time.","It was the Great Celestial Demon Art.","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle was now completely under Chu Yunfan’s control. The stronger it was, the more benefits it would bring to him. In any case, it could not escape his control. No matter how strong it was, it could only be used by him.","Of course, the technique Chu Yunfan had given it was only the first part of the cultivation method. The true method that led directly to the Great Dao was still in his hands.","However, even if it was only a part of the cultivation method, it was enough to make the Black-scaled Horned Eagle feel ecstatic, also sweeping away its depression from being forcefully subdued by Chu Yunfan.","Moreover, it could vaguely feel a faint suppression from Chu Yunfan’s bloodline, as if he was a natural monarch.","It was not shameful to submit to such an existence.","The eagle didn’t know that it was because of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s bloodline in Chu Yunfan’s body that was suppressing its bloodline. The phoenix was the king of birds, and almost all birds were ruled by the phoenix clan. This kind of bloodline suppression had been formed since ancient times.","“Thank you, Master! ”","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle hurriedly lowered its head and bowed, its huge body continuously bowing down.","“Hahaha!” Suddenly, a surprised and mocking voice came from the distance. “l can’t believe how easy it was to find it!”","Chu Yunfan raised his head and saw two men descending from the sky. They appeared in front of him on a streak of light.","One of the two men looked to be in his 30s, while the other looked to be an old man in his 60s or 70s.","When they saw the Black-scaled Horned Eagle, their eyes immediately revealed a greedy expression.","The middle-aged man said in surprise and joy, “It really is the Black-scaled Horned Eagle that Young Master is looking for! I heard that there were some of them around here. I didn’t expect to meet one so quickly. This is great!”","“How lucky!” The old man also burst into laughter.","Chu Yunfan looked at the two men and said coldly, “Who are you?”","These two people were talking to themselves and ignoring him completely, as if they had already regarded this Black-scaled Horned Eagle as something in their possession.","On the side, the eagle’s face also flashed with a fierce expression, its huge head revealing an extremely ferocious expression.","Although it looked like a puppy in front of Chu Yunfan, it was actually a ferocious bird with a famous reputation.","It could be said that if it hadn’t encountered a tough guy like Chu Yunfan, it wouldn’t even put ordinary human geniuses in its eyes. If it appeared on the human-demon battlefield, it could rely on its own strength to defeat and swallow an entire elite army.","“Brat, it seems like you came in from the outside. Let me tell you, this","Black-scaled Horned Eagle has already been taken by the Marquis Tianwei. It’s an honor that you’re able to give the bird to him!” The old man looked at Chu Yunfan with an arrogant expression.","“Marquis Tianwei?” Chu Yunfan’s expression instantly turned extremely cold.","He was far too familiar with this Marquis Tianwei. However, wasn’t the title of Marquis Tianwei given to Jun Tianci?","Jun Tianci was ranked first on the Prodigy List two years ago. Grand Xia had long conferred that title to him. Compared to Li Qianyuan and Chu Yunfan, he had it much worse","It could even be said that in Grand Xia, this was the highest Marquis rank there was!","Unlike the title Marquis Zhenyuan that Chu Yunfan had, Marquis Tianwei was a top-notch lord!","Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci’s grudge also went without saying. It could be said that they were already irreconcilable.","Chu Yunfan hadn’t even gone to find trouble with Jun Tianci, but he had already run into two of his subordinates.","Although it was obvious from the looks of these two people that they weren’t geniuses who had entered from outside, they should still be natives to this place.","In the Prodigy Battlefield, the laws were more active and obvious. Coupled with the dense spirit energy, it could be compared to the grotto-heavens and blessed lands in the outside world. Therefore, many experts were said to be around here.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “If it were someone else, perhaps you two wouldn’t have to die. But since you are Jun Tianci’s men, you’re doomed!”","“You’re courting death! ”","Their expressions instantly turned fierce. They weren’t stupid, and they knew that Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid of Jun Tianci. Instead, he showed killing intent.","Obviously, he was Jun Tianci’s enemy from outside.","“Brat, I don’t care who you are. Since you dare to oppose Marquis Tianwei, I’ll capture you today before going to see him!” At this moment, the old man’s face revealed a fierce expression.","Boom!","He attacked in an instant. On the Prodigy Battlefield, countless spirit energy of heaven and earth condensed into his hand. Afterward, he condensed a golden sword.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. This old man’s technique was quite interesting.","There were many impurities in the spirit energy, and it was divided into many different attributes.","To be able to condense the metal-elemental spirit energy into a sword in an instant, this old man’s cultivation and strength were quite good.","In an instant, the sword light turned into a golden stream that swept across the sky, tearing everything apart and stabbing toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","Swoosh!","Swing!","The sword’s speed was so fast that even Chu Yunfan didn’t have time to react. The old man’s sword pierced his head. However, before the old man could show a happy expression, Chu Yunfan’s face was filled with joy instead. The golden sword actually shattered inch by inch, unable to pierce Chu","Yunfan.","“D*mn it!”","The old man was shocked and retreated.","However, there was no time for that. Chu Yunfan stretched out his hands and tore him apart with terrifying force, turning the old man into a rain of blood.."]},{"number":2083,"title":"Chapter 2083: The Black-Scaled Horned Eagle Reaches the Middle Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2083: The Black-Scaled Horned Eagle Reaches the Middle Arcana Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Despite being a simple move, a Minor Arcane like that had been torn apart.","“He couldn’t even break through his defense!”","When the Black-scaled Horned Eagle saw this scene, its eyes that were as huge as millstones narrowed as if it had seen a monster.","Chu Yunfan’s defense was too amazing. It was very glad that it didn’t attack back then. Otherwise, it wouldn’t even be able to break through Chu Yunfan’s defense. Instead, it would be killed with a slap.","When the middle-aged man saw this, he was utterly terrified. At most, his cultivation base was about the same as the other old man’s, both of them being Minor Arcanes.","Among the natives of the Prodigy Battlefield, he was originally considered a local tyrant. Later, he was subdued by Marquis Tianwei, Jun Tianci, and became his subordinate.","Jun Tianci’s strength was enough to make the two of them submit to him!","He had only wanted to help that man capture a Black-scaled Horned Eagle, but who would have thought that he would run into such a ruthless person?","He immediately fled into the distance.","However, how could Chu Yunfan let him go? He immediately reached out with one hand, a huge amount of spirit energy appearing out of thin air as he grabbed the middle-aged man in an instant.","In the next moment, the man who had just fled for a hundred miles was captured.","Chu Yunfan asked lightly, “Tell me, where is Jun Tianci now?”","Suddenly, a terrifying force gushed out from the middle-aged man’s mind. In the next second, his head exploded.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes turned cold. Someone had clearly placed a seal on this man’s head. Once Jun Tianci was involved, it would explode automatically.","The only person who could do this was undoubtedly Jun Tianci himself.","From this, it could be seen that his actions were flawless, and he was even more ruthless than Li Qianyuan. He didn’t allow other people a chance to catch him.","Chu Yunfan collected the two corpses and watered them on the Brahma Tree. After more than ten years of growth, the tree was twice as big as it was a decade ago. Its absorption and conversion ability had also undergone earth- shattering changes.","Moreover, it could even absorb and transform the blood of Arcanes quickly. In just a moment, two beautiful Brahma Fruits had grown on it.","Chu Yunfan had consumed a lot of spirit stones. He frowned slightly. He had spent all his time in seclusion to recover from his injuries. When he was in the stage of rebirth, he had spent the only wealth he had. By now, he was broke.","He had to think of a way to get deep pockets!","In his hands were two spatial bags. They were the ones carried by the two experts he had killed.","In the past, he had no way to deal with this kind of bag. Unless his main body opened it personally, it would be very difficult for outsiders to open it even if they obtained it.","Only those in the Arcana Stage could have such an ability!","This is because after reaching the Arcana Stage, one’s strength would not only soar, but they would also understand spatial law to a certain degree. Only with this could they open a spatial bag with their own strength.","Chu Yunfan followed the method recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book and spent a moment opening the two spatial bags. The primordial spirits attached to them were not able to withstand a single blow.","However, after checking inside, Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but be disappointed as there was almost nothing good in them. The two experts’ combined items were only a mere 100,000 high-grade spirit stones.","“Why do they have so little?” Chu Yunfan said gloomily.","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “Master, I think Jun Tianci must have taken their stuff!”","Obviously, Chu Yunfan had already known about this situation. These people had become Jun Tianci’s followers, so of course they couldn’t have done so voluntarily. They must have gone through a great battle.","As losers, they had no right or ability to preserve their wealth. No matter how much wealth they had, it would become the spoils of war for the victors.","It was rare for someone like Chu Yunfan to bestow an extremely important cultivation technique as soon as he arrived.","He said gloomily, “l see!”","Despite that, it was better to have 100,000 high-grade spirit stones than nothing!","Chu Yunfan plucked one of the two Brahma Fruits and handed it to the eagle. He said, “Eat it. Combined with the Great Celestial Demon Art, try to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage!’","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle was overjoyed, with even a rare touch of emotion in its huge eyes. It had thought that it would definitely be like a cow or horse when following Chu Yunfan, and it would never be able to escape.","But now, it had already reaped so many benefits without even doing anything for him yet.","“Master, 1 am grateful for your kindness. I will definitely climb mountains of knives and dive into seas of fire for you in the future!”","The Black-scaled Horned Eagle transformed into a human. He became a man in his thirties. He received the Brahma Fruit from Chu Yunfan with excitement.","Chu Yunfan nodded. To him, this eagle was his confidant. The stronger he was now, the more he could help him.","In any case, this eagle could not escape his control anymore.","The eagle stared at the Brahma Fruit, which emitted a faint fluctuation. The fluctuations had a fatal attraction to him, and even he did not understand why.","He immediately consumed the fruit. Afterward, his body began to undergo some changes. Waves of enormous demonic energy were released from his body.","He hurriedly began to cultivate according to the techniques recorded in the Great Celestial Demon Art, turning this powerful energy into his own.","Chu Yunfan watched from the side, but he did not idle around. He swallowed the other Brahma Fruit and began to circulate the Emperor Method to digest it.","The enormous medicinal power swirled around in his body as he swiftly absorbed it. Almost every cell was cheering as they took in this abundant energy.","After a long time, eagle finally came back to his senses from his cultivation state. At this moment, his cultivation had undergone earth-shattering changes compared to before.","He had advanced to the Middle Arcana Stage from the Minor Arcana Stage!","This change was reflected in his combat strength as it had directly doubled.."]},{"number":2084,"title":"Chapter 2084: Nighttime in the Prodigy Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2084: Nighttime in the Prodigy Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This huge improvement made Black Eagle feel ecstatic!","If he himself wanted to break through, even he did not know how much time he would need to spend to achieve it.","But after following Chu Yunfan for a short while, he had advanced!","He was completely subservient to Chu Yunfan, not only because he was being controlled, but also because he had a big stick in one hand and a carrot in the other!","While Black Eagle was advancing, Chu Yunfan was not idling around either.","His cultivation speed, which was initially suppressed, had already risen to the Minor Arcana Stage in a short period.","After reaching this level, he once again stopped supplying spirit energy to the godhead, interrupting his progress in comprehending the Dao,","This was because the Brahma Fruit’s energy had already been completely absorbed. If he continued enlightenment, his entire body would be sucked dry.","Moreover, his combat strength had also doubled from its original foundation.","Although Black Eagle’s strength had increased by a lot and had also doubled, his basic combat prowess was completely different. Therefore, although his cultivation had increased to a new stage, the gap between his combat strength and Chu Yunfan’s was even greater.","Chu Yunfan looked over and suddenly, night had fallen. The afterglow of the setting sun shone from afar.","“Is there a normal cycle of day and night on the Prodigy Battlefield?” His eyes lit up. He knew that creating a small world was already very difficult.","The Flying Celestials also had such a small world. It was just that its size was different, but its essence was the same.","However, it was always daytime in the sect’s small world. It was consistently enveloped in light.","In terms of the entire world’s level, it was of course incomparable to a world that could simulate normal day-night rotation. With just this point alone, no matter how much Chu Yunfan overestimated the master who created this small world, it would never be an exaggeration.","At this point, the Black Eagle suddenly trembled and said, “Oh no, it’s already dark. Master, we can’t stay here for long. We’d better find a city to settle down in as soon as possible, or something bad will happen!’","“Something bad? What will happen?” Chu Yunfan frowned, but he did feel that the temperature in the world seemed to drop as night fell.","Originally, with his cultivation, even if the temperature difference changed by thousands of degrees, it would be difficult to hurt him, let alone make him feel it.","However, this sudden drop contained extremely uncomfortable Yin energy. Moreover, this energy invaded Chu Yunfan’s body through every pore.","He immediately circulated the Emperor Method to expel it.","However, more and more Yin energy soon surrounded him.","From afar, there was a series of furious roars. It wasn’t the sound of one or two experts fighting. On the contrary, it was similar to a huge battlefield.","Thousands of troops were fighting here!","In the sky, figures appeared in front of Chu Yunfan as night fell.","The Yin energy on these figures soared into the sky, and they carried extremely terrifying hostility as they quickly surrounded them.","“The Prodigy Battlefield...” Chu Yunfan seemed to understand why this place was given that name.","Boundless night enveloped the entire surroundings, with a few streaks of light that swept across the sky. In just a moment, they had already cut through the sky. However, black figures appeared out of thin air and blocked these light streaks.","The figures in the light attacked one after another, defeating the black figures in front of them. Despite that, they were still surrounded by countless black shadows, revealing their faces.","If an outsider saw these people, they would immediately react. Weren’t these the top few experts on the previous generation’s Prodigy List?","The Flying Celestials’ next leader, Yang Dengxian, was dressed in a white robe and had a cold expression.","On the other hand, there was a peerless beauty holding a red ribbon in one hand while sharply swinging her sword. Wasn’t she the unparalleled genius among the demons, Hu Qingxuan?","There were also some others who wore scholarly robes and held the Seasons Brush. Every stroke they made formed a huge character, and each one could destroy a black figure.","This was the second-ranked Virtuous Academy’s current successor, Meng","Tianran.","On the other side, there was a young man dressed in a purple robe. He was one of the top geniuses of the previous generation from Great Change Faith, Zi Buyu.","Moreover, there was also the southern barbarian Fire Cloud Cave’s young master, Meng Potian, who was dressed in beast skin and had a strong body.","Each of these people was a peerless expert who had set off a boundless tide in recent years. Back then, they were only prodigies on the Prodigy List. Now, they were big shots who could influence the world’s situation.","However, these big shots were scattered all over the world. When they met, they weren’t at peace. Even when the human and the non-human race experts met, they would fight for 300 rounds.","In the outside world, they were either competitors or mortal enemies of different factions and races.","Despite that, at this time, they had all joined forces to form a small team to explore the Prodigy Battlefield.","“This won’t do. If this continues, more and more spirits will be revived. We’ll be swallowed by these guys sooner or later!” Meng Potian smashed a black figure that was flying over with a punch, his face without the slightest bit of arrogance. On the contrary, it was filled with worry.","All of them were powerful cultivators. The powerful blood in their bodies was like a beacon on the battlefield after night fell, attracting countless heroic spirits.","No matter how many they could kill with a single punch, these spirits would soon pounce on them from all directions.","Even though they were powerful, they still felt extremely exhausted when facing so many of these things. They might even die of exhaustion.","Once they ran out of energy, they would probably be devoured by these heroic spirits.","If these ghosts and heroic spirits could have their flesh and blood, they would naturally be able to advance further and reach an unprecedented stage.","“We came at the wrong time. I didn’t expect it to be night already!” Hu","Qingxuan’s beautiful face also revealed a somewhat anxious expression.","Meng Tianran kept working with the Season Brush, every word he wrote killed a spirit. This was the “Seasons Punishment.” There were almost no evil spirits in the world who were not afraid of this technique.","“In the past, I only heard that the Prodigy Battlefield was very terrifying at night, I didn’t expect it to be ten times harder to deal with than what the rumors say!”"]},{"number":2085,"title":"Chapter 2085: The Miserable Friends","paragraphs":["Chapter 2085: The Miserable Friends","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Meng Tianran wrote out the word “kill” as he continuously circulated his internal energy, forming righteous energy around his body to resist the Yin energy in the surroundings.","Everyone fell silent. They were all geniuses with powerful inheritances. The Prodigy Battlefield only opened once every few hundred years, so how could the various large factions not know anything about it?","In this place, other than geniuses from different enemy forces and the natives, the most terrifying thing was the atmosphere at night.","When night arrives, the Prodigy Battlefield would be enveloped in Yin energy. The energy was mixed with spirit energy, and these black shadows were none other than the hero spirits of the prodigies who had died in this place.","Although they have been dead for countless years, a trace of their divine spirit had already been imprinted in this world. Every time night fell, they would wake up with the spread of Yin energy.","These spirits were extremely powerful experts when they were alive, and many people were not inferior to them. After their deaths, even if they were now spirits, they were still very difficult to deal with.","Most importantly, they had left a trace of their godly spirit brand in this world. Even if they were killed with a punch, they could be revived with the Yin energy’s help. Thus, it was safe to assume they were immortal to a certain extent.","If these experts could not escape from the hero spirits and died here, they would become one of the spirits and tirelessly chase after the geniuses who entered from outside.","They didn’t need much to stay alive. Just the powerful blood essence of these prodigies was already a feast for these hero spirits.","Some of the powerful ones devoured the blood of the prodigies who came later, and their strength changed drastically. They grew stronger, and they could even break free from the shackles of nighttime and appear in broad daylight. This was the most terrifying fact about them.","Therefore, no matter how many these experts killed, they would only feel like the spirits were increasing. Moreover, it even felt like there was no end to them. The speed at which they slaughtered couldn’t keep up with the speed at which the spirits appeared.","This Prodigy Battlefield had existed for countless years, but nobody knew how many prodigies had died in it.","These prodigies all turned into hero spirits. In the night, they began to condense their bodies from when they were alive and began to hunt down the prodigies who came later.","“We have to find a city to settle down in as soon as possible. Otherwise, we’ll all die!” Zi Buyu shouted, his body turning into a sea of purple lightning.","Countless hero spirits that approached him instantly died. However, not long afterward, they revived under the Yin energys nourishment. It was almost endless, and there was no way to kill them all.","These people were all trapped here at this moment, and it was almost impossible for them to move. The few of them could only work together to slaughter their way out among the increasing number of hero spirits, but their speed was too slow.","Even with the density of their divine powers, they could feel some signs of being unable to withstand it. They claimed that their divine power was boundless, but in the end, it was limited.","Even if they were to consume divine power recovery pills at the same time, they still wouldn’t be able to keep up with this shocking consumption.","Facing the hero spirits, none of these people dared to relax at all. They all used their trump cards.","Normally, ordinary people wouldn’t even have the chance to see this happen. However, the situation was very visible now. One could see that these prodigies had already been forced to a dead end.","They had to fight their way out of this long night and persist until dawn.","Hu Qingxuan quickly said, “There are too many of them. We can’t escape!” The red ribbon in her hand had already gone numb from killing.","Suddenly, just as they were about to fall into depression, they saw a bright light shining in the distance.","Meng Potian hurriedly said, “We’re saved. Let’s hurry over there!”","They looked over, one after another. Sure enough, there was a light in the distance. In this darkness, if a person could see light, it meant that someone was there.","Without thinking, they crossed the sky and pierced through the hero spirits that were chasing after them. Finally, after their divine power had almost run out, they arrived at where the light was.","Then, they saw something that almost made their jaws drop.","It was in a desert, where a pile of firewood was lit in the cold wind. When the wind blew over the fire, it turned into an awe-inspiring aura. Not only did it not extinguish the flames, but it also turned into an aura that helped the pile of firewood burn.","Beside it was a man in green sitting cross-legged. Surrounded by countless hero spirits, he was meditating and cultivating. When everyone saw this, they all looked as if they had seen a ghost.","In the night under the control of these hero spirits, almost everyone was struggling to survive. Even powerful prodigies like them who could summon wind and rain outside were in a very sorry state under the spirits’ siege.","Not far away from the man, the Black-scaled Horned Eagle, who was now about the size of a human, was releasing a terrifying aura. It was as if a monstrous sea of blood was sweeping toward a figure in front of it.","In front of it was a man who looked to be in his thirties. His clothes were extremely simple and exquisite, and his body carried an ancient aura.","In his hand was a long halberd, and every move he made contained great power. He seemed different from ordinary hero spirits.","Most spirits were illusory, and the aura on their bodies was also chaotic. For this one, his face was angular. It was obvious that it was a human face, the one that resembled a hero spirit when it was alive.","The gray-white chainmail armor coupled with the monstrous Yin energy made his strength not much weaker than when he was alive.","This hero spirit continuously attacked the Black-scaled Horned Eagle with his halberd. He wanted to defeat the eagle and even kill the person behind it.","However, he could not do anything at all. Black Eagle was already in the Middle Arcana Stage, after all. Moreover, Black Eagle kept blocking his attacks, and none of his attacks were effective. Even the flames on the pile of firewood could not be extinguished.","The hero spirit’s eyes flashed with greed as he looked at the eagle and the unknown man.","Instinct had driven him here. He had devoured some geniuses in the past, but he had recovered some of his consciousness and strength.","At this moment, he had a gut feeling that as long as he could eat that man, his cultivation would return to the peak of his previous life.."]},{"number":2086,"title":"Chapter 2086: Shocking the Hero Spirit With One Stab","paragraphs":["Chapter 2086: Shocking the Hero Spirit With One Stab","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Yang Dengxian and the others looked at the countless hero spirits in the distance. They were like a small boat in a stormy sea that could capsize at any time.","However, in this sea, that person sat steadily on the fishing platform-completely unaffected by these hero spirits. Endless lightning swirled around his body. The spirits who tried to approach were directly destroyed by it before they could even get close.","Other than the halberd-wielding hero spirit, the other ones had no way of approaching this person.","“What dense divine power!” Hu Qingxuan’s red lips parted slightly, and a look of disbelief flashed in her beautiful eyes.","All of them were already Minor Arcanes, and their cultivation bases could be said to be shocking. They don’t look down upon even three to five of these spirits.","After all, most of these spirits were acting with resentment!","They were all top-notch prodigies when they were alive, and some were even self-proclaimed geniuses from the past. Later on, they landed in the Prodigy Battlefield for various reasons.","If the big goal hasn’t been accomplished, then the ambition cannot be fulfilled!","All of this turned into a wave of resentment that was marked into this world, resulting in them relying on Yin energy at night to revive.","However, this was only a short revival. Ultimately, they just turned into vengeful souls with no consciousnesses and only knew how to devour human blood.","Ordinary people could not do anything to them, but this did not include Yang Dengxian and the others. However, an exception could happen if these hero spirits devoured the blood essence of some prodigies, greatly increasing their strength and developing their intelligence.","Just like that halberd-wielding hero spirit, it could pose a huge threat to them.","However, even so, with this group of people’s strength, they were still cautious. This was the reason why these proud and aloof prodigies chose to cooperate with each other.","What really troubled them was that these spirits could be resurrected continuously. The Yin energy in the world was endless, so these hero spirits were able to revive themselves indefinitely.","Even with their dense divine power, they couldn’t hold on in such a high-intensity battle forever.","Although these hero spirits weren’t as strong as when they were alive, they still needed to use their full strength to destroy them every time. Moreover, the spirits immediately revive. This kind of continuous attack was the root of their grief.","Many prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield were tortured to death. In the end, their divine powers didn’t have time to recover before they were dismembered by these hero spirits.","The hero spirit holding the halberd had clearly devoured a lot of flesh and blood before regaining a portion of its intelligence.","On the other hand, it wasn’t that Yang Dengxian and the others couldn’t do what Chu Yunfan was doing, but it wouldn’t take long for their divine power to run out.","They watched for a long time. Chu Yunfan’s divine power was endless and did not show any signs of exhaustion. He didn’t even take any pills to replenish his consumption.","From this, it could be seen that his divine power recovery speed was far beyond their imagination. They could also see the denseness of his power from this.","Just this alone was enough to make them feel the gap they had between Chu","Yunfan.","“Isn’t that the senior who killed Li Yuanjia?” Yang Dengxian immediately recognized the person in the endless sea of lightning. Wasn’t he the unknown expert who had killed Li Yuanjia?","Although Chu Yunfan had killed many experts, he was far from impressed by the fact that he had killed Li Yuanjia, who was once as famous as him.","Everyone’s expressions changed. Li Yuanjia’s death had caused a huge sensation in their circle, and they had been concerned about it.","Of course, they all knew what had happened.","The Destiny Sect had paid such a huge price in an attempt to kill Chu Hongcai, but in the end, they were interrupted by an expert who appeared out of nowhere.","At that time, he slaughtered without hesitation. Not only Li Yuanjia, but also killed a large number of the Destiny Sect’s elders, Xiang Feiyun’s protector, and other hidden experts from other races.","With just one battle, he shocked the world.","Various large sects had used all sorts of methods to investigate him, but they could not find any traces.","In the end, news spread that even the Mysteries Pavilion was unable to deduce this expert’s origins.","Generally speaking, the more powerful one was and the closer one’s connection with heaven and earth was, the harder it was for others to track their information. However, that was speaking in that sort of case.","In this situation, there was no news regarding this expert at all. It was as if he had jumped out of nowhere.","Everyone was speculating that he must have a magical artifact that could hide his secrets. Otherwise, the Mysteries Pavilion wouldn’t have been able to deduce it.","Despite that, if it were so easy to find out his identity, he would’ve been torn","to pieces by the Destiny Sect by now.","They all thought that this person should be an old senior who had lived in seclusion for many years. Otherwise, how could they not have heard of him at all?","Contrary to their thoughts, reality had completely overturned their understanding.","Chu Yunfan was able to enter the Prodigy Battlefield, which meant that his age was definitely not old. He should also meet this place’s standards.","Since ancient times, there had never been anyone who could enter the Prodigy Battlefield even though they were older.","Just as they were still in shock, they saw Chu Yunfan, who had been resting with his eyes closed, suddenly move. With a casual grab, he caught countless thunderbolts with his hand and turned into a huge lightning spear.","The spear pierced through the sky and instantly stabbed the halberd-wielding hero spirit, nailing him to the ground.","On the other hand, the spirit didn’t die. It could only struggle and scream, unable to move at all.","“Hiss, what a terrifying attack!”","Meng Potian’s sword-like eyebrows furrowed slightly. This unknown expert’s strength was terrifying.","That hero spirit was at least a Middle Arcane. It was a terrifying existence that they could not hope to catch up to at the moment.","If they were to encounter such a powerful existence that had recovered its strength from when it was alive on the battlefield, they would probably have to fight to the end to escape. Moreover, they might even be chased until the end of their lives.","On this Prodigy Battlefield, this kind of hero spirit was the most terrifying.","Despite that, it was no match for Chu Yunfan’s attack.","At this moment, they seemed to have understood how he had slaughtered a group of Minor Arcanes who were on par or even stronger than them so easily.","Only Yang Dengxian had a different feeling. He sensed that Chu Yunfan was obviously stronger than before.."]},{"number":2087,"title":"Chapter 2087: Beating the Hero Spirit, Greatly Advancing in Cultivation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2087: Beating the Hero Spirit, Greatly Advancing in Cultivation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although Chu Yunfan had killed the strong enemy in such a straightforward manner that Yang Dengxian found it unfathomable, it was the same now. He couldn’t even guess the man’s strength from his actions.","However, he still had an obvious feeling that Chu Yunfan had grown stronger by not just more than a little, but it was almost a rampant increase!","This was just a guess. However, Yang Dengxian believed in his own intuition. Cultivators believed in their own guts because it was often the most accurate.","What Yang Dengxian didn’t know was that his intuition was very accurate. Compared to when he had just come out of seclusion, Chu Yunfan was indeed much stronger, and it wasn’t just a small amount of improvement.","On the other hand, the others were even more shocked by Chu Yunfan’s shocking performance. It wasn’t difficult to kill a hero spirit, but to pin this specific one down was a very difficult thing.","Of course, this was possible if one’s strength was completely above this hero spirit’s.","The way everyone looked at Chu Yunfan had completely changed. This was because he wasn’t even that old, and he was vastly different from the senior they assumed he was.","This was also very important, because it meant that his potential was above that. In the future, he could even reach a limit that they could not even imagine.","After Chu Yunfan nailed the halberd-wielding hero spirit to the ground, he sat cross-legged again. Suddenly, he saw Yang Dengxian and the others in the distance, and a hint of surprise flashed across his eyes.","He didn’t expect to see them at this time.","It was obvious that they did not enter the battlefield as soon as it opened. They had waited until their cultivation had reached the Minor Arcana Stage and gathered enough strength to protect themselves before they chose to enter this place and meet him directly.","Chu Yunfan said, “A friend has arrived from afar. Why don’t you come and greet him?”","Yang Dengxian and the others saw that Chu Yunfan had already discovered them, so they immediately stopped hiding. At the same time, they were also being chased by the hero spirits behind them, so they quickly entered Chu","Yunfan’s lightning domain.","The hero spirits behind were barricaded by the domain.","In addition to Black Eagle guarding the perimeter, Chu Yunfan’s location became a safe place.","The flames and powerful blood essence attracted more and more hero spirits. They almost the entire surroundings, taking up all the space. Despite that, they were all blocked by the domain and couldn’t approach.","As the domain’s core, Chu Yunfan had been maintaining his bursts of divine power without any signs of exhaustion. His power’s density and recovery speed also made Yang Dengxian and the others envious.","“Thank you for taking us in, Daoist Brother!”","As the only person who had seen Chu Yunfan, Yang Dengxian immediately stepped forward and cupped his hands. He guessed that even if Chu Yunfan was older than them, he wouldn’t be so far off in age. Therefore, Yang","Dengxian couldn’t call him Senior anymore and could only call him Dao Brother.","He had a bitter smile on his face. Before this, he would never have thought that he and the others would actually become stray dogs not long after entering the Prodigy Battlefield.","They were chased by these hero spirits for thousands of miles and almost died in their pursuit.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand and said, “It’s fine. This is a simple matter!”","He couldn’t restore his original identity and reunite with Yang Dengxian, but he could still provide him with some kindness","He had been here for most of the night. When night first fell, Black Eagle showed great unease. Soon, Chu Yunfan learned from it that the Prodigy Battlefield became extremely terrifying at night.","It could almost be said that even the top-notch prodigies didn’t dare to roam freely around this place at night because it was far too risky.","Other than that, Chu Yunfan had accidentally discovered that spirits he defeated would turn into pure Yin energy. Afterward, their wills would be projected into it, and the energy would resurrect the spirit again.","Ordinary people had no way to deal with these nearly-immortal hero spirits, which was why they left behind so many terrifying legends.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had cultivated the Heaven Devouring Art, so the spirit energy also became energy that he could naturally use. After defeating some hero spirits, he took advantage of the spirits and the Yin energy before they revived, refining the Yin energy for his own use.","The energy condensed from the spirits was at least ten times purer than the Yin energy that filled the entire battlefield at night.","There was no need to refine it at all; he could directly use them.","Of course, this was also thanks to his Imperial, Thunderclap, and Immemorial Dark Phoenix Physiques being too powerful. They could resist the Yin energy’s corrosion. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would have been frozen into a popsicle after the first breath.","However, not only did these hero spirits not pose any threat to him, but they had also become contributors to his cultivation.","He continuously killed them and absorbed the Yin energy. In just half a night, he discovered that his cultivation had increased at an astonishing speed.","It could be said that it was almost equivalent to several months of bitter cultivation!","Chu Yunfan had only just reached the Minor Arcana Stage, but now, he was showing signs of breaking through to the Middle Arcana Stage.","Although these were only signs, it was enough to make him excited.","Chu Yunfan muttered to himself, “There are too many benefits in the Prodigy Battlefield. Even if there’s nothing else, just refining this Yin energy can save countless years of hard cultivation. No wonder so many prodigies want to enter this place!”","He finally understood why so many people’s cultivations would often advance by leaps and bounds after going through the Prodigy Battlefield’s trials.","He made the right decision to come this time. Even with this Yin energy alone, he was confident that his cultivation would soar greatly in the coming days. He could even gather enough strength to fight Jun Tianci.","The others saw that Chu Yunfan wasn’t difficult to talk with, so they immediately went forward to greet him. In this world, the strong were respected. Only Chu Yunfan’s almost unfathomable cultivation could make these usually high and mighty figures submit to him.","Even the monstrous demonic aura emitted by the Black-scaled Horned Eagle beside him had already crushed them. It wasn’t something they could compare to.","Hu Qingxuan cupped her hands and said, “It’s all thanks to you being here today. Otherwise, even if we could escape these hero spirits, we would’ve been skinned alive! ”","Even as a prodigy of the Heavenly Fox Clan, she didn’t have the clan’s seductiveness. Instead, her every frown and smile actually carried hints of purity.."]},{"number":2088,"title":"Chapter 2088: The Night Ends and Dawn Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 2088: The Night Ends and Dawn Arrives","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan glanced at Hu Qingxuan and found her rather interesting. He had","once heard that the Heavenly Fox Clan had a special heavenly technique, After one successfully cultivated it, they would be completely different from the clan’s usual charming fox-like appearance. Moreover, only the clan’s direct descendants with the purest bloodline were qualified to cultivate it.","Hu Qingxuan clearly practiced this technique. Hence, she was starkly different compared to the other Heavenly Foxes.","Chu Yunfan smiled and replied, “Since we’ve met, then it must be fate. We’re just helping each other- It’s not worth mentioning!’","Everyone looked at his relaxed demeanor and couldn’t help but sigh. Comparisons were truly infuriating.","With Chu Yunfan’s continuous attacks, a safe zone was formed. Everyone finally heaved a sigh of relief. Then, they also began to attack the endless stream of hero spirits.","Chu Yunfan was surprised to find that he wasn’t the only one who knew the secret of being able to absorb Yin energy. Yang Dengxian, Hu Qingxuan, Meng Potian, Meng Tianran, Zi Buyu, and the others all knew this secret.","After killing a hero spirit, they began to absorb the Yin energy left behind. The Yin energy condensed from the spirits was many times purer than ordinary Yin energy, and its energy level was much higher.","It saved them a lot of trouble!","They all obviously knew about this secret, but Chu Yunfan immediately understood that he was the only one who was aware of this. After all, it wasn’t the first time that the Prodigy Battlefield had been opened. In the countless years of history, it had opened many times, and many prodigies had entered. It would be a big joke if no one had discovered something like this.","Each of these people had an extremely deep foundation. They had entered the Prodigy Battlefield and probably had obtained information accumulated by their sects for generations. They were much better than Chu Yunfan, who didn’t know anything.","Originally, Chu Yunfan should have received such treatment, but because of Jun Tianci, he didn’t want to restore his identity for the time being. Thus, he could only travel with another identity.","Although Yang Dengxian and the others also knew this secret, their absorption efficiency was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","This Yin energy was extremely pure and cold, freezing even a Creator if he breathed in it. Even powerful experts like them who had entered the Arcana Stage could be considered masters in the world.","Despite that, they still had to carefully absorb the Yin energy ball. It took them fifteen minutes to finish absorbing it.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan was different. After dispersing the hero spirits on the spot, he could immediately absorb their Yin energy for his own use. In just a few moments, he had completely refined the energy and sucked it up.","Just his efficiency alone was more than twenty times higher than the others’.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan could absorb several balls of Yin energy at the same time, which made his efficiency even more amazing.","Everyone had a tacit understanding and didn’t speak further. Instead, they began to work together to kill the endless spirits that filled the mountains and plains while increasing their cultivation.","It was as if someone had pressed the fast-forward button as nobody felt time passing by. Soon, nighttime had already ended, with the Yin energy and hero spirits quietly retreating.","Now, all that was left was a mess.","Other than Chu Yunfan, Yang Dengxian and the others were more or less in a sorry state. They were no longer as carefree as they were outside.","However, they did not think much of it. Compared to being chased like stray dogs in the first half of the night, they were already considered lucky to keep killing hero spirits and absorbing Yin energy for their cultivation in the second half of the night.","Everyone could feel that their levels had greatly improved. Their improvements were almost equivalent to cultivating in the outside world for a month.","It had only been one night, and they had already obtained such a huge harvest. No wonder countless seniors wanted to think of ways to enter the Prodigy Battlefield.","The gap between those who could not enter this place and those who could would be widened several times.","Although this was thanks to Chu Yunfan protecting them and them not having to worry about being ambushed by the spirits, such a huge harvest still pleasantly surprised them.","In front of Chu Yunfan, the halberd-wielding hero spirit that had been nailed to the ground and unable to move also turned into a cloud of black smoke and disappeared in front of everyone.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the pure Yin energy that was about to dissipate and swallowed it. After a while, he completely digested it, increasing his cultivation by a level.","That halberd-wielding hero spirit was clearly of a much higher level than the ordinary ones without wills, and its Yin energy was also purer.","Yang Dengxian and the others were dumbfounded. Although they already knew, they had to admit that there were still abnormal people in the world when they saw Chu Yunfan easily absorb the Yin energy that, in their case, would take more than two hours to absorb.","‘No wonder he dared to challenge a monster like Jun Tianci. He’s also a monster himself!’ This thought appeared in everyone’s minds.","At this moment, Yang Dengxian stepped forward and said, “It was all thanks to your help last night. I’m ashamed that I haven’t even asked for your name. I’ll definitely repay this kindness in the future, Brother.","Chu Yunfan casually threw out a fake name, “l am Jian Wuchen!”","Everyone did not know if this name was real or fake, but they all remembered it in their hearts. They had a feeling that this name would definitely be famous throughout the world.","Yang Dengxian proposed, “Do you have a destination in mind, Brother? If not, you can come with us to a nearby city. What do you think? We could take care of each other on the way!’","“Alright then.” Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and nodded. “Let’s go to the nearby city together! ”","Seeing that he had already agreed, the others didn’t hesitate any longer. They all used their flying lights. A moment later, there was no one left in this messy area.","The sun rose from the east, and sunlight shone down on the entire city. A city with about 100,000 people appeared in front of Chu Yunfan and the others.","After entering, Chu Yunfan separated from them. Instead of joining them, he went to stay in a quaint inn.","The entire place was decorated in an ancient style. It was unknown when it was built, but its design was very different from the present-day inns.","It was currently packed with people, and all of them were experts in their own regions. Even the weakest of them were at the Creation Stage, and there were even Minor Arcanes among them.","This would be a rare sight if it were outside, but it seemed to be harmonious here.."]},{"number":2089,"title":"Chapter 2089: The Current Era’s Prodigies Outshine the Past Era’s","paragraphs":["Chapter 2089: The Current Era’s Prodigies Outshine the Past Era’s","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As many experts were around, even the Minor Arcanes didn’t dare to be impudent. They were all restraining their auras.","This was especially true for the Prodigy Battlefield’s locals. They all understood that in the years since the battlefield had opened, these foreign experts were the most terrifying existences.","This is because they usually consisted of the world’s top geniuses or a certain era’s top genius, way in the past. Any one of them could become a world-shaking figure when they grew up.","Even if they didn’t, they still wouldn’t allow others to humiliate them.","“How many hero spirits did you kill last night? I killed two of them, but unfortunately, I only managed to absorb one. The remaining one dissipated before I could!”","“I’ve absorbed two of them. My cultivation has increased by at least ten percent! ”","“On the battlefield yesterday, the strongest ones were indeed those foreign prodigies. We can see that by their secret techniques that hail from all eras, races, and sects!”","In the hall, many people were discussing animatedly, but they were talking about how many hero spirits they had killed last night.","However, with their cultivation, their efficiency in killing the spirits wasn’t as good as Yang Dengxian and the others, who weren’t even on Chu Yunfan’s level. Throughout the entire night, the most powerful expert among everyone was only able to absorb three to five balls of Yin energy. Usually, it would take an entire night to absorb one of them.","Despite that, these people’s cultivations had increased.","“It’s been several years since 100,000 geniuses had entered the battlefield, and there’s already some who already stand out. It’s really a cruel battle. Almost every day, I hear stories about geniuses who once dominated an era falling to ruin!”","“That’s right. In this place, even prodigies are like weeds, and ordinary people are like ants!”","“Didn’t someone speculate before that the Prodigy Battlefield is actually a place for raising worms? Only those who stand out from the cruelest battles in it can possibly walk on the final path to becoming a god!’","Chu Yunfan stopped in his tracks and listened carefully. Although many of these people were speculating, it was undeniable that many truths could be hidden in these discussions.","After all, what these people were saying wasn’t unreasonable.","The battlefield had a bizarre layout. People could only enter with a certain blood essence, and they would be chased out once they exceeded the age limit.","“That’s right. There are already quite a number of people in this world who have reached the peak of their cultivation base and stopped, unwilling to exceed the Prodigy Battlefield’s upper limit. These kinds of people are the most terrifying. Moreover, those who come from ancient times are also terrifying monsters as well. These people are the most terrifying with their unbelievable cultivation bases!”","Chu Yunfan heard another piece of crucial information. On the battlefield, it seemed that there was not only a limit on age, but also on cultivation. Once one’s cultivation exceeded a certain level, they would immediately be rejected by this place.","To obtain the qualifications to enter the Prodigy Battlefield, many ancient prodigies chose to limit their cultivation and maintain it at the peak.","On the battlefield, they could be almost invincible!","This group of people should be the true rulers of the entire Prodigy Battlefield, the ones who are basically invincible.","Chu Yunfan wondered what their cultivation limits were.","This was the most beneficial information for him who was chasing after the latecomers. Although he already accumulated many years of strength, he was almost invincible only within his peers.","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. These ancient geniuses were terrifying, but he was even more so.","Given enough time, he could even kill them one by one for people to see.","“Fortunately, these people are waiting for some opportunity in the core region, so they won’t appear in ordinary situations. Otherwise, the entire battlefield will be dominated by them. We don’t have the right to compete with these old monsters for resources!”","“Fighting for resources? Hehe, these are all nice words. In fact, they don’t care about competing with us for these resources! What we’re fighting for is just what they don’t like and what’s left!”","“You guys have always said that the prodigies from the past are terrifying, but 1 don’t think so. Our current generation’s prodigies also have extraordinary existences. A few years ago, when Jun Tianci first entered the Prodigy Battlefield, he was stunning!’","Someone suddenly mentioned a name, which made Chu Yunfan’s spirits rise. That person was naturally Jun Tianci, whom he could not forget.","“Of course, I remember. He’s far too strong. When he entered this place, he could already compete with most of the ancient prodigies. Although he’s not one himself, he isn’t inferior to them in terms of cultivation level. Moreover, I heard that his physique is also extraordinary. He can compete with the ancient prodigies without being at a disadvantage!’","“Fighting against the ancient experts without being at a disadvantage? It’s not just that. After he entered, he killed many geniuses from the old era. He even said that the current geniuses should be stronger than the ancient ones. Do you still remember that?”","When someone mentioned this, it immediately resonated with many people, making them speak up one after another.","“How could I forget? A few years ago, he caused a huge commotion. It was said that he angered a few top geniuses from the ancient era. If it weren’t for the fact that the Destiny Sect had a few ancient geniuses protecting him in the battlefield, a huge battle would have been inevitable!”","“However, back then, he still needed the protection of some seniors in the","Destiny Sect. Now, he’s already the head of a league and created an alliance. He didn’t even join the created by the Destiny Sect’s elites, which rumors said angered those elites!”","The crowd was in a heated discussion. A person like Jun Tianci was the most unforgettable hero even on the battlefield.","Just as Chu Yunfan was thinking about how to deal with Jun Tianci, someone suddenly mentioned a name that intrigued him.","“l think Jun Tianci’s claim that the past is different from the present makes some sense. Apart from him, the most powerful person in the world should be Princess Gushe, Tang Siyu. She is much younger than Jun Tianci, but she has been extremely powerful for the past few years. Moreover, it is said that she has a grudge against him and chased him all the way to this battlefield!”","“Speaking of Princess Gushe, have you forgotten? There’s another Princess Gushe in the world, and that person isn’t someone to be trifled with.. Now that their titles overlap, she has also said that there can only be one of them in this place! “"]},{"number":2090,"title":"Chapter 2090: When Two Tigers Fight, One Will End up Injured","paragraphs":["Chapter 2090: When Two Tigers Fight, One Will End up Injured","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“That’s true. The other Princess Gushe is also a powerful figure!”","As everyone discussed this, Chu Yunfan found out that there was more than one Princess Gushe. In ancient times, before Grand Xia was established, there was also someone from a certain dynasty who was granted that title.","That person was also called a top genius who managed to dominate an era.","Even Tang Siyu’s title of Princess Gushe was related to this origin!","The two of them were initially separated by countless eras, so it should have been impossible for them to meet. However, with the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield, the two of them ended up meeting in this era.","When two tigers fought, one would definitely be injured!","It was even more so when it came to these proud prodigies. Since they shared the same title, it was only natural that a victor had to be decided. Only the winner would be qualified to continue using the Princess Gushe title.","The other person would have to leave dejectedly and give up this title.","Through these people’s discussions, Chu Yunfan finally understood the battlefield’s current situation.","Although these geniuses were all experts from their respective eras, they were at least in the top ten or twenty of their era’s younger generation.","This was possibly a good thing, as each era’s essence was all gathered in this era.","However, there were also differences between these geniuses. At some point in time, people had formed alliances. They were divided into alliances based on different sects, eras, and races.","As for the remaining geniuses who didn’t have enough people to create their own alliances, they joined alliances one after another.","Some of the large- scale and powerful ones could even affect the situation on the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","Jun Tianci’s original alliance was the Destiny Alliance. Their few alliance leaders were all peerless geniuses who dominated eras since ancient times.","They had relied on self- sealing methods to survive until now. With them as the leader and the alliance formed by the peerless geniuses of the Destiny Sect’s affiliated sects, they were now one of the top behemoths on the entire battlefield.","Jun Tianci seemed to have left the alliance and created one on his own, becoming a leader as well.","One could imagine how ambitious he was. He didn’t just want to follow behind the ancient prodigies of the Destiny Sect and become their underling.","Instead, he wanted to make his own standing in the current era.","Chu Yunfan could naturally understand his thoughts, even though there were ancient geniuses who were countless years older than them. Many of them lived in a time that was even older than the Grand Xia Empire’s founding age.","However, in terms of cultivation years, although there was a gap, they could be considered to be on par. Why could these ancient prodigies be above modern prodigies like them?","What Jun Tianci had said was the same principle in the past and present!","The ancient people had indeed made their way through an extremely brilliant civilization, but that didn’t mean that modern people were necessarily inferior to the ancient experts. Grand Xia had been established for countless years, and the martial arts had produced an extremely brilliant civilization that wasn’t inferior to the ancients.","However, these alliances that dominated the Prodigy Battlefield were basically in the core region, while a portion of them were in the central region.","Only a tiny amount of their members walked around in the outer region!","Very soon, Chu Yunfan had already made up his mind. He was in the dark now, while Jun Tianci was in the light. However, Jun Tianci still didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had recovered. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan from more than ten years ago was probably already dead.","This information was his greatest advantage!","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, it was still difficult for him to be on par with Jun Tianci. Based on the contents of the discussion just now, he could even deduce that Jun Tianci was probably already a Major Arcane.","However, he wasn’t surprised at all. A dozen years ago, Jun Tianci’s cultivation had probably already entered the Middle Arcana Stage, let alone now. After wandering on the battlefield for several years, it was only natural that his cultivation would undergo large changes.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had to start with the alliance that dealt with Jun Tianci. Jun Tianci had created an alliance called the Monarch Alliance, which meant that it was an alliance that ruled the world. His ambitions really shone from this.","If they wanted to deal with Jun Tianci, they had to first destroy the Monarch Alliance that Jun Tianci had taken as his arm.","Just as Chu Yunfan was thinking about how to deal with the Monarch Alliance and attack Jun Tianci, he suddenly received an invitation.","“A casual gathering?” Chu Yunfan looked at the golden words on the invitation.","This gathering was held by Yang Dengxian, Meng Potian, Meng Tianran, Hu Qingxuan, Zi Buyu, and others. It was aimed at giving the prodigies of the same generation a chance to interact.","However, Chu Yunfan certainly did not believe that this was just a casual gathering. Whether it was Yang Dengxian, Meng Potian, Meng Tianren, Hu","Qingxuan, or Zi Buyu; although their cultivation levels weren’t high, they were undoubtedly the major forces’ treasures. It could be said that this generation depended on them, the peerless geniuses, to support it.","“No matter what, I’ll know when I go and take a look!” Chu Yunfan followed the instructions on the invitation and went to a huge mountain near the city wall, located south of the city.","Strange rocks were strewn all over the mountain peak. Although it wasn’t too high, it gave off a feeling of being surrounded by immortal energy.","On this peak, there was a large manor floating in front of Chu Yunfan. The entire place looked quiet, but it also had some vitality, resembling extravagance that had been restrained.","When Chu Yunfan arrived at the manor, someone quickly came out to welcome him. Who else could it be but Yang Dengxian?","Compared to his previous miserable state, he looked really high- spirited at this time. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he immediately smiled and said, “Brother","Jian, it’s an honor to have you here!”","Yang Dengxian’s smile was warm, and he looked like a sunny boy. He treated people like a spring breeze,","This was naturally the result of his many years of training as a sect leader candidate.","“You are too polite, Brother Yang!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“Brother Jian, please follow me. This is not the place to talk!”","Yang Dengxian led Chu Yunfan into the villa. At this moment, Chu Yunfan saw many familiar figures.."]},{"number":2091,"title":"Chapter 2091: Everyone Tries to Snatch Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2091: Everyone Tries to Snatch Chu Yunfan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the villa, Hu Qingxuan and the others were already gathered. They were chatting and laughing, but when they saw Chu Yunfan, they smiled kindly.","In addition to these acquaintances that Chu Yunfan had long known, there were many people that he had never seen or even heard of. However, these people all carried extremely tyrannical auras, clearly much stronger than Hu Qingxuan and the others.","Yang Dengxian said, “Everyone, please allow me to introduce you. This is Jian Wuchen. On the way here, we were in danger. It was only with his protection that we were safe!”.","Many people turned their gazes over, feeling somewhat dominated by Chu Yunfan’s presence.","Many people frowned. Of course, they had heard of Jian Wuchen.","He probably wasn’t from the same era as Yang Dengxian and the others. However, from the fact that he could enter and leave the Prodigy Battlefield, he should also be a prodigy of a certain generation.","If that were the case, how could they not have heard of him?","Many of these people were geniuses of the previous generation’s Prodigy List.","They all frowned because Chu Yunfan wasn’t a prodigy they knew.","They all felt like he had just appeared out of nowhere.","On the other hand, Hu Qingxuan and the others formally stepped forward and bowed to Chu Yunfan.","They said in unison, “Thank you for your protection, Brother Jian. We are extremely grateful! ”","“Fellow cultivators, there’s no need to be so polite,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Many people raised their eyebrows because he wasn’t as arrogant and frivolous as they had expected.","According to the information they had received, he was like a sharpened sword.","But now, it seemed that he was actually as gentle as jade.","“Brother Jian, do you have an alliance? If you don’t have one, the Flying Celestial Alliance is an option!” A muscular young man in a moon-white robe stepped forward and came in front of Chu Yunfan with a smile on his face.","Yang Dengxian quickly introduced, “Brother Jian, this is the Flying Celestials’ previous head disciple, Lan Hao!”","Only then did Chu Yunfan know that Lan Hao had personally appeared to rope him in.","Compared to Yang Dengxian, Lan Hao was naturally much stronger. He had probably already broken through to the Middle Arcana Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan still shook his head secretly. Lan Hao should be a prodigy of the same age as Jun Tianci, but his current cultivation might not be much better than Jun Tianci’s cultivation ten years ago.","It could be said that although they were of the same age, they couldn’t be compared at all. Their relationship was a bit like Chu Yunfan and Yang Dengxian.","Despite that, Lan Hao could already be considered a rare talent in the world.","After all, he represented the Flying Celestial Alliance’s invitation to Chu Yunfan.","“Hahaha, if I’m not wrong, you probably traced my background!” Chu Yunfan laughed and looked at the crowd.","Everyone faced his words calmly as this wasn’t something difficult to accept. On the contrary, this was a compulsory lesson. If they hadn’t investigated his background, who would dare to invite Chu Yunfan over? What if they made a mistake?","Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “Since that’s the case, then I’ll tell you the truth.","I’m sure everyone knows about me by now. Now that I’ve arrived at the Prodigy Battlefield, 1 won’t be able to hide it for long. Soon, the Destiny Sect will also receive this news. At that time, there might be ancient geniuses coming to kill me. Can the Flying Celestials really do anything about it?”","He was originally a disciple of the Flying Celestials, but this was not a good time to reveal his identity.","Seeing his half-smile, Lan Hao only smiled and replied, “Brother Jian, don’t worry. Although the Destiny Alliance is powerful, the Flying Celestial Alliance isn’t a pushover. As long as you are willing to join us, we can guarantee that we will protect your life. Moreover, there are many complete cultivation methods in our alliance that can allow your cultivation to increase rapidly. Of course, the heavenly sword path cultivation is also part of them!","“Although the Destiny Alliance has ancient geniuses, don’t you think our alliance would also have an ancient expert that can match up to theirs? You can rest assured that as long as you choose to join us, we have ways to help you develop in a short time and allow you to compete with the ancient prodigies!’","At this moment, many people present were secretly shocked. The Flying Celestials were investing a lot in Chu Yunfan. They were one of the top ten sects in the outside world, so they could be said to be a big figure.","On the Prodigy Battlefield, even if their status could not be compared to the outside world, they were still a long-standing alliance that ordinary people were unwilling to find.","They were extremely strict when recruiting new people, but they didn’t expect to treat Chu Yunfan so differently.","“Brother Jian, if you want to join an alliance, I don’t think the Flying Celestials is your only choice. The Virtuous Academy that I belong to is the most suitable choice for you!” Meng Tianran, who was at the side, spoke up, “The Virtuous Academy is the only force that can compete with the Destiny Sect. Even they wouldn’t dare to underestimate us!”","The Virtuous Academy was ranked second among the many forces in the world. Even if it couldn’t compare to the first-ranked Destiny Sect, it was probably not much different. In addition, their influence in the Imperial Court was far beyond ordinary people’s imaginations.","Moreover, 80% of civil officials originated from Virtuous Academy, which was more powerful than the Destiny Sect in the Imperial Court. Therefore, although they were only second in the world, they dared to compete with the Destiny Sect.","Meng Tianran’s words seemed to have triggered a consensus among everyone. Many people reacted immediately, speaking one after another.","Hu Qingxuan had already come to Chu Yunfan’s side. She looked at him and said, “The Heavenly Fox Clan established the Heavenly Fox Alliance. Although it’s not a human clan, we also have our own unique inheritance. Among them, we have collected many sword techniques from powerful swordsmen. I think it should be helpful to you, Brother Jian!’","“What a joke! Brother Jian is a human, so how can he join you demons?!” Zi Buyu said, not giving Hu Qingxuan any face at all.","Although they had cooperated before, this cooperation wasn’t enough when it came to recruiting Chu Yunfan. They split up into different sections on the spot.."]},{"number":2092,"title":"Chapter 2092: Fighting to Kill Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2092: Fighting to Kill Chu Yunfan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For a moment, Chu Yunfan became a hot potato in the eyes of many people!","From the beginning to the end, Yang Dengxian and the others did not know exactly how strong Chu Yunfan was. They only felt that he was unfathomable. However, he had more or less figured out that he was at least above the Middle Arcane Stage.","A Middle Arcane would be a big shot in the outside world. He would be able to establish a sect and attract the attention of the world. Even on the battlefield where there were as many prodigies as weeds, people with such strength could be considered an expert.","Although these prodigies had yet to enter the Prodigy Battlefield, because of the different races and sects they belonged to, they had long been divided into factions. For someone like Chu Yunfan, who was powerful but had no clear ownership, he was a hot potato in everyone’s eyes.","One had to know that the battlefield was only accessible to those with king-level physiques and above. Such a person would definitely become famous in the future. A person who didn’t have a clear sect or power was rare.","The various forces fought crazily. Even though they knew that Chu Yunfan had offended the Destiny Sect to the death, there were still many people who wanted to rope him in. Although the Destiny Sect was a colossus, they weren’t the strongest among the various alliances on the Prodigy Battlefield.","Moreover, the alliance with Chu Yunfan could continue after leaving the battlefield, especially for a powerful genius like Chu Yunfan. As long as he was given enough time, he could grow into a top-notch expert.","“What’s wrong with joining a demon alliance? What kind of person is Brother","Jian? How can he be so rigidly bound by the distinction between races?” Hu Qingxuan said, “This isn’t the Central Plains, and it has nothing to do with the fate of a race. It’s just a chance for an individual to reach enlightenment.","What’s wrong with that?”","No one was willing to give in. It wasn’t easy to see such a wild expert. Only the locals could have such an expert who didn’t belong to any alliance. Now that they had finally encountered one, how could they let it go?","Suddenly, before everyone could finish fighting, a figure appeared before Chu Yunfan. This person was dressed in a purple robe, his face was demonic, and his body faintly emitted a terrifying aura.","“l heard that you’re very arrogant. You don’t even put the Destiny Sect in your eyes?” The devilish man smiled coldly.","“Are you from the Destiny Sect?” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. His expression was cold, but he had a sense of power.","Everyone stopped fighting for Chu Yunfan because they could see that this man with a devilish face had come with ill intentions.","“No!” The devilish man shook his head.","“Then this is none of your business!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“l am indebted to a senior from the Destiny Sect for saving my life in the past.","The thing I hate the most in my life is someone who disrespects the Destiny Sect. Disrespecting them will make you die a hundred times!” the devilish man said coldly, “On top if that, you dared to kill the people of the Destiny Sect. You can escape the blame even if you die a hundred times. I don’t just want to kill you, I want to extract your soul and whip it day and night so that you won’t be able to reincarnate and beg for death.”","“After saying so much, the most important thing is whether you have the ability or not. If you want to stand up for the Destiny Sect, you have to see if you have the ability!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“Wait!","Suddenly, a muffled sound came from outside the manor. Immediately after, a bloody light flashed into the manor. Everyone saw a young man dressed in bloody-stained clothes with an arrogant expression walking in.","“What are you trying to do, Traceless Blood?” The devilish man asked the bloody-clothed mans. “He’s my prey. Are you trying to snatch him away?”","Traceless Blood just smiled coldly. “Si Wuxie, I want this man’s head. Someone is offering a great reward for it. You can’t kill the person 1 want to kill.","The devilish young man, Si Wuxie, sneered. “What a joke. Traceless Blood, I’ve heard about you. You’re a peerless genius of the assassin organization known as Blood-Clothes Tower. You once assassinated a big shot, and you were hunted until you disappeared. I thought you were dead. I didn’t expect you to drag on until now. But since you survived, why didn’t you cherish your life and come here to die?”","“This is too ridiculous. Didn’t expect me to survive until now?” Traceless Blood said with a cold smile. “Si Wuxie, do you think you are the only one who knows my background? You’re a prodigy of a certain generation in the Heavenly Evil Sect. Back then, the Heavenly Evil Sect was strong for a period of time but later on, it angered Grand Xia and was exterminated. Your Heavenly Evil Sect merely had a few remaining disciples who were lingering outside. Just based on you, do you think you’re qualified to bark like a dog in front of me? The Blood-Clothes Tower exterminating the remaining Heavenly","Evil Sect disciples is just a piece of cake!”","Many people only knew from the conversation between these two that these two people were prodigies of a certain generation from the Blood-Clothes Tower and Heavenly Evil Sect respectively. They were both extremely powerful.","The Blood-Clothes Tower had been one of the top assassin organizations in the world since ancient times. No one knew how many experts there were in this organization. Their tentacles spread all over the world, and no one knew how many famous experts might be members of this organization. Even Grand Xia was extremely wary of the Blood-Clothes Tower.","And the other Heavenly Evil Sect was once powerful and prosperous. In the distant past, it was even known as the number one sect in the evil and heretical path, a colossus that could contend with the ten great sects in the world. Later on, because of their unscrupulous actions, they caused the people of the world to be filled with resentment, causing Grand Xia to destroy him. Currently, only a few disciples were left in the to drag out their days. However, there were still some geniuses who had sealed themselves in secret places and survived. Si Wuxie was one of them.","Such a situation was very common among many ancient prodigies. After they sealed themselves and came out of seclusion, the sects and races they belonged to had been destroyed for many years. Nothing could last forever. Time would wash away everything.","Hearing Traceless Blood’s contemptuous tone, Si Wuxie’s face showed a bit of anger. He said coldly, “l don’t know how powerful the Blood-Clothes Tower is. But I can kill you easily now. You, an assassin, dare to appear in front of me..","You are too bold!”"]},{"number":2093,"title":"Chapter 2093: A Little Show","paragraphs":["Chapter 2093: A Little Show","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Si Wuxie struck out instantly. His hand struck Traceless Blood’s body like lightning and pierced through his body in an instant.","He attacked just like that!","Many people present could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. They finally remembered that Si Wuxie was a remnant of the Heavenly Evil Sect. The Heavenly Evil Sect was the number one sect of the evil path. Although they were not of the demonic path and were enemies with all living beings in the world, the evil path was not a good person either.","It could be said that none of these experts from the evil path were good people. Back then, the Heavenly Evil Sect was too unbridled, causing the heavens to be enraged and the people to be resentful. That was why Grand Xia was forced to personally take action to wipe them out.","Otherwise, even Grand Xia would have to be wary of such a colossal existence.","That was because even though they could annihilate it, the strength that the Heavenly Evil Sect possessed was enough to make Grand Xia loose a tooth. If it wasn’t for the fact that they had no other choice, even Grand Xia wouldn’t easily make a move against such a colossus.","And it just so happened that the Heavenly Evil Sect at that time had caused the heavens to be enraged and the people to be resentful. Not only did they make countless enemies in Grand Xia, there were even many sects that wished for the Heavenly Evil Sect to die.","After all, the Heavenly Evil Sect was too powerful back then and had crushed all those evil devils and heretics from the foreign lands, conquering those who did not submit. That way, he would be deserted by everyone in the end.","Si Wuxie was a prodigy who had come from that Heavenly Evil Sect, and his way of doing things could naturally be said to be of the same origin as the Heavenly Evil Sect back then.","Many people instantly raised their own power to prevent the two from fighting and affecting them.","Before Si Wuxie could show a cold smile, Traceless Blood’s body turned into a pool of blood and fell to the ground.","This was not the original body, but a clone. It was a secret technique of the Blood-Clothes Tovver. Although it did not have the strength of the original body, its confusion effect was the best. Even Si Wuxie and the others hadn’t realized that Traceless Blood was actually a clone.","“Si Wuxie, I think you’re courting death!”","Suddenly, at this moment, Traceless Blood’s voice rang out. A short sword","appeared in the void and tore through the space. In an instant, the short sword was already slashing toward Si Wuxie.","When Si Wuxie realized that he had only killed a clone, he instantly reacted and retreated continuously. However, the sword still easily shattered the defensive barrier around his body as if it was cutting open a piece of white paper.","However, at that critical moment, Si Wuxie managed to dodge the fatal blow. However, there was a bloody scar on her face, which was scratched by Traceless Blood’s sword light.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it only happened in an instant. Before anyone could react, the two of them had already completed this exchange. Obviously, both sides were wary of this place, so even if they attacked, they were restrained and did not erupt with their strongest strength. Otherwise, if the two of them attacked with their full strength, it would not be like this.","The two of them glared at each other fiercely, but then they realized that their target this time was Chu Yunfan. They couldn’t let him escape.","At this time, Hu Qingxuan was the first to react. She stood up and said, “You two, Brother Jian is a guest we invited. He’s not someone you can kill just because you want to!”","“Can you protect the person I want to kill?” Traceless Blood only sneered. As soon as he finished speaking, he had already appeared in front of Hu Qingxuan. “You’re just a fledgling Minor Arcane. You don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!”","In an instant, a terrifying blood-red light flashed through the air. Although it looked like an ordinary blood-red light, it carried a terrifying aura that could destroy the world. This was a sign that one had controlled their aura to the extreme, not leaking a single bit. And for martial artists who cultivated the path of assassination, this was just an instinctive level.","This sword almost made Hu Qingxuan’s expression change drastically in an instant. But when she wanted to escape, she found that there was no way at all. Even though she was a Minor Arcane, compared to the truly powerful Traceless Blood, the difference was like the difference between heaven and earth.","Traceless Blood had already stepped into the Middle Arcana Stage. The difference of one major stage was enough to crush everything. The battle between Jun Tianci and Chu Yunfan back then was similar to this. It was just that Chu Yunfan was many times stronger than Hu Qingxuan back then, which was why Jun Tianci suffered a huge loss.","“l think you’re the one who doesn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!” a cold voice said.","Then, a large hand formed in the air. The large hand suddenly grabbed the blood light and crushed it.","“Who is it?” Traceless Blood’s attack failed. He frowned. It was fine that he could not kill Si Wuxie, but Si Wuxie’s cultivation was the same as his, both of them had just entered the Middle Arcana Stage.","Although he had only just entered the Middle Arcane Stage, he was already at the peak of the outer region of the battlefield. Many more powerful experts had already entered the central and core regions of the battlefield.","That was why the two of them were so unscrupulous. Even if they killed people casually in front of everyone, they did not have the slightest scruple. Among these people, the only one who could make them look at him in a different light was the previous generation’s prodigy of the Flying Celestials, Lan Hao.","However, Lan Hao was an ancient prodigy of the Flying Celestials. It was impossible for him to fall out with them for the sake of others. That was why they were so unscrupulous. As long as they did not kill the people of the Flying Celestial Alliance, Lan Hao would not easily make a move!","However, when he turned around and looked at the direction of the big hand, he saw Chu Yunfan with a cold smile on his face. In other words, the person who blocked his attack at the critical moment was none other than Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Hu Qingxuan was a little frightened. Then, a hint of embarrassment and anger flashed through her eyes. When had she ever been ignored like this in the outside world? He killed as he wished without any scruples! He was simply treating her like an ant!","In the outside world, even the big shots of the sects did not dare to look down on her. Now, she had almost died at Traceless Blood’s hands.","At this moment, she truly understood what the seniors in the clan had warned her before she entered. It was completely different on the Prodigy Battlefield and in the outside world.","In the outside world, everyone treated her as a treasure, giving in to her and protecting her. However, in the Prodigy Battlefield, she was no different from a blade of grass.."]},{"number":2094,"title":"Chapter 2094: Slapping Traceless Blood to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2094: Slapping Traceless Blood to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was because there were countless geniuses like her in the battlefield.","There were many people with more shocking talents and bloodlines than her.","This was because the ancient prodigies who barged into the Prodigy Battlefield were almost all top-notch prodigies who had suppressed an era.","It was an existence that made the young experts of an era despair.","They only had one goal in self-sealing, which was to finally become a god and live a long life.","Those who dared to have such thoughts were extremely proud and conceited. If they didn’t have some skills, how could they dare to have such delusions?","Here, no one would give in to her because of her talent, bloodline, or the Nine-Tailed Heavenly Fox clan that stood behind her.","That was because any one of those prodigies had a terrifying background. Any one of their talents had once stunned an era. Traceless Blood was like that now. He wanted to kill her just like that. He would not hesitate at all!","Previously, she only had a superficial understanding of the cruelty of the Prodigy Battlefield. Now, she truly had a fundamental understanding. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, she would have died here long ago.","“Thank you for saving my life, Brother Jian!” Hu Qingxuan bowed.","Then, she looked at Traceless Blood with an astonishing cold light. Although her current cultivation was inferior to Traceless Blood, Si Wuxie, and the others, it did not mean that she was afraid of Traceless Blood.","She was known as a rare genius of the Heavenly Fox clan. Traceless Blood had only cultivated for a few more years than her. If she was given a few more years, she could be on par with Traceless Blood, or even completely surpass him. Now that Traceless Blood wanted to kill her, this grudge was huge.","“Traceless Blood, you’re finished. The Heavenly Fox clan will never let the Blood-Clothes Tower get away with this!” Hu Qingxuan gritted her teeth.","“So what?” Traceless Blood sneered. “Wait until you can get out before you talk about revenge. This is probably your first time entering the Prodigy Battlefield. You don’t understand the principle at all. Mind your own business and cut the crap!’","He clearly did not take Hu Qingxuan’s words seriously. At the same time, a shocking killing intent burst out of his eyes. Since he had already offended Hu Qingxuan, he might as well kill him all together, lest he became trouble for him in the future.","Hu Qingxuan was so angry that her pretty face was flushed red, and her plump chest kept heaving up and down.","Then, Traceless Blood looked at Chu Yunfan. After all, this was his primary","“You can’t even protect yourself, and you still dare to meddle in other people’s affairs. What a joke!” Traceless Blood sneered.","At this moment, Lan Hao stood up and said, “l don’t care who is trying to kill Jian Wuchen today. But killing someone at my banquet is disrespectful. Do you really think that I am easy to bully?”","“Lan Hao, don’t be a busybody. This matter has nothing to do with the Flying Celestial Alliance!” Si Wuxie said, “If you force Traceless Blood and me to join hands, you won’t have an easy time. Instead of losing face, you might as well give way now! ”","Lan Hao’s expression was cold. Obviously, Si Wuxie’s threat made him very angry. However, Si Wuxie’s words did have an effect. He believed that he was not bad when dealing with any one of them. However, when the two of them joined forces, even he had to be afraid.","And for Chu Yunfan, it was hard to say if there was a need to take this risk.","“Jian Wuchen, if you join the Flying Celestial Alliance now, I can protect you in the name of the Flying Celestial Alliance,” Lan Hao said. He was still unwilling to give up on a wild expert like Chu Yunfan. “When the time comes, we’ll be able to fight them together!”","Just as everyone was looking at Chu Yunfan, he finally said, “Don’t worry about it, Brother Lan. These two are just ants. How dare they act so impudently in front of me? Let me deal with them first!”","“How dare you call me an ant to my face!” Si Wuxie’s eyes shone with a terrifying light. His body began to be surrounded by demonic energy, which turned into evil flames, making him look very strange.","“l told you, I’m the only one who can kill him!” Traceless Blood said coldly.","Chu Yunfan grinned. Did these two actually treat him like a weak little lamb? Let them deal with it!","“Why don’t we work together for the time being? You want his head in exchange for the reward, but I don’t need it. I just want him dead!” Si Wuxie finally decided to take a step back. To him, there was nothing more important than killing Chu Yunfan.","Traceless Blood thought for a moment and nodded. “Alright, since that’s the case, let’s attack together!”","However, just as he finished speaking, he saw a figure appear in front of him. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","‘That was so fast!’ Traceless Blood was shocked, and a terrifying feeling suddenly emerged from his heart.","Then, a big hand suddenly appeared in front of him. It was Chu Yunfan who opened his hand and then suddenly covered his face.","Bam!","With a loud bang, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s palm hit Traceless Blood. With an absolutely terrifying palm force, Traceless Blood was slapped to the ground, and his head was hit hard.","Boom!","The entire mountain peak was shaking slightly. Everyone could not help but be shocked. How much strength was needed to do such a thing?","If not for the fact that this mountain range had long been protected by various arrays and barriers, this slap would probably have shattered the entire mountain peak.","Traceless Blood’s entire face was covered in blood from the slap. His entire head had cracked, and cracks had appeared on his skull. It was obvious how terrifying this slap was.","Then, Chu Yunfan smiled coldly and grabbed Traceless Blood’s sleeve. He pulled him up and asked indifferently, “Do you understand now? Who truly is the one who can’t protect themselves? Who was the hunter? Who is the prey?!”","Traceless Blood’s brain was almost blown out of his head. His face was covered in blood. He wanted to struggle, but it was as if he was suppressed by a terrifying force. He could not struggle at all.","“Trash!” Chu Yunfan pierced Traceless Blood’s chest with a strike of his hand.","Traceless Blood was dead!"]},{"number":2095,"title":"Chapter 2095: This Is What a Real Man Should Be Like","paragraphs":["Chapter 2095: This Is What a Real Man Should Be Like","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Chu Yunfan stabbed Traceless Blood to death, he slowly put the latter’s body away. His expression did not change at all, and he kept a faint smile.","“What does this mean? Everyone thinks that they are very powerful, everyone thinks that they are the most special one, but in reality, they are all trash!” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","Everyone present was stunned by Chu Yunfan’s imposing manner. Chu Yunfan’s attack was not even earth- shattering. He had killed Traceless Blood with a single slap. This proved how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Because his strength completely surpassed Traceless Blood’s, Traceless Blood couldn’t even withstand such a simple slap. He was directly injured and then easily killed by Chu Yunfan.","Yang Dengxian and the others had already witnessed Chu Yunfan’s strength. Chu Yunfan’s killing of Traceless Blood was just another proof of Chu Yunfan’s strength. However, Lan Hao was different. This was the first time he had seen Chu Yunfan attack. This attack was earth- shattering to him.","Traceless Blood, whom even he found extremely troublesome, could not even withstand Chu Yunfan’s slap. How powerful must he be to do this? However, he had thought that Chu Yunfan was at most on par with him. This was the most ridiculous thing.","‘Why have I never heard of this person? This shouldn’t be the case!’","Such a thought appeared in Lan Hao’s mind. With his experience and the powerful forces of the Flying Celestials, it could be said that everything that had appeared should have been recorded.","Unless Chu Yunfan was not a peerless genius of the current generation, but a peerless genius of the modern era.","In the recent ancient times, that was before the establishment of Grand Xia. At that time, the Flying Celestials were not so powerful, and it was not even one of the ten great sects.","Only a peerless prodigy who appeared in that era could not be recorded in the Flying Celestials’ database. If that was the case, then all their previous judgments were wrong. Chu Yunfan wasn’t a prodigy of the current generation, but an ancient prodigy.","What was even more terrifying was Chu Yunfan’s strength. He couldn’t even tell how strong he was, and he didn’t seem like a Major Arcane. The energy waves coming from a Major Arcane was something that even he wouldn’t be able to withstand. However, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was terrifyingly powerful!","Instantly, Lan Hao secretly ranked Chu Yunfan as the most terrifying expert in the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield.","There were many people who were shocked, but the only one who was horrified was none other than Si Wuxie. He was about to join forces with Traceless Blood, but before he could do anything, Traceless Blood died tragically at the hands of Chu Yunfan, whom they had never taken seriously before.","Now that he thought about it, their previous fight was really a farce, a laughable farce. No wonder Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid. At that time, Chu Yunfan was probably mocking them for overestimating their abilities.","Seeing Traceless Blood die at Chu Yunfan’s hands without being able to fight back, Si Wuxie instinctively felt a chill down his spine, and his hair stood on end. All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it only took a few breaths. Traceless Blood was dead, and Si Wuxie only had one thought left, and that was to escape.","Si Wuxie restrained the demonic energy in his body and fled toward the periphery of the manor. However, it was too late. Chu Yunfan was much faster than him, and in an instant, had already caught up to him.","Immediately after, another huge palm approached at an astonishing speed.","Bam!","Si Wuxie was sent flying by the slap and crashed into the ground of the manor. The ground instantly turned into dust within a radius of a hundred meters.","Si Wuxie’s skull cracked. If it was an ordinary person, he would have died long ago. Fortunately, he was a Middle Arcane, As long as his brain was not shattered, he would still be alive.","This slap did not just hurt his head, but even his body cracked open and blood began to flow out. Everyone was greatly shocked. This slap was too brutal.","This was especially true for many of the young geniuses present. Whether it was Si Wuxie or Traceless Blood, they were both Middle Arcanes. Now, they had been severely injured by a big slap.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was simply immeasurable, especially the way he easily injured someone. It was really too shocking. At this moment, they completely believed that Chu Yunfan had no qualms about attacking the experts of the Destiny Sect.","‘This guy is a lunatic. He’s unscrupulous!’","This thought appeared in the minds of many prodigies. Even they were shocked. However, for some reason, they still felt a little happy and even yearned for it. This was what a real man should do.","It wasn’t like they didn’t have the chance to show off their might, but that was when they were facing ordinary people who were far weaker than them. They weren’t like Chu Yunfan, who treated prodigies like ordinary cabbages. He could deal with them as he pleased and slap them as he pleased.","Defeating an expert that was almost invincible in their hearts was the true sense of achievement. However, they still felt a little sad. Their proud identity as prodigies seemed to be useless in front of Chu Yunfan. It tore down all their pride.","What bloodline? What innate divine ability? What invincible techniques? They were all finished without even having the chance to fight. It was too aggrieved to die like this!","At this moment, Si Wuxie, who had been slapped down, did not think about whether he would die in grievance. He wanted to struggle, but there was no way. Chu Yunfan grabbed him by the collar.","“You want to stand up for the Destiny Sect? You should first think about whether you have the strength to do so. With your weak strength, who gave you the confidence to think that you can avenge those people from the Destiny Sect?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Si Wuxie was on the verge of tears. Although their Heavenly Evil Sect had been destroyed for a long time, they had not fallen to the point where they could be bullied by others. No matter where he went, he would be praised as a rare prodigy. No one had ever commented that he was weak like Chu Yunfan had. It was simply too aggrieved.","However, he did not struggle for long because Chu Yunfan grabbed a lightning bolt and turned it into a spear that pierced through him and nailed him to the ground.."]},{"number":2096,"title":"Chapter 2096: To Rope in Chu Yunfan, I’ll Go All Out!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2096: To Rope in Chu Yunfan, I’ll Go All Out!","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even Si Wuxie couldn’t last against Chu Yunfan. Although many people still felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave and their hair stood on end, with Traceless Blood as an example, they could easily accept it.","Although there was a difference in combat strength between Si Wuxie and","Traceless Blood, they were still considered existences at the same level. Chu Yunfan could easily kill Traceless Blood, so it would not be difficult to easily kill Si Wuxie.","“I thought he was only a Minor Arcana Stage or a fledgling Middle Arcane, so he shouldn’t be that strong. But now that 1 think about it, I’m really lucky!’","“We wanted to threaten him to join our alliance, but we were so lucky. Before we could say anything, two unlucky guys helped us test Jian Wuchen’s quality!’","“I’m afraid there’s going to be a great storm in the outer region. With the addition of such a top-notch expert, it’s not impossible to cause a reshuffle!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Many people realized that with Chu Yunfan’s display of such strength, there would definitely be a place for Chu Yunfan in the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield.","However, after suffering such a huge loss, no matter if it was the Destiny","Alliance, Si Wuxie’s Evil Path Alliance, or Traceless Blood’s Bloody-Clothes Tower, they would not let it go so easily. At that time, there might be an even more shocking collision between the two sides. It might even cause the entire outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield to be reshuffled.","“Brother Jian, you are good at martial arts. I was rude before!” Lan Hao said.","As the initiator of this gathering, he thought that it was a sure thing to win over Chu Yunfan. He could even use protecting him from the pursuit of the Destiny Sect as a condition to rope Chu Yunfan into the Flying Celestial Alliance. But now, he realized that his previous thoughts were too naive. How could such a person be subordinate to others?","He even thought of Jun Tianci, who was from the same generation as him.","When he was still working hard for the Flying Celestial Alliance, Jun Tianci had already become independent and established the Monarch Alliance. He even stood on equal footing with the Destiny Sect.","The prodigies of other eras didn’t feel very frustrated, but they felt the most. They were completely left behind by Jun Tianci.","“But Brother Jian, you still have to be careful. No matter what, the person behind them won’t let this matter rest. If it was just the Destiny Alliance before, then you still have to be careful of the Evil Path Alliance and the Blood-Clothes Tower’s revenge!” Lan Hao said, “Brother Jian, although you are very powerful, and Si Wuxie and Traceless Blood are both vulnerable in front of you, don’t think that this is the full strength of their respective alliances. In fact, they are just the people in charge of the Evil Path Alliance and the Blood-Clothes Tower in the outer region.","“Now that the person in charge has been killed, they will definitely send even more powerful experts from the central region or even the core region to kill you. There are not many alliances in the world that can protect you, and the Flying Celestial Alliance is definitely the most sincere among them,” Lan Hao continued.","When everyone heard this, they realized that Lan Hao had not given up on recruiting Chu Yunfan. Clearly, he had seen Chu Yunfan’s potential, which was definitely far beyond what he had displayed so far. The more astonishing Chu Yunfan’s strength was, the greater his potential was. His future was limitless.","“l don’t think Brother Jian should join the Flying Celestial Alliance. Our Barbarian Alliance can also protect Brother Jian. Right now, the person in charge of this city is part of the Barbarian Alliance. As long as we give the order, experts will return from the central region very soon. By then, even if it’s the Blood-Clothes Tower, the Destiny Alliance, or the Evil Alliance, what can they do?”","Meng Potian, who had been silent all this while, suddenly spoke.","“As long as you are willing, Brother Jian, the barbarians are willing to give you the title of a Barbarian King. If you are willing, you can become the Barbarian King of the First Cave.”","When everyone heard Meng Potian’s words, they sucked in a breath of cold air. Such conditions were truly shocking. One must know that the supreme existence of the barbarians was the Barbarian Emperor. However, just like how there was only a Human King in Grand Xia, there were only Barbarian Kings among the barbarians. Unless there was an expert at the level of an emperor, only then would the person be qualified to become the Barbarian Emperor.","And in the history of the barbarians, there had only been one Barbarian Emperor. He was the supreme figure who had founded the barbarians to contend against the empires of the Central Plains.","Below the Barbarian Emperor were the Barbarian Kings of the 72 Caves, and below them were the Barbarian Commanders, Barbarian Generals, and so on. It could be said that the Barbarian King was the highest level of the barbarians.","Now that Meng Potian was trying to win Chu Yunfan over, his sincerity was not lacking. Soon, everyone understood why. Almost all of them thought the same thing as Lan Hao. Since no one had heard of Chu Yunfan in the current era, and Chu Yunfan obviously couldn’t have jumped out from a crack in the rock, there was only one possibility, which was that he was an ancient prodigy.","The sects where these ancient prodigies were from had their races destroyed as time passed. These ancient prodigies had their alliances in the Prodigy Battlefield, but they were all alone outside the Prodigy Battlefield.","Some prodigies were committed to rebuilding their sects, families, and races. However, there were also many prodigies who chose to rely on the existing factions. Among the many forces in the world, the barbarians were undoubtedly ranked at the top. Compared to them, even the Destiny Sect was much inferior.","What Meng Potian was thinking about was clearly not only the matters on the Prodigy Battlefield but also the matters outside the Prodigy Battlefield. After all, the time the Prodigy Battlefield was open was limited. Everyone had to plan for the long term.","“If that’s the case, the monsters are willing to wait too. I think that with Brother Jian’s strength, it won’t be a problem for him to become a Monster King,” Hu Qingxuan quickly interjected.","Similar to the barbarians, the monsters had many Monster Kings. The 81","Nionster Kings were the most powerful and ruled the entire monster race.","“Although Brother Jian is a human, the monster tribes include all living beings in the world and can be called a demon. Humans are also living beings in the world. It’s not unprecedented for a human like Brother Jian to join the monsters,” Hu Qingxuan quickly said.","“The two of you should give up. Even if Brother Jian wants to join, he has the choice of joining the Grand Xia Empire. No matter what, he can’t join the other races and become their lackeys!” Meng Tianren said.","For a moment, the gathering became like a market. Everyone was fighting fiercely over Chu Yunfan. They knew that Chu Yunfan had just offended several alliances, but they did not hesitate.."]},{"number":2097,"title":"Chapter 2097: Rejecting Everyone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2097: Rejecting Everyone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even though Chu Yunfan had already fallen out with the Destiny Sect and other behemoths, there were still many forces that wanted to rope him in.","Since Chu Yunfan had already displayed his peerless talent, many people were willing to risk offending a colossus like the Destiny Sect to rope him in.","For a moment, the conflicts that they had been suppressing all erupted.","Everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan. To compete for Chu Yunfan’s power, everyone here had a huge force in the outside world. Ordinary prodigies could be said to have leaped through the dragon gate and become extraordinary if they could obtain the invitation and rope in of any of the factions. Now that so many forces were willing to lower their status and invite Chu Yunfan, it could be seen how much shock Chu Yunfan had brought to them just now.","“Thank you for your invitation, everyone,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “However, I have no plans to join any alliance for the time being!’","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately caused the entire hall to fall into a dead silence. Many people could not help but reveal a somewhat stunned expression. If Chu Yunfan had chosen not to join these alliances before, perhaps they could understand.","But now, Chu Yunfan had completely offended the Destiny Alliance, the Monarch Alliance, the Blood-Clothes Tower, the Evil Alliance, and other famous alliances. These alliances all had extremely terrifying experts. If he offended these experts, Chu Yunfan would probably not be able to survive this battle. This was different from the outside world. On the Prodigy Battlefield, it was a naked competition of strength.","The reason why alliances became the mainstream was that individual strength was too weak in the Prodigy Battlefield, forcing these prodigies to cooperate with each other to obtain what they wanted.","Chu Yunfan didn’t choose to join any alliance. Facing these powerful alliances, he would probably die. Many people looked at Chu Yunfan with different expressions as if they were looking at a dead man. In their hearts, Chu Yunfan was no different from a dead man walking.","“Brother Jian, although you’re a lone wolf outside, you have to understand that the Prodigy Battlefield is different from the outside world. If you’re not part of an alliance, you have no place to stand,” Yang Dengxian said, ‘","Regardless of whether it’s the Blood-Clothes Tower, the Destiny Alliance, the Monarch Alliance, or even the Evil Path Alliance, they are all extremely powerful. Brother Jian, this is your first time entering the Prodigy Battlefield, and I’m afraid you don’t know that there are even Major Arcane prodigies in these alliances. Brother Jian, you may be powerful, but it’s still a little out of your league to face these top-tier experts alone.”","“That’s right. If you join the Virtuous Academy, there’s nothing to be afraid of even if you face the Destiny Sect!” Meng Tianren came forward again.","“There’s no need to say anything else. I appreciate everyone’s good intentions, but I really don’t have any plans to join the alliance for the time being!’","Of course, Chu Yunfan knew the benefits of joining an alliance. If he didn’t join an alliance, he wouldn’t have a place in the world. There were many people in the world who pursued the strategy of being either an enemy or a friend. If it was not an expert on their side, then they would do everything they could to kill the existence of the other party.","Not to mention that he had offended these powerful alliances. With the strength of these alliances, even with Chu Yunfan’s strength, he would be in great danger. However, they didn’t know what kind of trump card Chu Yunfan had. Chu Yunfan wasn’t like the prodigies they knew before. Even when he was surrounded and blocked by many experts, it was not like Chu Yunfan had never encountered them before, and he had won in the end.","“Thank you for your hospitality today. I have matters to attend to, so I will be leaving first!” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and left.","No one stopped Chu Yunfan. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan was leaving as soon as possible to avoid being surrounded by the experts of the major alliances who might arrive later. If it were them, their first reaction would definitely be to leave the scene after witnessing such an earth-shattering event. Otherwise, it was very likely that they would die here.","The few major forces were not existences that could be easily provoked. These alliances were able to make a name for themselves among the many alliances and become famous existences. Naturally, they were not ordinary people. Chu Yunfan’s strength might be very strong for them, but he was still too weak in the face of the pursuit and interception of these major forces.","“What a pity. I’m afraid it won’t be long before news of his death comes!” Lan Hao said after a long beat.","He really felt that it was a pity that he couldn’t rope Chu Yunfan in, even though he would offend the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance.","However, the conflict between the Flying Celestials and Destiny Sect had been growing over the years. Ever since Chu Yunfan’s death, the two sides had a deep hatred for each other. It could be said that they had fought in many places.","Naturally, the conflict spread to the Prodigy Battlefield. Since they had already offended the Destiny Sect, so what if they offended them again? Moreover, with the addition of a top-notch expert like Chu Yunfan, there was no doubt that it would increase the strength of the Flying Celestial Alliance.","As time passed, Chu Yunfan’s strength would become stronger and stronger.","At that time, the Flying Celestial Alliance would obtain more and more benefits. It was a win-win situation for both sides.","Unfortunately, Chu Yunfan had no intention of joining the Flying Celestial Alliance. He didn’t even have any intention of joining any alliance. It seemed that he was used to being alone.","Lan Hao had seen many such itinerant cultivators, but itinerant cultivators were still itinerant cultivators. There were too few itinerant cultivators who could become famous experts in the world. It could be said that they were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns.","Those people all had great fortuitous encounters, but such people could not be replicated. Sects like them could continuously nurture geniuses. That was a complete concept.","In his opinion, Jian Wuchen had seen too much in the outside world and was too arrogant. He had underestimated the experts on the battlefield. This was the gathering of the strongest 100,000 geniuses since ancient times. The collision would cause sparks that ordinary people could not imagine.","Some people even asserted that among so many geniuses, there would definitely be someone who would become an emperor and become an existence comparable to the emperors of the Immemorial and Ancient Era. To be able to stand out among so many geniuses, such a figure might be rare in history.","In a battlefield filled with geniuses, one person’s strength was too small. Even if this person was Jian Wuchen, who was extremely powerful and had no background, it was the same.."]},{"number":2098,"title":"Chapter 2098: Shaking the Entire City","paragraphs":["Chapter 2098: Shaking the Entire City","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan had become a byword for not knowing what was good for him. Yang Dengxian was slightly stunned because he vaguely felt that Jian Wuchen’s style was very familiar. That familiar feeling arose spontaneously.","However, he could not remember what kind of familiarity it was.","He had reservations about Lan Hao’s words because in his opinion, Chu Yunfan was obviously not someone who did not know the immensity of heaven and earth. After all, an expert who could cultivate to this level could not be an idiot who did not know anything. Such a person would have long died in the process of cultivation.","“Maybe he has his own plans, but no matter what, as long as he can bring some trouble to the Destiny Sect, it’s a good thing. Even if one of the prodigies from the Destiny Sect dies, it’s worth it!” Yang Dengxian said firmly.","Currently, the battle between the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect was getting more and more intense. Both sides were using all kinds of methods to target the other party’s prodigies.","Any of those experts who could enter the Prodigy Battlefield had terrifying talent that ordinary people could not imagine. Any one of them would become an influential expert.","These experts were also the prodigies that the Destiny Sect had slowly accumulated over countless years. Each of them was an existence that suppressed their peers. If one of them died, it could be said that it would be a huge blow to the Destiny Sect. The death of one was equivalent to the death of an entire era.","Since he couldn’t rope Chu Yunfan in, then using Chu Yunfan to deal with the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance was the best choice. The rest of the people also had thoughtful expressions on their faces. Clearly, they had thought of the same thing.","“Let’s hope that he can slow down the footsteps of the Destiny Alliance. In the past two years, the Destiny Alliance has become more and more arrogant. Just because they are the number one sect in the world, they actually dared to show off their might in the Prodigy Battlefield. They expect us to cooperate with them to establish some kind of current alliance to contend against the ancient prodigy alliances,” someone said indignantly.","“That’s right. If that’s all, then it’s fine. But they actually want to take the lead and make us obey their orders. They even want to set strict rules. Those who don’t obey them will be dealt away with.”","“The Destiny Alliance’s methods are getting crueler and crueler. And they want to treat us as their subsidiary alliances. This is simply too much!”","Many people revealed a disgusted expression when they heard about the","Destiny Alliance. These forces more or less had various conflicts with the Destiny Alliance. It could be said that these forces had joined forces to resist the pressure of the Destiny Alliance. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many alliances and factions that weren’t afraid of the Destiny Alliance’s pressure.","Unfortunately, Chu Yunfan refused. However, they also understood that Chu Yunfan wanted to deal with the Destiny Alliance. This was an unavoidable fate. After all, Chu Yunfan had killed so many experts of the Destiny Sect, unless he killed himself to thank the world. Otherwise, only one of them would survive, and the other would fall.","In their eyes, the one who would fall was definitely Chu Yunfan. However, before that, Chu Yunfan could help them slow down the Destiny Sect. Even if it caused some trouble, it was good.","“No matter what, we should help him as much as we can. We can’t let the Destiny Sect get rid of Jian Wuchen so easily!” someone suggested, which immediately resonated with many people.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know that after he left, although those prodigies were a little angry, they all joined forces to help him. These prodigies didn’t attack to protect Chu Yunfan, but to let him live for a while longer and delay the footsteps of the Destiny Alliance.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about their schemes. He didn’t fear the Destiny","Alliance, the Monarch Alliance, the Blood-Clothes Tower, or the Evil Path","Alliance. Moreover, dealing with the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance was his goal.","After leaving the manor where the banquet was held, everything that happened in the manor spread at an astonishing speed. In just a few moments, the news had already spread throughout the entire city.","“What? Si Wuxie of the Evil Path Alliance was killed?”","“Traceless Blood, the person in charge of the Blood-Clothes Tower, was killed?”","When many people heard these two pieces of news, their first reaction was that they did not believe it. It took them a long time before they finally believed this shocking news. One had to know that these two weren’t ordinary people. There were many prodigies outside the Prodigy Battlefield, and they were relatively weaker. They were basically all Minor Arcanes. This was more than enough to roam freely in the periphery of the Prodigy Battlefield. However, if one wanted to enter the center and core of the Prodigy Battlefield, they were still far from it.","However, there were still many resources outside the Prodigy Battlefield that made people drool. Therefore, the various alliances arranged for people in charge to stay in the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield to fight for the various resources and send them to the top geniuses in the middle and core regions.","Si Wuxie and Traceless Blood were the people in charge of the Evil Path Alliance and Blood-Clothes Tower respectively outside the Prodigy Battlefield. Neither of them was a righteous person, and they could be said to be evil.","These two people had once caused endless terror in the outer regions of the Prodigy Battlefield, especially among the natives of the Prodigy Battlefield. There had always been legends of these two people that had been passed down from ancient times.","Even without mentioning the Evil Path Alliance and Blood-Clothes Tower behind them, just their strength alone could be said to be top-notch among those in the outer region.","The experts who had the strength to fight or even kill the two of them had already entered the central and core regions of the Prodigy Battlefield. The experts who could match them remaining in the outer region were very few. They were also experts from the various large factions.","Contending was just contending. It was extremely difficult to kill the two of them. However, Chu Yunfan had done this. One could imagine how shocked everyone was.","For a time, the name Jian Wuchen had become a hot topic for many people. Many people wanted to see how he was going to face the revenge of these alliances. Because no matter which alliance they were, they were all ordinary people. If they were to swallow him down, Chu Yunfan probably did not have the strength to do so.","Just as everyone was discussing, the focus of their discussion, Chu Yunfan, quietly appeared in the city—in the Destiny Alliance’s encampment! Chu Yunfan swaggered to the entrance of the encampment.."]},{"number":2099,"title":"Chapter 2099: Golden Titan? Attack!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2099: Golden Titan? Attack!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The moment Chu Yunfan arrived before the Destiny Alliance, a majestic divine will swept out. It instantly swept across Chu Yunfan.","“Hmm?” A puzzled voice came from the encampment. It seemed a little strange. His divine will was ineffective on Chu Yunfan and he couldn’t even detect some basic things.","If he closed his eyes, he wouldn’t be able to feel that there was a person standing before him. It was as if this person had become one with heaven and earth.","A moment later, a young man with a golden body slowly walked out. This young man with a golden body looked very divine. It seemed that he had a special bloodline and his body was shining with an extraordinary light. “Who are you? Are you trying to provoke the Destiny Alliance?” the young man said.","“Provoke? I heard that your Destiny Alliance has collected many good things, so I came here to take them!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Just as Lan Hao and the others guessed that Chu Yunfan might have left the city to avoid disaster, who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would not leave at all and would directly attack the Destiny Alliance’s encampment.","“You came to take them? What a joke!” The young man sized Chu Yunfan up. “You’re just a guy who’s just entered the Minor Arcana Stage. Don’t tell me you think you’re the best there is?”","This young man clearly did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes. Clearly, he treated Chu Yunfan as a prodigy who had awakened from a certain era and did not know the immensity of heaven and earth.","After all, there was no reason for a prodigy to not know how powerful the Destiny Sect was. This was the number one sect in the world, and it was one of the top ten sects in the world since the establishment of Grand Xia. Their majesty was deeply rooted in the hearts of the people.","The only people who dared to look down on the Destiny Alliance like this were probably some geniuses from the ancient times before Grand Xia was established. These geniuses were all arrogant and naturally wouldn’t put Grand Xia in their eyes.","Over the past few years, such conflicts had occurred more than once or twice. This time, 100,000 geniuses had appeared, and many of them were ancient geniuses who had revived in the current era. The most recent one was also in recent times. How could they know that the world was changing now?","The Destiny Alliance had always dealt with prodigies who didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth. Even in ancient times, prodigies weren’t that powerful.","“Hand over the items now and you can still live. I won’t kill you!” Chu Yunfan said to the young man seriously.","The young man was angered by Chu Yunfan’s words and scolded, “You won’t kill me? Who do you think you are?! I will use your head to tell all the other fellows who want to provoke my alliance that the Destiny Alliance is not something you can afford to offend!”","In the next moment, the young man attacked. His body burst out with golden light. In an instant, he was like a golden man. His fist sxuvept across the sky and directly smashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Peak Minor Arcane!","This punch stirred up the air. In an instant, the nearby barriers sensed it and activated one after another, sealing this terrifying punch.","“The bloodline of the Golden Titan is indeed extraordinary. Unfortunately, it’s too watered down in your body. Just this level is far from enough!’","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he casually clapped his hand. With a loud boom, this terrifying punch was blocked by Chu Yunfan with a backhand.","Chu Yunfan had already recognized the bloodline of this young man. It was the bloodline of a powerful race—the titans from the immemorial era. Moreover, it was the bloodline of the Golden Titan, which was known as the strongest among the titans.","According to the records of the immemorial era in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories in Chu Yunfan’s mind, there were many experts among the titans back then. The strongest among them could contend with the emperors, and the strongest among them were known as the twelve Golden Titans. There were a total of 12 supreme experts in this race who could contend against emperors. The strength of this race could be seen from this.","However, there was only a thin bloodline in this young man’s body. Otherwise, it would be far more than that. However, this bloodline was not very common even in era when the Alchemy Emperor was alive. It was probably only in places like the Prodigy Battlefield, where peerless prodigies of various eras gathered, that one could casually see a kind of bloodline that had once made an illustrious reputation.","“What?” When the young man saw that his attack had been blocked, he was stunned. This Golden Titan bloodline made him invincible, and it was difficult for him to meet an opponent. Not to mention, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was far inferior to his.","However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan had already rushed in front of him.","Smack!","A huge slap landed in front of the young man, almost causing him to faint. Blood flowed from the corner of his mouth, and his front teeth were loose. “Look, I gave you a chance, but since you want to kill me, I’ll kill you!’","“l don’t think so.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “It’s rare to see the bloodline of the Golden Titan, so I wanted to spare your life. But now, it seems that it’s impossible! ”","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already sent the young man flying with a backhand punch.","Bam!","The young man crashed into the gate of the encampment, causing the entire gate to shake. The golden light on his body collapsed, revealing his original appearance. Even if it was a special bloodline, it was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan’s punch.","He was beaten until he was dizzy and could not mobilize his divine power. He was completely not a match. When he finally caught his breath, he saw Chu Yunfan walking over step by step.","“If you kill me, you won’t have a good ending. The Destiny Alliance won’t let you off!” The young man was trembling as if he was looking at a monster.","He wasn’t a disciple of the Destiny Sect, but a genius from a sect affiliated to the Destiny Sect. He had once shone for an era and defeated the prodigies of his generation. Later, he chose to seal himself and only came back in this era. He thought that even if there were 100,000 prodigies shining on the battlefield, he would be one of the best. Who knew that he would encounter a freak like Chu Yunfan?","He felt that his bloodline was about to collapse. Chu Yunfan was simply a","monster!","“It doesn’t matter. I’ll find trouble with the Destiny Sect anyway!” Chu Yunfan grinned and swung his hand. A ball of lightning covered his hand and instantly pierced through the young man.","The young man had no strength to resist. He died tragically in a moment, and his corpse was taken into the Mountain River Diagram by Chu Yunfan.."]},{"number":2100,"title":"Chapter 2100: This Is a Robbery, Hand Them Over!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2100: This Is a Robbery, Hand Them Over!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it only took a moment. This young man with the king-level Golden Titan bloodline died at Chu","Yunfan’s hands. It was a pure beating, and he had no strength to fight back. Although Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was low, in terms of combat power, even Middle Arcanes were no match for him.","At this moment, hundreds of powerful divine wills had gathered in the sky. The masters behind these divine wills had seen the tailend of the battle. It didn’t take long for them to sense the battle and rush over to watch it. However, Chu Yunfan had already ended the battle.","They only saw how Chu Yunfan dealt with the young man with the Golden Titan bloodline as easily as stepping on an ant. The young man’s bloodline was simply shattered by the attack, and he could not exert his power at all.","“Hiss! Who is this person? He’s so arrogant that he doesn’t even put the Destiny Alliance in his eyes!’","“He’s either a lunatic or an expert. 1 don’t think he’s the former. He’s too strong. That was Cao Hongyi, who was known to have the bloodline of the Golden Titan. When he grows to the extreme, his terrifying bloodline can compete with the emperors. But he was beaten up!’","“l only saw the last part. Cao Hongyi was completely beaten. Although his Golden Titan bloodline wasn’t pure enough, he at least had a king-level physique. If he grew up, he would definitely become a powerful king in the future. Now, he’s already dead!”","Many people used their divine wills to communicate and discuss. They did not even dare to look at Chu Yunfan, afraid that Chu Yunfan would kill the owner of the gaze if he had a bad temper.","This kind of thing was too normal in a place like the Prodigy Battlefield where there were as many Prodigies as ants. Whether they were called geniuses or monsters, they were not normal people. It was normal for them to have some strange eccentrics.","Liking to kill people was not even considered a strange hobby. It could only be considered a normal hobby. One could imagine the shock and terror in their hearts. Many of them were locals here, and at this moment, they were trembling. Every time the Prodigy Battlefield opened, it would make them feel despair.","No matter how much talent they displayed, in front of these top prodigies, they would be beaten until they were completely bruised. Any prodigy from the outside world was enough to make a name for themselves here.","On the other hand, Cao Hongyi’s name was quite famous in the outer regions of the battlefield. Although he wasn’t a Middle Arcane, he was one of the few peak Minor Arcanes, and he had the backing of a powerful alliance like the Destiny Alliance. He was quite famous in the city, but he was killed in just a few moves. The strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed was a little too frightening.","Chu Yunfan didn’t pay attention to the people outside who were peeping with their divine will. After all, even his current identity was fake.","“Stop him!” A group of experts ran out of the station and stopped Chu Yunfan.","These were all local experts. At the very least, they were middle-aged experts, and more than half of them were old. These people had all broken through to the Minor Arcana Stage and were forced to submit to the Destiny Alliance’s experts. In the end, they joined the Destiny Alliance and were sent to guard this encampment.","These experts did not hesitate and attacked directly. All kinds of magical treasures, divine weapons, martial arts, and divine powers swept toward Chu Yunfan. Even a peak Minor Arcane would not be able to remain calm in the face of such a terrifying attack. They could only choose to flee. However, these locals were wrong. Chu Yunfan was not a peak Minor Arcane like they thought.","Immediately, Chu Yunfan punched out. This punch instantly destroyed the flood of attacks. The terrifying fist force tore everything apart and instantly bombarded the the local Destiny Alliance experts.","In a moment, they were all annihilated. Their bodies exploded in midair, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky. Then, Chu Yunfan collected them and poured them onto the Brahma Tree.","One hit, team wipe!","Many experts in the city who saw this scene were scared to death by Chu Yunfan’s brutal fighting style. It was not that they had never seen an expert before, but they had never seen an expert with such a brutal fighting style.","“Is he really here to rob Destiny Alliance?” one of the experts said with his mouth agape. He had never thought that the most unlikely possibility that Chu Yunfan had mentioned before was the real reason.","Chu Yunfan didn’t look like he was here to provoke the experts of the Destiny Alliance. He was clearly here to rob them. At this moment, in the Destiny Alliance’s encampment, other than the local experts, there were also a large number of original sect subordinates. However, they had already been scared to death by Chu Yunfan. How could they dare to stay? They immediately fled in all directions.","When the tree falls, the monkeys scatter!","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop them. He just strode into the encampment and smashed the door of the treasure vault with a punch. Because at this moment, there were no experts guarding the Destiny Alliance encampment. No one could stop Chu Yunfan.","The experts in the city clearly saw that as Chu Yunfan’s punch smashed the door of the treasure vault, waves of medicinal fragrance floated out. The medicinal fragrance almost materialized. All kinds of medicinal herbs that were usually extremely rare appeared before them.","Other than these medicinal herbs, there were also many other heavenly and earthly treasures that had appeared. Many of the Minor Arcanes were extremely envious. In addition, there were two million high-grade spirit stones.","“He really struck it rich! I didn’t expect that there would be so many good things in the Destiny Alliance encampment. Indeed, a man can’t get rich without a windfall, and a horse can’t get fat without grass at night!”","The eyes of many experts were wide open. They had worked so hard to collect so many assets, but now all of them were going to fall into Chu Yunfan’s hands. It was true that hard work was not as fast as robbery. However, they also knew that Chu Yunfan was the only one who could do this. It could not be replicated.","Putting aside the fact that they didn’t have the strength to wipe out the experts of the Destiny Alliance, even if they did, they didn’t have the guts to offend them. After all, the Destiny Alliance didn’t only have these experts in their encampment. The truly powerful prodigies were in the core region, and ordinary people couldn’t even see them.","However, this didn’t stop them from looking at Chu Yunfan, who was about to make a fortune, with envy.."]}]);
